msgstr "Anda dapat menjadwalkan tindakan berulang otomatis untuk menerapkan highstate atau sekumpulan state kustom pada klien sesuai jadwal yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can apply recurring actions to individual clients, to all clients in a "
"system group, or to an entire organization."
msgstr "Anda dapat menerapkan tindakan berulang pada klien individual, semua klien dalam grup sistem, atau seluruh organisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can set actions to be performed in a particular order by creating action "
"chains."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengatur tindakan agar dijalankan dalam urutan tertentu dengan membuat rantai tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Action chains can be created and edited ahead of time, and scheduled to run "
"at a time that suits you."
msgstr "Rantai tindakan dapat dibuat dan diedit terlebih dahulu, lalu dijadwalkan untuk dijalankan pada waktu yang sesuai bagi Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:7
msgid "You can also perform remote commands on one or more of your clients."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menjalankan perintah jarak jauh pada satu atau beberapa klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Remote commands allows you to issue commands to individual clients, or to "
"all clients that match a search term."
msgstr "Perintah jarak jauh memungkinkan Anda mengirimkan perintah ke klien individual atau semua klien yang cocok dengan istilah pencarian."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan Berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can apply recurring actions on individual clients, to a system group, or "
"to all clients in an organization."
msgstr "Anda dapat menerapkan tindakan berulang pada klien individual, grup sistem, atau semua klien dalam organisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Currently, {productname} supports the following action types as recurring "
"actions:"
msgstr "Saat ini, {productname} mendukung jenis tindakan berikut sebagai tindakan berulang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:12
msgid "`Highstate:` Execute the highstate."
msgstr "`Highstate:` Menjalankan highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:13
msgid ""
"`Custom state:` Execute a set of custom states. A custom state can be either "
"an internal state provided by {productname}, or a configuration channel "
"created by a user."
msgstr "`State kustom:` Menjalankan sekumpulan state kustom. State kustom dapat berupa state internal yang disediakan oleh {productname} atau channel konfigurasi yang dibuat oleh pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:14
msgid ""
"For more information about configuration channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang channel konfigurasi, lihat xref:client-configuration:configuration-management.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Recurring Action"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Tindakan Berulang Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:16
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to an individual client, navigate to `Systems`, "
"click the client to configure schedules for, and navigate to the `Recurring "
"Actions` tab."
msgstr "Untuk menerapkan tindakan berulang pada klien individual, buka `Sistem`, klik klien yang jadwalnya ingin dikonfigurasi, lalu buka tab `Tindakan Berulang`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To apply a recurring action to a system group, navigate to "
"menu:Systems[System Groups], select the group to configure schedules for, "
"and navigate to `Recurring Actions` tab."
msgstr "Untuk menerapkan tindakan berulang pada grup sistem, buka menu:Systems[System Groups], pilih grup yang jadwalnya ingin dikonfigurasi, lalu buka tab `Tindakan Berulang`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:17
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:65
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:58
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:78
msgid "Click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Buat]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:19
msgid "Select an action type from the `Action Type` dropdown."
msgstr "Pilih jenis tindakan dari daftar tarik-turun `Jenis Tindakan`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:20
msgid "Type a name for the new schedule."
msgstr "Masukkan nama untuk jadwal baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:21
msgid "Choose the frequency of the recurring action:"
msgstr "Pilih frekuensi tindakan berulang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:22
msgid "`Hourly:` Type the minute of each hour."
msgstr "`Setiap Jam:` Masukkan menit pada setiap jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:23
msgid "For example, `15` runs the action at fifteen minutes past every hour."
msgstr "Misalnya, `15` menjalankan tindakan pada menit ke-15 setiap jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:24
msgid "`Daily:` Select the time of each day."
msgstr "`Harian:` Pilih waktu untuk setiap hari."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:25
msgid ""
"For example, `01:00` runs the action at 0100 every day, in the timezone of "
"the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Misalnya, `01:00` menjalankan tindakan pada pukul 01.00 setiap hari, sesuai zona waktu Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:26
msgid ""
"`Weekly:` Select the day of the week and the time of the day, to execute the "
"action every week at the specified time."
msgstr "`Mingguan:` Pilih hari dalam seminggu dan waktu pelaksanaan untuk menjalankan tindakan setiap minggu pada waktu yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:27
msgid ""
"`Monthly:` Select the day of the month and the time of the day, to execute "
"the action every month at the specified time."
msgstr "`Bulanan:` Pilih tanggal dalam sebulan dan waktu pelaksanaan untuk menjalankan tindakan setiap bulan pada waktu yang ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:28
msgid ""
"`Custom Quartz format:` For more detailed options, enter a custom quartz "
"string."
msgstr "`Format Quartz kustom:` Untuk opsi yang lebih terperinci, masukkan string Quartz kustom."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For example, to run a recurring action at 0215 every Saturday of every "
"month, enter:"
msgstr "Misalnya, untuk menjalankan tindakan berulang pada pukul 02.15 setiap hari Sabtu setiap bulan, masukkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"
msgstr "0 15 2 ? * 7\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:31
msgid "OPTIONAL: Toggle the `Test mode` switch on to run the schedule in test mode."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Aktifkan sakelar `Mode uji` untuk menjalankan jadwal dalam mode uji."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For actions of type `Custom state`, select the states from the list of "
"available states and click btn:[Save Changes]. This will only save the "
"current state selection and not the schedule."
msgstr "Untuk tindakan berjenis `State kustom`, pilih state dari daftar state yang tersedia, lalu klik btn:[Simpan Perubahan]. Ini hanya menyimpan pilihan state saat ini, bukan jadwalnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:33
msgid ""
"In the next pane, drag and drop the selected states to put them in the "
"execution order and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Pada panel berikutnya, seret dan lepas state yang dipilih untuk mengatur urutan eksekusinya, lalu klik btn:[Konfirmasi]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Create Schedule] to save, and see the complete list of existing "
"schedules."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Buat Jadwal] untuk menyimpan dan melihat daftar lengkap jadwal yang ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Organization Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in the organization.  Navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > "
"Recurring Actions] to see all recurring actions that apply to the entire "
"organization."
msgstr "Administrator Organisasi dapat mengatur dan mengedit tindakan berulang untuk semua klien dalam organisasi.  Buka menu:Home[My Organization > Recurring Actions] untuk melihat semua tindakan berulang yang berlaku bagi seluruh organisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:36
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can set and edit recurring actions for all "
"clients in all organizations.  Navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations], select "
"the organization to manage, and navigate to the menu:States[Recurring "
"Actions] tab."
msgstr "Administrator {productname} dapat mengatur dan mengedit tindakan berulang untuk semua klien di semua organisasi.  Buka menu:Admin[Organizations], pilih organisasi yang akan dikelola, lalu buka tab menu:States[Recurring Actions]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Action Chains"
msgstr "Rantai Tindakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:38
msgid ""
"If you need to perform a number of sequential actions on your clients, you "
"can create an action chain to ensure the order is respected."
msgstr "Jika Anda perlu menjalankan beberapa tindakan secara berurutan pada klien, Anda dapat membuat rantai tindakan untuk memastikan urutannya dipatuhi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:39
msgid ""
"By default, most clients execute an action as soon as the command is "
"issued.  In some case, actions take a long time, which could mean that "
"actions issued afterwards fail.  For example, if you instruct a client to "
"reboot, then issue a second command, the second action could fail because "
"the reboot is still occurring.  To ensure that actions occur in the correct "
"order, use action chains."
msgstr "Secara default, sebagian besar klien menjalankan tindakan segera setelah perintah diberikan.  Dalam beberapa kasus, tindakan memerlukan waktu lama sehingga tindakan yang diperintahkan setelahnya dapat gagal.  Misalnya, jika Anda memerintahkan klien untuk memulai ulang, lalu memberikan perintah kedua, tindakan kedua dapat gagal karena proses mulai ulang masih berlangsung.  Untuk memastikan tindakan dijalankan dalam urutan yang benar, gunakan rantai tindakan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For transactional update systems, an action chain is executed inside a "
"single snapshot, until there is a reboot action.  This can cause some "
"limitations."
msgstr "Pada sistem pembaruan transaksional, rantai tindakan dijalankan dalam satu snapshot hingga mencapai tindakan mulai ulang.  Hal ini dapat menimbulkan beberapa keterbatasan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] "
"and xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[] dan xref:client-configuration:clients-opensuseleapmicro.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:42
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:clients-slemicro.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:43
msgid ""
"You can use action chains on all clients.  Action chains can include any "
"number of these actions, in any order:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan rantai tindakan pada semua klien.  Rantai tindakan dapat mencakup sejumlah tindakan berikut dalam urutan apa pun:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:44
msgid "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Remote Command]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:45
msgid "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Schedule System Reboot]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:46
msgid "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[States > Highstate]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:47
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > List/Remove]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:48
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Install]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:49
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Packages > Upgrade]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:50
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Patches]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:51
msgid "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:52
msgid "menu:System Details[Configuration]"
msgstr "menu:System Details[Configuration]"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:53
msgid "menu:Images[Build]"
msgstr "menu:Images[Build]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Action chains are user-specific.  To see the action chain in the {webui}, "
"you must sign in as the same user who created the action chain."
msgstr "Rantai tindakan bersifat khusus untuk setiap pengguna.  Untuk melihat rantai tindakan di {webui}, Anda harus masuk sebagai pengguna yang membuat rantai tindakan tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Action Chain"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Rantai Tindakan Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to the first action you want to "
"perform in the action chain.  For example, navigate to `System Details` for "
"a client, and click btn:[Schedule System Reboot]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka tindakan pertama yang ingin Anda jalankan dalam rantai tindakan.  Misalnya, buka `Detail Sistem` untuk suatu klien, lalu klik btn:[Jadwalkan Mulai Ulang Sistem]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:57
msgid "Check the `Add to` field and select the action chain you want to add to:"
msgstr "Periksa kolom `Tambahkan ke` dan pilih rantai tindakan yang ingin Anda tambahi tindakan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:58
msgid "If this is your first action chain, select `new action chain`."
msgstr "Jika ini adalah rantai tindakan pertama Anda, pilih `rantai tindakan baru`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:59
msgid "If the action chain already exists, select it from the list."
msgstr "Jika rantai tindakan sudah ada, pilih dari daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If you already have existing action chains, but you want to create a new "
"action chain, start typing a name for the new action chain to create it."
msgstr "Jika Anda sudah memiliki rantai tindakan, tetapi ingin membuat rantai tindakan baru, mulailah mengetik nama rantai tindakan baru untuk membuatnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:61
msgid "Confirm the action."
msgstr "Konfirmasikan tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:62
msgid ""
"The action is not performed immediately, it creates the new action chain, "
"and a blue bar confirming this appears at the top of the screen."
msgstr "Tindakan tidak langsung dijalankan, tetapi rantai tindakan baru dibuat, dan bilah biru yang mengonfirmasi hal ini muncul di bagian atas layar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Continue adding actions to your action chain by checking the `Add to` field "
"and selecting the name of the action chain to add them to."
msgstr "Lanjutkan menambahkan tindakan ke rantai tindakan dengan memeriksa kolom `Tambahkan ke` dan memilih nama rantai tindakan yang akan ditambahi tindakan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:64
msgid ""
"When you have finished adding actions, navigate to menu:Schedule[Action "
"Chains] and selecting the action chain from the list."
msgstr "Setelah selesai menambahkan tindakan, buka menu:Schedule[Action Chains] dan pilih rantai tindakan dari daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:65
msgid ""
"Re-order actions by dragging them and dropping them into the correct "
"position."
msgstr "Atur ulang urutan tindakan dengan menyeret dan melepaskannya ke posisi yang benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Click the blue plus sign to see the clients an action is to be performed "
"on.  Click btn:[Save] to save your changes."
msgstr "Klik tanda tambah biru untuk melihat klien yang akan menjalankan tindakan.  Klik btn:[Simpan] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Schedule a time for your action chain to run, and click btn:[Save and "
"Schedule]."
msgstr "Jadwalkan waktu pelaksanaan rantai tindakan, lalu klik btn:[Simpan dan Jadwalkan]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:68
msgid ""
"If you leave the page without clicking either btn:[Save] or btn:[Save and "
"Schedule] all unsaved changes are discarded."
msgstr "Jika Anda meninggalkan halaman tanpa mengeklik btn:[Simpan] atau btn:[Simpan dan Jadwalkan], semua perubahan yang belum disimpan akan dibuang."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:69
msgid ""
"If one action in an action chain fails, the action chain stops, and no "
"further actions are executed."
msgstr "Jika salah satu tindakan dalam rantai tindakan gagal, rantai tindakan berhenti dan tidak ada tindakan selanjutnya yang dijalankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:70
msgid ""
"You can see scheduled actions from action chains by navigating to "
"menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."
msgstr "Anda dapat melihat tindakan terjadwal dari rantai tindakan dengan membuka menu:Schedule[Pending Actions]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote Commands"
msgstr "Perintah Jarak Jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:72
msgid "Use this procedure to run a remote command via {salt}."
msgstr "Gunakan prosedur ini untuk menjalankan perintah jarak jauh melalui {salt}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure your client is subscribed to the appropriate tools "
"child channel for its installed operating system.  For more information "
"about subscribing to software channels, see "
"xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan klien Anda berlangganan channel turunan tools yang sesuai dengan sistem operasi yang terinstal.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang berlangganan channel perangkat lunak, lihat xref:client-configuration:channels.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:74
msgid ""
"On transactional systems, remote commands can run on the live system or "
"using transactional update.  To select the execution mode from the system's "
"Remote Command page, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc[]."
msgstr "Pada sistem transaksional, perintah jarak jauh dapat dijalankan pada sistem yang sedang aktif atau menggunakan pembaruan transaksional.  Untuk memilih mode eksekusi dari halaman Perintah Jarak Jauh sistem, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-details/sd-remote-command.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Remote commands are run from the `/tmp/` directory on the client.  To ensure "
"that remote commands work accurately, do not mount `/tmp` with the `noexec` "
"option.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc[Troubleshooting "
"Mounting /tmp with noexec]."
msgstr "Perintah jarak jauh dijalankan dari direktori `/tmp/` pada klien.  Untuk memastikan perintah jarak jauh berfungsi dengan benar, jangan memasang `/tmp` dengan opsi `noexec`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc[Pemecahan Masalah Pemasangan /tmp dengan noexec]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:76
msgid ""
"All commands run from the `Remote Commands` page are executed as {rootuser} "
"on clients.  Wildcards can be used to run commands across any number of "
"systems.  Always take extra care to check your commands before issuing them."
msgstr "Semua perintah yang dijalankan dari halaman `Perintah Jarak Jauh` dieksekusi sebagai {rootuser} pada klien.  Wildcard dapat digunakan untuk menjalankan perintah pada sejumlah sistem sekaligus.  Selalu periksa perintah Anda dengan sangat cermat sebelum menjalankannya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running Remote Commands on Clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjalankan Perintah Jarak Jauh pada Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:78
msgid "Navigate to menu:Salt[Remote Commands]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Salt[Perintah Jarak Jauh]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:79
msgid ""
"In the first field, before the `@` symbol, type the command you want to "
"issue."
msgstr "Pada kolom pertama, sebelum simbol `@`, masukkan perintah yang ingin Anda jalankan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the second field, after the `@` symbol, type the client you want to issue "
"the command on."
msgstr "Pada kolom kedua, setelah simbol `@`, masukkan klien tempat Anda ingin menjalankan perintah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:81
msgid ""
"You can type the `minion-id` of an individual client, or you can use "
"wildcards to target a range of clients."
msgstr "Anda dapat memasukkan `minion-id` klien individual atau menggunakan wildcard untuk menargetkan sejumlah klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Find targets] to check which clients you have targeted, and "
"confirm that you have used the correct details."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Cari target] untuk memeriksa klien yang Anda targetkan dan memastikan detail yang Anda masukkan sudah benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/actions.adoc:83
msgid "Click btn:[Run command] to issue the command to the target clients."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Jalankan perintah] untuk menjalankan perintah pada klien target."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:1
#: en/modules/administration/pages/uyuni-admin-overview.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Administration Guide"
msgstr "Panduan Administrasi"

#.  PDF Publication
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/admin-overview.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/uyuni-admin-overview.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/uyuni-admin-overview.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Publication Date:** {docdate}\n"
msgstr "**Tanggal Publikasi:** {docdate}\n"

#. type: Title ==
