#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:63
msgid ""
"OVAL metadata is used in CVE auditing for only a subset of clients, namely, "
"clients that use openSUSE Leap, SUSE enterprise products, RHEL, Debian or "
"Ubuntu. This is due to the absence of OVAL vulnerability definitions "
"metadata for the other products."
msgstr "Metadata OVAL digunakan dalam audit CVE hanya untuk sebagian klien, yaitu klien yang menggunakan openSUSE Leap, produk enterprise SUSE, RHEL, Debian, atau Ubuntu. Hal ini disebabkan oleh tidak tersedianya metadata definisi kerentanan OVAL untuk produk lainnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "CVE Status"
msgstr "Status CVE"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:65
msgid ""
"The CVE status of clients is usually either `affected`, `not affected`, or "
"`patched`.  These statuses are based only on the information that is "
"available to {productname}."
msgstr "Status CVE klien biasanya berupa `affected`, `not affected`, atau `patched`.  Status ini hanya didasarkan pada informasi yang tersedia bagi {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:66
msgid "Within {productname}, these definitions apply:"
msgstr "Dalam {productname}, definisi berikut berlaku:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "System affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "Sistem yang terdampak oleh kerentanan tertentu"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:68
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version lower than the version "
"of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "Sistem yang memiliki paket terinstal dengan versi lebih rendah daripada versi paket yang sama dalam patch relevan yang ditandai untuk kerentanan tersebut."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "System not affected by a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "Sistem yang tidak terdampak oleh kerentanan tertentu"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:70
msgid ""
"A system which has no installed package that is also in a relevant patch "
"marked for the vulnerability."
msgstr "Sistem yang tidak memiliki paket terinstal yang juga tercakup dalam patch relevan yang ditandai untuk kerentanan tersebut."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "System patched for a certain vulnerability"
msgstr "Sistem yang telah diberi patch untuk kerentanan tertentu"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:72
msgid ""
"A system which has an installed package with version equal to or greater "
"than the version of the same package in a relevant patch marked for the "
"vulnerability."
msgstr "Sistem yang memiliki paket terinstal dengan versi yang sama atau lebih tinggi daripada versi paket yang sama dalam patch relevan yang ditandai untuk kerentanan tersebut."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant patch"
msgstr "Patch relevan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:74
msgid "A patch known by {productname} in a relevant channel."
msgstr "Patch yang diketahui oleh {productname} dalam channel relevan."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Relevant channel"
msgstr "Channel relevan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:76
msgid ""
"A channel managed by {productname}, which is either assigned to the system, "
"the original of a cloned channel which is assigned to the system, a channel "
"linked to a product which is installed on the system or a past or future "
"service pack channel for the system."
msgstr "Channel yang dikelola oleh {productname}, yang ditetapkan ke sistem, merupakan channel asal dari channel hasil kloning yang ditetapkan ke sistem, ditautkan ke produk yang terinstal pada sistem, atau merupakan channel service pack terdahulu maupun mendatang untuk sistem tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auditing.adoc:77
msgid ""
"Because of the definitions used within {productname}, CVE audit results "
"might be incorrect in some circumstances.  For example, unmanaged channels, "
"unmanaged packages, or non-compliant systems might report incorrectly."
msgstr "Karena definisi yang digunakan dalam {productname}, hasil audit CVE mungkin tidak akurat dalam kondisi tertentu.  Misalnya, channel yang tidak dikelola, paket yang tidak dikelola, atau sistem yang tidak memenuhi ketentuan dapat menghasilkan laporan yang tidak akurat."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With PAM"
msgstr "Autentikasi dengan PAM"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports network-based authentication systems using pluggable "
"authentication modules (PAM) using SSSD.  PAM is a suite of libraries that "
"allows you to integrate {productname} with a centralized authentication "
"mechanism, eliminating the need to remember multiple passwords.  "
"{productname} supports LDAP, Kerberos, and other network-based "
"authentication protocols."
msgstr "{productname} mendukung sistem autentikasi berbasis jaringan melalui pluggable authentication modules (PAM) dengan menggunakan SSSD.  PAM adalah kumpulan pustaka yang memungkinkan Anda mengintegrasikan {productname} dengan mekanisme autentikasi terpusat, sehingga Anda tidak perlu mengingat banyak kata sandi.  {productname} mendukung LDAP, Kerberos, dan protokol autentikasi berbasis jaringan lainnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSSD Configuration"
msgstr "Konfigurasi SSSD"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring SSSD"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi SSSD"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:5
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Users[Create User] and enable "
"a new or existing user to authenticate with PAM."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Users[Create User] dan aktifkan autentikasi PAM untuk pengguna baru atau yang sudah ada."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In usernames, additionally to alphanumeric characters, `-`, `_`, `.`, and "
"`@` are allowed."
msgstr "Selain karakter alfanumerik, karakter `-`, `_`, `.`, dan `@` juga diperbolehkan dalam nama pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:7
msgid "Check the `Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)` checkbox."
msgstr "Centang kotak `Pluggable Authentication Modules (PAM)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Configure SSSD in the server container.  At the command prompt of the "
"{productname} container host, as root, enter the server container:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan SSSD di dalam kontainer server.  Pada prompt perintah host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, masuk ke kontainer server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-logintimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl term\n"
msgstr "mgrctl term\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-bootstrap-repo-for-eol-products.adoc:7
msgid "Inside the container, execute the following steps:"
msgstr "Di dalam kontainer, lakukan langkah-langkah berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Edit `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf` according to your configuration.  For an example, "
"see xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."
msgstr "Edit `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf` sesuai konfigurasi Anda.  Untuk contohnya, lihat xref:administration:auth-methods-pam.adoc#auth-methods-pam-ad[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:12
msgid "When done, exit the container:"
msgstr "Setelah selesai, keluar dari kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "exit\n"
msgstr "exit\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:14
msgid "Restart {productname} using:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang {productname} menggunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:81
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:28
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:30
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:44
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:32
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm restart\n"
msgstr "mgradm restart\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Changing the password in the {productname} {webui} changes only the local "
"password on the {productname} Server.  If PAM is enabled for that user, the "
"local password might not be used at all.  In the above example, for "
"instance, the Kerberos password is not changed.  Use the password change "
"mechanism of your network service to change the password for these users."
msgstr "Mengubah kata sandi di {webui} {productname} hanya mengubah kata sandi lokal pada Server {productname}.  Jika PAM diaktifkan untuk pengguna tersebut, kata sandi lokal mungkin tidak digunakan sama sekali.  Misalnya, pada contoh di atas, kata sandi Kerberos tidak berubah.  Gunakan mekanisme perubahan kata sandi pada layanan jaringan Anda untuk mengubah kata sandi pengguna tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about PAM configuration, see the {sles} Security "
"Guide. The Security Guide contains a generic example that also works for "
"other network-based authentication methods.  It also describes how to "
"configure an Active Directory (AD) service.  For more information, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang konfigurasi PAM, lihat Panduan Keamanan {sles}. Panduan Keamanan berisi contoh umum yang juga dapat digunakan untuk metode autentikasi berbasis jaringan lainnya.  Panduan ini juga menjelaskan cara mengonfigurasi layanan Active Directory (AD).  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/part-auth.html."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "LDAP Integration with Active Directory Example"
msgstr "Contoh Integrasi LDAP dengan Active Directory"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For LDAP integration with Active Directory, you can use the following "
"example."
msgstr "Untuk integrasi LDAP dengan Active Directory, Anda dapat menggunakan contoh berikut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:20
msgid ""
"In the code snippet, change the following placeholders according to your "
"environment:"
msgstr "Dalam cuplikan kode, ubah placeholder berikut sesuai lingkungan Anda:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$domain`"
msgstr "`$domain`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:22
msgid "Your domain name"
msgstr "Nama domain Anda"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "`$ad_server`"
msgstr "`$ad_server`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:24
msgid ""
"FQDN of the AD server if it is not auto-detected from the `$domain` "
"`$uyuni-hostname`: The name of the machine this AD client is supposed to be "
"known.  If not set, it will be `uyuni-server.mgr.internal`."
msgstr "FQDN server AD jika tidak terdeteksi secara otomatis dari `$domain` `$uyuni-hostname`: Nama mesin yang akan digunakan untuk mengenali klien AD ini.  Jika tidak ditetapkan, namanya adalah `uyuni-server.mgr.internal`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:25
msgid "Example snippet for `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`:"
msgstr "Contoh cuplikan untuk `/etc/sssd/sssd.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"
msgstr ""
"[sssd]\n"
"config_file_version = 2\n"
"services = nss, pam\n"
"domains = $domain\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "[nss]\n"
msgstr "[nss]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "[pam]\n"
msgstr "[pam]\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"
msgstr ""
"[domain/$domain]\n"
"id_provider = ad\n"
"chpass_provider = ad\n"
"access_provider = ad\n"
"auth_provider = ad\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"
msgstr ""
"ad_domain = $domain\n"
"ad_server = $ad_server\n"
"ad_hostname = $uyuni-hostname\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"
msgstr "ad_gpo_map_network = +susemanager\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-pam.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"
msgstr ""
"krb5_keytab = FILE:/etc/rhn/krb5.conf.d/krb5.keytab\n"
"krb5_ccname_template = FILE:/tmp/krb5cc_%{uid}\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example SSO Implementation"
msgstr "Contoh Implementasi SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In this example, SSO is implemented by exposing three endpoints with "
"{productname}, and using Keycloak 26.5.3 or later as the identity service "
"provider (IdP)."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, SSO diimplementasikan dengan menyediakan tiga endpoint melalui {productname}, serta menggunakan Keycloak 26.5.3 atau yang lebih baru sebagai penyedia layanan identitas (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To set up Single Sign-On (SSO) with {productname} and Keycloak, you first "
"configure the Keycloak identity provider, obtain its public SAML "
"certificate, and set up the client and users. After that, you configure the "
"{productname} Server to trust Keycloak."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan Single Sign-On (SSO) dengan {productname} dan Keycloak, pertama-tama konfigurasikan penyedia identitas Keycloak, dapatkan sertifikat SAML publiknya, lalu siapkan klien dan pengguna. Setelah itu, konfigurasikan Server {productname} agar memercayai Keycloak."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This example is provided for illustrative purposes only.  {suse} does not "
"recommend or support third-party identity service providers, and is not "
"affiliated with Keycloak.  For Keycloak support, see "
"https://www.keycloak.org/."
msgstr "Contoh ini disediakan hanya untuk tujuan ilustrasi.  {suse} tidak merekomendasikan atau mendukung penyedia layanan identitas pihak ketiga, dan tidak berafiliasi dengan Keycloak.  Untuk dukungan Keycloak, lihat https://www.keycloak.org/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can install Keycloak directly on your machine, or run it in a "
"container.  In this example, we run Keycloak in a Podman container.  For "
"more information about installing Keycloak, see the Keycloak documentation "
"at https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."
msgstr "Anda dapat menginstal Keycloak langsung pada mesin Anda atau menjalankannya dalam kontainer.  Dalam contoh ini, Keycloak dijalankan dalam kontainer Podman.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang penginstalan Keycloak, lihat dokumentasi Keycloak di https://www.keycloak.org/guides#getting-started."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting up the identity service provider (Keycloak)"
msgstr "Menyiapkan penyedia layanan identitas (Keycloak)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:7
msgid ""
"First, run Keycloak, create a realm, obtain the SAML public certificate, and "
"configure the client."
msgstr "Pertama, jalankan Keycloak, buat realm, dapatkan sertifikat SAML publik, lalu konfigurasikan klien."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up Keycloak"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan Keycloak"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Install Keycloak in a Podman container, according to the Keycloak "
"documentation."
msgstr "Instal Keycloak dalam kontainer Podman sesuai dokumentasi Keycloak."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Run the container using the `-td` argument to ensure the process remains "
"running:"
msgstr "Jalankan kontainer menggunakan argumen `-td` untuk memastikan proses tetap berjalan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_ADMIN=admin -e "
"KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:26.1.1 start-dev\n"
msgstr "podman run -td --name keycloak -p 8080:8080 -e KEYCLOAK_ADMIN=admin -e KEYCLOAK_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin quay.io/keycloak/keycloak:26.1.1 start-dev\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:12
msgid "Sign in to the Keycloak Admin Console as the `admin` user."
msgstr "Masuk ke Konsol Admin Keycloak sebagai pengguna `admin`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:13
msgid "Create an authentication realm:"
msgstr "Buat realm autentikasi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:14
msgid ""
"In the top-left corner, click the realm selector dropdown (showing `master`) "
"and select `Manage realms`."
msgstr "Di sudut kiri atas, klik menu tarik-turun pemilih realm (yang menampilkan `master`), lalu pilih `Manage realms`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:15
msgid ""
"On the `Manage realms` page, click the btn:[Create realm] button in the "
"top-right corner."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Manage realms`, klik tombol btn:[Create realm] di sudut kanan atas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Realm name` field, enter a name (for example, `MLM`)."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Realm name`, masukkan nama (misalnya, `MLM`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:18
msgid "Obtain the SAML public certificate:"
msgstr "Dapatkan sertifikat SAML publik:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:19
msgid "From the left navigation menu, click menu:Realm settings[]."
msgstr "Dari menu navigasi kiri, klik menu:Realm settings[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:20
msgid "Click the `Keys` tab."
msgstr "Klik tab `Keys`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Find the active **RSA** key (with provider `rsa-generated`) in the active "
"keys table."
msgstr "Temukan kunci **RSA** yang aktif (dengan penyedia `rsa-generated`) dalam tabel kunci aktif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:22
msgid "Click the btn:[Certificate] button in that row."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Certificate] pada baris tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Copy the entire Base64-encoded certificate from the modal that opens. Keep "
"this certificate handy for the server configuration."
msgstr "Salin seluruh sertifikat yang dikodekan dalam Base64 dari jendela modal yang terbuka. Simpan sertifikat ini agar tersedia saat mengonfigurasi server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:24
msgid "Add {productname} as a Client:"
msgstr "Tambahkan {productname} sebagai Klien:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:25
msgid "From the left navigation menu, click menu:Clients[]."
msgstr "Dari menu navigasi kiri, klik menu:Clients[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Create client]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create client]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:27
msgid "In the `Client type` field, select `SAML`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Client type`, pilih `SAML`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the `Client ID` field, enter the {productname} Metadata endpoint.  For "
"example: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata`"
msgstr "Pada kolom `Client ID`, masukkan endpoint Metadata {productname}.  Misalnya: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the `Valid redirect URIs` field, enter the {productname} Assertion "
"Consumer Service (ACS) endpoint.  For example: "
"`https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`"
msgstr "Pada kolom `Valid redirect URIs`, masukkan endpoint Assertion Consumer Service (ACS) {productname}.  Misalnya: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:60
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:45
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:62
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:150
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:148
msgid "Click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:32
msgid "Fine-tune client settings:"
msgstr "Sesuaikan pengaturan klien:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:33
msgid "Under the `Settings` tab, scroll down to the `SAML capabilities` section:"
msgstr "Pada tab `Settings`, gulir ke bawah ke bagian `SAML capabilities`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:34
msgid "Toggle `Sign assertions` to `On`."
msgstr "Ubah `Sign assertions` menjadi `On`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:35
msgid "In the `Signature algorithm` field, select `RSA_SHA1`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Signature algorithm`, pilih `RSA_SHA1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:36
msgid "In the `SAML Signature Key Name` field, select `Key ID`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SAML Signature Key Name`, pilih `Key ID`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:37
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:47
msgid "Click **Save**."
msgstr "Klik **Save**."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:38
msgid "Under the `Keys` tab:"
msgstr "Pada tab `Keys`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:39
msgid "Toggle `Client signature required` to `Off`."
msgstr "Ubah `Client signature required` menjadi `Off`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:40
msgid ""
"Under the `Advanced` tab, scroll down to the `Fine Grain SAML Endpoint "
"Configuration` section:"
msgstr "Pada tab `Advanced`, gulir ke bawah ke bagian `Fine Grain SAML Endpoint Configuration`:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:41
msgid ""
"In both the `Assertion Consumer Service POST Binding URL` and `Assertion "
"Consumer Service Redirect Binding URL` fields, enter the {productname} ACS "
"endpoint."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Assertion Consumer Service POST Binding URL` dan `Assertion Consumer Service Redirect Binding URL`, masukkan endpoint ACS {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:42
msgid "For example: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`"
msgstr "Misalnya: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:43
msgid ""
"In the `Logout Service POST Binding URL` field, enter the {productname} SLS "
"endpoint."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Logout Service POST Binding URL`, masukkan endpoint SLS {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:44
msgid "For example: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls`"
msgstr "Misalnya: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the `Logout Service Redirect Binding URL` field, enter the root URL of "
"your {productname} instance."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Logout Service Redirect Binding URL`, masukkan URL akar instans {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:46
msgid "For example: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/`"
msgstr "Misalnya: `https://<FQDN_MLM>/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:48
msgid "Configure Client Scope and Mappers:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan Client Scope dan Mapper:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:49
msgid "From the left navigation menu, click menu:Client scopes[]."
msgstr "Dari menu navigasi kiri, klik menu:Client scopes[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:50
msgid "Click `role_list` in the list."
msgstr "Klik `role_list` dalam daftar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:51
msgid "Click the `Mappers` tab, and then click the `role list` mapper."
msgstr "Klik tab `Mappers`, lalu klik mapper `role list`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:52
msgid "Toggle `Single Role Attribute` to `On`, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Ubah `Single Role Attribute` menjadi `On`, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:53
msgid ""
"Go back to menu:Clients[], click your {productname} client ID "
"(`https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata`), and click the `Client "
"scopes` tab."
msgstr "Kembali ke menu:Clients[], klik ID klien {productname} Anda (`https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata`), lalu klik tab `Client scopes`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Click the dedicated scope (for example, "
"`https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata-dedicated`)."
msgstr "Klik scope khusus (misalnya, `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata-dedicated`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:55
msgid "Click btn:[Configure a new mapper]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Configure a new mapper]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:56
msgid ""
"Select `User Attribute` from the list, and configure the mapper with these "
"details:"
msgstr "Pilih `User Attribute` dari daftar, lalu konfigurasikan mapper dengan detail berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:57
msgid "In the `Name` field, enter `uid`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Name`, masukkan `uid`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:58
msgid "In the `Property` field, select `username`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Property`, pilih `username`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:59
msgid "In the `SAML Attribute Name` field, enter `uid`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `SAML Attribute Name`, masukkan `uid`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:61
msgid "Create Users:"
msgstr "Buat Pengguna:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:62
msgid "From the left navigation menu, click menu:Users[]."
msgstr "Dari menu navigasi kiri, klik menu:Users[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:63
msgid "Click btn:[Add user]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add user]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:64
msgid ""
"In the `Username` field, enter a username that matches an existing "
"{productname} user (for example, the administrative user)."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Username`, masukkan nama pengguna yang sama dengan pengguna yang sudah ada di {productname} (misalnya, pengguna administrator)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:66
msgid ""
"Click the `Credentials` tab, click btn:[Set password], set a password for "
"the user, and toggle `Temporary` to `Off`, click btn:[Save] and confirm by "
"clicking btn:[Save password]."
msgstr "Klik tab `Credentials`, klik btn:[Set password], tetapkan kata sandi untuk pengguna, lalu ubah `Temporary` menjadi `Off`, klik btn:[Save], dan konfirmasikan dengan mengeklik btn:[Save password]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "Setting up the {productname} server"
msgstr "Menyiapkan server {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:68
msgid ""
"After Keycloak is ready, configure the {productname} Server to use single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "Setelah Keycloak siap, konfigurasikan Server {productname} untuk menggunakan single sign-on."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Ensure that the users whom you intend to authenticate using SSO already "
"exist in {productname}. You can create users manually in the {productname} "
"{webui}, or use the command-line interface or API (using PAM-enabled or "
"passwordless authentication)."
msgstr "Pastikan pengguna yang akan diautentikasi menggunakan SSO sudah ada di {productname}. Anda dapat membuat pengguna secara manual di {webui} {productname}, atau menggunakan antarmuka baris perintah maupun API (dengan autentikasi berbasis PAM atau tanpa kata sandi)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up the {productname} server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan server {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:71
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` configuration "
"file."
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, buka berkas konfigurasi `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:72
msgid ""
"Add the following parameters. Replace `<FQDN_MLM>` with the fully qualified "
"domain name of your {productname} installation, `<FQDN_IDP>` with the FQDN "
"of your Keycloak server, `<REALM>` with your realm name (for example, "
"`MLM`), and `<CERTIFICATE>` with the SAML public certificate Base64-encoded "
"string obtained from Keycloak in the previous steps:"
msgstr "Tambahkan parameter berikut. Ganti `<FQDN_MLM>` dengan nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat dari instalasi {productname} Anda, `<FQDN_IDP>` dengan FQDN server Keycloak Anda, `<REALM>` dengan nama realm Anda (misalnya, `MLM`), dan `<CERTIFICATE>` dengan string sertifikat SAML publik yang dikodekan dalam Base64 yang diperoleh dari Keycloak pada langkah sebelumnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:73
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.debug = true\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.debug = true\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url      = "
"https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.entityid                       = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/metadata\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.single_logout_service.url = https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/sls\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url  = "
"http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
msgstr ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.entityid                   = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_sign_on_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.single_logout_service.url = http://<FQDN_IDP>:8080/realms/<REALM>/protocol/saml\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- "
"<CERTIFICATE> -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert = -----BEGIN CERTIFICATE----- <CERTIFICATE> -----END CERTIFICATE-----\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Organization Metadata (Optional)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.name = SUSE Multi-Linux Manager\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.displayname = SUSE Multi-Linux "
"Manager\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.url = https://<FQDN_MLM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.lang =\n"
msgstr ""
"# Metadata Organisasi (Opsional)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.name = SUSE Multi-Linux Manager\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.displayname = SUSE Multi-Linux Manager\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.url = https://<FQDN_MLM>\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.organization.lang =\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Contacts (Optional)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.given_name = SUSE Multi-Linux "
"Manager Admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.email_address = "
"admin@example.com\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.given_name = SUSE Multi-Linux "
"Manager Admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.email_address = admin@example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"# Kontak (Opsional)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.given_name = SUSE Multi-Linux Manager Admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.technical.email_address = [admin@example.com](mailto:admin@example.com)\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.given_name = SUSE Multi-Linux Manager Admin\n"
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.contacts.support.email_address = [admin@example.com](mailto:admin@example.com)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:80
msgid "Save your changes and restart the spacewalk service to apply them:"
msgstr "Simpan perubahan Anda dan mulai ulang layanan spacewalk untuk menerapkannya:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:82
msgid ""
"Navigate to the {productname} {webui}. You should be redirected to the "
"Keycloak login screen, and successfully log in back to {productname} upon "
"authentication."
msgstr "Buka {webui} {productname}. Anda seharusnya diarahkan ke layar masuk Keycloak, lalu berhasil masuk kembali ke {productname} setelah autentikasi."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:83
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:121
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:253
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-intro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:84
msgid ""
"If you encounter issues when authenticating with single sign-on, use these "
"steps to diagnose:"
msgstr "Jika Anda mengalami masalah saat melakukan autentikasi dengan single sign-on, gunakan langkah-langkah berikut untuk mendiagnosisnya:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Verify Logs:** Look for SSO errors in "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`. Detailed logging is enabled when "
"`java.sso.onelogin.saml2.debug = true` is set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.\n"
msgstr "**Periksa Log:** Cari kesalahan SSO di `/var/log/rhn/rhn_web_ui.log`. Pencatatan log terperinci diaktifkan jika `java.sso.onelogin.saml2.debug = true` ditetapkan di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**User Not Found:** If you see \"User not found\" or redirection fails after "
"Keycloak authentication, ensure the username in Keycloak matches the "
"username in {productname} exactly. Users must be pre-created in "
"{productname}.\n"
msgstr "**Pengguna Tidak Ditemukan:** Jika Anda melihat \"User not found\" atau pengalihan gagal setelah autentikasi Keycloak, pastikan nama pengguna di Keycloak sama persis dengan nama pengguna di {productname}. Pengguna harus dibuat terlebih dahulu di {productname}.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Signature and certificate errors:** If you see \"Signature verification "
"failed\", verify that the certificate in "
"`java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert` matches the active RSA certificate "
"displayed under the `Keys` tab in Keycloak Realm Settings, and ensure that "
"`Sign assertions` is toggled to `On` in the client settings.\n"
msgstr "**Kesalahan tanda tangan dan sertifikat:** Jika Anda melihat \"Signature verification failed\", pastikan sertifikat dalam `java.sso.onelogin.saml2.idp.x509cert` sesuai dengan sertifikat RSA aktif yang ditampilkan pada tab `Keys` di pengaturan realm Keycloak, dan pastikan `Sign assertions` diatur ke `On` dalam pengaturan klien.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso-example.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Invalid Redirect URI:** If Keycloak displays \"Invalid parameter: "
"redirect_uri\" on redirection, verify that `Valid redirect URIs` in client "
"settings in Keycloak is set to `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`.\n"
msgstr "**URI Pengalihan Tidak Valid:** Jika Keycloak menampilkan \"Invalid parameter: redirect_uri\" saat pengalihan, pastikan `Valid redirect URIs` dalam pengaturan klien di Keycloak diatur ke `https://<FQDN_MLM>/rhn/manager/sso/acs`.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication With Single Sign-On (SSO)"
msgstr "Autentikasi dengan Single Sign-On (SSO)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports single sign-on (SSO) by implementing the Security "
"Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2 protocol."
msgstr "{productname} mendukung single sign-on (SSO) dengan mengimplementasikan protokol Security Assertion Markup Language (SAML){nbsp}2."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Single sign-on is an authentication process that allows a user to access "
"multiple applications with one set of credentials.  SAML is an XML-based "
"standard for exchanging authentication and authorization data.  A SAML "
"identity service provider (IdP) provides authentication and authorization "
"services to service providers (SP), such as {productname}.  {productname} "
"exposes three endpoints which must be enabled for single sign-on."
msgstr "Single sign-on adalah proses autentikasi yang memungkinkan pengguna mengakses beberapa aplikasi dengan satu set kredensial.  SAML adalah standar berbasis XML untuk pertukaran data autentikasi dan otorisasi.  Penyedia layanan identitas SAML (IdP) menyediakan layanan autentikasi dan otorisasi bagi penyedia layanan (SP), seperti {productname}.  {productname} menyediakan tiga endpoint yang harus diaktifkan untuk single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:4
msgid "SSO in {productname} supports:"
msgstr "SSO di {productname} mendukung:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:5
msgid "Log in with SSO."
msgstr "Masuk dengan SSO."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Log out with service provider-initiated single logout (SLO), and Identity "
"service provider single logout service (SLS)."
msgstr "Keluar dengan single logout (SLO) yang dimulai oleh penyedia layanan, serta single logout service (SLS) dari penyedia layanan identitas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:7
msgid "Assertion and nameId encryption."
msgstr "Enkripsi assertion dan nameId."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:8
msgid "Assertion signatures."
msgstr "Tanda tangan assertion."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:9
msgid "Message signatures with AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, and LogoutResponses."
msgstr "Tanda tangan pesan dengan AuthNRequest, LogoutRequest, dan LogoutResponses."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:10
msgid "Enable an Assertion consumer service endpoint."
msgstr "Pengaktifan endpoint Assertion consumer service."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:11
msgid "Enable a single logout service endpoint."
msgstr "Pengaktifan endpoint single logout service."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:12
msgid "Publish the SP metadata (which can be signed)."
msgstr "Publikasi metadata SP (yang dapat ditandatangani)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:13
msgid "SSO in {productname} does not support:"
msgstr "SSO di {productname} tidak mendukung:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:14
msgid "Product choosing and implementation for the identity service provider (IdP)."
msgstr "Pemilihan dan implementasi produk untuk penyedia layanan identitas (IdP)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:15
msgid ""
"SAML support for other products (check with the respective product "
"documentation)."
msgstr "Dukungan SAML untuk produk lain (lihat dokumentasi produk terkait)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For an example implementation of SSO, see "
"xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk contoh implementasi SSO, lihat xref:administration:auth-methods-sso-example.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you change from the default authentication method to single sign-on, the "
"new SSO credentials apply only to the {webui}.  Client tools such as "
"`mgr-sync` or `spacecmd` continue to work with the default authentication "
"method only."
msgstr "Jika Anda beralih dari metode autentikasi bawaan ke single sign-on, kredensial SSO yang baru hanya berlaku untuk {webui}.  Alat klien seperti `mgr-sync` atau `spacecmd` tetap hanya dapat digunakan dengan metode autentikasi bawaan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "Prasyarat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you need to have configured an external identity service "
"provider with these parameters.  Check your IdP documentation for "
"instructions."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, Anda harus sudah mengonfigurasi penyedia layanan identitas eksternal dengan parameter berikut.  Lihat dokumentasi IdP Anda untuk petunjuknya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The mapping between the IdP user and the {productname} user is specified in "
"a SAML:Attribute.  The SAML:Attribute must be configured in the IdP and must "
"be passed to {productname} in the SAML authentication.  The attribute must "
"be named `uid` and must contain the {productname} user mapped to it after "
"login.  The {productname} user must be created before you activate single "
"sign-on."
msgstr "Pemetaan antara pengguna IdP dan pengguna {productname} ditentukan dalam SAML:Attribute.  SAML:Attribute harus dikonfigurasi di IdP dan harus diteruskan ke {productname} dalam autentikasi SAML.  Atribut tersebut harus bernama `uid` dan harus berisi pengguna {productname} yang dipetakan ke atribut tersebut setelah masuk.  Pengguna {productname} harus dibuat sebelum Anda mengaktifkan single sign-on."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:21
msgid "You need these endpoints:"
msgstr "Anda memerlukan endpoint berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Assertion consumer service (or ACS): an endpoint to accept SAML messages to "
"establish a session into the Service Provider."
msgstr "Assertion consumer service (atau ACS): endpoint untuk menerima pesan SAML guna membentuk sesi pada Penyedia Layanan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:23
msgid ""
"The endpoint for ACS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"
msgstr "Endpoint ACS di {productname} adalah: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/acs"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Single logout service (or SLS): an endpoint to initiate a logout request "
"from the IdP."
msgstr "Single logout service (atau SLS): endpoint untuk memulai permintaan keluar dari IdP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The endpoint for SLS in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"
msgstr "Endpoint SLS di {productname} adalah: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/sls"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:26
msgid "Metadata: an endpoint to retrieve {productname} metadata for SAML."
msgstr "Metadata: endpoint untuk mengambil metadata {productname} untuk SAML."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The endpoint for metadata in {productname} is: "
"https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"
msgstr "Endpoint metadata di {productname} adalah: https://server.example.com/rhn/manager/sso/metadata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:28
msgid ""
"After the authentication with the IdP using the user `orgadmin` is "
"successful, you are logged in to {productname} as the `orgadmin` user, "
"provided that the `orgadmin` user exists in {productname}."
msgstr "Setelah autentikasi dengan IdP menggunakan pengguna `orgadmin` berhasil, Anda masuk ke {productname} sebagai pengguna `orgadmin`, dengan syarat pengguna `orgadmin` sudah ada di {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable SSO"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan SSO"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Using SSO is mutually exclusive with other types of authentication: it is "
"either enabled or disabled.  SSO is disabled by default."
msgstr "SSO tidak dapat digunakan bersamaan dengan jenis autentikasi lain: SSO hanya dapat diaktifkan atau dinonaktifkan.  Secara bawaan, SSO dinonaktifkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-delclients.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:3
msgid "Use `mgrctl term` before running steps inside the server container."
msgstr "Gunakan `mgrctl term` sebelum menjalankan langkah-langkah di dalam kontainer server."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling SSO"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan SSO"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:33
msgid "If your users do not yet exist in {productname}, create them first."
msgstr "Jika pengguna Anda belum ada di {productname}, buat pengguna tersebut terlebih dahulu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:34
msgid "Edit `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and add this line at the end of the file:"
msgstr "Edit `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` dan tambahkan baris berikut di akhir berkas:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Find the parameters you want to customize in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`."
msgstr "Temukan parameter yang ingin Anda sesuaikan di `/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Insert the parameters you want to customize into `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` and "
"prefix them with `java.sso`.  For example, in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf` find:"
msgstr "Masukkan parameter yang ingin Anda sesuaikan ke dalam `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` dan tambahkan awalan `java.sso` pada parameter tersebut.  Misalnya, di `/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java_sso.conf`, temukan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:39
msgid ""
"To customize it, create the corresponding option in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` by "
"prefixing the option name with `java.sso.`:"
msgstr "Untuk menyesuaikannya, buat opsi yang sesuai di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` dengan menambahkan awalan `java.sso.` pada nama opsi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = "
"https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"
msgstr "java.sso.onelogin.saml2.sp.assertion_consumer_service.url = https://YOUR-PRODUCT-HOSTNAME-OR-IP/rhn/manager/sso/acs\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:41
msgid ""
"To find all the occurrences you need to change, search in the file for the "
"placeholders `YOUR-PRODUCT` and `YOUR-IDP-ENTITY`.  Every parameter comes "
"with a brief explanation of what it is meant for."
msgstr "Untuk menemukan semua bagian yang perlu Anda ubah, cari placeholder `YOUR-PRODUCT` dan `YOUR-IDP-ENTITY` di dalam berkas.  Setiap parameter disertai penjelasan singkat tentang kegunaannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:42
msgid "Restart the spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan spacewalk untuk menerapkan perubahan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods-sso.adoc:44
msgid ""
"When you visit the {productname} URL, you are redirected to the IdP for SSO "
"where you are requested to authenticate.  Upon successful authentication, "
"you are redirected to the {productname} {webui}, logged in as the "
"authenticated user.  If you encounter problems with logging in using SSO, "
"check the {productname} logs for more information."
msgstr "Saat mengunjungi URL {productname}, Anda diarahkan ke IdP untuk SSO dan diminta melakukan autentikasi.  Setelah autentikasi berhasil, Anda diarahkan ke {webui} {productname} dan masuk sebagai pengguna yang telah diautentikasi.  Jika Anda mengalami masalah saat masuk menggunakan SSO, periksa log {productname} untuk informasi lebih lanjut."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Authentication Methods"
msgstr "Metode Autentikasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/auth-methods.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} supports several different authentication methods.  This "
"section discusses pluggable authentication modules (PAM) and single sign-on "
"(SSO)."
msgstr "{productname} mendukung beberapa metode autentikasi yang berbeda.  Bagian ini membahas pluggable authentication modules (PAM) dan single sign-on (SSO)."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Backup Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Pencadangan Basis Data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This guide describes how to manage online database backups for the "
"{productname} server using `mgradm`.  The backup system is based on "
"{postgresql} continuous archiving Write-Ahead Logging (WAL)."
msgstr "Panduan ini menjelaskan cara mengelola pencadangan basis data secara daring untuk server {productname} menggunakan `mgradm`.  Sistem pencadangan ini didasarkan pada pengarsipan berkelanjutan Write-Ahead Logging (WAL) {postgresql}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To ensure the system can be fully recovered, perform regular backups of both "
"the database and other system volumes."
msgstr "Untuk memastikan sistem dapat dipulihkan sepenuhnya, lakukan pencadangan rutin terhadap basis data dan volume sistem lainnya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regularly copy your backup volumes and WAL files to an external storage "
"device or an off-site location for disaster recovery."
msgstr "Salin volume cadangan dan berkas WAL Anda secara berkala ke perangkat penyimpanan eksternal atau lokasi di luar lokasi utama untuk pemulihan bencana."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Gambaran Umum"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Continuous archiving reduces the risk of data loss by constantly backing up "
"the transaction logs (WAL) to a dedicated volume."
msgstr "Pengarsipan berkelanjutan mengurangi risiko kehilangan data dengan terus-menerus mencadangkan log transaksi (WAL) ke volume khusus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The backup system utilizes a dedicated Podman volume named "
"`var-pgsql-walbackup` to store:"
msgstr "Sistem pencadangan menggunakan volume Podman khusus bernama `var-pgsql-walbackup` untuk menyimpan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:8
msgid "A base backup (a full snapshot of the database)."
msgstr "Cadangan dasar (snapshot lengkap basis data)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:9
msgid "WAL segments (incremental changes since the last base backup)."
msgstr "Segmen WAL (perubahan inkremental sejak cadangan dasar terakhir)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Point-in-time recovery is currently not supported by `mgradm` and requires a "
"manual workflow."
msgstr "Pemulihan ke titik waktu tertentu saat ini tidak didukung oleh `mgradm` dan memerlukan alur kerja manual."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Only full recovery is supported by `mgradm` tool.  The restore procedure "
"will restore everything from the backup location."
msgstr "Alat `mgradm` hanya mendukung pemulihan penuh.  Prosedur pemulihan akan memulihkan seluruh isi dari lokasi cadangan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:13
msgid "`mgradm` tool installed on the host."
msgstr "Alat `mgradm` terinstal pada host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:14
msgid "{productname} server running in a Podman environment."
msgstr "Server {productname} berjalan dalam lingkungan Podman."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enabling backups"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan pencadangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:16
msgid "To enable continuous archiving, run the following command:"
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan pengarsipan berkelanjutan, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db enable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db enable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:18
msgid "This command:"
msgstr "Perintah ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:19
msgid "Verifies that the backup is not already enabled."
msgstr "Memastikan pencadangan belum diaktifkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Configures {postgresql} (`postgresql.conf`) to enable `archive_mode` and "
"sets the `archive_command`."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi {postgresql} (`postgresql.conf`) untuk mengaktifkan `archive_mode` dan menetapkan `archive_command`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:21
msgid "Configures the `var-pgsql-walbackup` volume for the database service."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi volume `var-pgsql-walbackup` untuk layanan basis data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:22
msgid "Restarts the database service to apply changes."
msgstr "Memulai ulang layanan basis data untuk menerapkan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:23
msgid "Performs an initial base backup inside the container."
msgstr "Membuat cadangan dasar awal di dalam kontainer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:24
msgid ""
"If the backup is already configured but you need to re-initialize it, use "
"the `--force` flag."
msgstr "Jika pencadangan sudah dikonfigurasi tetapi Anda perlu menginisialisasi ulang, gunakan flag `--force`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checking backup status"
msgstr "Memeriksa status pencadangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:26
msgid "You can verify the current state of the database backup system at any time:"
msgstr "Anda dapat memeriksa kondisi terkini sistem pencadangan basis data kapan saja:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db status\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db status\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:28
msgid "The command will report one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "Perintah ini akan melaporkan salah satu status berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "*enabled*: Backup is correctly configured and active.\n"
msgstr "*enabled*: Pencadangan dikonfigurasi dengan benar dan aktif.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "*disabled*: Continuous archiving is explicitly turned off.\n"
msgstr "*disabled*: Pengarsipan berkelanjutan dinonaktifkan secara eksplisit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*misconfigured*: There is a discrepancy between the configuration and the "
"runtime state (for example, missing volume, incorrect archive command).\n"
msgstr "*misconfigured*: Terdapat ketidaksesuaian antara konfigurasi dan kondisi saat dijalankan (misalnya, volume tidak tersedia atau perintah pengarsipan tidak benar).\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintaining backups (rebasing)"
msgstr "Memelihara cadangan (rebasing)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Over time, the number of WAL segments can grow significantly, consuming disk "
"space and increasing restoration time.  It is recommended to periodically "
"\"rebase\" the backup by creating a new base backup and starting a new WAL "
"chain."
msgstr "Seiring waktu, jumlah segmen WAL dapat bertambah secara signifikan, menghabiskan ruang disk dan memperpanjang waktu pemulihan.  Sebaiknya lakukan \"rebase\" cadangan secara berkala dengan membuat cadangan dasar baru dan memulai rangkaian WAL baru."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db rebase\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db rebase\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:35
msgid ""
"This command creates a fresh full snapshot of the database without requiring "
"a service restart."
msgstr "Perintah ini membuat snapshot lengkap basis data yang baru tanpa perlu memulai ulang layanan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Regularly rebase your database backups using command `mgradm backup db "
"rebase` to minimize the time required for restore operations."
msgstr "Lakukan rebase cadangan basis data Anda secara berkala menggunakan perintah `mgradm backup db rebase` untuk meminimalkan waktu yang diperlukan untuk operasi pemulihan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restoring from backup"
msgstr "Memulihkan dari cadangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Restoring from a backup is a *destructive operation* that replaces the "
"current database data with the content of the backup."
msgstr "Pemulihan dari cadangan merupakan *operasi destruktif* yang mengganti data basis data saat ini dengan isi cadangan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db restore\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db restore\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:40
msgid "The restoration process:"
msgstr "Proses pemulihan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:41
msgid "Stops the database service."
msgstr "Menghentikan layanan basis data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:42
msgid "Clears the current database data directory."
msgstr "Mengosongkan direktori data basis data saat ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:43
msgid "Extracts the base backup from the backup volume."
msgstr "Mengekstrak cadangan dasar dari volume cadangan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:44
msgid "Configures {postgresql} for recovery."
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi {postgresql} untuk pemulihan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:45
msgid "Starts the database service."
msgstr "Memulai layanan basis data."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:46
msgid "Replays the WAL segments to bring the database to the latest possible state."
msgstr "Menerapkan ulang segmen WAL untuk mengembalikan basis data ke kondisi paling mutakhir yang dapat dipulihkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:47
msgid ""
"The command will wait until the database has fully recovered and is ready to "
"accept connections."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan menunggu hingga basis data pulih sepenuhnya dan siap menerima koneksi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:48
msgid ""
"Ensure you have a recent base backup and all necessary WAL segments in the "
"`var-pgsql-walbackup` volume before performing a restore."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki cadangan dasar terbaru dan semua segmen WAL yang diperlukan dalam volume `var-pgsql-walbackup` sebelum melakukan pemulihan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disabling backups"
msgstr "Menonaktifkan pencadangan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:50
msgid "To turn off continuous archiving:"
msgstr "Untuk menonaktifkan pengarsipan berkelanjutan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:52
msgid ""
"By default, this command disables archiving in the configuration and "
"restarts the database but preserves the backup volume."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, perintah ini menonaktifkan pengarsipan dalam konfigurasi dan memulai ulang basis data, tetapi tetap mempertahankan volume cadangan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:53
msgid "To also remove the backup volume and all stored backups, use:"
msgstr "Untuk sekaligus menghapus volume cadangan dan semua cadangan yang tersimpan, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup db disable --purge-volume\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Regularly test your restore procedures to verify data integrity and ensure "
"you are prepared for a recovery."
msgstr "Uji prosedur pemulihan Anda secara berkala untuk memverifikasi integritas data dan memastikan kesiapan Anda melakukan pemulihan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "External documentation"
msgstr "Dokumentasi eksternal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore-db.adoc:57
msgid ""
"For more information on {postgresql}, see "
"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} "
"{postgresql-version}: Continuous Archiving and Point-in-Time Recovery "
"(PITR)]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang {postgresql}, lihat https://www.postgresql.org/docs/{postgresql-version}/continuous-archiving.html[{postgresql} {postgresql-version}: Pengarsipan Berkelanjutan dan Pemulihan ke Titik Waktu Tertentu (PITR)]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backup and Restore"
msgstr "Pencadangan dan Pemulihan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This chapter contains information on the files you need to back up.  With "
"the built-in backup and restore solution (`mgradm backup`) you create "
"{productname} backups.  Information about restoring from your backups in the "
"case of a system failure completes this chapter."
msgstr "Bab ini berisi informasi tentang berkas yang perlu Anda cadangkan.  Dengan solusi pencadangan dan pemulihan bawaan (`mgradm backup`), Anda dapat membuat cadangan {productname}.  Bab ini juga mencakup informasi tentang pemulihan dari cadangan jika terjadi kegagalan sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because {productname} relies on a database as well as the installed program "
"and configurations, it is important to back up all components of your "
"installation.  Back up your {productname} installation regularly to prevent "
"data loss and enable quick recovery."
msgstr "Karena {productname} bergantung pada basis data serta program dan konfigurasi yang terinstal, semua komponen instalasi Anda perlu dicadangkan.  Cadangkan instalasi {productname} Anda secara berkala untuk mencegah kehilangan data dan memungkinkan pemulihan yang cepat."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Regardless of the backup method you use, you must have available at least "
"three times the amount of space your current installation uses.  Running out "
"of space can result in backups failing, so check this often."
msgstr "Apa pun metode pencadangan yang Anda gunakan, Anda harus menyediakan ruang kosong setidaknya tiga kali lipat dari ruang yang digunakan instalasi Anda saat ini.  Kehabisan ruang dapat menyebabkan pencadangan gagal, jadi periksa ketersediaan ruang secara berkala."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Back up {productname}"
msgstr "Mencadangkan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The most comprehensive method for backing up your {productname} installation "
"is to use `mgradm backup create` command.  This can save you time in "
"administering your backup, and can be faster to reinstall and re-synchronize "
"in the case of failure.  However, this method requires significant disk "
"space and could take a long time to perform the backup."
msgstr "Metode paling menyeluruh untuk mencadangkan instalasi {productname} Anda adalah menggunakan perintah `mgradm backup create`.  Metode ini dapat menghemat waktu pengelolaan cadangan serta mempercepat penginstalan ulang dan sinkronisasi ulang jika terjadi kegagalan.  Namun, metode ini memerlukan ruang disk yang besar dan proses pencadangannya dapat memakan waktu lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:7
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` command performs backup to a directory.  This "
"directory can be both local or mounted remote storage."
msgstr "Perintah `mgradm backup create` mencadangkan data ke sebuah direktori. Direktori ini dapat berada di penyimpanan lokal maupun penyimpanan jarak jauh yang dipasang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:8
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` command allows various customizations of the content "
"of the backup.  For all available options, see `mgradm backup create "
"--help`."
msgstr "Perintah `mgradm backup create` memungkinkan berbagai penyesuaian isi cadangan.  Untuk semua opsi yang tersedia, lihat `mgradm backup create --help`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Full backup of {productname}"
msgstr "Pencadangan penuh {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:10
msgid ""
"A full backup of the {productname} consists of backing up the following "
"components:"
msgstr "Pencadangan penuh {productname} mencakup pencadangan komponen berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:11
msgid "{productname} volumes"
msgstr "volume {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:12
msgid "database volumes"
msgstr "volume basis data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:13
msgid "podman network configuration"
msgstr "konfigurasi jaringan podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:14
msgid "podman secrets"
msgstr "secret podman"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:15
msgid "{productname} systemd services"
msgstr "layanan systemd {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:16
msgid "{productname} container images"
msgstr "image kontainer {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:17
msgid ""
"The {productname} service is automatically stopped for the time it takes to "
"create a full backup.  The downtime can be significant.  After backup is "
"done, service is automatically restarted."
msgstr "Layanan {productname} dihentikan secara otomatis selama pembuatan cadangan penuh.  Waktu henti dapat berlangsung cukup lama.  Setelah pencadangan selesai, layanan dimulai ulang secara otomatis."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating full backup with `mgradm backup create`"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat cadangan penuh dengan `mgradm backup create`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:39
msgid "On the container host, as root, create backup with:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, sebagai root, buat cadangan dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:33
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:56
msgid "Replace `$path` by the path to the backup location."
msgstr "Ganti `$path` dengan jalur ke lokasi cadangan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Partial backup of {productname}"
msgstr "Pencadangan parsial {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:23
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup create` tool allows creating partial backups.  It is possible "
"to skip individual or all volumes, skip database backup and images."
msgstr "Alat `mgradm backup create` memungkinkan pembuatan cadangan parsial.  Anda dapat melewati satu atau semua volume, pencadangan basis data, dan image."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Particularly when database backup is skipped, backup is created without "
"stopping {productname} services and can act as a one phase in two phase "
"backup procedure."
msgstr "Khususnya jika pencadangan basis data dilewati, cadangan dibuat tanpa menghentikan layanan {productname} dan dapat menjadi salah satu tahap dalam prosedur pencadangan dua tahap."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Partial backups are only considering a part of the data, and do not take "
"potential dependencies with other parts which may not have been backed up in "
"consideration.  Therefore they cannot guarantee backup/restore consistency."
msgstr "Cadangan parsial hanya mencakup sebagian data dan tidak memperhitungkan kemungkinan ketergantungan pada bagian lain yang mungkin tidak dicadangkan.  Oleh karena itu, cadangan parsial tidak dapat menjamin konsistensi pencadangan dan pemulihan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping database backup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat cadangan parsial dengan melewati pencadangan basis data"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipdatabase $path\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating partial backup by skipping a volume"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat cadangan parsial dengan melewati volume"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes $volumes $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Replace `$volumes` by the name of the volume name to be excluded from the "
"backup, or by a comma separated list of volumes to be excluded."
msgstr "Ganti `$volumes` dengan nama volume yang akan dikecualikan dari cadangan, atau dengan daftar volume yang akan dikecualikan, dipisahkan dengan koma."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:35
msgid "Use `all` to skip all volumes, except database volumes."
msgstr "Gunakan `all` untuk melewati semua volume, kecuali volume basis data."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backing up extra volumes"
msgstr "Mencadangkan volume tambahan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:37
msgid ""
"`mgradm backup` command uses internal list of {productname} volumes.  If "
"additional volumes were configured during the installation, or additional "
"volumes should be added to the backup, they need to be specified using "
"`--extravolumes $volumes`."
msgstr "Perintah `mgradm backup` menggunakan daftar internal volume {productname}.  Jika volume tambahan dikonfigurasi selama penginstalan, atau jika volume tambahan perlu disertakan dalam cadangan, volume tersebut harus ditentukan menggunakan `--extravolumes $volumes`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating backup with additional custom volume"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat cadangan dengan volume kustom tambahan"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --extravolumes $volume $path\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:42
msgid ""
"Replace `$volumes` by the name of the volume name to be included in the "
"backup. or by a comma separated list of volumes to be included."
msgstr "Ganti `$volumes` dengan nama volume yang akan disertakan dalam cadangan, atau dengan daftar volume yang akan disertakan, dipisahkan dengan koma."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform a manual database backup"
msgstr "Melakukan pencadangan basis data secara manual"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Performing a manual database backup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan pencadangan basis data secara manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:45
msgid "Allocate permanent storage space for your backup."
msgstr "Alokasikan ruang penyimpanan permanen untuk cadangan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:46
msgid "At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, use:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, gunakan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"
msgstr "mgradm backup create --skipvolumes all --skipconfig --skipimages $path\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restore {productname} from the existing backup"
msgstr "Memulihkan {productname} dari cadangan yang sudah ada"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Restoring {productname} from the existing backup will enumerate backup for "
"volumes, images and configuration to restore. Unlike in backup create "
"scenario, restore operation is not using an internal volume list, but "
"automatically detect every volume or image present in the backup."
msgstr "Pemulihan {productname} dari cadangan yang sudah ada akan mendata volume, image, dan konfigurasi dalam cadangan yang akan dipulihkan. Berbeda dengan proses pembuatan cadangan, operasi pemulihan tidak menggunakan daftar volume internal, tetapi secara otomatis mendeteksi setiap volume atau image yang ada dalam cadangan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:50
msgid ""
"After the list of items to restore is gathered, presence and integrity check "
"is performed. Presence check ensures backup restore will not accidentally "
"overwrite existing volumes, image or configurations. Integrity check is done "
"by computing backup items checksums."
msgstr "Setelah daftar item yang akan dipulihkan terkumpul, pemeriksaan keberadaan dan integritas dilakukan. Pemeriksaan keberadaan memastikan pemulihan cadangan tidak secara tidak sengaja menimpa volume, image, atau konfigurasi yang sudah ada. Pemeriksaan integritas dilakukan dengan menghitung checksum item cadangan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:51
msgid "After both checks are successful, actual backup restore is performed."
msgstr "Setelah kedua pemeriksaan berhasil, pemulihan cadangan dilakukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:52
msgid ""
"{productname} services are not automatically started after backup restore is "
"finished."
msgstr "Layanan {productname} tidak dimulai secara otomatis setelah pemulihan cadangan selesai."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restoring from an existing backup"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memulihkan dari cadangan yang sudah ada"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:54
msgid "On the container host, as root, re-deploy the {productname} Server with:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, sebagai root, terapkan ulang Server {productname} dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm stop\n"
"mgradm backup restore $path\n"
"mgradm start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Verification of the backup can be a time-consuming operation. If backup "
"integrity is ensured by other means, verification can be skipped by using "
"`--skipverify` option."
msgstr "Verifikasi cadangan dapat memakan waktu lama. Jika integritas cadangan dipastikan melalui cara lain, verifikasi dapat dilewati menggunakan opsi `--skipverify`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:58
msgid ""
"If for some reason it is needed to skip restoring a volume present in the "
"backup, `--skipvolumes $volumes` option can be used."
msgstr "Jika karena alasan tertentu pemulihan suatu volume dalam cadangan perlu dilewati, opsi `--skipvolumes $volumes` dapat digunakan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended steps after restoring a backup"
msgstr "Langkah yang disarankan setelah memulihkan cadangan"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Recommended steps after {productname} restore"
msgstr "Prosedur: Langkah yang disarankan setelah pemulihan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Re-synchronize your {productname} repositories using either the "
"{productname} {webui}, or with the `mgr-sync` tool at the command prompt in "
"the container.  You can choose to re-register your product, or skip the "
"registration and SSL certificate generation sections."
msgstr "Sinkronkan ulang repositori {productname} Anda menggunakan {webui} {productname} atau alat `mgr-sync` pada prompt perintah di dalam kontainer.  Anda dapat memilih untuk mendaftarkan ulang produk Anda, atau melewati bagian pendaftaran dan pembuatan sertifikat SSL."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:62
msgid ""
"On the container host, check whether you need to restore "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`.  If "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/` was not "
"in your backup, you need to restore it.  If the source repository is "
"available, you can restore "
"`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`u with a "
"complete channel synchronization:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, periksa apakah Anda perlu memulihkan `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`.  Jika `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/` tidak disertakan dalam cadangan, Anda perlu memulihkannya.  Jika repositori sumber tersedia, Anda dapat memulihkan `/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-spacewalk/_data/packages/`u dengan sinkronisasi channel penuh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh --refresh-channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Schedule the re-creation of search indexes next time the `rhn-search` "
"service is started."
msgstr "Jadwalkan pembuatan ulang indeks pencarian saat layanan `rhn-search` dimulai berikutnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:65
msgid ""
"This command produces only debug messages, it does not produce error "
"messages."
msgstr "Perintah ini hanya menghasilkan pesan debug, bukan pesan kesalahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:66
msgid "On the container host, enter:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer, masukkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/backup-restore.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- rhn-search cleanindex\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Channel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:2
msgid "Channels are a method of grouping software packages."
msgstr "Channel merupakan metode untuk mengelompokkan paket perangkat lunak."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In {productname}, channels are grouped into base and child channels, with "
"base channels grouped by operating system type, version, and architecture, "
"and child channels being compatible with their related base channel.  When a "
"client has been assigned to a base channel, it is only possible for that "
"system to install the related child channels.  Organizing channels in this "
"way ensures that only compatible packages are installed on each system."
msgstr "Di {productname}, channel dikelompokkan menjadi channel dasar dan channel anak. Channel dasar dikelompokkan berdasarkan jenis, versi, dan arsitektur sistem operasi, sedangkan channel anak kompatibel dengan channel dasar terkait.  Setelah klien ditetapkan ke channel dasar, sistem tersebut hanya dapat menginstal channel anak yang terkait.  Pengaturan channel dengan cara ini memastikan bahwa hanya paket yang kompatibel yang diinstal pada setiap sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Software channels use repositories to provide packages.  The channels mirror "
"the repositories in {productname}, and the package names and other data are "
"stored in the {productname} database.  You can have any number of "
"repositories associated with a channel.  The software from those "
"repositories can then be installed on clients by subscribing the client to "
"the appropriate channel."
msgstr "Channel perangkat lunak menggunakan repositori untuk menyediakan paket.  Channel mencerminkan repositori di {productname}, sedangkan nama paket dan data lainnya disimpan dalam basis data {productname}.  Anda dapat mengaitkan berapa pun jumlah repositori dengan sebuah channel.  Perangkat lunak dari repositori tersebut kemudian dapat diinstal pada klien dengan mendaftarkan klien ke channel yang sesuai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Clients can only be assigned to one base channel.  The client can then "
"install or update packages from the repositories associated with that base "
"channel and any of its child channels."
msgstr "Klien hanya dapat ditetapkan ke satu channel dasar.  Klien kemudian dapat menginstal atau memperbarui paket dari repositori yang terkait dengan channel dasar tersebut dan semua channel anaknya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} provides a number of vendor channels, which provide you "
"everything you need to run {productname}.  {productname} Administrators and "
"Channel Administrators have channel management authority, which gives them "
"the ability to create and manage their own custom channels.  If you want to "
"use your own packages in your environment, you can create custom channels.  "
"Custom channels can be used as a base channel, or you can associate them "
"with a vendor base channel."
msgstr "{productname} menyediakan sejumlah channel vendor yang menyediakan semua yang Anda perlukan untuk menjalankan {productname}.  Administrator {productname} dan Administrator Channel memiliki wewenang pengelolaan channel, sehingga mereka dapat membuat dan mengelola channel kustom sendiri.  Jika Anda ingin menggunakan paket sendiri di lingkungan Anda, Anda dapat membuat channel kustom.  Channel kustom dapat digunakan sebagai channel dasar, atau dikaitkan dengan channel dasar vendor."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For more on creating custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pembuatan channel kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Channel Administration"
msgstr "Administrasi Channel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"By default, any user can subscribe channels to a system.  You can implement "
"restrictions on the channel using the {webui}."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, setiap pengguna dapat mendaftarkan sistem ke channel.  Anda dapat menerapkan pembatasan pada channel menggunakan {webui}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Restricting Subscriber Access to a Channel"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membatasi Akses Pelanggan ke Channel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Channel List], and "
"select the channel to edit."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Channel List], lalu pilih channel yang akan diedit."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Locate the `Per-User Subscription Restrictions` section and check `Only "
"selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel`.  "
"Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "Temukan bagian `Per-User Subscription Restrictions` dan centang `Only selected users within your organization may subscribe to this channel`.  Klik btn:[Update] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:13
msgid "Navigate to the `Subscribers` tab and select or deselect users as required."
msgstr "Buka tab `Subscribers`, lalu pilih atau batalkan pilihan pengguna sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Delete Channels"
msgstr "Menghapus Channel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:15
msgid "You can delete vendor software channels from the command prompt."
msgstr "Anda dapat menghapus channel perangkat lunak vendor melalui prompt perintah."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting Vendor Channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghapus Channel Vendor"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, as root, list the "
"available vendor channels, and make a note of the channel you want to "
"delete:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, di prompt perintah, sebagai root, tampilkan daftar channel vendor yang tersedia, lalu catat channel yang ingin Anda hapus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync list channels\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync list channels\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:19
msgid "Delete the channel:"
msgstr "Hapus channel:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-remove-channel -c <channel-name>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"For more information about deleting channels manually, see "
"xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang penghapusan channel secara manual, lihat xref:administration:removing-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/channel-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"For information about deleting custom channels, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang penghapusan channel kustom, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confidential Computing"
msgstr "Komputasi Konfidensial"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{CoCo} is a technology which allows protection of data in use by using "
"hardware-based Trusted Execution Environment (TEE), the type of environments "
"that provide increased level of security for data integrity, data "
"confidentiality, and code integrity."
msgstr "{CoCo} adalah teknologi yang memungkinkan perlindungan data yang sedang digunakan melalui Trusted Execution Environment (TEE) berbasis perangkat keras, yaitu jenis lingkungan yang memberikan tingkat keamanan lebih tinggi untuk integritas data, kerahasiaan data, dan integritas kode."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "{CoCo} with {productname}"
msgstr "{CoCo} dengan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The trustworthiness of the TEE is checked with the attestation process.  "
"{productname} can be used as an attestation server for the systems "
"registered to it.  It generates a report page for the systems which run in "
"this mode.  These systems need to be attested and checked on regular base.  "
"The history of the past checks is also stored and available per request."
msgstr "Keterpercayaan TEE diperiksa melalui proses atestasi.  {productname} dapat digunakan sebagai server atestasi untuk sistem yang terdaftar padanya.  {productname} menghasilkan halaman laporan untuk sistem yang berjalan dalam mode ini.  Sistem tersebut perlu diatestasi dan diperiksa secara berkala.  Riwayat pemeriksaan sebelumnya juga disimpan dan tersedia berdasarkan permintaan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:5
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation depends on the used hardware and environment where the "
"attested systems are running on."
msgstr "Atestasi {CoCo} bergantung pada perangkat keras yang digunakan dan lingkungan tempat sistem yang diatestasi berjalan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{CoCo} Attestation is only available when {productname} is running on "
"{x86_64} architecture."
msgstr "Atestasi {CoCo} hanya tersedia jika {productname} berjalan pada arsitektur {x86_64}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:129
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:8
msgid "{CoCo} can be set up in an environment with the following characteristics:"
msgstr "{CoCo} dapat disiapkan dalam lingkungan dengan karakteristik berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Attested system (virtual machine) is bootstrapped to {productname} and runs "
"on one of the following systems:"
msgstr "Sistem yang diatestasi (mesin virtual) telah melalui proses bootstrap ke {productname} dan menjalankan salah satu sistem berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:10
msgid "{sle} 15 SP6"
msgstr "{sle} 15 SP6"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:11
msgid "{sle} 15 SP7"
msgstr "{sle} 15 SP7"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:12
msgid "{sle} 16"
msgstr "{sle} 16"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:13
msgid "{leap} 15 SP6"
msgstr "{leap} 15 SP6"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:14
msgid "{leap} 15 SP7"
msgstr "{leap} 15 SP7"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:15
msgid "{leap} 16"
msgstr "{leap} 16"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:16
msgid "Hardware must have one of the following CPUs:"
msgstr "Perangkat keras harus memiliki salah satu CPU berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:17
msgid "`AMD EPYC Milan`"
msgstr "`AMD EPYC Milan`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:18
msgid "`AMD EPYC Genoa`"
msgstr "`AMD EPYC Genoa`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:19
msgid "`AMD EPYC Bergamo`"
msgstr "`AMD EPYC Bergamo`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:20
msgid "`AMD EPYC Siena`"
msgstr "`AMD EPYC Siena`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:21
msgid "`AMD EPYC Turin`"
msgstr "`AMD EPYC Turin`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:22
msgid "`IBM z16`"
msgstr "`IBM z16`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:23
msgid "`IBM z17`"
msgstr "`IBM z17`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:24
msgid "BIOS must be configured to allow {CoCo} attestation"
msgstr "BIOS harus dikonfigurasi untuk mengizinkan atestasi {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Host OS and the virtualization software (KVM and libvirt) must support "
"{CoCo}"
msgstr "Sistem operasi host dan perangkat lunak virtualisasi (KVM dan libvirt) harus mendukung {CoCo}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For information about required URLs when performing confidential computing "
"attestation for IBM, see see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#required-urls[Required "
"URLs]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang URL yang diperlukan saat melakukan atestasi komputasi konfidensial untuk IBM, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:network-requirements.adoc#required-urls[URL yang Diperlukan]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:260
#, no-wrap
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Batasan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Secure boot is attested.  However, currently KVM secure boot and AMD "
"attestation tool `snpguest` are not working together."
msgstr "Secure boot diatestasi.  Namun, saat ini secure boot KVM dan alat atestasi AMD `snpguest` tidak dapat berfungsi bersama."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use {CoCo} in {productname}"
msgstr "Menggunakan {CoCo} di {productname}"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For the exact steps for setting up and configuring {CoCo} on your host, "
"refer to the OS Vendor documentation."
msgstr "Untuk langkah-langkah terperinci dalam menyiapkan dan mengonfigurasi {CoCo} pada host Anda, lihat dokumentasi vendor sistem operasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container During the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan Kontainer Atestasi Selama Penginstalan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:32
msgid ""
"The attestation container is enabled during the installation of "
"{productname} with `mgradm install`."
msgstr "Kontainer atestasi diaktifkan selama penginstalan {productname} dengan `mgradm install`."

#. I need full path to this file.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:33
msgid "Add the following to file `mgradm.yaml`."
msgstr "Tambahkan yang berikut ke berkas `mgradm.yaml`."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"
msgstr ""
"coco:\n"
"    replicas: 1\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Enabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan Kontainer Atestasi Setelah Penginstalan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:36
msgid ""
"To enable the attestation container after the installation, use the command "
"line parameter `mgradm`."
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan kontainer atestasi setelah penginstalan, gunakan parameter baris perintah `mgradm`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:37
msgid "Run the command"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 1\n"

#.  (PLACEHOLDER): In the future instead of number 1, it should be possible to allow more then one container replica.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Procedure: Disabling Attestation Container After the {productname} "
"Installation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menonaktifkan Kontainer Atestasi Setelah Penginstalan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:40
msgid "To disable the already enabled attestation container, run the command:"
msgstr "Untuk menonaktifkan kontainer atestasi yang sudah diaktifkan, jalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"
msgstr "mgradm scale uyuni-server-attestation --replicas 0\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling Attestation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan Atestasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:43
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > "
"Settings]."
msgstr "Untuk sistem yang dipilih, buka tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > Settings]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:44
msgid "Enable the attestation by selecting the toggle button."
msgstr "Aktifkan atestasi dengan memilih tombol pengalih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the field `Environment Type` select the correct option from the drop-down "
"list."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Environment Type`, pilih opsi yang sesuai dari daftar tarik-turun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:46
msgid ""
"If the field `Environment Type` is set to one of the `IBM z-series` CPU "
"values, two more settings are required, `Host Key Document` and `Secure "
"Execution Header`."
msgstr "Jika kolom `Environment Type` diatur ke salah satu nilai CPU `IBM z-series`, diperlukan dua pengaturan tambahan, yaitu `Host Key Document` dan `Secure Execution Header`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:47
msgid ""
"`Host Key Document` is a public key certificate of the IBM hypervisor server "
"instance where the attested system is going to run."
msgstr "`Host Key Document` adalah sertifikat kunci publik dari instans server hypervisor IBM tempat sistem yang diatestasi akan dijalankan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:48
msgid ""
"`Secure Execution Header` is a binary file needed to build the IBM secure VM "
"image of the attested system."
msgstr "`Secure Execution Header` adalah berkas biner yang diperlukan untuk membuat image VM aman IBM bagi sistem yang diatestasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:49
msgid ""
"Both files should be requested by the administrator creating the attested "
"system VM running on the IBM hypervisor."
msgstr "Kedua berkas tersebut harus diminta oleh administrator yang membuat VM sistem yang diatestasi dan dijalankan pada hypervisor IBM."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:50
msgid ""
"`Host Key Document` and `Secure Execution Header` are not security "
"sensitive, therefore it is safe to store them on the {productname} server."
msgstr "`Host Key Document` dan `Secure Execution Header` tidak bersifat sensitif dari segi keamanan, sehingga aman untuk disimpan pada server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:51
msgid "Click button btn:[Save] to save the changes."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Save] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling New Attestation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjadwalkan Atestasi Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:53
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:59
msgid ""
"For the selected system, go to tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List "
"Attestations]."
msgstr "Untuk sistem yang dipilih, buka tab menu:Audit[Confidential Computing > List Attestations]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:54
msgid "Click btn:[Schedule Attestation].  The new form opens."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Schedule Attestation].  Formulir baru akan terbuka."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:55
msgid "In the field `Earliest` select the time of running the attestation."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Earliest`, pilih waktu pelaksanaan atestasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If needed, add the newly created attestation to the action chain by "
"selecting `Add to` option."
msgstr "Jika diperlukan, tambahkan atestasi yang baru dibuat ke rantai tindakan dengan memilih opsi `Add to`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Click button btn:[Schedule] to save and schedule the new attestation "
"execution."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Schedule] untuk menyimpan dan menjadwalkan pelaksanaan atestasi baru."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from System Details"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melihat Laporan Atestasi dari Detail Sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:60
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:67
msgid "Find and select the report you want to view."
msgstr "Temukan dan pilih laporan yang ingin Anda lihat."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:61
msgid "After clicking the selected attestation report tab `Overview` will open."
msgstr "Setelah Anda mengeklik laporan atestasi yang dipilih, tab `Overview` akan terbuka."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:62
msgid ""
"If the selected CPU is `AMD` you will be shown additional tabs `SEV-SNP` and "
"`Secure boot`."
msgstr "Jika CPU yang dipilih adalah `AMD`, tab tambahan `SEV-SNP` dan `Secure boot` akan ditampilkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:63
msgid ""
"If the selected CPU is `IBM` you will be shown additional tab `IBM "
"SELPVATTEST`."
msgstr "Jika CPU yang dipilih adalah `IBM`, tab tambahan `IBM SELPVATTEST` akan ditampilkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Viewing Attestation Reports from Audit"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melihat Laporan Atestasi dari Audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:65
msgid "From the navigation bar, select menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."
msgstr "Dari bilah navigasi, pilih menu:Audit[Confidential Computing]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:66
msgid "The list of all attestations will be shown in the main panel."
msgstr "Daftar semua atestasi akan ditampilkan pada panel utama."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Report Statuses"
msgstr "Status Laporan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:69
msgid "Attestation reports can have one of the following statuses:"
msgstr "Laporan atestasi dapat memiliki salah satu status berikut:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Tertunda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:71
msgid ""
"This is the default status of the scheduled attestation.  The report is "
"still not available, either because the process has not yet started or "
"completed."
msgstr "Ini adalah status bawaan atestasi yang dijadwalkan.  Laporan belum tersedia karena proses belum dimulai atau belum selesai."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Successful"
msgstr "Berhasil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:73
msgid ""
"When the scheduled attestation creates a report which can be viewed, the "
"status of the process is `Successful`."
msgstr "Ketika atestasi yang dijadwalkan menghasilkan laporan yang dapat dilihat, status prosesnya adalah `Successful`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Gagal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When the scheduled fails and does not create a report as a result, the "
"status of the process is `Failed`."
msgstr "Ketika atestasi yang dijadwalkan gagal dan tidak menghasilkan laporan, status prosesnya adalah `Failed`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Related Topics"
msgstr "Topik Terkait"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/confidential-computing.adoc:77
msgid ""
"For more information about {CoCo}, see "
"https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[here]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang {CoCo}, lihat https://www.fortanix.com/platform/confidential-computing-manager/what-is-confidential-computing[di sini]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management Examples"
msgstr "Contoh Pengelolaan Siklus Hidup Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section contains some common examples of how you can use content "
"lifecycle management.  Use these examples to build your own personalized "
"implementation."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi beberapa contoh umum penggunaan pengelolaan siklus hidup konten.  Gunakan contoh-contoh ini untuk menyusun implementasi yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a Project for a Monthly Patch Cycle"
msgstr "Membuat Proyek untuk Siklus Patch Bulanan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:4
msgid "An example project for a monthly patch cycle consists of:"
msgstr "Contoh proyek untuk siklus patch bulanan mencakup:"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a `By Date` filter"
msgstr "Membuat filter `By Date`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:6
msgid "Adding the filter to the project"
msgstr "Menambahkan filter ke proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:7
msgid "Applying the filter to a new project build"
msgstr "Menerapkan filter pada build proyek baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:8
msgid "Excluding a patch from the project"
msgstr "Mengecualikan patch dari proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:9
msgid "Including a patch in the project"
msgstr "Menyertakan patch dalam proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `By Date` filter excludes all patches released after a specified date.  "
"This filter is useful for your content lifecycle projects that follow a "
"monthly patch cycle."
msgstr "Filter `By Date` mengecualikan semua patch yang dirilis setelah tanggal yang ditentukan.  Filter ini berguna untuk proyek siklus hidup konten yang mengikuti siklus patch bulanan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating the `By Date` filter"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat filter `By Date`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:38
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:53
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], lalu klik btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:14
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:90
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, type a name for your filter."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Name`, ketik nama untuk filter Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:15
msgid "For example, `Exclude patches by date`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `Exclude patches by date`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Patch (Issue date)`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Type`, pilih `Patch (Issue date)`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:17
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, `later or equal` is autoselected."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Matcher`, `later or equal` dipilih secara otomatis."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:18
msgid "Select the date and time."
msgstr "Pilih tanggal dan waktu."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add a filter to the project"
msgstr "Menambahkan filter ke proyek"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a filter to a project"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan filter ke proyek"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:22
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] "
"and select a project from the list."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek dari daftar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:23
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link to see all available filters"
msgstr "Klik tautan btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] untuk melihat semua filter yang tersedia"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:24
msgid "Select the new `Exclude patches by date` filter."
msgstr "Pilih filter baru `Exclude patches by date`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Apply a filter to a new project build"
msgstr "Menerapkan filter pada build proyek baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The new filter is added to your filter list, but it still needs to be "
"applied to the project.  To apply the filter you need to build the first "
"environment."
msgstr "Filter baru telah ditambahkan ke daftar filter Anda, tetapi masih perlu diterapkan pada proyek.  Untuk menerapkan filter, Anda perlu melakukan build lingkungan pertama."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using the filter"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menggunakan filter"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:29
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to build the first environment."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Build] untuk melakukan build lingkungan pertama."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:30
msgid "OPTIONAL: Add a message."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Tambahkan pesan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:31
msgid "You can use messages to help track the build history."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan pesan untuk membantu melacak riwayat build."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:32
msgid ""
"Check that the filter has worked correctly by using the new channels on a "
"test server."
msgstr "Pastikan filter berfungsi dengan benar dengan menggunakan channel baru pada server pengujian."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:33
msgid "Click btn:[Promote] to move the content to the next environment."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Promote] untuk memindahkan konten ke lingkungan berikutnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The build takes longer if you have a large number of filters, or they are "
"very complex."
msgstr "Proses build memerlukan waktu lebih lama jika jumlah filter banyak atau filter sangat kompleks."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude a patch from the project"
msgstr "Mengecualikan patch dari proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Tests may help you discover issues.  When an issue is found, exclude the "
"problem patch released before the `by date` filter."
msgstr "Pengujian dapat membantu Anda menemukan masalah.  Jika ditemukan masalah, kecualikan patch bermasalah yang dirilis sebelum tanggal yang ditentukan dalam filter `by date`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding a patch"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengecualikan patch"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:39
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, enter a name for the filter."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Name`, masukkan nama untuk filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:40
msgid "For example, `Exclude openjdk patch`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `Exclude openjdk patch`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:41
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:56
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Patch (Advisory Name)`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Type`, pilih `Patch (Advisory Name)`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:42
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:57
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:134
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:149
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, select `equals`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Matcher`, pilih `equals`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:43
msgid "In the `Advisory Name` field, type a name for the advisory."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Advisory Name`, ketik nama advisori."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:44
msgid "For example, `SUSE-15-2019-1807`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `SUSE-15-2019-1807`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:46
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:99
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:140
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:165
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:83
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:101
msgid "Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project."
msgstr "Buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters] link, select `Exclude openjdk patch`, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Klik tautan btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], pilih `Exclude openjdk patch`, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you rebuild the project with the btn:[Build] button, the new filter is "
"used together with the `by date` filter we added before."
msgstr "Saat Anda melakukan build ulang proyek dengan tombol btn:[Build], filter baru digunakan bersama filter `by date` yang telah ditambahkan sebelumnya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Include a patch in the project"
msgstr "Menyertakan patch dalam proyek"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In this example, you have received a security alert.  An important security "
"patch was released several days after the first of the month you are "
"currently working on.  The name of the new patch is `SUSE-15-2019-2071`.  "
"You need to include this new patch into your environment."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, Anda telah menerima peringatan keamanan.  Patch keamanan penting dirilis beberapa hari setelah tanggal satu pada bulan yang sedang Anda tangani.  Nama patch baru tersebut adalah `SUSE-15-2019-2071`.  Anda perlu menyertakan patch baru ini dalam lingkungan Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:51
msgid ""
"The `Allow` filters rule overrides the exclude function of the `Deny` filter "
"rule.  For more information, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Aturan filter `Allow` mengesampingkan fungsi pengecualian aturan filter `Deny`.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Including a patch in a project"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyertakan patch dalam proyek"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:54
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, type a name for the filter."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Name`, ketik nama untuk filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:55
msgid "For example, `Include kernel security fix`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `Include kernel security fix`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:58
msgid "In the `Advisory Name` field, type `SUSE-15-2019-2071`, and check `Allow`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Advisory Name`, ketik `SUSE-15-2019-2071`, lalu centang `Allow`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:59
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:98
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to store the filter."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save] untuk menyimpan filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects] and select your project from "
"the list."
msgstr "Buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek Anda dari daftar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and select `Include kernel security "
"patch`."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], lalu pilih `Include kernel security patch`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:63
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:114
msgid "Click btn:[Build] to rebuild the environment."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Build] untuk melakukan build ulang lingkungan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update an existing monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "Memperbarui siklus patch bulanan yang sudah ada"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When a monthly patch cycle is complete, you can update the patch cycle for "
"the next month."
msgstr "Setelah siklus patch bulanan selesai, Anda dapat memperbarui siklus patch untuk bulan berikutnya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Updating a monthly patch cycle"
msgstr "Prosedur: Memperbarui siklus patch bulanan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:67
msgid "In the `by date` field, change the date of the filter to the next month."
msgstr "Pada kolom `by date`, ubah tanggal filter ke bulan berikutnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:68
msgid "Alternatively, create a new filter and change the assignment to the project."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, buat filter baru dan ubah penetapan filter pada proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Check if the exclude filter for `SUSE-15-2019-1807` can be detached from the "
"project."
msgstr "Periksa apakah filter pengecualian untuk `SUSE-15-2019-1807` dapat dilepas dari proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:70
msgid "There may be a new patch available to fix this issue."
msgstr "Patch baru untuk memperbaiki masalah ini mungkin sudah tersedia."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:71
msgid "Detach the `allow` filter you added previously."
msgstr "Lepaskan filter `allow` yang Anda tambahkan sebelumnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:72
msgid "The patch is included by default."
msgstr "Patch tersebut disertakan secara bawaan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:73
msgid ""
"Rebuild the project to create a new environment with patches for the next "
"month."
msgstr "Lakukan build ulang proyek untuk membuat lingkungan baru dengan patch untuk bulan berikutnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhance a project with live patching"
msgstr "Meningkatkan proyek dengan live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:75
msgid ""
"This section covers setting up filters to create environments for live "
"patching."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas penyiapan filter untuk membuat lingkungan bagi live patching."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:76
msgid ""
"When you are preparing to use live patching, there are some important "
"considerations:"
msgstr "Saat mempersiapkan penggunaan live patching, ada beberapa hal penting yang perlu dipertimbangkan:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:77
msgid "Only ever use one kernel version on your systems."
msgstr "Selalu gunakan hanya satu versi kernel pada sistem Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:78
msgid "The live patching packages are installed with a specific kernel."
msgstr "Paket live patching diinstal bersama kernel tertentu."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:79
msgid "Live patching updates are shipped as one patch."
msgstr "Pembaruan live patching didistribusikan sebagai satu patch."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:80
msgid ""
"Each kernel patch that begins a new series of live patching kernels displays "
"the `required reboot` flag."
msgstr "Setiap patch kernel yang mengawali rangkaian baru kernel live patching menampilkan flag `required reboot`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:81
msgid ""
"These kernel patches come with live patching tools.  When you have installed "
"them, you need to reboot the system at least once before the next year."
msgstr "Patch kernel ini disertai alat live patching.  Setelah menginstalnya, Anda perlu memulai ulang sistem setidaknya sekali sebelum tahun berikutnya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:82
msgid "Only install live patch updates that match the installed kernel version."
msgstr "Instal hanya pembaruan live patch yang sesuai dengan versi kernel yang terinstal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:83
msgid "Live patches are provided as stand-alone patches."
msgstr "Live patch disediakan sebagai patch mandiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:84
msgid ""
"You must exclude all regular kernel patches with higher kernel version than "
"the currently installed one."
msgstr "Anda harus mengecualikan semua patch kernel reguler dengan versi kernel yang lebih tinggi daripada versi yang saat ini terinstal."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exclude packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "Mengecualikan paket dengan versi kernel yang lebih tinggi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:86
msgid ""
"In this example you update your systems with the `SUSE-15-2019-1244` patch.  "
"This patch contains `kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64`."
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, Anda memperbarui sistem dengan patch `SUSE-15-2019-1244`.  Patch ini berisi `kernel-default-4.12.14-150.17.1-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:87
msgid ""
"You need to exclude all patches which contain a higher version of "
"`kernel-default` and `kernel-default-base`."
msgstr "Anda perlu mengecualikan semua patch yang berisi versi `kernel-default` dan `kernel-default-base` yang lebih tinggi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Excluding packages with a higher kernel version"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengecualikan paket dengan versi kernel yang lebih tinggi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:89
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:76
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:94
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], "
"and click btn:[Create Filter]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters], lalu klik btn:[Create Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:91
msgid "For example, `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:92
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Patch (Contains Package)`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Type`, pilih `Patch (Contains Package)`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:93
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, select `version greater than`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Matcher`, pilih `version greater than`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:94
msgid "In the `Package Name` field, type `kernel-default`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Package Name`, ketik `kernel-default`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:95
msgid "Leave the `Epoch` field empty."
msgstr "Biarkan kolom `Epoch` kosong."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:96
msgid "In the `Version` field, type `4.12.14`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Version`, ketik `4.12.14`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:97
msgid "In the `Release` field, type `150.17.1`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Release`, ketik `150.17.1`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:84
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:102
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Attach/Detach Filters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:101
msgid "Select `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Pilih `Exclude kernel greater than 4.12.14-150.17.1`, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:102
msgid "You need to repeat this procedure for the `kernel-default-base` package."
msgstr "Anda perlu mengulangi prosedur ini untuk paket `kernel-default-base`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:103
msgid ""
"When you click btn:[Build], a new environment is created.  The new "
"environment contains all the kernel patches up to the version you installed."
msgstr "Saat Anda mengeklik btn:[Build], lingkungan baru dibuat.  Lingkungan baru tersebut berisi semua patch kernel hingga versi yang Anda instal."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:104
msgid ""
"All kernel patches with higher kernel versions are removed.  Live patching "
"kernels remain available as long as they are not the first in a series."
msgstr "Semua patch kernel dengan versi kernel yang lebih tinggi dihapus.  Kernel live patching tetap tersedia selama bukan yang pertama dalam suatu rangkaian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:105
msgid ""
"This procedure can be automated using a filter template.  For more "
"information on how to apply a live patching filter template, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."
msgstr "Prosedur ini dapat diotomatisasi menggunakan templat filter.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara menerapkan templat filter live patching, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle.adoc#filter-templates[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to a new kernel version for live patching"
msgstr "Beralih ke versi kernel baru untuk live patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Live patching for a specific kernel version is only available for one year.  "
"After one year you must update the kernel on your systems.  Execute these "
"environment changes:"
msgstr "Live patching untuk versi kernel tertentu hanya tersedia selama satu tahun.  Setelah satu tahun, Anda harus memperbarui kernel pada sistem Anda.  Lakukan perubahan lingkungan berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Switch to a new kernel version"
msgstr "Prosedur: Beralih ke versi kernel baru"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:109
msgid "Decide which kernel version to upgrade to."
msgstr "Tentukan versi kernel tujuan peningkatan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:110
msgid "For example: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"
msgstr "Misalnya: `4.12.14-150.32.1`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:111
msgid "Create a new kernel version Filter."
msgstr "Buat filter versi kernel baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:112
msgid "Detach all previous Live Patching filters associated with the old kernel."
msgstr "Lepaskan semua filter Live Patching sebelumnya yang terkait dengan kernel lama."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:113
msgid "Attach the new kernel version filter."
msgstr "Pasang filter versi kernel baru."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Once the build is complete, you must immediately re-attach the two filters "
"which:"
msgstr "Setelah build selesai, Anda harus segera memasang kembali kedua filter yang:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:116
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:72
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:90
msgid "Deny patches that contain `reboot_suggested` keyword"
msgstr "Menolak patch yang berisi kata kunci `reboot_suggested`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:117
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:73
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:91
msgid ""
"Deny patches that contain a package which provides the name "
"`installhint(reboot-needed)`"
msgstr "Menolak patch yang berisi paket yang menyediakan nama `installhint(reboot-needed)`"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The new environment contains all kernel patches up to the new kernel version "
"you selected.  You need to reboot systems after they have performed the "
"upgrade.  The new kernel remains valid for one year.  All packages installed "
"during the year match the current live patching kernel filter."
msgstr "Lingkungan baru berisi semua patch kernel hingga versi kernel baru yang Anda pilih.  Anda perlu memulai ulang sistem setelah peningkatan selesai dilakukan.  Kernel baru tetap berlaku selama satu tahun.  Semua paket yang diinstal selama tahun tersebut sesuai dengan filter kernel live patching saat ini."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:119
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream filters"
msgstr "Filter AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:120
msgid ""
"In a content lifecycle management project, you can use the AppStream filter "
"to transform modular repositories into regular repositories.  It does this "
"by keeping the packages in the repository and stripping away the module "
"metadata.  The resulting repository can be used in {productname} in the same "
"way as a regular repository."
msgstr "Dalam proyek pengelolaan siklus hidup konten, Anda dapat menggunakan filter AppStream untuk mengubah repositori modular menjadi repositori reguler.  Proses ini dilakukan dengan mempertahankan paket dalam repositori dan menghapus metadata modul.  Repositori yang dihasilkan dapat digunakan di {productname} dengan cara yang sama seperti repositori reguler."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:121
msgid "AppStream repositories are natively supported throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "Repositori AppStream didukung secara native di seluruh {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Since {productname} 5.0, AppStream repositories are natively supported "
"throughout the {webui}."
msgstr "Sejak {productname} 5.0, repositori AppStream didukung secara native di seluruh {webui}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Therefore, this process is not mandatory to work with AppStream "
"repositories."
msgstr "Oleh karena itu, proses ini tidak wajib dilakukan untuk menggunakan repositori AppStream."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:124
msgid ""
"The AppStream filter selects a single module stream to be included in the "
"target repository.  You can add multiple filters to select multiple module "
"streams."
msgstr "Filter AppStream memilih satu stream modul untuk disertakan dalam repositori target.  Anda dapat menambahkan beberapa filter untuk memilih beberapa stream modul."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:125
msgid ""
"If you do not use an AppStream filter in your CLM project, the module "
"metadata in the modular sources remains intact, and the target repositories "
"contain the same module metadata.  As long as at least one AppStream filter "
"is enabled in the CLM project, all target repositories are transformed into "
"regular repositories."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menggunakan filter AppStream dalam proyek CLM, metadata modul dalam sumber modular tetap utuh, dan repositori target berisi metadata modul yang sama.  Selama setidaknya satu filter AppStream diaktifkan dalam proyek CLM, semua repositori target diubah menjadi repositori reguler."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:126
msgid ""
"In some cases, you might wish to build regular repositories without having "
"to include packages from any module.  To do so, add an AppStream filter "
"using the matcher `none (disable modularity)`.  This will disable all the "
"modules in the target repository.  This is especially useful for "
"{rhel}{nbsp}9 clients, where the default versions of most modules are "
"already included in the AppStream repository as regular packages."
msgstr "Dalam beberapa kasus, Anda mungkin ingin membuat repositori reguler tanpa menyertakan paket dari modul mana pun.  Untuk melakukannya, tambahkan filter AppStream menggunakan matcher `none (disable modularity)`.  Tindakan ini akan menonaktifkan semua modul dalam repositori target.  Hal ini sangat berguna untuk klien {rhel}{nbsp}9, karena versi bawaan sebagian besar modul sudah disertakan dalam repositori AppStream sebagai paket reguler."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:127
msgid ""
"To use the AppStream filter, you need a CLM project with a modular "
"repository such as `{rhel} AppStreams`.  Ensure that you included the module "
"you need as a source before you begin."
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan filter AppStream, Anda memerlukan proyek CLM dengan repositori modular seperti `{rhel} AppStreams`.  Pastikan Anda telah menyertakan modul yang diperlukan sebagai sumber sebelum memulai."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:128
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Using AppStream filters"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menggunakan filter AppStream"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:129
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:144
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:158
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to your {rhel}{nbsp}8 or 9 CLM "
"project."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka proyek CLM {rhel}{nbsp}8 atau 9 Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:130
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:145
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:159
msgid "Ensure that you have included the AppStream channels for your project."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda telah menyertakan channel AppStream untuk proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:146
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:160
msgid "Click btn:[Create Filter] and use these parameters:"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Filter] dan gunakan parameter berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:132
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:147
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:161
msgid "In the `Filter Name` field, type a name for the new filter."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Name`, ketik nama untuk filter baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:133
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:148
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:162
msgid "In the `Filter Type` field, select `Module (Stream)`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Filter Type`, pilih `Module (Stream)`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:135
msgid "In the `Module Name` field, type a module name."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Module Name`, ketik nama modul."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:136
msgid "For example, `postgresql`."
msgstr "Misalnya, `postgresql`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:137
msgid "In the `Stream` field, type the name of the desired stream."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Stream`, ketik nama stream yang diinginkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:138
msgid ""
"For example, `10`.  If you leave this field blank, the default stream for "
"the module is selected."
msgstr "Misalnya, `10`.  Jika kolom ini dibiarkan kosong, stream bawaan untuk modul tersebut dipilih."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:139
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:164
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the new filter."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save] untuk membuat filter baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:141
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:166
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], select your new AppStream filter, and "
"click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], pilih filter AppStream baru Anda, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:142
msgid ""
"You can use the browse function in the `Create/Edit Filter` form to select a "
"module from a list of available module streams for a modular channel."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan fungsi penelusuran pada formulir `Create/Edit Filter` untuk memilih modul dari daftar stream modul yang tersedia untuk channel modular."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:143
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Browsing available module streams"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menelusuri stream modul yang tersedia"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:150
msgid "Click `Browse available modules` to see all modular channels."
msgstr "Klik `Browse available modules` untuk melihat semua channel modular."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:151
msgid "Select a channel to browse the modules and streams:"
msgstr "Pilih channel untuk menelusuri modul dan stream:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:152
msgid ""
"In the `Module Name` field, start typing a module name to search, or select "
"from the list."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Module Name`, mulai ketik nama modul untuk mencarinya, atau pilih dari daftar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:153
msgid ""
"In the `Stream` field, start typing a stream name to search, or select from "
"the list."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Stream`, mulai ketik nama stream untuk mencarinya, atau pilih dari daftar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:154
msgid ""
"Channel selection is only for browsing modules.  The selected channel is not "
"be saved with the filter, and does not affect the CLM process in any way."
msgstr "Pemilihan channel hanya digunakan untuk menelusuri modul.  Channel yang dipilih tidak disimpan bersama filter dan tidak memengaruhi proses CLM dengan cara apa pun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:155
msgid ""
"You can create additional AppStream filters for any other module stream to "
"be included in the target repository.  Any module streams that the selected "
"stream depends on is automatically included."
msgstr "Anda dapat membuat filter AppStream tambahan untuk stream modul lain yang ingin disertakan dalam repositori target.  Semua stream modul yang menjadi dependensi stream yang dipilih akan disertakan secara otomatis."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:156
msgid ""
"Be careful not to specify conflicting, incompatible, or missing module "
"streams.  For example, selecting two streams from the same module is "
"invalid."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda tidak menentukan stream modul yang saling bertentangan, tidak kompatibel, atau tidak tersedia.  Misalnya, memilih dua stream dari modul yang sama tidak diperbolehkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling modularity"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menonaktifkan modularitas"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:163
msgid "In the `Matcher` field, select `none (disable modularity)`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Matcher`, pilih `none (disable modularity)`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:167
msgid ""
"This will effectively remove the module metadata from the target repository, "
"excluding any package that belongs to a module."
msgstr "Tindakan ini akan menghapus metadata modul dari repositori target dan mengecualikan semua paket yang termasuk dalam modul."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:168
msgid ""
"When you build your CLM project using the btn:[Build] button in the {webui}, "
"the target repository is a regular repository without any modules, that "
"contains packages from the selected module streams."
msgstr "Saat Anda melakukan build proyek CLM menggunakan tombol btn:[Build] di {webui}, repositori target menjadi repositori reguler tanpa modul, yang berisi paket dari stream modul yang dipilih."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle-examples.adoc:169
msgid ""
"Disabling modularity altogether in {rhel}{nbsp}8 projects might result in a "
"faulty environment as some modules are essential for healthy operation in "
"{rhel}{nbsp}8."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan modularitas sepenuhnya dalam proyek {rhel}{nbsp}8 dapat menghasilkan lingkungan yang bermasalah karena beberapa modul sangat penting agar {rhel}{nbsp}8 beroperasi dengan baik."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Lifecycle Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Siklus Hidup Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to customize and test packages "
"before updating production clients.  This is especially useful if you need "
"to apply updates during a limited maintenance window."
msgstr "Pengelolaan siklus hidup konten memungkinkan Anda menyesuaikan dan menguji paket sebelum memperbarui klien produksi.  Hal ini sangat berguna jika Anda perlu menerapkan pembaruan dalam periode pemeliharaan yang terbatas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Content lifecycle management allows you to select software channels as "
"sources, adjust them as required for your environment, and thoroughly test "
"them before installing onto your production clients."
msgstr "Pengelolaan siklus hidup konten memungkinkan Anda memilih channel perangkat lunak sebagai sumber, menyesuaikannya sesuai kebutuhan lingkungan, dan mengujinya secara menyeluruh sebelum menginstalnya pada klien produksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:4
msgid ""
"While you cannot directly modify vendor channels, you can clone them and "
"then modify the clones by adding or removing packages and custom patches.  "
"You can assign these cloned channels to test clients to ensure they work as "
"expected."
msgstr "Meskipun Anda tidak dapat mengubah channel vendor secara langsung, Anda dapat mengkloningnya lalu mengubah hasil kloning dengan menambahkan atau menghapus paket dan patch kustom.  Anda dapat menetapkan channel hasil kloning ini ke klien pengujian untuk memastikan channel tersebut berfungsi sesuai harapan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:5
msgid ""
"By default, cloned vendor channels match the original vendor channel and "
"automatically select the dependencies.  You can disable the automatic "
"selection for cloned channels by adding the following option in "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Secara bawaan, channel vendor hasil kloning sesuai dengan channel vendor asli dan memilih dependensi secara otomatis.  Anda dapat menonaktifkan pemilihan otomatis untuk channel hasil kloning dengan menambahkan opsi berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"
msgstr "java.cloned_channel_auto_selection = false\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Then, when all tests pass, you can promote the cloned channels to production "
"servers."
msgstr "Kemudian, setelah semua pengujian berhasil, Anda dapat mempromosikan channel hasil kloning ke server produksi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:8
msgid ""
"This is achieved through a series of environments that your software "
"channels can move through on their lifecycle.  Most environment lifecycles "
"include at least test and production environments, but you can have as many "
"environments as you require."
msgstr "Proses ini dilakukan melalui serangkaian lingkungan yang dapat dilalui channel perangkat lunak selama siklus hidupnya.  Sebagian besar siklus hidup lingkungan mencakup setidaknya lingkungan pengujian dan produksi, tetapi Anda dapat memiliki lingkungan sebanyak yang diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This section covers the basic content lifecycle procedures, and the filters "
"available.  For more specific examples, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas prosedur dasar siklus hidup konten dan filter yang tersedia.  Untuk contoh yang lebih spesifik, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "Membuat proyek siklus hidup konten"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:11
msgid ""
"To set up a content lifecycle, you need to begin with a project.  The "
"project defines the software channel sources, the filters used to find "
"packages, and the build environments."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan siklus hidup konten, Anda perlu memulai dengan sebuah proyek.  Proyek menentukan sumber channel perangkat lunak, filter yang digunakan untuk menemukan paket, dan lingkungan build."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat proyek siklus hidup konten"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and click btn:[Create Project]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu klik btn:[Create Project]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:14
msgid "In the `Label` field, enter a label for your project."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Label`, masukkan label untuk proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The `Label` field only accepts lowercase letters, numbers, periods, hyphens, "
"and underscores."
msgstr "Kolom `Label` hanya menerima huruf kecil, angka, titik, tanda hubung, dan garis bawah."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:16
msgid "In the `Name` field, enter a descriptive name for your project."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Name`, masukkan nama yang deskriptif untuk proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Click the btn:[Create] button to create your project and return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Create] untuk membuat proyek dan kembali ke halaman proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:18
msgid "Click btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Attach/Detach Sources]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the `Sources` dialog, select the source type, and select a base channel "
"for your project."
msgstr "Pada dialog `Sources`, pilih jenis sumber, lalu pilih channel dasar untuk proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:20
msgid ""
"The available child channels for the selected base channel are displayed, "
"including information on whether the channel is mandatory or recommended."
msgstr "Channel anak yang tersedia untuk channel dasar yang dipilih akan ditampilkan, beserta informasi apakah channel tersebut wajib atau disarankan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Check the child channels you require, and click btn:[Save] to return to the "
"project page."
msgstr "Centang channel anak yang Anda perlukan, lalu klik btn:[Save] untuk kembali ke halaman proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:22
msgid "The software channels you selected should now be showing."
msgstr "Channel perangkat lunak yang Anda pilih seharusnya kini ditampilkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:24
msgid ""
"In the `Filters` dialog, select the filters you want to attach to the "
"project."
msgstr "Pada dialog `Filters`, pilih filter yang ingin Anda pasang pada proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:25
msgid "To create a new filter, click btn:[Create new Filter]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat filter baru, klik btn:[Create new Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:26
msgid "Click btn:[Add Environment]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Add Environment]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the `Environment Lifecycle` dialog, give the first environment a name, a "
"label, and a description, and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Pada dialog `Environment Lifecycle`, berikan nama, label, dan deskripsi untuk lingkungan pertama, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Continue creating environments until you have all the environments for your "
"lifecycle completed."
msgstr "Lanjutkan pembuatan lingkungan hingga semua lingkungan untuk siklus hidup Anda selesai dibuat."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can select the order of the environments in the lifecycle by selecting "
"an environment in the `Insert before` field when you create it."
msgstr "Anda dapat menentukan urutan lingkungan dalam siklus hidup dengan memilih lingkungan pada kolom `Insert before` saat membuatnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter types"
msgstr "Jenis filter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:32
msgid ""
"{productname} allows you to create various types of filters to control the "
"content used for building the project.  Filters allow you to select which "
"packages are included or excluded from the build.  For example, you could "
"exclude all kernel packages, or include only specific releases of some "
"packages."
msgstr "{productname} memungkinkan Anda membuat berbagai jenis filter untuk mengontrol konten yang digunakan dalam build proyek.  Filter memungkinkan Anda memilih paket yang disertakan atau dikecualikan dari build.  Misalnya, Anda dapat mengecualikan semua paket kernel, atau hanya menyertakan rilis tertentu dari beberapa paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:33
msgid "The supported filters are:"
msgstr "Filter yang didukung adalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:34
msgid "package filtering"
msgstr "pemfilteran paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:35
msgid "by name"
msgstr "berdasarkan nama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:36
msgid "by name, epoch, version, release, and architecture"
msgstr "berdasarkan nama, epoch, versi, rilis, dan arsitektur"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:37
msgid "by provided name"
msgstr "berdasarkan nama yang disediakan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:38
msgid "patch filtering"
msgstr "pemfilteran patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:39
msgid "by advisory name"
msgstr "berdasarkan nama advisori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:40
msgid "by advisory type"
msgstr "berdasarkan jenis advisori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:41
msgid "by synopsis"
msgstr "berdasarkan sinopsis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:42
msgid "by keyword"
msgstr "berdasarkan kata kunci"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:43
msgid "by date"
msgstr "berdasarkan tanggal"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:44
msgid "by affected package"
msgstr "berdasarkan paket yang terdampak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:45
msgid "module"
msgstr "modul"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:46
msgid "by stream"
msgstr "berdasarkan stream"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:47
msgid "Package dependencies are not resolved during content filtering."
msgstr "Dependensi paket tidak diselesaikan selama pemfilteran konten."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:48
msgid ""
"There are multiple matchers you can use with the filter.  Which ones are "
"available depends on the filter type you choose."
msgstr "Ada beberapa matcher yang dapat Anda gunakan dengan filter.  Matcher yang tersedia bergantung pada jenis filter yang Anda pilih."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:49
msgid "The available matchers are:"
msgstr "Matcher yang tersedia adalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:50
msgid "contains"
msgstr "berisi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:51
msgid "matches (must take the form of a regular expression)"
msgstr "cocok dengan (harus berupa ekspresi reguler)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:52
msgid "equals"
msgstr "sama dengan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:53
msgid "greater"
msgstr "lebih besar dari"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:54
msgid "greater or equal"
msgstr "lebih besar dari atau sama dengan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:55
msgid "lower or equal"
msgstr "lebih kecil dari atau sama dengan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:56
msgid "lower"
msgstr "lebih kecil dari"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:57
msgid "later or equal"
msgstr "lebih akhir dari atau sama dengan"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter `rule` parameter"
msgstr "Parameter `rule` pada filter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Each filter has a `rule` parameter that can be set to either `Allow` or "
"`Deny`.  The filters are processed like this:"
msgstr "Setiap filter memiliki parameter `rule` yang dapat diatur ke `Allow` atau `Deny`.  Filter diproses sebagai berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:60
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies a `Deny` filter, it is excluded from the "
"result."
msgstr "Jika paket atau patch memenuhi filter `Deny`, paket atau patch tersebut dikecualikan dari hasil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:61
msgid ""
"If a package or patch satisfies an `Allow` filter, it is included in the "
"result (even if it was excluded by a `Deny` filter). `Allow` filters for "
"packages only operate on package filters and `Allow` filters for patches "
"only operate on patch filters. This means with a package filter you cannot "
"add packages back in that were filtered out through patch filters or vice "
"versa for patches that where filtered out through package filters."
msgstr "Jika paket atau patch memenuhi filter `Allow`, paket atau patch tersebut disertakan dalam hasil (meskipun telah dikecualikan oleh filter `Deny`). Filter `Allow` untuk paket hanya berlaku pada filter paket, dan filter `Allow` untuk patch hanya berlaku pada filter patch. Artinya, filter paket tidak dapat menyertakan kembali paket yang telah dikecualikan melalui filter patch, begitu pula sebaliknya untuk patch yang telah dikecualikan melalui filter paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:62
msgid ""
"This behavior is useful when you want to exclude large number of packages or "
"patches using a general `Deny` filter and \"cherry-pick\" specific packages "
"or patches with specific `Allow` filters."
msgstr "Perilaku ini berguna jika Anda ingin mengecualikan sejumlah besar paket atau patch menggunakan filter `Deny` umum, lalu memilih paket atau patch tertentu secara selektif dengan filter `Allow` khusus."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Content filters are global in your organization and can be shared between "
"projects."
msgstr "Filter konten berlaku secara global dalam organisasi Anda dan dapat digunakan bersama antarproyek."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:64
msgid ""
"If your project already contains built sources, when you add an environment "
"it is automatically populated with the existing content.  Content is drawn "
"from the previous environment of the cycle if it had one.  If there is no "
"previous environment, it is left empty until the project sources are built "
"again."
msgstr "Jika proyek Anda sudah berisi sumber yang telah melalui proses build, lingkungan yang Anda tambahkan akan otomatis diisi dengan konten yang sudah ada.  Konten diambil dari lingkungan sebelumnya dalam siklus jika lingkungan tersebut tersedia.  Jika tidak ada lingkungan sebelumnya, lingkungan baru dibiarkan kosong hingga sumber proyek melalui proses build kembali."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter templates"
msgstr "Templat filter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:66
msgid ""
"To help with creating filters for some common scenarios, {productname} "
"offers filter templates.  When applied, these templates help creating a set "
"of filters in advance, tailored for a specific use case."
msgstr "Untuk membantu pembuatan filter bagi beberapa skenario umum, {productname} menyediakan templat filter.  Saat diterapkan, templat ini membantu membuat sekumpulan filter terlebih dahulu yang disesuaikan dengan kasus penggunaan tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:67
msgid "This section describes available templates and their usages."
msgstr "Bagian ini menjelaskan templat yang tersedia dan penggunaannya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a {suse} product"
msgstr "Live patching berdasarkan produk {suse}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:69
msgid ""
"In a project that contains live patching, regular future kernel packages "
"must be excluded so that only live patch packages are offered as updates to "
"clients. On the other hand, already installed regular kernel packages must "
"still be included to keep system integrity."
msgstr "Dalam proyek yang mencakup live patching, paket kernel reguler yang dirilis kemudian harus dikecualikan agar hanya paket live patch yang ditawarkan sebagai pembaruan kepada klien. Di sisi lain, paket kernel reguler yang sudah terinstal harus tetap disertakan untuk menjaga integritas sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:70
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:88
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates three filters required to achieve this "
"behavior:"
msgstr "Saat diterapkan, templat ini membuat tiga filter yang diperlukan untuk menghasilkan perilaku tersebut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:71
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:89
msgid ""
"Allow patches that contain `kernel-default` package equal to a base kernel "
"version"
msgstr "Mengizinkan patch yang berisi paket `kernel-default` dengan versi yang sama dengan versi kernel dasar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:74
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:92
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up a live patching project, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara menyiapkan proyek live patching, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#exclude-higher-kernel-version[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:75
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:93
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying the template"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan templat"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:77
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template]. The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "Pada dialog, klik btn:[Use a template]. Kolom masukan akan berubah sesuai templat."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:78
msgid ""
"In the `Prefix` field, type a name prefix. This value will be prepended to "
"the name of every individual filter created by the template. If the template "
"is being applied in the context of a project, this field will be prefilled "
"with the project label."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Prefix`, ketik awalan nama. Nilai ini akan ditambahkan di awal nama setiap filter yang dibuat oleh templat. Jika templat diterapkan dalam konteks proyek, kolom ini akan terisi otomatis dengan label proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:79
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `Live patching based on a SUSE product`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Template`, pilih `Live patching based on a SUSE product`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the `Product` field, select the product you wish to set up live patching "
"for."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Product`, pilih produk yang ingin Anda siapkan untuk live patching."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:81
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel` field, select a kernel version from the list of versions "
"available in the selected product. The filter to deny the later regular "
"kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Kernel`, pilih versi kernel dari daftar versi yang tersedia pada produk yang dipilih. Filter untuk menolak patch kernel reguler yang dirilis kemudian akan didasarkan pada versi ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:82
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:119
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to create the filters."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save] untuk membuat filter."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:85
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:103
msgid ""
"Select the three filters that have the specified prefix, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Pilih ketiga filter yang memiliki awalan yang ditentukan, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live patching based on a system"
msgstr "Live patching berdasarkan sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:87
msgid ""
"When you want to set up a live patching project based on a kernel version "
"installed in a specific registered system, you can use the \"live patching "
"based on a system\" template."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menyiapkan proyek live patching berdasarkan versi kernel yang terinstal pada sistem terdaftar tertentu, Anda dapat menggunakan templat \"live patching berdasarkan sistem\"."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:95
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:115
msgid ""
"In the dialog, click btn:[Use a template].  The inputs will change "
"accordingly."
msgstr "Pada dialog, klik btn:[Use a template].  Kolom masukan akan berubah sesuai templat."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:96
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:116
msgid ""
"In the `Prefix` field, type a name prefix.  This value will be prepended to "
"the name of every filter created by the template.  If the template is being "
"applied in the context of a project, this field will be prefilled with the "
"project label."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Prefix`, ketik awalan nama.  Nilai ini akan ditambahkan di awal nama setiap filter yang dibuat oleh templat.  Jika templat diterapkan dalam konteks proyek, kolom ini akan terisi otomatis dengan label proyek."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:97
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `Live patching based on a specific system`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Template`, pilih `Live patching based on a specific system`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:98
msgid ""
"In the `System` field, select a system from the list, or start typing a "
"system name to narrow down the options."
msgstr "Pada kolom `System`, pilih sistem dari daftar, atau mulai ketik nama sistem untuk mempersempit pilihan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:99
msgid ""
"In the `Kernel` field, select a kernel version from the list of versions "
"installed in the selected system.  The filter to deny the later regular "
"kernel patches will be based on this version."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Kernel`, pilih versi kernel dari daftar versi yang terinstal pada sistem yang dipilih.  Filter untuk menolak patch kernel reguler yang dirilis kemudian akan didasarkan pada versi ini."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:104
#, no-wrap
msgid "AppStream modules with defaults"
msgstr "Modul AppStream dengan stream bawaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:105
msgid ""
"When you want to have all the modules available in a modular repository "
"included in your project, you can automatically add them using this filter "
"template."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin menyertakan semua modul yang tersedia dalam repositori modular ke dalam proyek, Anda dapat menambahkannya secara otomatis menggunakan templat filter ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:106
msgid ""
"When applied, this template creates an AppStream filter per module and its "
"default stream."
msgstr "Saat diterapkan, templat ini membuat filter AppStream untuk setiap modul beserta stream bawaannya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:107
msgid ""
"If this process is done from the project's page, the filters are added to "
"the project automatically. Otherwise, the created filters can be listed in "
"menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] and be added to any project as needed."
msgstr "Jika proses ini dilakukan dari halaman proyek, filter ditambahkan ke proyek secara otomatis. Jika tidak, filter yang dibuat dapat dilihat dalam daftar di menu:Content Lifecycle[Filters] dan ditambahkan ke proyek mana pun sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:108
msgid ""
"Each individual filter can be edited to select a different module stream, or "
"removed altogether to exclude that module from the target repositories."
msgstr "Setiap filter dapat diedit untuk memilih stream modul yang berbeda, atau dihapus sepenuhnya untuk mengecualikan modul tersebut dari repositori target."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:109
msgid ""
"Because not all module streams are compatible with each other, changing "
"individual streams may prevent successful resolution of modular "
"dependencies. When this happens, the filters pane in the project details "
"page will show an error describing the problem, and the build button will be "
"disabled until all the module selections are compatible."
msgstr "Karena tidak semua stream modul saling kompatibel, mengubah stream tertentu dapat menyebabkan kegagalan penyelesaian dependensi modular. Jika hal ini terjadi, panel filter pada halaman detail proyek akan menampilkan pesan kesalahan yang menjelaskan masalah tersebut, dan tombol build akan dinonaktifkan hingga semua pilihan modul kompatibel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Since {rhel}{nbsp}9, modules do not have any defined default streams.  "
"Therefore, using this template with {rhel}{nbsp}9 sources will have no "
"effect."
msgstr "Sejak {rhel}{nbsp}9, modul tidak memiliki stream bawaan yang ditentukan.  Oleh karena itu, penggunaan templat ini dengan sumber {rhel}{nbsp}9 tidak akan berpengaruh."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:111
msgid ""
"For more information on how to set up AppStream repositories with content "
"lifecycle management, see "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara menyiapkan repositori AppStream dengan pengelolaan siklus hidup konten, lihat xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#appstream-filters[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:113
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select your project."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:114
msgid ""
"In the `Filters` section, click btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], and then click "
"btn:[Create New Filter]."
msgstr "Pada bagian `Filters`, klik btn:[Attach/Detach Filters], lalu klik btn:[Create New Filter]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:117
msgid "In the `Template` field, select `AppStream modules with defaults`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Template`, pilih `AppStream modules with defaults`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:118
msgid ""
"In the `Channel` field, select a modular channel to get the modules from. In "
"this dropdown, only the modular channels are displayed."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Channel`, pilih channel modular yang akan menjadi sumber modul. Dalam daftar tarik-turun ini, hanya channel modular yang ditampilkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:120
msgid "Scroll to the `Filters` section to see the newly attached AppStream filters."
msgstr "Gulir ke bagian `Filters` untuk melihat filter AppStream yang baru dipasang."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:121
msgid ""
"You can edit/remove any individual filter to tailor the project to your "
"needs."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengedit atau menghapus setiap filter untuk menyesuaikan proyek dengan kebutuhan Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "Melakukan build proyek siklus hidup konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:123
msgid ""
"When you have created your project, defined environments, and attached "
"sources and filters, you can build the project for the first time."
msgstr "Setelah membuat proyek, menentukan lingkungan, serta memasang sumber dan filter, Anda dapat melakukan build proyek untuk pertama kalinya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:124
msgid ""
"Building applies filters to the attached sources and clones them to the "
"first environment in the project."
msgstr "Proses build menerapkan filter pada sumber yang dipasang dan mengkloning sumber tersebut ke lingkungan pertama dalam proyek."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:125
msgid ""
"You can use the same vendor channels as sources for multiple content "
"projects.  In this case, {productname} does not create new patch clones for "
"each cloned channel.  Instead, a single patch clone is shared between all of "
"your cloned channels.  This can cause problems if a vendor modifies a patch; "
"for example, if the patch is retracted, or the packages within the patch are "
"changed.  When you build one of the content projects, all the channels that "
"share the cloned patch are synchronized with the original by default, even "
"if the channels are in other environments of your content project, or other "
"content project channels in your organization.  You can change this behavior "
"by turning off automatic patch synchronization in your organization "
"settings.  To manually synchronize the patch later for all channels sharing "
"the patch, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], click the channel "
"you want to synchronize and navigate to the `Sync` subtab.  Even manual "
"patch synchronization affects all organization channels sharing the patch."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan channel vendor yang sama sebagai sumber untuk beberapa proyek konten.  Dalam hal ini, {productname} tidak membuat klona patch baru untuk setiap channel hasil kloning.  Sebaliknya, satu klona patch digunakan bersama oleh semua channel hasil kloning Anda.  Hal ini dapat menimbulkan masalah jika vendor mengubah patch; misalnya, jika patch ditarik atau paket di dalamnya diubah.  Saat Anda melakukan build salah satu proyek konten, semua channel yang menggunakan patch hasil kloning yang sama secara bawaan disinkronkan dengan sumber aslinya, meskipun channel tersebut berada di lingkungan lain dalam proyek konten Anda atau merupakan channel proyek konten lain dalam organisasi Anda.  Anda dapat mengubah perilaku ini dengan menonaktifkan sinkronisasi patch otomatis dalam pengaturan organisasi. Untuk menyinkronkan patch secara manual di kemudian hari pada semua channel yang menggunakan patch tersebut, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], klik channel yang ingin Anda sinkronkan, lalu buka subtab `Sync`.  Sinkronisasi patch secara manual sekalipun memengaruhi semua channel organisasi yang menggunakan patch tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a content lifecycle project"
msgstr "Prosedur: Melakukan build proyek siklus hidup konten"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:127
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to build."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek yang ingin Anda build."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:128
msgid "Make sure you have the environment available before building the project."
msgstr "Pastikan lingkungan sudah tersedia sebelum melakukan build proyek."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:129
msgid "Review the attached sources and filters, and click btn:[Build]."
msgstr "Tinjau sumber dan filter yang dipasang, lalu klik btn:[Build]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:130
msgid "Provide a version message to describe the changes or updates in this build."
msgstr "Masukkan pesan versi untuk menjelaskan perubahan atau pembaruan dalam build ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:131
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:138
msgid "You can monitor build progress in the `Environment Lifecycle` section."
msgstr "Anda dapat memantau kemajuan build pada bagian `Environment Lifecycle`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:132
msgid ""
"After the build is finished, the environment version is increased by one and "
"the built sources, such as software channels, can be assigned to your "
"clients."
msgstr "Setelah build selesai, versi lingkungan bertambah satu dan sumber hasil build, seperti channel perangkat lunak, dapat ditetapkan ke klien Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:133
#, no-wrap
msgid "Promote environments"
msgstr "Mempromosikan lingkungan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:134
msgid ""
"When the project has been built, the built sources can be sequentially "
"promoted to the environments."
msgstr "Setelah proyek selesai melalui proses build, sumber hasil build dapat dipromosikan ke lingkungan secara berurutan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:135
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting environments"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mempromosikan lingkungan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:136
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], "
"and select the project you want to work with."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Content Lifecycle[Projects], lalu pilih proyek yang ingin Anda kelola."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:137
msgid ""
"In the `Environment Lifecycle` section, locate the environment to promote to "
"its successor, and click btn:[Promote]."
msgstr "Pada bagian `Environment Lifecycle`, temukan lingkungan yang kontennya akan dipromosikan ke lingkungan berikutnya, lalu klik btn:[Promote]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:139
#, no-wrap
msgid "Assign clients to environments"
msgstr "Menetapkan klien ke lingkungan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:140
msgid ""
"When you build and promote content lifecycle projects, {productname} creates "
"a tree of software channels.  To add clients to the environment, assign the "
"base and child software channels to your client using menu:Software[Software "
"Channels] in the `System Details` page for the client."
msgstr "Saat Anda melakukan build dan mempromosikan proyek siklus hidup konten, {productname} membuat struktur pohon channel perangkat lunak.  Untuk menambahkan klien ke lingkungan, tetapkan channel perangkat lunak dasar dan anak ke klien Anda menggunakan menu:Software[Software Channels] pada halaman `System Details` klien tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:141
msgid ""
"Newly added cloned channels are not assigned to clients automatically.  If "
"you add or promote sources you need to manually check and update your "
"channel assignments."
msgstr "Channel hasil kloning yang baru ditambahkan tidak ditetapkan ke klien secara otomatis.  Jika Anda menambahkan atau mempromosikan sumber, Anda perlu memeriksa dan memperbarui penetapan channel secara manual."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-lifecycle.adoc:142
msgid ""
"Automatic assignment is intended to be added to {productname} in a future "
"version."
msgstr "Penetapan otomatis direncanakan akan ditambahkan ke {productname} pada versi mendatang."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Content Staging"
msgstr "Penyiapan Awal Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Staging is used by clients to download packages in advance, before they are "
"installed.  This allows package installation to begin as soon as it is "
"scheduled, which can reduce the amount of time required for a maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "Penyiapan awal digunakan oleh klien untuk mengunduh paket terlebih dahulu sebelum diinstal.  Dengan demikian, penginstalan paket dapat dimulai sesuai jadwal, sehingga dapat mengurangi waktu yang diperlukan untuk periode pemeliharaan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable Content Staging"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan Penyiapan Awal Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:4
msgid ""
"You can manage content staging across your entire organization.  In the "
"{productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Organizations] to see a list "
"of available organizations.  Click the name of an organization, and check "
"the `Enable Staging Contents` box to allow clients in this organization to "
"stage package data."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengelola penyiapan awal konten di seluruh organisasi Anda. Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Organizations] untuk melihat daftar organisasi yang tersedia.  Klik nama organisasi, lalu centang kotak `Enable Staging Contents` agar klien dalam organisasi ini dapat menyiapkan data paket terlebih dahulu."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/organizations.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You must be logged in as the {productname} administrator to create and "
"manage organizations."
msgstr "Anda harus masuk sebagai administrator {productname} untuk membuat dan mengelola organisasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:6
msgid ""
"You can also enable staging at the command prompt by editing "
"`/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date`, and adding or editing these lines:"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat mengaktifkan penyiapan awal melalui prompt perintah dengan mengedit `/etc/sysconfig/rhn/up2date`, lalu menambahkan atau mengedit baris berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"
msgstr ""
"stagingContent=1\n"
"stagingContentWindow=24\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The `stagingContentWindow` parameter is a time value expressed in hours and "
"determines when downloading starts.  It is the number of hours before the "
"scheduled installation or update time.  In this example, content is "
"downloaded 24 hours before the installation time.  The start time for "
"download depends on the selected contact method for a system."
msgstr "Parameter `stagingContentWindow` adalah nilai waktu dalam satuan jam yang menentukan kapan pengunduhan dimulai.  Nilai ini menunjukkan jumlah jam sebelum waktu penginstalan atau pembaruan yang dijadwalkan. Dalam contoh ini, konten diunduh 24 jam sebelum waktu penginstalan.  Waktu mulai pengunduhan bergantung pada metode kontak yang dipilih untuk sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Next time an action is scheduled, packages are automatically downloaded, but "
"not installed.  At the scheduled time, the staged packages are installed."
msgstr "Saat tindakan berikutnya dijadwalkan, paket diunduh secara otomatis, tetapi tidak diinstal.  Pada waktu yang dijadwalkan, paket yang telah disiapkan diinstal."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Content Staging"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Penyiapan Awal Konten"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:11
msgid "There are two parameters used to configure content staging:"
msgstr "Ada dua parameter yang digunakan untuk mengonfigurasi penyiapan awal konten:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:12
msgid ""
"`salt_content_staging_advance` is the advance time for the content staging "
"window to open, in hours."
msgstr "`salt_content_staging_advance` adalah selang waktu sebelum penginstalan ketika periode penyiapan awal konten dibuka, dalam satuan jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:13
msgid ""
"This is the number of hours before installation starts, that package "
"downloads can begin."
msgstr "Nilai ini menunjukkan berapa jam sebelum penginstalan dimulai pengunduhan paket dapat dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:14
msgid ""
"`salt_content_staging_window` is the duration of the content staging window, "
"in hours."
msgstr "`salt_content_staging_window` adalah durasi periode penyiapan awal konten, dalam satuan jam."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:15
msgid ""
"This is the amount of time clients have to stage packages before "
"installation begins."
msgstr "Nilai ini menunjukkan waktu yang tersedia bagi klien untuk menyiapkan paket sebelum penginstalan dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For example, if `salt_content_staging_advance` is set to six hours, and "
"`salt_content_staging_window` is set to two hours, the staging window opens "
"six hours before the installation time, and remain open for two hours.  No "
"packages are downloaded in the four remaining hours until installation "
"starts."
msgstr "Misalnya, jika `salt_content_staging_advance` diatur ke enam jam dan `salt_content_staging_window` diatur ke dua jam, periode penyiapan awal dibuka enam jam sebelum waktu penginstalan dan tetap terbuka selama dua jam.  Tidak ada paket yang diunduh selama empat jam tersisa hingga penginstalan dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:17
msgid ""
"If you set the same value for both `salt_content_staging_advance` and "
"`salt_content_staging_window` packages are able to be downloaded until "
"installation begins."
msgstr "Jika Anda menetapkan nilai yang sama untuk `salt_content_staging_advance` dan `salt_content_staging_window`, paket dapat diunduh hingga penginstalan dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Configure the content staging parameters in "
"`/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan parameter penyiapan awal konten di `/usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:19
msgid "Default values:"
msgstr "Nilai bawaan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:20
msgid "`salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours`"
msgstr "`salt_content_staging_advance: 8 hours`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:21
msgid "`salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours`"
msgstr "`salt_content_staging_window: 8 hours`"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/content-staging.adoc:22
msgid "Content staging must be enabled for these parameters to work correctly."
msgstr "Penyiapan awal konten harus diaktifkan agar parameter ini berfungsi dengan benar."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom Channels"
msgstr "Channel Kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Custom channels give you the ability to create your own software packages "
"and repositories, which you can use to update your clients.  They also allow "
"you to use software provided by third party vendors in your environment."
msgstr "Channel kustom memungkinkan Anda membuat paket perangkat lunak dan repositori sendiri yang dapat digunakan untuk memperbarui klien.  Channel ini juga memungkinkan Anda menggunakan perangkat lunak yang disediakan oleh vendor pihak ketiga di lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This section gives more detail on how to create, administer, and delete "
"custom channels.  You must have administrator privileges to be able to "
"create and manage custom channels."
msgstr "Bagian ini memberikan penjelasan lebih terperinci tentang cara membuat, mengelola, dan menghapus channel kustom.  Anda harus memiliki hak akses administrator untuk membuat dan mengelola channel kustom."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating custom channels and repositories"
msgstr "Membuat channel kustom dan repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Before you create a custom channel, determine which base channel you want to "
"associate it with, and which repositories you want to use for content."
msgstr "Sebelum membuat channel kustom, tentukan channel dasar yang ingin Anda kaitkan dengannya dan repositori yang ingin Anda gunakan sebagai sumber konten."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you have custom software packages that you need to install on your client "
"systems, you can create a custom child channel to manage them.  You need to "
"create the channel in the {productname} {webui} and create a repository for "
"the packages, before assigning the channel to your systems."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki paket perangkat lunak kustom yang perlu diinstal pada sistem klien, Anda dapat membuat channel anak kustom untuk mengelolanya.  Anda perlu membuat channel di {webui} {productname} dan membuat repositori untuk paket tersebut sebelum menetapkan channel ke sistem Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Do not create child channels containing packages that are not compatible "
"with the client system."
msgstr "Jangan membuat channel anak yang berisi paket yang tidak kompatibel dengan sistem klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You can select a vendor channel as the base channel if you want to use "
"packages provided by a vendor.  Alternatively, select `none` to make your "
"custom channel a base channel."
msgstr "Anda dapat memilih channel vendor sebagai channel dasar jika ingin menggunakan paket yang disediakan oleh vendor.  Sebagai alternatif, pilih `none` untuk menjadikan channel kustom Anda sebagai channel dasar."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a custom channel"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat channel kustom"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:10
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu klik btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the `Create Software Channel` page, give your channel a name (for "
"example, `My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64`) and a label (for example, "
"`my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64`)."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Create Software Channel`, berikan nama untuk channel Anda (misalnya, `My Tools SLES 15 SP1 x86_64`) dan label (misalnya, `my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:12
msgid "Labels must not contain spaces or uppercase letters."
msgstr "Label tidak boleh berisi spasi atau huruf kapital."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:13
msgid ""
"In the `Parent Channel` drop down, choose the relevant base channel (for "
"example, `SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64`)."
msgstr "Pada daftar tarik-turun `Parent Channel`, pilih channel dasar yang relevan (misalnya, `SLE-Product-SLES15-SP1-Pool for x86_64`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:14
msgid "Ensure that you choose the compatible parent channel for your packages."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memilih channel induk yang kompatibel dengan paket Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In the `Architecture` drop down, choose the appropriate hardware "
"architecture (for example, `x86_64`)."
msgstr "Pada daftar tarik-turun `Architecture`, pilih arsitektur perangkat keras yang sesuai (misalnya, `x86_64`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Provide any additional information in the contact details, channel access "
"control, and GPG fields, as required for your environment."
msgstr "Masukkan informasi tambahan pada kolom detail kontak, kontrol akses channel, dan GPG sesuai kebutuhan lingkungan Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:17
msgid "Click btn:[Create Channel]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Custom channels sometimes require additional security settings.  Many third "
"party vendors secure packages with GPG.  If you want to use GPG-protected "
"packages in your custom channel, you need to trust the GPG key which has "
"been used to sign the metadata.  You can then check the `Has Signed "
"Metadata?` check box to match the package metadata against the trusted GPG "
"keys."
msgstr "Channel kustom terkadang memerlukan pengaturan keamanan tambahan.  Banyak vendor pihak ketiga mengamankan paket dengan GPG.  Jika Anda ingin menggunakan paket yang dilindungi GPG dalam channel kustom, Anda perlu memercayai kunci GPG yang digunakan untuk menandatangani metadata.  Anda kemudian dapat mencentang kotak `Has Signed Metadata?` untuk memverifikasi metadata paket menggunakan kunci GPG tepercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If remote channels and repositories are signed with GPG keys, you can import "
"and trust these GPG keys.  For example, execute the `spacewalk-repo-sync` "
"from the command line on the {productname} Server:"
msgstr "Jika channel dan repositori jarak jauh ditandatangani dengan kunci GPG, Anda dapat mengimpor dan memercayai kunci GPG tersebut.  Misalnya, jalankan `spacewalk-repo-sync` melalui baris perintah pada Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"
msgstr "/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channellabelname> -t yum\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:21
msgid ""
"This command and procedure is for temporary GPG key synchronization only.  "
"For storing the key permantenly, see this section later on."
msgstr "Perintah dan prosedur ini hanya untuk sinkronisasi kunci GPG sementara.  Untuk menyimpan kunci secara permanen, lihat penjelasan selanjutnya dalam bagian ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:22
msgid ""
"The underlying `zypper` call will import the key, if it is available.  The "
"{webui} does not offer this feature."
msgstr "Pemanggilan `zypper` yang mendasarinya akan mengimpor kunci jika tersedia.  {webui} tidak menyediakan fitur ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:23
msgid ""
"This only works when the repository you want to mirror is set up in a "
"special way and provides the \"key\" in the repository next to the "
"signature.  This is the case for all repositories generated by the Open "
"Build Service (OBS).  For other repositories special preparation steps are "
"needed, as described further below."
msgstr "Cara ini hanya berfungsi jika repositori yang ingin Anda cerminkan dikonfigurasi secara khusus dan menyediakan \"kunci\" dalam repositori bersama tanda tangannya.  Semua repositori yang dihasilkan oleh Open Build Service (OBS) memenuhi ketentuan ini.  Untuk repositori lain, diperlukan langkah persiapan khusus sebagaimana dijelaskan lebih lanjut di bawah."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"By default, the `Enable GPG Check` field is checked when you create a new "
"channel.  If you would like to add custom packages and applications to your "
"channel, make sure you uncheck this field to be able to install unsigned "
"packages.  Disabling the GPG check is a security risk if packages are from "
"an untrusted source."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, kolom `Enable GPG Check` dicentang saat Anda membuat channel baru.  Jika Anda ingin menambahkan paket dan aplikasi kustom ke channel, pastikan Anda menghapus centang pada kolom ini agar dapat menginstal paket yang tidak ditandatangani.  Menonaktifkan pemeriksaan GPG menimbulkan risiko keamanan jika paket berasal dari sumber yang tidak tepercaya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:25
msgid ""
"You can only add a repository to the {productname} with the {webui} if it is "
"a valid software repository.  Check in advance that needed repository "
"metadata are available.  Tools such as `createrepo` and `reprepro` are "
"useful in this regard.  `mgrpush` can help with pushing a single RPM into a "
"channel without creating a repository."
msgstr "Anda hanya dapat menambahkan repositori ke {productname} melalui {webui} jika repositori tersebut merupakan repositori perangkat lunak yang valid.  Pastikan terlebih dahulu bahwa metadata repositori yang diperlukan tersedia.  Alat seperti `createrepo` dan `reprepro` berguna untuk keperluan ini.  `mgrpush` dapat membantu memasukkan satu RPM ke dalam channel tanpa membuat repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information on `createrepo_c` see "
"`https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/createrepo_c/`"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang `createrepo_c`, lihat `https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/createrepo_c/`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:27
msgid ""
"For more information on `reprepro` see "
"`https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/reprepro/`"
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang `reprepro`, lihat `https://manpages.opensuse.org/Leap-15.6/reprepro/`"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding a software repository"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan repositori perangkat lunak"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:29
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > "
"Repositories], and click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Repositories], lalu klik btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:30
msgid ""
"On the `Create Repository` page, give your repository a label (for example, "
"`my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo`)."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Create Repository`, berikan label untuk repositori Anda (misalnya, `my-tools-sles15sp1-x86_64-repo`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:31
msgid ""
"In the `Repository URL` field, provide the path to the directory that "
"contains the `repodata` file (for example, `file:///opt/mytools/`).  You can "
"use any valid addressing protocol in this field."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Repository URL`, masukkan jalur ke direktori yang berisi berkas `repodata` (misalnya, `file:///opt/mytools/`).  Anda dapat menggunakan protokol pengalamatan apa pun yang valid pada kolom ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:32
msgid "Uncheck the `Has Signed Metadata?` check box."
msgstr "Hapus centang pada kotak `Has Signed Metadata?`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:33
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: Complete the SSL fields if your repository requires client "
"certificate authentication."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Lengkapi kolom SSL jika repositori Anda memerlukan autentikasi sertifikat klien."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:34
msgid "Click btn:[Create Repository]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Repository]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The above procedure only works if the repository you want to mirror provides "
"the \"key\" in the repository next to the signature.  This is the case for "
"all repositories generated by the OBS, but it is typically not the case for "
"repositories of operating systems that are not offered by the OBS."
msgstr "Prosedur di atas hanya berfungsi jika repositori yang ingin Anda cerminkan menyediakan \"kunci\" dalam repositori bersama tanda tangannya.  Semua repositori yang dihasilkan oleh OBS memenuhi ketentuan ini, tetapi biasanya tidak demikian untuk repositori sistem operasi yang tidak disediakan oleh OBS."

#.  Not sure how it is possible to import the key into the RPM DB which is used for syncing.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:36
msgid ""
"If the repository you want to use does not have a GPG key you can provide "
"one yourself and import the GPG key into the keyring manually.  If you "
"import the key into the `/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir` keyring using the `gpg` "
"command line tool it would be stored permanently.  The key would also "
"persist if the chroot environment would be cleaned."
msgstr "Jika repositori yang ingin Anda gunakan tidak memiliki kunci GPG, Anda dapat menyediakannya sendiri dan mengimpor kunci GPG tersebut ke keyring secara manual.  Jika Anda mengimpor kunci ke keyring `/var/lib/spacewalk/gpgdir` menggunakan alat baris perintah `gpg`, kunci tersebut akan disimpan secara permanen.  Kunci juga akan tetap tersimpan meskipun lingkungan chroot dibersihkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a software repository with GPG key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat repositori perangkat lunak dengan kunci GPG"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:38
msgid "The command to import a key into the keyring, is:"
msgstr "Perintah untuk mengimpor kunci ke keyring adalah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl gpg upload /path/to/gpg.key\n"
msgstr "mgrctl gpg upload /path/to/gpg.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:40
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:client-configuration:autoinst-owngpgkey.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Add Debian non-flat repositories using `uyuni_suite`, `uyuni_component`, and "
"`uyuni_arch` query parameters."
msgstr "Tambahkan repositori Debian non-flat menggunakan parameter kueri `uyuni_suite`, `uyuni_component`, dan `uyuni_arch`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_suite`"
msgstr "`uyuni_suite`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:43
msgid ""
"is mandatory.  In Debian documentation, this is also known as "
"`distribution`.  With this parameter you specify the apt source.  Without "
"this parameter the original approach is used.  If the parameter ends with "
"`/`, the repository is identified as flat."
msgstr "wajib diisi.  Dalam dokumentasi Debian, parameter ini juga dikenal sebagai `distribution`.  Dengan parameter ini, Anda menentukan sumber apt.  Tanpa parameter ini, pendekatan awal digunakan.  Jika parameter diakhiri dengan `/`, repositori diidentifikasi sebagai flat."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_component`"
msgstr "`uyuni_component`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:45
msgid ""
"is optional.  This parameter can specify only one component.  It is not "
"possible to list the components.  An apt source entry allows to specify "
"multiple components, but for Uyuni it is not possible.  Instead you must "
"create a separate repository for each component."
msgstr "bersifat opsional.  Parameter ini hanya dapat menentukan satu komponen.  Komponen tidak dapat ditentukan dalam bentuk daftar.  Entri sumber apt memungkinkan penentuan beberapa komponen, tetapi Uyuni tidak mendukungnya.  Sebagai gantinya, Anda harus membuat repositori terpisah untuk setiap komponen."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "`uyuni_arch`"
msgstr "`uyuni_arch`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:47
msgid ""
"is optional.  If omitted the architecture name is calculated with a SQL "
"query for the channel from the database.  Specify `uyuni_arch` explicitly if "
"it does not match the architecture of the channel (sometimes architecture "
"naming is ambiguous)."
msgstr "bersifat opsional.  Jika dihilangkan, nama arsitektur ditentukan melalui kueri SQL untuk channel tersebut dari basis data.  Tentukan `uyuni_arch` secara eksplisit jika nilainya tidak sesuai dengan arsitektur channel (terkadang penamaan arsitektur bersifat ambigu)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:48
msgid "Here are some examples:"
msgstr "Berikut beberapa contoh:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Debian non-flat repository mapping"
msgstr "Pemetaan repositori Debian non-flat"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type             | Source line / URL\n"
"| apt source line  | `deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/`\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"`https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/`\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | `deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main`\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"`https://deb.debian.org/debian/?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main`\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| apt source line  | `deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble main`\n"
"| URL mapping      | "
"`http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/?uyuni_suite=noble&uyuni_component=main`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jenis             | Baris sumber / URL\n"
"| baris sumber apt  | `deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/`\n"
"| pemetaan URL      | `https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable?uyuni_suite=binary/`\n"
"| {nbsp}   |\n"
"| baris sumber apt  | `deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main`\n"
"| pemetaan URL      | `https://deb.debian.org/debian/?uyuni_suite=stable&uyuni_component=main`\n"
"| {nbsp}           |\n"
"| baris sumber apt  | `deb http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/ noble main`\n"
"| pemetaan URL      | `http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/?uyuni_suite=noble&uyuni_component=main`\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:51
msgid ""
"This following information about the Debian repository definition format is "
"based on https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."
msgstr "Informasi berikut tentang format definisi repositori Debian didasarkan pada https://wiki.debian.org/DebianRepository/Format#Overview."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:52
msgid "The repository definition format is as follows:"
msgstr "Format definisi repositori adalah sebagai berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"
msgstr "deb uri suite [component1] [component2] [...]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:54
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:88
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:10
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main\n"
msgstr "deb https://deb.debian.org/debian/ stable main\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:56
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:6
msgid "or"
msgstr "atau"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"
msgstr "deb https://pkg.jenkins.io/debian-stable binary/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For each pair of `suite` and `component` the specification defines a "
"distinct URL calculated on the base URL `+ suite + component`."
msgstr "Untuk setiap pasangan `suite` dan `component`, spesifikasi menetapkan URL berbeda yang dibentuk dari URL dasar `+ suite + component`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning the repository to a channel"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan repositori ke channel"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Assign your new repository to your custom channel by navigating to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels], clicking the name of your newly created "
"custom channel."
msgstr "Tetapkan repositori baru ke channel kustom Anda dengan membuka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu mengeklik nama channel kustom yang baru dibuat."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Navigate to the `Repositories` tab, and ensure the repository you want to "
"assign to the channel is checked.  Click btn:[Save Repositories]."
msgstr "Buka tab `Repositories`, lalu pastikan repositori yang ingin Anda tetapkan ke channel telah dicentang.  Klik btn:[Save Repositories]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:62
msgid "By default, the synchronization process starts immediately."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, proses sinkronisasi langsung dimulai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:63
msgid ""
"For more information about channel synchronization, see "
"xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang sinkronisasi channel, lihat xref:administration:custom-channels.adoc#custom-channel-sync[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding custom channels to an activation key"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan channel kustom ke kunci aktivasi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:65
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Activation Keys], and "
"select the key you want to add the custom channel to."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Activation Keys], lalu pilih kunci yang ingin Anda tambahi channel kustom."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:66
msgid ""
"On the `Details` tab, in the `Child Channels` listing, select the channel to "
"associate."
msgstr "Pada tab `Details`, dalam daftar `Child Channels`, pilih channel yang akan dikaitkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:67
msgid "You can select multiple channels, if you need to."
msgstr "Anda dapat memilih beberapa channel jika diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:68
msgid "Click btn:[Update Activation Key]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Activation Key]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom channel synchronization"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi channel kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:70
msgid ""
"To avoid missing important updates, {suse} recommends to keep your custom "
"channels up to date with the remote repositories changes."
msgstr "Agar tidak melewatkan pembaruan penting, {suse} menyarankan agar Anda selalu memperbarui channel kustom sesuai perubahan pada repositori jarak jauh."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:71
msgid ""
"By default, a synchronization will happen automatically for all custom "
"channels you create.  In particular, it will happen:"
msgstr "Secara bawaan, sinkronisasi dilakukan secara otomatis untuk semua channel kustom yang Anda buat.  Secara khusus, sinkronisasi dilakukan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:72
msgid ""
"after adding a repository to a channel from the UI or by using "
"`spacewalk-common-channels`"
msgstr "setelah menambahkan repositori ke channel melalui antarmuka pengguna atau menggunakan `spacewalk-common-channels`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:73
msgid ""
"as part of the daily task `mgr-sync-refresh-default`, which will synchronize "
"all your custom and vendor channels."
msgstr "sebagai bagian dari tugas harian `mgr-sync-refresh-default`, yang akan menyinkronkan semua channel kustom dan vendor Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:74
msgid "To disable this default behaviour, set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Untuk menonaktifkan perilaku bawaan ini, tetapkan pengaturan berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"
msgstr "java.unify_custom_channel_management = 0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:76
msgid ""
"With this property turned off, no synchronization is performed automatically "
"and, in order to keep a custom channel up to date, you need to:"
msgstr "Jika properti ini dinonaktifkan, tidak ada sinkronisasi yang dilakukan secara otomatis. Agar channel kustom tetap mutakhir, Anda perlu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:77
msgid ""
"synchronize it manually by navigating to the `Sync` tab and click btn:[Sync "
"Now],"
msgstr "menyinkronkannya secara manual dengan membuka tab `Sync`, lalu mengeklik btn:[Sync Now],"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:78
msgid "set up an automated synchronization schedule from the `Repositories` tab."
msgstr "menyiapkan jadwal sinkronisasi otomatis dari tab `Repositories`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:79
msgid ""
"When the process is started, there are several ways to check if a channel "
"has finished synchronizing:"
msgstr "Setelah proses dimulai, ada beberapa cara untuk memeriksa apakah sinkronisasi channel telah selesai:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:80
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Setup Wizard] and "
"select the `Products` tab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Setup Wizard], lalu pilih tab `Products`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:81
msgid ""
"This dialog displays a completion bar for each product when they are being "
"synchronized."
msgstr "Dialog ini menampilkan bilah kemajuan untuk setiap produk saat proses sinkronisasi berlangsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:82
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"then click the channel associated to the repository."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu klik channel yang terkait dengan repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:83
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:[Repositories > Sync] tab.  The `Sync Status` is shown "
"next to the repository name."
msgstr "Buka tab menu:[Repositories > Sync].  `Sync Status` ditampilkan di samping nama repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:84
msgid "Check the synchronization log file at the command prompt:"
msgstr "Periksa berkas log sinkronisasi melalui prompt perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"
msgstr "tail -f /var/log/rhn/reposync/<channel-label>.log\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:86
msgid ""
"Each child channel generates its own log during the synchronization "
"progress.  You need to check all the base and child channel log files to be "
"sure that the synchronization is complete."
msgstr "Setiap channel anak menghasilkan log tersendiri selama proses sinkronisasi.  Anda perlu memeriksa semua berkas log channel dasar dan anak untuk memastikan sinkronisasi telah selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:87
msgid "The following custom channel synchronization options are available:"
msgstr "Opsi sinkronisasi channel kustom berikut tersedia:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Retain packages in channels which have been removed from the repository"
msgstr "Mempertahankan paket dalam channel yang telah dihapus dari repositori"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:89
msgid "This turns off `strict` mode."
msgstr "Opsi ini menonaktifkan mode `strict`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Do not sync errata"
msgstr "Tidak menyinkronkan errata"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:91
msgid "Do not synchronize patches."
msgstr "Tidak menyinkronkan patch."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sync only latest packages"
msgstr "Hanya menyinkronkan paket terbaru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:93
msgid "Synchronize latest package version only."
msgstr "Hanya menyinkronkan versi paket terbaru."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create kickstartable tree"
msgstr "Membuat struktur direktori yang mendukung kickstart"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:95
msgid ""
"This option prepares a directory tree ready for {kickstart} auto "
"installation."
msgstr "Opsi ini menyiapkan struktur direktori yang siap untuk penginstalan otomatis {kickstart}."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "Terminate upon any error"
msgstr "Menghentikan proses jika terjadi kesalahan apa pun"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:97
msgid "Stop synchronizing if an error occurs."
msgstr "Menghentikan sinkronisasi jika terjadi kesalahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:98
msgid ""
"These options will be saved persistently for each channel.  The btn:[Sync "
"now] button also saves the channel options before performing the "
"synchronization."
msgstr "Opsi ini akan disimpan secara permanen untuk setiap channel.  Tombol btn:[Sync now] juga menyimpan opsi channel sebelum melakukan sinkronisasi."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add packages and patches to custom channels"
msgstr "Menambahkan paket dan patch ke channel kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:100
msgid ""
"When you create a new custom channel without cloning it from an existing "
"channel, it does not contain any packages or patches.  You can add the "
"packages and patches you require using the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Saat Anda membuat channel kustom baru tanpa mengkloningnya dari channel yang sudah ada, channel tersebut tidak berisi paket atau patch apa pun.  Anda dapat menambahkan paket dan patch yang diperlukan menggunakan {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Custom channels can only include packages or patches that are cloned or "
"custom, and they must match the base architecture of the channel.  Patches "
"added to custom channels must apply to a package that exists in the channel."
msgstr "Channel kustom hanya dapat menyertakan paket atau patch hasil kloning maupun kustom, dan paket atau patch tersebut harus sesuai dengan arsitektur dasar channel.  Patch yang ditambahkan ke channel kustom harus berlaku untuk paket yang ada dalam channel tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:102
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding packages to custom channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan paket ke channel kustom"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:103
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the `Packages` tab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu buka tab `Packages`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:104
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all packages currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"`List/Remove` tab."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Lihat semua paket yang saat ini ada dalam channel dengan membuka tab `List/Remove`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:105
msgid "Add new packages to the channel by navigating to the `Add` tab."
msgstr "Tambahkan paket baru ke channel dengan membuka tab `Add`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:106
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide packages, and click btn:[View Packages] "
"to populate the list."
msgstr "Pilih channel induk sebagai sumber paket, lalu klik btn:[View Packages] untuk menampilkan daftar paket."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:107
msgid ""
"Check the packages to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Add "
"Packages]."
msgstr "Centang paket yang akan ditambahkan ke channel kustom, lalu klik btn:[Add Packages]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:108
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm Addition] to "
"add the packages to the channel."
msgstr "Setelah memastikan pilihan sudah sesuai, klik btn:[Confirm Addition] untuk menambahkan paket ke channel."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:109
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: You can compare the packages in the current channel with those in "
"a different channel by navigating to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], and "
"going to the menu:Packages[Compare] tab."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Anda dapat membandingkan paket dalam channel saat ini dengan paket dalam channel lain dengan membuka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu membuka tab menu:Packages[Compare]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:110
msgid ""
"To make the two channels the same, click the btn:[Merge Differences] button, "
"and resolve any conflicts."
msgstr "Untuk menyamakan kedua channel, klik tombol btn:[Merge Differences], lalu selesaikan konflik yang ada."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:111
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding patches to a custom channel"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan patch ke channel kustom"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:112
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and go to the `Patches` tab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu buka tab `Patches`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:113
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: See all patches currently in the channel by navigating to the "
"`List/Remove` tab."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Lihat semua patch yang saat ini ada dalam channel dengan membuka tab `List/Remove`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Add new patches to the channel by navigating to the `Add` tab, and selecting "
"what kind of patches you want to add."
msgstr "Tambahkan patch baru ke channel dengan membuka tab `Add`, lalu pilih jenis patch yang ingin Anda tambahkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Select the parent channel to provide patches, and click btn:[View Associated "
"Patches] to populate the list."
msgstr "Pilih channel induk sebagai sumber patch, lalu klik btn:[View Associated Patches] untuk menampilkan daftar patch."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:116
msgid "Check the patches to add to the custom channel, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Centang patch yang akan ditambahkan ke channel kustom, lalu klik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:117
msgid ""
"When you are satisfied with the selection, click btn:[Confirm] to add the "
"patches to the channel."
msgstr "Setelah memastikan pilihan sudah sesuai, klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menambahkan patch ke channel."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:118
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage custom channels"
msgstr "Mengelola channel kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:119
msgid ""
"{productname} administrators and channel administrators can alter or delete "
"any channel."
msgstr "Administrator {productname} dan administrator channel dapat mengubah atau menghapus channel mana pun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:120
msgid ""
"To grant other users rights to alter or delete a channel, navigate to "
"menu:Software[Manage > Channels] and select the channel you want to edit.  "
"Navigate to the `Managers` tab, and check the user to grant permissions.  "
"Click btn:[Update] to save the changes."
msgstr "Untuk memberikan hak kepada pengguna lain untuk mengubah atau menghapus channel, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu pilih channel yang ingin Anda edit.  Buka tab `Managers`, lalu centang pengguna yang akan diberi izin.  Klik btn:[Update] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:121
msgid ""
"If you delete a channel that has been assigned to a set of clients, it "
"triggers an immediate update of the channel state for any clients associated "
"with the deleted channel.  This is to ensure that the changes are reflected "
"accurately in the repository file."
msgstr "Jika Anda menghapus channel yang telah ditetapkan ke sejumlah klien, status channel akan segera diperbarui untuk semua klien yang terkait dengan channel yang dihapus.  Hal ini memastikan perubahan tercermin secara akurat dalam berkas repositori."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:122
msgid ""
"You cannot delete {productname} channels with the {webui}.  Only custom "
"channels can be deleted."
msgstr "Anda tidak dapat menghapus channel {productname} melalui {webui}.  Hanya channel kustom yang dapat dihapus."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:123
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting custom channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghapus channel kustom"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:124
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Channels], "
"and select the channel you want to delete."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu pilih channel yang ingin Anda hapus."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:125
msgid "Click btn:[Delete software channel]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete software channel]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:126
msgid ""
"On the `Delete Channel` page, check the details of the channel you are "
"deleting, and check the `Unsubscribe Systems` checkbox to remove the custom "
"channel from any systems that might still be subscribed."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Delete Channel`, periksa detail channel yang akan Anda hapus, lalu centang kotak `Unsubscribe Systems` untuk menghapus channel kustom dari semua sistem yang mungkin masih terdaftar pada channel tersebut."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:127
msgid "Click btn:[Delete Channel]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete Channel]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:128
msgid "When channels are deleted:"
msgstr "Saat channel dihapus:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:129
msgid ""
"the packages that are part of the deleted channel are not automatically "
"removed.  You are not able to update packages that have had their channel "
"deleted."
msgstr "paket yang merupakan bagian dari channel yang dihapus tidak dihapus secara otomatis.  Anda tidak dapat memperbarui paket yang salurannya telah dihapus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:130
msgid ""
"all activation keys referring to that channel as a base channel are also "
"removed."
msgstr "semua kunci aktivasi yang merujuk ke channel tersebut sebagai channel dasar juga dihapus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/custom-channels.adoc:131
msgid ""
"You can delete packages that are not associated with a channel in the "
"{productname} {webui}.  Navigate to menu:Software[Manage > Packages], check "
"the packages to remove, and click btn:[Delete Packages]."
msgstr "Anda dapat menghapus paket yang tidak terkait dengan channel melalui {webui} {productname}.  Buka menu:Software[Manage > Packages], centang paket yang akan dihapus, lalu klik btn:[Delete Packages]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Setup"
msgstr "Penyiapan Tanpa Koneksi Internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to connect {productname} to the internet, you can "
"use it within a disconnected environment."
msgstr "Jika {productname} tidak dapat dihubungkan ke internet, Anda dapat menggunakannya dalam lingkungan tanpa koneksi internet."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The repository mirroring tool (RMT) is available on {sle}{nbsp}15 and "
"later.  RMT replaces the subscription management tool (SMT), which can be "
"used on older {sle} installations."
msgstr "Repository Mirroring Tool (RMT) tersedia pada {sle}{nbsp}15 dan versi yang lebih baru.  RMT menggantikan Subscription Management Tool (SMT), yang dapat digunakan pada instalasi {sle} versi lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In a disconnected {productname} setup, RMT or SMT uses an external network "
"to connect to {scclongform}.  All software channels and repositories are "
"synchronized to a removable storage device.  The storage device can then be "
"used to update the disconnected {productname} installation."
msgstr "Dalam penyiapan {productname} tanpa koneksi internet, RMT atau SMT menggunakan jaringan eksternal untuk terhubung ke {scclongform}.  Semua channel perangkat lunak dan repositori disinkronkan ke perangkat penyimpanan yang dapat dilepas.  Perangkat penyimpanan tersebut kemudian dapat digunakan untuk memperbarui instalasi {productname} yang tidak terhubung ke internet."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This setup allows your {productname} installation to remain in an offline, "
"disconnected environment."
msgstr "Penyiapan ini memungkinkan instalasi {productname} Anda tetap berada dalam lingkungan luring tanpa koneksi internet."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Your RMT or SMT instance must be used to manage the {productname} Server "
"directly.  It cannot be used to manage a second RMT or SMT instance, in a "
"cascade."
msgstr "Instans RMT atau SMT Anda harus digunakan untuk mengelola Server {productname} secara langsung.  Instans tersebut tidak dapat digunakan untuk mengelola instans RMT atau SMT kedua secara berantai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:7
msgid "For more information on RMT, see {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang RMT, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize Channels and Repositories from {scc}"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan Channel dan Repositori dari {scc}"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize RMT"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can use RMT on {sle} 15 installations to manage clients running {sle} 12 "
"or later."
msgstr "Anda dapat menggunakan RMT pada instalasi {sle} 15 untuk mengelola klien yang menjalankan {sle} 12 atau versi yang lebih baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:11
msgid ""
"We recommend you set up a dedicated RMT instance for each {productname} "
"installation."
msgstr "Kami menyarankan agar Anda menyiapkan instans RMT khusus untuk setiap instalasi {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up RMT"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:13
msgid "On the RMT instance, install the RMT package:"
msgstr "Pada instans RMT, instal paket RMT:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in rmt-server\n"
msgstr "zypper in rmt-server\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:15
msgid "Configure RMT using {yast}:"
msgstr "Konfigurasikan RMT menggunakan {yast}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "yast2 rmt\n"
msgstr "yast2 rmt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:17
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete installation."
msgstr "Ikuti petunjuk yang ditampilkan untuk menyelesaikan penginstalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on setting up RMT, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang penyiapan RMT, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/book-rmt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing RMT with {scc}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyinkronkan RMT dengan {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:20
msgid ""
"On the RMT instance, list all available products and repositories for your "
"organization:"
msgstr "Pada instans RMT, tampilkan daftar semua produk dan repositori yang tersedia untuk organisasi Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli products list --all\n"
"rmt-cli repos list --all\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:22
msgid "Synchronize all available updates for your organization:"
msgstr "Sinkronkan semua pembaruan yang tersedia untuk organisasi Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli sync\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli sync\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:24
msgid "You can also configure RMT to synchronize regularly using systemd."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat mengonfigurasi RMT agar melakukan sinkronisasi secara berkala menggunakan systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:25
msgid "Enable the products you require."
msgstr "Aktifkan produk yang Anda perlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:26
msgid "For example, to enable SLES 15:"
msgstr "Misalnya, untuk mengaktifkan SLES 15:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli product enable sles/15/x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:28
msgid "Export the synchronized data to your removable storage."
msgstr "Ekspor data yang telah disinkronkan ke perangkat penyimpanan yang dapat dilepas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:29
msgid "In this example, the storage medium is mounted at `/mnt/usb`:"
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini, media penyimpanan dipasang pada `/mnt/usb`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr "rmt-cli export data /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:31
msgid "Export the enabled repositories to your removable storage:"
msgstr "Ekspor repositori yang telah diaktifkan ke perangkat penyimpanan yang dapat dilepas:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"
msgstr ""
"rmt-cli export settings /mnt/usb\n"
"rmt-cli export repos /mnt/usb\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change RMT user settings in the `cli` section of "
"`/etc/rmt.conf`."
msgstr "Pastikan penyimpanan eksternal dipasang pada direktori yang dapat ditulisi oleh pengguna RMT.  Anda dapat mengubah pengaturan pengguna RMT pada bagian `cli` di `/etc/rmt.conf`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize SMT"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:35
msgid ""
"SMT is included with {sle} 12, and can be used to manage clients running "
"{sle} 10 or later."
msgstr "SMT disertakan dalam {sle} 12 dan dapat digunakan untuk mengelola klien yang menjalankan {sle} 10 atau versi yang lebih baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:36
msgid ""
"SMT requires you to create a local mirror directory on the SMT instance to "
"synchronize repositories and packages."
msgstr "SMT mengharuskan Anda membuat direktori cermin lokal pada instans SMT untuk menyinkronkan repositori dan paket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:37
msgid ""
"For more details on installing and configuring SMT, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih terperinci tentang penginstalan dan konfigurasi SMT, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/book-smt.html."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing SMT with {scc}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyinkronkan SMT dengan {scc}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:39
msgid "On the SMT instance, create a database replacement file:"
msgstr "Pada instans SMT, buat berkas pengganti basis data:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"
msgstr "smt-sync --createdbreplacementfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Export the synchronized data to your removable storage.  In this example, "
"the storage medium is mounted at `/mnt/usb`:"
msgstr "Ekspor data yang telah disinkronkan ke perangkat penyimpanan yang dapat dilepas.  Dalam contoh ini, media penyimpanan dipasang pada `/mnt/usb`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o "
"/mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"
msgstr ""
"smt-sync --todir /mnt/usb\n"
"smt-mirror --dbreplfile /tmp/dbrepl.xml --directory /mnt/usb \\\n"
"           --fromlocalsmt -L /var/log/smt/smt-mirror-export.log\n"
"curl https://scc.suse.com/multi-linux-manager/product_tree.json -o /mnt/usb/product_tree.json\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Ensure that the external storage is mounted to a directory that is writeable "
"by the RMT user.  You can change SMT user settings in `/etc/smt.conf`."
msgstr "Pastikan penyimpanan eksternal dipasang pada direktori yang dapat ditulisi oleh pengguna RMT.  Anda dapat mengubah pengaturan pengguna SMT di `/etc/smt.conf`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mandatory Channels"
msgstr "Channel Wajib"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The corresponding {productname} Client Tools Channels are required, for "
"{productname} to be able to synchronize a given channel.  If these channels "
"are not enabled, {productname} may fail to detect that product."
msgstr "Channel Alat Klien {productname} yang sesuai diperlukan agar {productname} dapat menyinkronkan channel tertentu.  Jika channel ini tidak diaktifkan, {productname} mungkin gagal mendeteksi produk tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:46
msgid "Run the following command to enable these mandatory channels:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah berikut untuk mengaktifkan channel wajib tersebut:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 12 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 12 dan produk berbasis SLES 12 seperti SLES for SAP atau SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:48
msgid "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64`"
msgstr "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/12/x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:49
msgid "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64`"
msgstr "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,12,x86_64`"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "SLES 15 and products based on it such as SLES for SAP or SLE HPC"
msgstr "SLES 15 dan produk berbasis SLES 15 seperti SLES for SAP atau SLE HPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:51
msgid "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64`"
msgstr "RMT: `rmt-cli products enable sle-manager-tools/15/x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:52
msgid "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64`"
msgstr "SMT: `smt repos -p sle-manager-tools,15,x86_64`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:53
msgid "Then mirror the channels, and export."
msgstr "Kemudian buat cermin channel tersebut dan ekspor."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:54
msgid ""
"Other distributions, or architectures, can be enabled.  For more information "
"about enabling product channels or repositories to be mirrored, see the "
"documentation:"
msgstr "Distribusi atau arsitektur lain dapat diaktifkan.  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang pengaktifan channel produk atau repositori yang akan dicerminkan, lihat dokumentasi:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "RMT"
msgstr "RMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:56
msgid "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"
msgstr "{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-rmt-mirroring.html#sec-rmt-mirroring-enable-disable"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "SMT"
msgstr "SMT"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:58
msgid "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"
msgstr "https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/single-html/SLES-smt/index.html#smt-mirroring-manage-domirror"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disconnected Server"
msgstr "Server Tanpa Koneksi Internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:60
msgid ""
"To set up {productname} as a disconnected server follow the instructions of "
"an air-gapped deployment."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan {productname} sebagai server tanpa koneksi internet, ikuti petunjuk penerapan air-gapped."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy"
msgstr "Menerapkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:62
msgid ""
"It is recommended to deploy a disconnected server as a Virtual Machine (VM) "
"using a provided image.  For an air-gapped deployment of {productname} "
"Server, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."
msgstr "Sebaiknya terapkan server tanpa koneksi internet sebagai Mesin Virtual (VM) menggunakan image yang disediakan.  Untuk penerapan air-gapped Server {productname}, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/server-air-gapped-deployment-mlm.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Keep in mind to execute the final command with the `--mirror` option and "
"replace `</media/disk>` with your mount point:"
msgstr "Pastikan Anda menjalankan perintah terakhir dengan opsi `--mirror` dan mengganti `</media/disk>` dengan titik pemasangan Anda:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm install --mirror </media/disk>\n"
msgstr "mgradm install --mirror </media/disk>\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "Synchronize"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:66
msgid ""
"When you have removable media loaded with your {scclongform} data, you can "
"use it to synchronize your disconnected server."
msgstr "Setelah media yang dapat dilepas berisi data {scclongform} Anda, media tersebut dapat digunakan untuk menyinkronkan server tanpa koneksi internet."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:67
msgid ""
"The removable media that you use for synchronization must always be "
"available at the same mount point.  Do not trigger a synchronization if the "
"storage medium is not mounted.  This results in data corruption."
msgstr "Media yang dapat dilepas yang Anda gunakan untuk sinkronisasi harus selalu tersedia pada titik pemasangan yang sama.  Jangan memulai sinkronisasi jika media penyimpanan belum dipasang.  Hal ini akan menyebabkan kerusakan data."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Synchronizing a Disconnected Server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyinkronkan Server Tanpa Koneksi Internet"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:69
msgid "Restart the Tomcat service:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan Tomcat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- systemctl restart tomcat\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:71
msgid "Refresh the local data:"
msgstr "Segarkan data lokal:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync refresh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:73
msgid "Perform a synchronization:"
msgstr "Lakukan sinkronisasi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync list channels\n"
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-sync add channel channel-label\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:75
msgid ""
"Be aware that if `server.susemanager.fromdir` is set, {productname} will not "
"be able to check if {scclongform} credentials are valid or not.  Instead, a "
"warning sign will be displayed and no {scc} online check will be performed."
msgstr "Perlu diketahui bahwa jika `server.susemanager.fromdir` ditetapkan, {productname} tidak dapat memeriksa apakah kredensial {scclongform} valid.  Sebagai gantinya, tanda peringatan akan ditampilkan dan pemeriksaan daring {scc} tidak akan dilakukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/disconnected-setup.adoc:76
msgid ""
"An alternative to disconnected setup may be to copy content between servers "
"using Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS).  For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization - Version 2]."
msgstr "Alternatif penyiapan tanpa koneksi internet adalah menyalin konten antarserver menggunakan Inter-Server Synchronization (ISS).  Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Sinkronisasi Antarserver - Versi 2]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Building and Management"
msgstr "Pembuatan dan Pengelolaan Image"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image building overview"
msgstr "Gambaran umum pembuatan image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} enables system administrators to build containers and OS "
"Images and push the results to an image store."
msgstr "{productname} memungkinkan administrator sistem membuat kontainer dan image sistem operasi serta mengirimkan hasilnya ke penyimpanan image."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building and pushing images"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat dan mengirimkan image"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:5
msgid "Define an image store."
msgstr "Tentukan penyimpanan image."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Define an image profile and associate it with a source (either a git "
"repository or a directory)."
msgstr "Tentukan profil image dan kaitkan dengan sumber (repositori git atau direktori)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:7
msgid "Build the image."
msgstr "Buat image."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:8
msgid "Push the image to the image store."
msgstr "Kirimkan image ke penyimpanan image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:9
msgid ""
"{productname} supports these two build types: Dockerfile and the Kiwi build "
"type.  The Kiwi build type is used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images."
msgstr "{productname} mendukung dua jenis build berikut: Dockerfile dan Kiwi.  Jenis build Kiwi digunakan untuk membuat image sistem, image virtual, dan image lainnya."

#.  Needs checking
#.  at later places to be fix accordingly
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The image store for the Kiwi build type is pre-defined as a file system "
"directory in the `srv-www` volume."
msgstr "Penyimpanan image untuk jenis build Kiwi telah ditentukan sebagai direktori sistem berkas dalam volume `srv-www`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:200
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"`https://MANAGER-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  The exact "
"location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr "Berkas image dapat diunduh dari `https://MANAGER-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  Lokasi tepatnya dapat diketahui dari halaman detail image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:12
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:201
msgid ""
"The image files can be downloaded from "
"`https://UYUNI-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  The exact "
"location can be determined from the image details page."
msgstr "Berkas image dapat diunduh dari `https://UYUNI-HOST/os-images/ORGANIZATION-ID/FILE-NAME`.  Lokasi tepatnya dapat diketahui dari halaman detail image."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container images"
msgstr "Image kontainer"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:15
msgid ""
"The containers feature is available for {salt} clients running {sles} 12 or "
"later.  Before you begin, ensure your environment meets these requirements:"
msgstr "Fitur kontainer tersedia untuk klien {salt} yang menjalankan {sles} 12 atau versi yang lebih baru.  Sebelum memulai, pastikan lingkungan Anda memenuhi persyaratan berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:16
msgid ""
"A published git repository containing a Dockerfile and configuration "
"scripts.  The repository can be public or private, and should be hosted on "
"GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket."
msgstr "Repositori git yang telah dipublikasikan dan berisi Dockerfile serta skrip konfigurasi.  Repositori dapat bersifat publik atau privat dan sebaiknya dihosting di GitHub, GitLab, atau BitBucket."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:17
msgid "A properly configured image store, such as a Docker registry."
msgstr "Penyimpanan image yang dikonfigurasi dengan benar, seperti registry Docker."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:18
msgid ""
"For more information on containers, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang kontainer, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/container/all/html/Container-guide/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:163
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a build host"
msgstr "Membuat host build"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:20
msgid ""
"To build images with {productname}, you need to create and configure a build "
"host.  Container build hosts are {salt} clients running {sle} 12 or later.  "
"This section guides you through the initial configuration for a build host."
msgstr "Untuk membuat image dengan {productname}, Anda perlu membuat dan mengonfigurasi host build.  Host build kontainer adalah klien {salt} yang menjalankan {sle} 12 atau versi yang lebih baru.  Bagian ini memandu Anda melakukan konfigurasi awal host build."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:166
msgid ""
"The operating system on the build host must match the operating system on "
"the targeted image."
msgstr "Sistem operasi pada host build harus sesuai dengan sistem operasi pada image target."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:167
msgid ""
"For example, build {sles}{nbsp}15 based images on a build host running "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) OS version.  Build {sles}{nbsp}12 based images "
"on a build host running {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 or {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4 OS version."
msgstr "Misalnya, buat image berbasis {sles}{nbsp}15 pada host build yang menjalankan sistem operasi {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 atau versi yang lebih baru).  Buat image berbasis {sles}{nbsp}12 pada host build yang menjalankan sistem operasi {sles}{nbsp}12 SP5 atau {sles}{nbsp}12 SP4."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:23
msgid "Cross-architecture builds are not supported."
msgstr "Build lintas arsitektur tidak didukung."

#. 2022-05-12, ke: at least for now, according to feedback, this is unsupported:
#. For example, you must build Raspberry Pi {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 images on a Raspberry Pi (aarch64 architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3.
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:24
msgid ""
"From the {productname} {webui}, perform these steps to configure a build "
"host:"
msgstr "Dari {webui} {productname}, lakukan langkah-langkah berikut untuk mengonfigurasi host build:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building a host"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat host"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Select a {salt} client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Systems] overview page."
msgstr "Pilih klien {salt} yang akan ditetapkan sebagai host build dari halaman ringkasan menu:Systems[Systems]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:27
msgid ""
"From the `System Details` page of the selected client assign the containers "
"modules.  Navigate to menu:Software[Software Channels] and enable the "
"containers module (for example, `SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool` and "
"`SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates`).  Continue with btn:[Next]."
msgstr "Dari halaman `System Details` klien yang dipilih, tetapkan modul kontainer.  Buka menu:Software[Software Channels] dan aktifkan modul kontainer (misalnya, `SLE-Module-Containers15-Pool` dan `SLE-Module-Containers15-Updates`).  Lanjutkan dengan btn:[Next]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:28
msgid "Schedule the ` Software Channel Change`, and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Jadwalkan ` Software Channel Change`, lalu klik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:29
msgid ""
"From the `System Details` tab select menu:Properties[] page, and enable "
"`Container Build Host` from the `Add-on System Types` list.  Confirm by "
"clicking btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "Dari tab `System Details`, pilih halaman menu:Properties[], lalu aktifkan `Container Build Host` dari daftar `Add-on System Types`.  Konfirmasikan dengan mengeklik btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Install all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the system "
"details tab select menu:States[Highstate], and click btn:[Apply Highstate].  "
"Alternatively, apply `Highstate` from the {productname} Server command line:"
msgstr "Instal semua paket yang diperlukan dengan menerapkan `Highstate`.  Dari tab detail sistem, pilih menu:States[Highstate], lalu klik btn:[Apply Highstate].  Sebagai alternatif, terapkan `Highstate` melalui baris perintah Server {productname}:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:31
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"
msgstr "salt '$your_client' state.highstate\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for containers"
msgstr "Membuat kunci aktivasi untuk kontainer"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The containers built with {productname} use channels associated to the "
"activation key as repositories when building the image.  This section guides "
"you through creating an ad-hoc activation key for this purpose."
msgstr "Kontainer yang dibuat dengan {productname} menggunakan channel yang terkait dengan kunci aktivasi sebagai repositori saat membuat image.  Bagian ini memandu Anda membuat kunci aktivasi ad hoc untuk keperluan tersebut."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To build a container, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `SUSE Manager Default`."
msgstr "Untuk membuat kontainer, Anda memerlukan kunci aktivasi yang terkait dengan channel selain `SUSE Manager Default`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:35
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:196
msgid "For more information, see xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut, lihat xref:client-configuration:activation-keys.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:36
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image store"
msgstr "Membuat penyimpanan image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:37
msgid ""
"All built images are pushed to an image store.  This section contains "
"information about creating an image store.  Image store is generally "
"referenced as a registry."
msgstr "Semua image yang telah dibuat dikirimkan ke penyimpanan image.  Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pembuatan penyimpanan image.  Penyimpanan image umumnya disebut registry."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating image store"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat penyimpanan image"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:39
msgid "Select menu:Images[Stores]."
msgstr "Pilih menu:Images[Stores]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:40
msgid "Click `Create` to create a new store."
msgstr "Klik `Create` untuk membuat penyimpanan baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:41
msgid "From the `Store Type` select the correct type."
msgstr "Pada `Store Type`, pilih jenis yang sesuai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:42
msgid "Define a name for the image store in the `Label` field."
msgstr "Tentukan nama penyimpanan image pada kolom `Label`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:43
msgid ""
"Provide the path to your image registry by filling in the `URI` field, as a "
"fully qualified domain name (FQDN) for the container registry host (whether "
"internal or external)."
msgstr "Masukkan jalur ke registry image Anda pada kolom `URI` berupa nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) untuk host registry kontainer (baik internal maupun eksternal)."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"The Registry URI can also be used to specify an image store on a registry "
"that is already in use."
msgstr "URI registry juga dapat digunakan untuk menentukan penyimpanan image pada registry yang sudah digunakan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"
msgstr "registry.example.com:5000/myregistry/myproject\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:47
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to add the new image store."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk menambahkan penyimpanan image baru."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:48
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an image profile"
msgstr "Membuat profil image"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:49
msgid ""
"All container images are built using an image profile, which contains the "
"building instructions.  This section contains information about creating an "
"image profile with the {productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Semua image kontainer dibuat menggunakan profil image yang berisi instruksi pembuatan.  Bagian ini berisi informasi tentang pembuatan profil image melalui {webui} {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:50
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:204
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an image profile"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat profil image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:51
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat profil image, pilih menu:Images[Profiles], lalu klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:52
msgid "Provide a name for the image profile by filling in the `Label` field."
msgstr "Masukkan nama profil image pada kolom `Label`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:53
msgid ""
"If your container image tag is in a format such as `myproject/myimage`, make "
"sure your image store registry URI contains the `/myproject` suffix."
msgstr "Jika tag image kontainer Anda menggunakan format seperti `myproject/myimage`, pastikan URI registry penyimpanan image Anda berisi akhiran `/myproject`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:54
msgid "Use `Dockerfile` as the `Image Type`."
msgstr "Gunakan `Dockerfile` sebagai `Image Type`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Use the drop-down menu to select your registry from the `Target Image Store` "
"field."
msgstr "Gunakan menu tarik-turun untuk memilih registry Anda pada kolom `Target Image Store`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:56
msgid ""
"In the `Path` field, type a GitHub, GitLab, or BitBucket repository URL.  "
"The path can also be a local directory on the build host.  The URL should be "
"`http`, `https`, or a token authentication URL.  For GitHub or GitLab, use "
"one of these formats:"
msgstr "Pada kolom `Path`, ketik URL repositori GitHub, GitLab, atau BitBucket.  Jalur ini juga dapat berupa direktori lokal pada host build.  URL harus berupa `http`, `https`, atau URL autentikasi token.  Untuk GitHub atau GitLab, gunakan salah satu format berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitHub Path Options"
msgstr "Opsi Jalur GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:58
msgid "GitHub single user project repository"
msgstr "Repositori proyek pengguna individual GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/USER/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:60
msgid "GitHub organization project repository"
msgstr "Repositori proyek organisasi GitHub"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/ORG/project.git#branchname:folder\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:62
msgid "GitHub token authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi token GitHub"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:63
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private, modify the profile's URL to include "
"authentication.  Use this URL format to authenticate with a GitHub token:"
msgstr "Jika repositori git Anda bersifat privat, ubah URL profil agar menyertakan autentikasi.  Gunakan format URL berikut untuk melakukan autentikasi dengan token GitHub:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://USER:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@github.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "GitLab Path Options"
msgstr "Opsi Jalur GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:66
msgid "GitLab single user project repository"
msgstr "Repositori proyek pengguna individual GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:68
msgid "GitLab groups project repository"
msgstr "Repositori proyek grup GitLab"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab.example.com/GROUP/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:70
msgid "GitLab token authentication"
msgstr "Autentikasi token GitLab"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:71
msgid ""
"If your git repository is private and not publicly accessible, you need to "
"modify the profile's git URL to include authentication.  Use this URL format "
"to authenticate with a GitLab token:"
msgstr "Jika repositori git Anda bersifat privat dan tidak dapat diakses publik, Anda perlu mengubah URL git profil agar menyertakan autentikasi.  Gunakan format URL berikut untuk melakukan autentikasi dengan token GitLab:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"
msgstr "https://gitlab-ci-token:<AUTHENTICATION_TOKEN>@gitlab.example.com/USER/project.git#master:/container/\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:73
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a git branch, the `master` branch is used by default.  "
"If a `folder` is not specified, the image sources (Dockerfile sources) are "
"expected to be in the root directory of the GitHub or GitLab checkout."
msgstr "Jika Anda tidak menentukan branch git, branch `master` digunakan secara bawaan.  Jika `folder` tidak ditentukan, sumber image (sumber Dockerfile) diharapkan berada di direktori akar hasil checkout GitHub atau GitLab."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:74
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:211
msgid ""
"Select an `Activation Key`.  Activation keys ensure that images using a "
"profile are assigned to the correct channel and packages."
msgstr "Pilih `Activation Key`.  Kunci aktivasi memastikan bahwa image yang menggunakan profil ditetapkan ke channel dan paket yang benar."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:75
msgid ""
"When you associate an activation key with an image profile you are ensuring "
"any image using the profile uses the correct software channel and any "
"packages in the channel."
msgstr "Dengan mengaitkan kunci aktivasi ke profil image, Anda memastikan bahwa setiap image yang menggunakan profil tersebut menggunakan channel perangkat lunak yang benar beserta paket-paket di dalamnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:76
msgid "Click the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "Klik tombol btn:[Create]."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example Dockerfile sources"
msgstr "Contoh sumber Dockerfile"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:78
msgid ""
"An Image Profile that can be reused is published at "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."
msgstr "Profil Image yang dapat digunakan kembali tersedia di https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:79
msgid ""
"The `ARG` parameters ensure that the built image is associated with the "
"desired repository served by {productname}.  The `ARG` parameters also allow "
"you to build image versions of {sles} which may differ from the version of "
"{sles} used by the build host itself."
msgstr "Parameter `ARG` memastikan bahwa image yang dibangun dikaitkan dengan repositori yang diinginkan yang disediakan oleh {productname}.  Parameter `ARG` juga memungkinkan Anda membangun image untuk versi {sles} yang mungkin berbeda dari versi {sles} yang digunakan oleh host build itu sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:80
msgid ""
"For example: The `ARG repo` parameter and the `echo` command pointing to the "
"repository file, creates and then injects the correct path into the "
"repository file for the desired channel version."
msgstr "Sebagai contoh: Parameter `ARG repo` dan perintah `echo` yang mengarah ke berkas repositori membuat lalu menyisipkan jalur yang benar ke dalam berkas repositori untuk versi channel yang diinginkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:81
msgid ""
"The repository is determined by the activation key that you assigned to your "
"image profile."
msgstr "Repositori ditentukan oleh kunci aktivasi yang Anda tetapkan ke profil image."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"
msgstr ""
"FROM registry.example.com/sles12sp2\n"
"MAINTAINER Tux Administrator \"tux@example.com\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "### Begin: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### Awal: Baris-baris ini diperlukan untuk penggunaan dengan {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"
msgstr ""
"ARG repo\n"
"ARG cert\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the correct certificate\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"# Tambahkan sertifikat yang benar\n"
"RUN echo \"$cert\" > /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT.pem\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Update certificate trust store\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"
msgstr ""
"# Perbarui penyimpanan sertifikat tepercaya\n"
"RUN update-ca-certificates\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:87
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the repository path to the image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# Tambahkan jalur repositori ke image\n"
"RUN echo \"$repo\" > /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "### End: These lines are required for use with {productname}\n"
msgstr "### Akhir: Baris-baris ini diperlukan untuk penggunaan dengan {productname}\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Add the package script\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Tambahkan skrip paket\n"
"ADD add_packages.sh /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# Run the package script\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"# Jalankan skrip paket\n"
"RUN /root/add_packages.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# After building remove the repository path from image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"
msgstr ""
"# Setelah build selesai, hapus jalur repositori dari image\n"
"RUN rm -f /etc/zypp/repos.d/susemanager:dockerbuild.repo\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using custom info key-value pairs as Docker `buildargs`"
msgstr "Menggunakan pasangan kunci-nilai informasi kustom sebagai `buildargs` Docker"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:93
msgid ""
"You can assign custom info key-value pairs to attach information to the "
"image profiles.  Additionally, these key-value pairs are passed to the "
"Docker build command as `buildargs`."
msgstr "Anda dapat menetapkan pasangan kunci-nilai informasi kustom untuk melampirkan informasi ke profil image.  Selain itu, pasangan kunci-nilai ini diteruskan ke perintah build Docker sebagai `buildargs`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:94
msgid ""
"For more information about the available custom info keys and creating "
"additional ones, see xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang kunci informasi kustom yang tersedia dan cara membuat kunci tambahan, lihat xref:reference:systems/custom-system-info.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:95
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:238
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build an image"
msgstr "Membangun image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:96
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build an image.  The first way is to create it from "
"scratch.  To do that, select menu:Images[Build] from the left navigation "
"bar, or click the build icon in the menu:Images[Profiles] list and follow "
"the procedure."
msgstr "Ada dua cara untuk membangun image.  Cara pertama adalah membuatnya dari awal.  Untuk melakukannya, pilih menu:Images[Build] dari bilah navigasi kiri, atau klik ikon build pada daftar menu:Images[Profiles] dan ikuti prosedurnya."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:97
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:240
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Building an image"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membangun image"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:98
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:241
msgid "Select menu:Images[Build]."
msgstr "Pilih menu:Images[Build]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:99
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"`latest` (only relevant to containers)."
msgstr "Tambahkan nama tag yang berbeda jika Anda menginginkan versi selain versi bawaan `latest` (hanya berlaku untuk container)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:100
msgid "Select `Build Profile` and `Build Host`."
msgstr "Pilih `Build Profile` dan `Build Host`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:101
msgid ""
"Notice the `Profile Summary` to the right of the build fields.  When you "
"have selected a build profile, detailed information about the selected "
"profile is displayed in this area."
msgstr "Perhatikan `Profile Summary` di sebelah kanan kolom build.  Setelah Anda memilih profil build, informasi terperinci tentang profil yang dipilih akan ditampilkan di area ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:102
msgid "To schedule a build click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "Untuk menjadwalkan build, klik tombol btn:[Build]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:103
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import an image"
msgstr "Mengimpor image"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:104
msgid ""
"The second way to get an image is to import and inspect arbitrary images.  "
"To do that, select menu:Images[Image List] from the left navigation bar.  "
"Complete the text boxes of the `Import` dialog.  When it has processed, the "
"imported image is listed on the `Image List` page."
msgstr "Cara kedua untuk mendapatkan image adalah mengimpor dan memeriksa image apa pun.  Untuk melakukannya, pilih menu:Images[Image List] dari bilah navigasi kiri.  Isi kotak teks pada dialog `Import`.  Setelah pemrosesan selesai, image yang diimpor akan tercantum pada halaman `Image List`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:105
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing an image"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:106
msgid ""
"From menu:Images[Image list] click btn:[Import] to open the `Import Image` "
"dialog."
msgstr "Dari menu:Images[Image list], klik btn:[Import] untuk membuka dialog `Import Image`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:107
msgid "In the `Import Image` dialog complete these fields:"
msgstr "Pada dialog `Import Image`, isi kolom-kolom berikut:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image store"
msgstr "Penyimpanan image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:109
msgid "The registry from where the image is pulled for inspection."
msgstr "Registry tempat image diambil untuk diperiksa."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:110
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image name"
msgstr "Nama image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:111
msgid "The name of the image in the registry."
msgstr "Nama image di registry."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:112
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image version"
msgstr "Versi image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:113
msgid "The version of the image in the registry."
msgstr "Versi image di registry."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build host"
msgstr "Host build"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:115
msgid "The build host that pulls and inspects the image."
msgstr "Host build yang mengambil dan memeriksa image."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activation key"
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:117
msgid ""
"The activation key that provides the path to the software channel that the "
"image is inspected with."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi yang menyediakan jalur ke channel perangkat lunak yang digunakan untuk memeriksa image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:118
msgid "For confirmation, click btn:[Import]."
msgstr "Untuk mengonfirmasi, klik btn:[Import]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:119
msgid ""
"The entry for the image is created in the database, and an `Inspect Image` "
"action on {productname} is scheduled."
msgstr "Entri untuk image dibuat dalam basis data, dan tindakan `Inspect Image` pada {productname} dijadwalkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:120
msgid ""
"When it has been processed, you can find the imported image in the `Image "
"List`.  It has a different icon in the `Build` column, to indicate that the "
"image is imported.  The status icon for the imported image can also be seen "
"on the `Overview` tab for the image."
msgstr "Setelah pemrosesan selesai, Anda dapat menemukan image yang diimpor di `Image List`.  Image tersebut memiliki ikon berbeda pada kolom `Build` untuk menunjukkan bahwa image tersebut diimpor.  Ikon status image yang diimpor juga dapat dilihat pada tab `Overview` untuk image tersebut."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:122
#, no-wrap
msgid "General issues"
msgstr "Masalah umum"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:123
msgid "These are some known problems when working with images:"
msgstr "Berikut beberapa masalah yang diketahui saat bekerja dengan image:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:124
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates to access the registry or the git repositories should be "
"deployed to the client by a custom state file."
msgstr "Sertifikat HTTPS untuk mengakses registry atau repositori git harus diterapkan ke klien melalui berkas state kustom."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:125
msgid "SSH git access using Docker is currently unsupported."
msgstr "Akses git melalui SSH menggunakan Docker saat ini tidak didukung."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "OS images"
msgstr "Image OS"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:127
msgid ""
"OS Images are built by the Kiwi build system.  The output image is "
"customizable and can be PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, or other types of images."
msgstr "Image OS dibangun menggunakan sistem build Kiwi.  Image yang dihasilkan dapat disesuaikan dan berupa PXE, QCOW2, LiveCD, atau jenis image lainnya."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:128
msgid ""
"For more information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang sistem build Kiwi, lihat https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[dokumentasi Kiwi]."

#. SLE15 images support is not yet released for MLM4, but is part of MLM4.0.4 as tech preview
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:130
msgid ""
"The Kiwi image building feature is available for {salt} clients running "
"{sles}{nbsp}12 and {sles}{nbsp}11."
msgstr "Fitur build image Kiwi tersedia untuk klien {salt} yang menjalankan {sles}{nbsp}12 dan {sles}{nbsp}11."

#. From {sles}{nbsp}15, `kiwi-ng` is used instead of the legacy Kiwi.
#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:131
msgid ""
"Kiwi image configuration files and configuration scripts must be accessible "
"in one of these locations:"
msgstr "Berkas konfigurasi image Kiwi dan skrip konfigurasi harus dapat diakses di salah satu lokasi berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:132
msgid "Git repository"
msgstr "Repositori Git"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:133
msgid "HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive"
msgstr "Arsip tar yang dihosting melalui HTTP atau HTTPS"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:134
msgid "Local directory on the build host"
msgstr "Direktori lokal pada host build"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:135
msgid ""
"For an example of a complete Kiwi repository served by git, see "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."
msgstr "Untuk contoh repositori Kiwi lengkap yang disediakan melalui git, lihat https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles/tree/master/OSImage."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:136
msgid ""
"You need at least 1{nbsp}GB of RAM available for hosts running OS Images "
"built with Kiwi.  Disk space depends on the actual size of the image.  For "
"more information, see the documentation of the underlying system."
msgstr "Anda memerlukan setidaknya 1{nbsp}GB RAM yang tersedia untuk host yang menjalankan Image OS yang dibangun dengan Kiwi.  Kebutuhan ruang disk bergantung pada ukuran aktual image.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat dokumentasi sistem yang mendasarinya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Accessing Git repositories via an HTTP/HTTPS proxy when building images"
msgstr "Mengakses repositori Git melalui proxy HTTP/HTTPS saat membangun image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:138
msgid ""
"When a build host needs to fetch sources from a git repository that is only "
"reachable through an HTTP/HTTPS proxy, you may see git timeouts during the "
"build because the git client invoked by the Salt state does not always pick "
"up system-wide proxy settings (for example `/etc/sysconfig/proxy` or "
"environment variables)."
msgstr "Ketika host build perlu mengambil sumber dari repositori git yang hanya dapat dijangkau melalui proxy HTTP/HTTPS, Anda mungkin mengalami timeout git selama build karena klien git yang dipanggil oleh state Salt tidak selalu menggunakan pengaturan proxy tingkat sistem (misalnya `/etc/sysconfig/proxy` atau variabel lingkungan)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:139
msgid ""
"To make git use the proxy for non-interactive builds create `/etc/gitconfig` "
"with an http.proxy entry:"
msgstr "Agar git menggunakan proxy untuk build noninteraktif, buat `/etc/gitconfig` dengan entri http.proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:140
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# or for HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
msgstr ""
"# /etc/gitconfig\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = http://proxy.example.com:3128\n"
"# or for HTTPS\n"
"[http]\n"
"    proxy = https://proxy.example.com:3128\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:141
msgid ""
"If the proxy requires authentication, prefer a credential helper or use a "
"credential store instead of embedding credentials in the URL."
msgstr "Jika proxy memerlukan autentikasi, utamakan penggunaan credential helper atau gunakan penyimpanan kredensial alih-alih menyematkan kredensial dalam URL."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Automating with {salt}"
msgstr "Otomatisasi dengan {salt}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:143
msgid ""
"You can manage `/etc/gitconfig` on build hosts through Configuration "
"Management, the same way as on any other managed system.  Create a Salt "
"state file and assign it to the build host via a config channel, then apply "
"a highstate from the {productname} UI."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengelola `/etc/gitconfig` pada host build melalui Manajemen Konfigurasi, dengan cara yang sama seperti pada sistem terkelola lainnya.  Buat berkas state Salt dan tetapkan ke host build melalui channel konfigurasi, lalu terapkan highstate dari UI {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:144
msgid ""
"If you want to source the proxy address from a System Custom Info field, use "
"the `custom_info:` pillar prefix:"
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin mengambil alamat proxy dari kolom System Custom Info, gunakan prefiks pillar `custom_info:`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ "
"salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', "
"'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"
msgstr ""
"/etc/gitconfig:\n"
"  file.managed:\n"
"    - user: root\n"
"    - group: root\n"
"    - mode: '0644'\n"
"    - contents: |\n"
"        [http]\n"
"            proxy = {{ salt['pillar.get']('custom_info:build_server:git_proxy', 'http://proxy.example.com:3128') }}\n"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "Container-based Kiwi image build support"
msgstr "Dukungan build image Kiwi berbasis container"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:147
msgid ""
"{productname} introduces a container-based Kiwi image build system, in "
"addition to the existing legacy Kiwi and KiwiNG tools."
msgstr "{productname} memperkenalkan sistem build image Kiwi berbasis container, selain alat Kiwi lama dan KiwiNG yang sudah ada."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuration and overrides "
msgstr "Konfigurasi dan penggantian pengaturan bawaan "

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:149
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values.  To configure these, navigate to menu:[Systems>Custom "
"System Info] in the {webui} and create the necessary keys."
msgstr "Administrator dapat mengganti perilaku bawaan menggunakan nilai pillar atau nilai kustom berikut.  Untuk mengonfigurasinya, buka menu:[Systems>Custom System Info] di {webui} dan buat kunci yang diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:150
msgid ""
"The build system used depends on the underlying OS or specific pillar "
"values:"
msgstr "Sistem build yang digunakan bergantung pada OS yang mendasarinya atau nilai pillar tertentu:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:151
msgid "for SLE 11 / SLE 12: legacy Kiwi v7"
msgstr "untuk SLE 11 / SLE 12: Kiwi v7 lama"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:152
msgid "for SLE 15: KiwiNG (v9 and containerized Kiwi 10)"
msgstr "untuk SLE 15: KiwiNG (v9 dan Kiwi 10 dalam container)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Administrators can override the default behavior using the following pillar "
"or custom values:"
msgstr "Administrator dapat mengganti perilaku bawaan menggunakan nilai pillar atau nilai kustom berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:154
msgid "`use_kiwi_ng`: force the use of Kiwi 9,"
msgstr "`use_kiwi_ng`: memaksakan penggunaan Kiwi 9,"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:155
msgid ""
"`use_kiwi_container`: force the use of containerized Kiwi 10.  To enable "
"this, set the value to `1`."
msgstr "`use_kiwi_container`: memaksakan penggunaan Kiwi 10 dalam container.  Untuk mengaktifkannya, tetapkan nilainya ke `1`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:156
msgid ""
"`use_bundle_build`: upload additional KIWI bundle build artifacts (like "
"`.install.tar` which contains PXE files, and `.raw.xz`) to the server.  To "
"enable this, set the value to `true`."
msgstr "`use_bundle_build`: mengunggah artefak build bundel KIWI tambahan (seperti `.install.tar` yang berisi berkas PXE, dan `.raw.xz`) ke server.  Untuk mengaktifkannya, tetapkan nilainya ke `true`."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Version-specific configurations"
msgstr "Konfigurasi khusus versi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:158
msgid ""
"When using a containerized build host for SUSE Linux Enterprise 15 profiles, "
"specific configurations are required because SLES 15 profiles rely on Kiwi "
"9, while the default container behavior uses Kiwi 10."
msgstr "Saat menggunakan host build dalam container untuk profil SUSE Linux Enterprise 15, diperlukan konfigurasi khusus karena profil SLES 15 bergantung pada Kiwi 9, sedangkan perilaku bawaan container menggunakan Kiwi 10."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:159
msgid ""
"To ensure the correct version is used for SLES 15 profiles, you must define "
"the `kiwi_image` custom info key with the following value:"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan versi yang benar digunakan untuk profil SLES 15, Anda harus menetapkan kunci informasi kustom `kiwi_image` dengan nilai berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:160
msgid "`Key`: kiwi_image"
msgstr "`Key`: kiwi_image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:161
msgid "`Value`: `registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:9`"
msgstr "`Value`: `registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:9`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:162
msgid ""
"If this key is not set, the system defaults to the latest version (e.g., "
"`registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:10.2`), which may result in build issues for "
"SLES 15 profiles."
msgstr "Jika kunci ini tidak ditetapkan, sistem secara bawaan menggunakan versi terbaru (misalnya, `registry.suse.com/bci/kiwi:10.2`), yang dapat menyebabkan masalah build untuk profil SLES 15."

#.  FIXME, bsc#1245987:
#.  Discussing Container-Based KIWI Image Build Support here?
#.  Perhaps 2.'docker' might be 2, but the container variant might be different?
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:164
msgid ""
"To build all kinds of images with {productname}, create and configure a "
"build host.  OS Image build hosts are {salt} clients running on "
"{sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 or later) or {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 or later)."
msgstr "Untuk membangun semua jenis image dengan {productname}, buat dan konfigurasikan host build.  Host build Image OS adalah klien {salt} yang berjalan pada {sles}{nbsp}15 (SP2 atau yang lebih baru) atau {sles}{nbsp}12 (SP4 atau yang lebih baru)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:165
msgid ""
"This procedure guides you through the initial configuration for a build "
"host."
msgstr "Prosedur ini memandu Anda melakukan konfigurasi awal untuk host build."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Cross-architecture builds are not possible.  For example, you must build "
"Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 image on a Raspberry PI (aarch64 "
"architecture) build host running {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."
msgstr "Build lintas arsitektur tidak dapat dilakukan.  Sebagai contoh, Anda harus membangun image Raspberry PI {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3 pada host build Raspberry PI (arsitektur aarch64) yang menjalankan {sles}{nbsp}15 SP3."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:169
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configure the build host in the {productname} {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi host build di {webui} {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:170
msgid ""
"Select a client to be designated as a build host from the "
"menu:Systems[Overview] page."
msgstr "Pilih klien yang akan ditetapkan sebagai host build dari halaman menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:171
msgid ""
"Navigate to the menu:System Details[Properties] tab, and check the `Add-on "
"System Type` > `OS Image Build Host` box."
msgstr "Buka tab menu:System Details[Properties], lalu centang kotak `Add-on System Type` > `OS Image Build Host`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:172
msgid "Confirm with btn:[Update Properties]."
msgstr "Konfirmasikan dengan btn:[Update Properties]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:173
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], and enable "
"the required software channels depending on the build host version."
msgstr "Buka menu:System Details[Software > Software Channels], lalu aktifkan channel perangkat lunak yang diperlukan sesuai versi host build."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:174
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}12 build hosts require {productname} Client tools "
"(`SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool` and `SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates`)."
msgstr "Host build {sles}{nbsp}12 memerlukan alat Klien {productname} (`SLE-Manager-Tools12-Pool` dan `SLE-Manager-Tools12-Updates`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:175
msgid ""
"{sles}{nbsp}15 build hosts require {sles} modules "
"`SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool` and `SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates`."
msgstr "Host build {sles}{nbsp}15 memerlukan modul {sles} `SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Pool` dan `SLE-Module-DevTools15-SP4-Updates`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:176
msgid "Schedule and click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Jadwalkan dan klik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:177
msgid ""
"Install Kiwi and all required packages by applying `Highstate`.  From the "
"system details page select menu:States[Highstate] and click btn:[Apply "
"Highstate].  Alternatively, apply Highstate from the {productname} Server "
"command line:"
msgstr "Instal Kiwi dan semua paket yang diperlukan dengan menerapkan `Highstate`.  Dari halaman detail sistem, pilih menu:States[Highstate] dan klik btn:[Apply Highstate].  Atau, terapkan Highstate dari baris perintah Server {productname}:"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:179
#, no-wrap
msgid "{productname} web server public certificate RPM"
msgstr "RPM sertifikat publik server web {productname}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:180
msgid ""
"Build host provisioning copies the {productname} certificate RPM to the "
"build host.  This certificate is used for accessing repositories provided by "
"{productname}."
msgstr "Penyediaan host build menyalin RPM sertifikat {productname} ke host build.  Sertifikat ini digunakan untuk mengakses repositori yang disediakan oleh {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:181
msgid ""
"The certificate is packaged in RPM by the "
"`mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage` package script.  The package script is "
"called automatically during a new {productname} installation."
msgstr "Sertifikat dikemas dalam RPM oleh skrip pengemasan `mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage`.  Skrip pengemasan ini dipanggil secara otomatis selama instalasi baru {productname}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:182
msgid ""
"When you upgrade the `spacewalk-certs-tools` package, the upgrade scenario "
"calls the package script using the default values.  However if the "
"certificate path was changed or unavailable, call the package script "
"manually using `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` after the upgrade "
"procedure has finished."
msgstr "Saat Anda memutakhirkan paket `spacewalk-certs-tools`, proses pemutakhiran memanggil skrip pengemasan menggunakan nilai bawaan.  Namun, jika jalur sertifikat diubah atau tidak tersedia, panggil skrip pengemasan secara manual menggunakan `--ca-cert-full-path <path_to_certificate>` setelah prosedur pemutakhiran selesai."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:183
#, no-wrap
msgid "Package script call example"
msgstr "Contoh pemanggilan skrip pengemasan"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:184
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path "
"/root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr "/usr/sbin/mgr-package-rpm-certificate-osimage --ca-cert-full-path /root/ssl-build/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:185
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is stored in a salt-accessible "
"directory such as:"
msgstr "Paket RPM yang berisi sertifikat disimpan dalam direktori yang dapat diakses oleh salt, seperti:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:186
#, no-wrap
msgid "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"
msgstr "/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:187
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the certificate is provided in the local build host "
"repository:"
msgstr "Paket RPM yang berisi sertifikat disediakan dalam repositori lokal host build:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:188
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/repo\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:189
msgid ""
"Specify the RPM package with the {productname} SSL certificate in the build "
"source, and make sure your Kiwi configuration contains "
"`rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage` as a required package in the `bootstrap` "
"section."
msgstr "Tentukan paket RPM yang berisi sertifikat SSL {productname} dalam sumber build, dan pastikan konfigurasi Kiwi Anda mencantumkan `rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage` sebagai paket wajib dalam bagian `bootstrap`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:190
#, no-wrap
msgid "config.xml"
msgstr "config.xml"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:191
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"
msgstr ""
"...\n"
"  <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"    ...\n"
"    <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
"  </packages>\n"
"...\n"

#.  FIXME 2024-04-25, ke: continue here compare with container build host
#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:192
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create an activation key for OS images"
msgstr "Membuat kunci aktivasi untuk image OS"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:193
msgid ""
"Create an activation key associated with the channel that your OS Images can "
"use as repositories when building the image."
msgstr "Buat kunci aktivasi yang dikaitkan dengan channel yang dapat digunakan oleh Image OS Anda sebagai repositori saat membangun image."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:194
msgid "Activation keys are mandatory for OS Image building."
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi wajib digunakan untuk membangun Image OS."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:195
msgid ""
"To build OS Images, you need an activation key that is associated with a "
"channel other than `Default` activation key."
msgstr "Untuk membangun Image OS, Anda memerlukan kunci aktivasi yang dikaitkan dengan channel selain kunci aktivasi `Default`."

#.  For background info about Image Store, see the overview at the beginning of this chapter.
#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:198
msgid ""
"OS Images can require a significant amount of storage space.  By default, "
"the image store is using the `srv-www` volume."
msgstr "Image OS dapat memerlukan ruang penyimpanan yang cukup besar.  Secara bawaan, penyimpanan image menggunakan volume `srv-www`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:199
msgid ""
"Image stores for Kiwi build type, used to build system, virtual, and other "
"images, are not supported yet."
msgstr "Penyimpanan image untuk jenis build Kiwi, yang digunakan untuk membangun image sistem, image virtual, dan image lainnya, belum didukung."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:203
msgid "Manage image profiles using the {webui}."
msgstr "Kelola profil image menggunakan {webui}."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:205
msgid ""
"To create an image profile select from menu:Images[Profiles] and click "
"btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat profil image, pilih menu:Images[Profiles] dan klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:206
msgid "In the `Label` field, provide a name for the `Image Profile`."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Label`, masukkan nama untuk `Image Profile`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:207
msgid "Use `Kiwi` as the `Image Type`."
msgstr "Gunakan `Kiwi` sebagai `Image Type`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:208
msgid "Image store is automatically selected."
msgstr "Penyimpanan image dipilih secara otomatis."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:209
msgid ""
"Enter a `Config URL` to the directory containing the Kiwi configuration "
"files.  For example, a git URI such as "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/SLE-Micro54.  "
"Other options are a HTTP or HTTPS hosted tar archive or a local directory on "
"the build host.  For more information, see source format options at the end "
"of this section."
msgstr "Masukkan `Config URL` yang mengarah ke direktori berisi berkas konfigurasi Kiwi.  Misalnya, URI git seperti https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/SLE-Micro54. Pilihan lainnya adalah arsip tar yang dihosting melalui HTTP atau HTTPS, atau direktori lokal pada host build.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat opsi format sumber di akhir bagian ini."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:210
msgid ""
"Enter `Kiwi options` if needed.  If the Kiwi configuration files specify "
"multiple profiles, use `--profile <name>` to select the active one.  For "
"other options, see Kiwi documentation."
msgstr "Masukkan `Kiwi options` jika diperlukan.  Jika berkas konfigurasi Kiwi menentukan beberapa profil, gunakan `--profile <name>` untuk memilih profil yang aktif.  Untuk opsi lainnya, lihat dokumentasi Kiwi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:212
msgid ""
"Associate an activation key with an image profile to ensure the image "
"profile uses the correct software channel, and any packages."
msgstr "Kaitkan kunci aktivasi dengan profil image untuk memastikan profil image menggunakan channel perangkat lunak yang benar beserta paket-paketnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:213
msgid "Confirm with the btn:[Create] button."
msgstr "Konfirmasikan dengan tombol btn:[Create]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:214
#, no-wrap
msgid "Source Format Options"
msgstr "Opsi Format Sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:215
msgid "_git/HTTP(S) URL to the repository_"
msgstr "_URL git/HTTP(S) ke repositori_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:216
msgid ""
"URL to a public or private git repository containing the sources of the "
"image to be built.  Depending on the layout of the repository the URL can "
"be:"
msgstr "URL ke repositori git publik atau privat yang berisi sumber image yang akan dibangun.  Bergantung pada struktur repositori, URL dapat berupa:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:217
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:218
msgid ""
"You can specify a branch after the `#` character in the URL.  In this "
"example, we use the `master` branch:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menentukan branch setelah karakter `#` dalam URL.  Dalam contoh ini, kita menggunakan branch `master`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:219
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:220
msgid ""
"You can specify a directory that contains the image sources after the `:` "
"character.  In this example, we use `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menentukan direktori yang berisi sumber image setelah karakter `:`.  Dalam contoh ini, kita menggunakan `OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:221
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"
msgstr "https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles#master:OSImage/POS_Image-JeOS6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:222
msgid "_HTTP(S) URL to the tar archive_"
msgstr "_URL HTTP(S) ke arsip tar_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:223
msgid "URL to the tar archive, compressed or uncompressed, hosted on the webserver."
msgstr "URL ke arsip tar, baik terkompresi maupun tidak terkompresi, yang dihosting pada server web."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:224
#, no-wrap
msgid "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "https://myimagesourceserver.example.org/MyKiwiImage.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:225
msgid "_Path to the directory on the build host_"
msgstr "_Jalur ke direktori pada host build_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:226
msgid ""
"Enter the path to the directory with the Kiwi build system sources.  This "
"directory must be present on the selected build host."
msgstr "Masukkan jalur ke direktori yang berisi sumber sistem build Kiwi.  Direktori ini harus tersedia pada host build yang dipilih."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:227
#, no-wrap
msgid "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"
msgstr "/var/lib/Kiwi/MyKiwiImage\n"

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:228
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of Kiwi sources"
msgstr "Contoh sumber Kiwi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:229
msgid ""
"Kiwi sources consist at least of `config.xml`.  Usually, `config.sh` and "
"`images.sh` are present as well.  Sources can also contain files to be "
"installed in the final image under the `root` subdirectory."
msgstr "Sumber Kiwi setidaknya terdiri atas `config.xml`.  Biasanya, `config.sh` dan `images.sh` juga tersedia.  Sumber juga dapat memuat berkas di dalam subdirektori `root` yang akan diinstal pada image akhir."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:230
msgid ""
"For information about the Kiwi build system, see the "
"https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[Kiwi documentation]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang sistem build Kiwi, lihat https://osinside.github.io/kiwi/[dokumentasi Kiwi]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:231
msgid ""
"{suse} provides examples of fully functional image sources at the "
"https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles] "
"public GitHub repository."
msgstr "{suse} menyediakan contoh sumber image yang berfungsi sepenuhnya di repositori GitHub publik https://github.com/SUSE/manager-build-profiles[SUSE/manager-build-profiles]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:232
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example of JeOS config.xml"
msgstr "Contoh config.xml JeOS"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:233
#, no-wrap
msgid "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"
msgstr "<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\"?>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:234
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"
msgstr ""
"<image schemaversion=\"6.1\" name=\"POS_Image_JeOS6\">\n"
"    <description type=\"system\">\n"
"        <author>Admin User</author>\n"
"        <contact>noemail@example.com</contact>\n"
"        <specification>SUSE Linux Enterprise 12 SP3 JeOS</specification>\n"
"    </description>\n"
"    <preferences>\n"
"        <version>6.0.0</version>\n"
"        <packagemanager>zypper</packagemanager>\n"
"        <bootsplash-theme>SLE</bootsplash-theme>\n"
"        <bootloader-theme>SLE</bootloader-theme>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:235
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <locale>en_US</locale>\n"
"        <keytable>us.map.gz</keytable>\n"
"        <timezone>Europe/Berlin</timezone>\n"
"        <hwclock>utc</hwclock>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:236
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" "
"checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" "
"fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" "
"kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without "
"that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} "
"repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" "
"bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"        <rpm-excludedocs>true</rpm-excludedocs>\n"
"        <type boot=\"saltboot/suse-SLES12\" bootloader=\"grub2\" checkprebuilt=\"true\" compressed=\"false\" filesystem=\"ext3\" fsmountoptions=\"acl\" fsnocheck=\"true\" image=\"pxe\" kernelcmdline=\"quiet\"></type>\n"
"    </preferences>\n"
"    <!--    CUSTOM REPOSITORY\n"
"    <repository type=\"rpm-dir\">\n"
"      <source path=\"this://repo\"/>\n"
"    </repository>\n"
"    -->\n"
"    <packages type=\"image\">\n"
"        <package name=\"patterns-sles-Minimal\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"aaa_base-extras\"/> <!-- wouldn't be SUSE without that ;-) -->\n"
"        <package name=\"kernel-default\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"venv-salt-minion\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"bootstrap\">\n"
"        ...\n"
"        <package name=\"sles-release\"/>\n"
"        <!-- this certificate package is required to access {productname} repositories\n"
"             and is provided by {productname} automatically -->\n"
"        <package name=\"rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage\" bootinclude=\"true\"/>\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:237
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </packages>\n"
"    <packages type=\"delete\">\n"
"        <package name=\"mtools\"/>\n"
"        <package name=\"initviocons\"/>\n"
"        ...\n"
"    </packages>\n"
"</image>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:239
msgid ""
"There are two ways to build or get an image using the {webui}.  Either "
"select menu:Images[Build], or click the build icon in the "
"menu:Images[Profiles] list."
msgstr "Ada dua cara untuk membangun atau mendapatkan image menggunakan {webui}.  Pilih menu:Images[Build], atau klik ikon build pada daftar menu:Images[Profiles]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:242
msgid ""
"Add a different tag name if you want a version other than the default "
"`latest` (applies only to containers)."
msgstr "Tambahkan nama tag yang berbeda jika Anda menginginkan versi selain versi bawaan `latest` (hanya berlaku untuk container)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:243
msgid "Select the `Image Profile` and a `Build Host`."
msgstr "Pilih `Image Profile` dan `Build Host`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:244
msgid ""
"A `Profile Summary` is displayed to the right of the build fields.  When you "
"have selected a build profile, detailed information about the selected "
"profile is shown here."
msgstr "`Profile Summary` ditampilkan di sebelah kanan kolom build.  Setelah Anda memilih profil build, informasi terperinci tentang profil yang dipilih ditampilkan di sini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:245
msgid "To schedule a build, click the btn:[Build] button."
msgstr "Untuk menjadwalkan build, klik tombol btn:[Build]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:246
msgid ""
"The build server cannot run any form of automounter during the image "
"building process.  If applicable, ensure that you do not have your Gnome "
"session running as root.  If an automounter is running, the image build "
"finishes successfully, but the checksum of the image is different and causes "
"a failure."
msgstr "Server build tidak boleh menjalankan automounter apa pun selama proses build image.  Jika Anda menggunakan Gnome, pastikan sesi Gnome tidak berjalan sebagai root.  Jika automounter berjalan, build image akan selesai dengan sukses, tetapi checksum image akan berbeda dan menyebabkan kegagalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:247
msgid ""
"After the image is successfully built, the inspection phase begins.  During "
"the inspection phase {susemgr} collects information about the image:"
msgstr "Setelah image berhasil dibangun, tahap pemeriksaan dimulai.  Selama tahap pemeriksaan, {susemgr} mengumpulkan informasi tentang image:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:248
msgid "List of packages installed in the image"
msgstr "Daftar paket yang diinstal pada image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:249
msgid "Checksum of the image"
msgstr "Checksum image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:250
msgid "Image type and other image details"
msgstr "Jenis image dan detail image lainnya"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:251
msgid ""
"If the built image type is `PXE`, a {salt} pillar is also generated.  Image "
"pillars are stored in the database and the {salt} subsystem can access "
"details about the generated image.  Details include where the image files "
"are located and provided, image checksums, information needed for network "
"boot, and more."
msgstr "Jika jenis image yang dibangun adalah `PXE`, pillar {salt} juga dibuat.  Pillar image disimpan dalam basis data dan subsistem {salt} dapat mengakses detail tentang image yang dihasilkan.  Detail tersebut mencakup lokasi penyimpanan dan penyediaan berkas image, checksum image, informasi yang diperlukan untuk boot jaringan, dan lainnya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:252
msgid "The generated pillar is available to all connected clients."
msgstr "Pillar yang dihasilkan tersedia untuk semua klien yang terhubung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:254
msgid ""
"Building an image requires several dependent steps.  When the build fails, "
"investigating {salt} states results and build log can help identify the "
"source of the failure.  You can carry out these checks when the build fails:"
msgstr "Membangun image memerlukan beberapa langkah yang saling bergantung.  Ketika build gagal, pemeriksaan hasil state {salt} dan log build dapat membantu mengidentifikasi sumber kegagalan.  Anda dapat melakukan pemeriksaan berikut ketika build gagal:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:255
msgid "The build host can access the build sources"
msgstr "Host build dapat mengakses sumber build"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:256
msgid ""
"There is enough disk space for the image on both the build host and the "
"{productname} server"
msgstr "Tersedia ruang disk yang cukup untuk image pada host build maupun server {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:257
msgid "The activation key has the correct channels associated with it"
msgstr "Kunci aktivasi dikaitkan dengan channel yang benar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:258
msgid "The build sources used are valid"
msgstr "Sumber build yang digunakan valid"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:259
msgid ""
"The RPM package with the {productname} public certificate is up to date and "
"available at "
"`/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`.  "
"For more on how to refresh a public certificate RPM, see "
"<<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."
msgstr "Paket RPM yang berisi sertifikat publik {productname} sudah diperbarui dan tersedia di `/usr/share/susemanager/salt/images/rhn-org-trusted-ssl-cert-osimage-1.0-1.noarch.rpm`. Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang cara memperbarui RPM sertifikat publik, lihat <<at.images.kiwi.buildhost>>."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:261
msgid "The section contains some known issues when working with images."
msgstr "Bagian ini memuat beberapa masalah yang diketahui saat bekerja dengan image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:262
msgid ""
"HTTPS certificates used to access the HTTP sources or git repositories "
"should be deployed to the client by a custom state file, or configured "
"manually."
msgstr "Sertifikat HTTPS yang digunakan untuk mengakses sumber HTTP atau repositori git harus diterapkan ke klien melalui berkas state kustom, atau dikonfigurasi secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:263
msgid "Importing Kiwi-based images is not supported."
msgstr "Impor image berbasis Kiwi tidak didukung."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:264
#, no-wrap
msgid "List of built images"
msgstr "Daftar image yang telah dibangun"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:265
msgid ""
"To list available built images select menu:Images[Image List].  A list of "
"all images is displayed."
msgstr "Untuk menampilkan daftar image hasil build yang tersedia, pilih menu:Images[Image List].  Daftar semua image akan ditampilkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:266
msgid ""
"Displayed data about images includes an image `Name`, its `Version`, "
"`Revision`, and the build `Status`.  You can also see the image update "
"status with a listing of possible patch and package updates that are "
"available for the image."
msgstr "Data image yang ditampilkan mencakup `Name`, `Version`, `Revision`, dan `Status` build.  Anda juga dapat melihat status pembaruan image beserta daftar patch dan pembaruan paket yang tersedia untuk image tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:267
msgid ""
"For OS Images, the `Name` and `Version` fields originate from Kiwi sources "
"and are updated at the end of successful build.  During building or after "
"failed build these fields show a temporary name based on profile name."
msgstr "Untuk Image OS, kolom `Name` dan `Version` berasal dari sumber Kiwi dan diperbarui setelah build berhasil diselesaikan.  Selama build berlangsung atau setelah build gagal, kolom-kolom ini menampilkan nama sementara berdasarkan nama profil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:268
msgid ""
"`Revision` is automatically increased after each successful build. For OS "
"Images, multiple revisions can co-exist in the store."
msgstr "`Revision` secara otomatis bertambah setelah setiap build yang berhasil. Untuk Image OS, beberapa revisi dapat disimpan secara bersamaan dalam penyimpanan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:269
msgid ""
"For Container Images the store holds only the latest revision.  Information "
"about previous revisions (packages, patches, etc.) are preserved and it is "
"possible to list them with the `Show obsolete` checkbox."
msgstr "Untuk Image Container, penyimpanan hanya menyimpan revisi terbaru.  Informasi tentang revisi sebelumnya (paket, patch, dan sebagainya) tetap disimpan dan dapat ditampilkan dengan mencentang kotak `Show obsolete`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:270
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Details] button on an image provides a detailed view.  The "
"detailed view includes an exact list of relevant patches, list of all "
"packages installed within the image and a build log."
msgstr "Mengklik tombol btn:[Details] pada suatu image akan menampilkan tampilan terperinci.  Tampilan ini mencakup daftar lengkap patch yang relevan, daftar semua paket yang diinstal pada image, dan log build."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:271
msgid ""
"Clicking the btn:[Delete] button deletes the image from the list.  It also "
"deletes the associated pillar, files from OS Image Store and obsolete "
"revisions."
msgstr "Mengklik tombol btn:[Delete] akan menghapus image dari daftar.  Tindakan ini juga menghapus pillar terkait, berkas dari Penyimpanan Image OS, dan revisi yang sudah usang."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/image-management.adoc:272
msgid ""
"The patch and the package list is only available if the inspect state after "
"a build was successful."
msgstr "Daftar patch dan paket hanya tersedia jika state pemeriksaan setelah build berhasil dijalankan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Infrastructure maintenance tasks"
msgstr "Tugas pemeliharaan infrastruktur"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you work with scheduled downtime periods, you might find it difficult to "
"remember all the things that you need to do before, during, and after that "
"critical downtime of the {productname} Server.  {productname} Server related "
"systems such as Inter-Server Synchronization Slave Servers or {productname} "
"Proxies are also affected and have to be considered."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan periode waktu henti terjadwal, Anda mungkin kesulitan mengingat semua hal yang perlu dilakukan sebelum, selama, dan setelah waktu henti kritis Server {productname} tersebut.  Sistem yang terkait dengan Server {productname}, seperti Server Slave Sinkronisasi Antarserver atau Proxy {productname}, juga terdampak dan perlu diperhitungkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{suse} recommends you always keep your {productname} infrastructure "
"updated.  That includes servers, proxies, and build hosts.  If you do not "
"keep the {productname} Server updated, you might not be able to update some "
"parts of your environment when you need to."
msgstr "{suse} menyarankan agar Anda selalu memperbarui infrastruktur {productname}.  Ini mencakup server, proxy, dan host build.  Jika Anda tidak memperbarui Server {productname}, Anda mungkin tidak dapat memperbarui beberapa bagian lingkungan saat diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This section contains a checklist for your downtime period, with links to "
"further information on performing each of the steps."
msgstr "Bagian ini memuat daftar periksa untuk periode waktu henti Anda, beserta tautan ke informasi lebih lanjut tentang pelaksanaan setiap langkah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Server"
msgstr "Server"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Server checks"
msgstr "Prosedur: Pemeriksaan server"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:7
msgid "Apply the latest updates."
msgstr "Terapkan pembaruan terbaru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:8
msgid "Upgrade to the latest service pack, if required."
msgstr "Mutakhirkan ke service pack terbaru jika diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:9
msgid "Run `podman ps` and check whether all required services are up and running."
msgstr "Jalankan `podman ps` dan periksa apakah semua layanan yang diperlukan aktif dan berjalan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:10
msgid "On {sles} {bci-mlm}, you can install updates using a package manager:"
msgstr "Pada {sles} {bci-mlm}, Anda dapat menginstal pembaruan menggunakan pengelola paket:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For information on using {yast}, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan {yast}, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-onlineupdate-you.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:12
msgid ""
"For information on using zypper, see "
"{sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan zypper, lihat {sles-base-os-documentation}/cha-sw-cl.html#sec-zypper."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:13
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro} {microversion}, you can install updates using the "
"`transactional-update` command.  For information on using "
"`transactional-update`, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."
msgstr "Pada {sl-micro} {microversion}, Anda dapat menginstal pembaruan menggunakan perintah `transactional-update`.  Untuk informasi tentang penggunaan `transactional-update`, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:14
msgid ""
"By default, several update channels are configured and enabled for the "
"{productname} Server.  New and updated packages become available "
"automatically."
msgstr "Secara bawaan, beberapa channel pembaruan dikonfigurasi dan diaktifkan untuk Server {productname}.  Paket baru dan paket yang diperbarui tersedia secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:15
msgid ""
"To keep {susemgr} up to date, either connect it directly to {scclongform} or "
"use {rmtool} (RMT).  You can use RMT as a local installation source for "
"disconnected environments."
msgstr "Agar {susemgr} tetap mutakhir, hubungkan langsung ke {scclongform} atau gunakan {rmtool} (RMT).  Anda dapat menggunakan RMT sebagai sumber instalasi lokal untuk lingkungan yang tidak terhubung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You can check that the update channels are available on your system with "
"this command:"
msgstr "Anda dapat memeriksa ketersediaan channel pembaruan pada sistem dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper lr\n"
msgstr "zypper lr\n"

