#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:20
msgid ""
"{productname} releases maintenance updates (MUs) to provide newer packages.  "
"Maintenance updates are indicated with a new version number.  For example, "
"the major release 5.2 is incremented to 5.2.1 when an MU is released."
msgstr "{productname} merilis pembaruan pemeliharaan (MU) untuk menyediakan paket yang lebih baru.  Pembaruan pemeliharaan ditandai dengan nomor versi baru.  Sebagai contoh, rilis utama 5.2 dinaikkan menjadi 5.2.1 saat MU dirilis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:21
msgid ""
"You can verify which version you are running by looking at the bottom of the "
"navigation bar in the {webui}.  You can also fetch the version number with "
"the `api.getVersion()` XMLRPC API call."
msgstr "Anda dapat memeriksa versi yang sedang digunakan dengan melihat bagian bawah bilah navigasi di {webui}.  Anda juga dapat mengambil nomor versi melalui panggilan API XMLRPC `api.getVersion()`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Client tools"
msgstr "Alat klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:23
msgid ""
"When the server is updated consider updating some tools on the clients, "
"too.  Updating `venv-salt-minion`, `zypper`, and other related management "
"package on clients is not a strict requirement, but it is a best practice in "
"general.  For example, a maintenance update on the server might introduce a "
"major new Salt version.  Then Salt clients continue to work but might "
"experience problems later on.  To avoid this {suse} makes sure that "
"`venv-salt-minion` will always be updated safely."
msgstr "Saat server diperbarui, pertimbangkan untuk memperbarui beberapa alat pada klien juga.  Memperbarui `venv-salt-minion`, `zypper`, dan paket pengelolaan terkait lainnya pada klien bukanlah persyaratan wajib, tetapi secara umum merupakan praktik terbaik.  Sebagai contoh, pembaruan pemeliharaan pada server mungkin memperkenalkan versi mayor Salt yang baru.  Klien Salt akan tetap berfungsi, tetapi mungkin mengalami masalah di kemudian hari.  Untuk menghindari hal ini, {suse} memastikan bahwa `venv-salt-minion` selalu dapat diperbarui dengan aman."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Inter-Server Synchronization slave server"
msgstr "Server slave Sinkronisasi Antarserver"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:25
msgid ""
"If you are using an Inter-Server Synchronization slave server, update it "
"after the {productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan server slave Sinkronisasi Antarserver, perbarui server tersebut setelah pembaruan Server {productname} selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:26
msgid ""
"For more information, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Inter-Server "
"Synchronization - Version 2]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/iss_v2.adoc[Sinkronisasi Antarserver - Versi 2]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring server"
msgstr "Server pemantauan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:28
msgid ""
"If you are using a monitoring server for Prometheus, update it after the "
"{productname} Server update is complete."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan server pemantauan untuk Prometheus, perbarui server tersebut setelah pembaruan Server {productname} selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:29
msgid ""
"For more information on monitoring, see "
"xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemantauan, lihat xref:administration:monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Proxy"
msgstr "Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Proxies should be updated as soon as {productname} Server updates are "
"complete."
msgstr "Proxy harus diperbarui segera setelah pembaruan Server {productname} selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:32
msgid ""
"In general, running a proxy connected to a server on a different version is "
"not supported.  The only exception is for the duration of updates where it "
"is expected that the server is updated first, so the proxy could run the "
"previous version temporarily."
msgstr "Secara umum, menjalankan proxy yang terhubung ke server dengan versi berbeda tidak didukung.  Satu-satunya pengecualian adalah selama proses pembaruan, ketika server harus diperbarui terlebih dahulu sehingga proxy dapat menjalankan versi sebelumnya untuk sementara."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/infra-maintenance.adoc:33
msgid "Always upgrade the server first, then any proxy."
msgstr "Selalu mutakhirkan server terlebih dahulu, lalu semua proxy."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up Channels for Live Patching"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Channel untuk Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:2
msgid ""
"A reboot is required every time you update the full kernel package.  "
"Therefore, it is important that clients using Live Patching do not have "
"newer kernels available in the channels they are assigned to.  Clients using "
"live patching have updates for the running kernel in the live patching "
"channels."
msgstr "Reboot diperlukan setiap kali Anda memperbarui paket kernel lengkap.  Oleh karena itu, penting untuk memastikan bahwa channel yang ditetapkan ke klien yang menggunakan Live Patching tidak menyediakan kernel yang lebih baru.  Klien yang menggunakan live patching mendapatkan pembaruan untuk kernel yang sedang berjalan melalui channel live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:3
msgid "There are two ways to manage channels for live patching:"
msgstr "Ada dua cara untuk mengelola channel live patching:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Use content lifecycle management to clone the product tree and remove kernel "
"versions newer than the running one.  This procedure is explained in the "
"xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[].  "
"This is the recommended solution."
msgstr "Gunakan manajemen siklus hidup konten untuk mengkloning pohon produk dan menghapus versi kernel yang lebih baru daripada versi yang sedang berjalan.  Prosedur ini dijelaskan dalam xref:administration:content-lifecycle-examples.adoc#enhance-project-with-livepatching[]. Ini merupakan solusi yang direkomendasikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Alternatively, use the `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle` tool.  This "
"procedure is more manual and requires command line tools as well as the "
"{webui}.  This procedure is explained in this section for SLES{nbsp}15 SP5, "
"but it also works for SLE{nbsp}12 SP4 or later."
msgstr "Atau, gunakan alat `spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle`.  Prosedur ini lebih bersifat manual dan memerlukan alat baris perintah serta {webui}.  Prosedur ini dijelaskan dalam bagian ini untuk SLES{nbsp}15 SP5, tetapi juga berlaku untuk SLE{nbsp}12 SP4 atau yang lebih baru."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle for Live Patching"
msgstr "Menggunakan spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle untuk Live Patching"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:7
msgid ""
"spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle has been deprecated and will be removed "
"in an upcoming release. Users are advised to switch to the supported and "
"feature-rich Content Lifecycle Management (CLM) API instead."
msgstr "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle telah dinyatakan usang dan akan dihapus dalam rilis mendatang. Pengguna disarankan untuk beralih ke API Content Lifecycle Management (CLM) yang didukung dan kaya fitur."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Cloned vendor channels should be prefixed by `dev` for development, "
"`testing`, or `prod` for production.  In this procedure, you create a `dev` "
"cloned channel and then promote the channel to `testing`."
msgstr "Channel vendor hasil kloning harus diberi prefiks `dev` untuk pengembangan, `testing` untuk pengujian, atau `prod` untuk produksi.  Dalam prosedur ini, Anda membuat channel hasil kloning `dev`, lalu mempromosikan channel tersebut ke `testing`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Cloning Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengkloning Channel Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:10
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as root, obtain the current package "
"channel tree:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah klien, sebagai root, dapatkan pohon channel paket saat ini:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --list-channels\n"
"Spacewalk Username: admin\n"
"Spacewalk Password:\n"
"Channel tree:\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"
msgstr ""
" 1. sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-live-patching15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-pool-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sle-manager-tools15-updates-x86_64-{sp-vert}\n"
"      \\__ sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:13
msgid ""
"Use the `spacewalk-manage-channel` command with the `init` argument to "
"automatically create a new development clone of the original vendor channel:"
msgstr "Gunakan perintah `spacewalk-manage-channel` dengan argumen `init` untuk secara otomatis membuat klon pengembangan baru dari channel vendor asli:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --init -c sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Check that `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64` is available in your "
"channel list."
msgstr "Pastikan `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64` tersedia dalam daftar channel Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Check the `dev` cloned channel you created, and remove any kernel updates "
"that require a reboot."
msgstr "Periksa channel hasil kloning `dev` yang Anda buat, lalu hapus semua pembaruan kernel yang memerlukan reboot."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Removing Non-Live Kernel Patches from Cloned Channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghapus Patch Kernel Non-Live dari Channel Hasil Kloning"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:18
msgid ""
"Check the current kernel version by selecting the client from "
"menu:Systems[System List], and taking note of the version displayed in the "
"`Kernel` field."
msgstr "Periksa versi kernel saat ini dengan memilih klien dari menu:Systems[System List], lalu catat versi yang ditampilkan pada kolom `Kernel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:19
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"navigate to the menu:Software[Manage > Channels] tab, and select "
"`dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pilih klien dari menu:Systems[Overview], buka tab menu:Software[Manage > Channels], lalu pilih `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-updates-x86_64`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:20
msgid "Navigate to the `Patches` tab, and click btn:[List/Remove Patches]."
msgstr "Buka tab `Patches`, lalu klik btn:[List/Remove Patches]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:21
msgid ""
"In the search bar, type `kernel` and identify the kernel version that "
"matches the kernel currently used by your client."
msgstr "Pada bilah pencarian, ketik `kernel` dan identifikasi versi kernel yang sesuai dengan kernel yang saat ini digunakan oleh klien Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Remove all kernel versions that are newer than the currently installed "
"kernel."
msgstr "Hapus semua versi kernel yang lebih baru daripada kernel yang saat ini terinstal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Your channel is now set up for live patching, and can be promoted to "
"`testing`.  In this procedure, you also add the live patching child channels "
"to your client, ready to be applied."
msgstr "Channel Anda kini telah disiapkan untuk live patching dan dapat dipromosikan ke `testing`.  Dalam prosedur ini, Anda juga menambahkan channel turunan live patching ke klien agar siap diterapkan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Promoting Live Patching Channels"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mempromosikan Channel Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:25
msgid ""
"At the command prompt on the client, as `root`, promote and clone the "
"`dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` channel to a new `testing` channel:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah klien, sebagai `root`, promosikan dan kloning channel `dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` menjadi channel `testing` baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c "
"dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"
msgstr "# spacewalk-manage-channel-lifecycle --promote -c dev-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:27
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview], "
"and navigate to the menu:Software[Software Channels] tab."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pilih klien dari menu:Systems[Overview], lalu buka tab menu:Software[Software Channels]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:28
msgid ""
"Check the new `test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` custom channel to change "
"the base channel, and check both corresponding live patching child channels."
msgstr "Centang channel kustom baru `test-sles15-{sp-vert}-pool-x86_64` untuk mengubah channel dasar, lalu centang kedua channel turunan live patching yang terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Next], confirm that the details are correct, and click "
"btn:[Confirm] to save the changes."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Next], pastikan detailnya benar, lalu klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menyimpan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-channel-setup.adoc:30
msgid ""
"You can now select and view available CVE patches, and apply these important "
"kernel updates with Live Patching."
msgstr "Anda kini dapat memilih dan melihat patch CVE yang tersedia, serta menerapkan pembaruan kernel penting ini dengan Live Patching."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}12"
msgstr "Live Patching pada SLES{nbsp}12"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}12 systems, live patching is managed by kGraft.  For in depth "
"information covering kGraft use, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."
msgstr "Pada sistem SLES{nbsp}12, live patching dikelola oleh kGraft.  Untuk informasi mendalam tentang penggunaan kGraft, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/sles/12-SP5/html/SLES-all/cha-kgraft.html."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure:"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:4
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:4
msgid "{productname} is fully updated."
msgstr "{productname} telah diperbarui sepenuhnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}12 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "Anda memiliki satu atau beberapa klien Salt yang menjalankan SLES{nbsp}12 (SP1 atau yang lebih baru)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}12 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "Klien Salt SLES{nbsp}12 Anda terdaftar di {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}12 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "Anda memiliki akses ke channel SLES{nbsp}12 yang sesuai dengan arsitektur Anda, termasuk satu atau beberapa channel turunan live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:8
msgid "The clients are fully synchronized."
msgstr "Klien telah disinkronkan sepenuhnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:9
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:9
msgid "Assign the clients to the cloned channels prepared for live patching."
msgstr "Tetapkan klien ke channel hasil kloning yang telah disiapkan untuk live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:10
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:10
msgid ""
"For more information on preparation, see "
"xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang persiapan, lihat xref:administration:live-patching-channel-setup.adoc[]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:11
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up for Live Patching"
msgstr "Prosedur: Persiapan untuk Live Patching"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and on the system details page navigate to the "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install] tab."
msgstr "Pilih klien yang ingin Anda kelola dengan Live Patching dari menu:Systems[Overview], lalu pada halaman detail sistem, buka tab menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the `kgraft` package, and install it."
msgstr "Cari paket `kgraft`, lalu instal."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kgraft_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:15
msgid "Apply the highstate to enable Live Patching, and reboot the client."
msgstr "Terapkan highstate untuk mengaktifkan Live Patching, lalu reboot klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:16
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:16
msgid "Repeat for each client that you want to manage with Live Patching."
msgstr "Ulangi untuk setiap klien yang ingin Anda kelola dengan Live Patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that `Live Patching` appears in "
"the `Kernel` field."
msgstr "Untuk memastikan live patching telah diaktifkan dengan benar, pilih klien dari menu:Systems[System List], lalu pastikan `Live Patching` muncul pada kolom `Kernel`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:18
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying Live Patches to a Kernel"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan Live Patch pada Kernel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:19
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, select the client from menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, pilih klien dari menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:20
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:20
msgid ""
"A banner at the top of the screen shows the number of critical and "
"non-critical packages available for the client."
msgstr "Banner di bagian atas layar menampilkan jumlah paket kritis dan nonkritis yang tersedia untuk klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:21
msgid "Click btn:[Critical] to see a list of the available critical patches."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Critical] untuk melihat daftar patch kritis yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Select any patch with a synopsis reading `Important: Security update for the "
"Linux kernel`."
msgstr "Pilih patch dengan ringkasan bertuliskan `Important: Security update for the Linux kernel`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:23
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:23
msgid "Security bugs also include their CVE number, where applicable."
msgstr "Bug keamanan juga mencantumkan nomor CVE jika tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:24
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:24
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If you know the CVE number of a patch you want to apply, you can "
"search for it in menu:Audit[CVE Audit], and apply the patch to any clients "
"that require it."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Jika Anda mengetahui nomor CVE patch yang ingin diterapkan, Anda dapat mencarinya di menu:Audit[CVE Audit], lalu menerapkan patch tersebut ke semua klien yang memerlukannya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Not all kernel patches are Live Patches.  Non-Live kernel patches are "
"represented by a `Reboot Required` icon located next to the `Security` "
"shield icon.  These patches always require a reboot."
msgstr "Tidak semua patch kernel merupakan Live Patch.  Patch kernel non-Live ditandai dengan ikon `Reboot Required` yang terletak di sebelah ikon perisai `Security`.  Patch ini selalu memerlukan reboot."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles12.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch.  Some "
"security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"require a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr "Tidak semua masalah keamanan dapat diperbaiki dengan menerapkan live patch.  Beberapa masalah keamanan hanya dapat diperbaiki dengan menerapkan pembaruan kernel lengkap dan memerlukan reboot.  Nomor CVE yang ditetapkan untuk masalah ini tidak disertakan dalam live patch.  Audit CVE menampilkan persyaratan ini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching on SLES{nbsp}15"
msgstr "Live Patching pada SLES{nbsp}15"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:2
msgid ""
"On SLES{nbsp}15 systems and newer, live patching is managed by the `klp "
"livepatch` tool."
msgstr "Pada sistem SLES{nbsp}15 dan yang lebih baru, live patching dikelola oleh alat `klp livepatch`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:5
msgid "You have one or more Salt clients running SLES{nbsp}15 (SP1 or later)."
msgstr "Anda memiliki satu atau beberapa klien Salt yang menjalankan SLES{nbsp}15 (SP1 atau yang lebih baru)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:6
msgid "Your SLES{nbsp}15 Salt clients are registered with {productname}."
msgstr "Klien Salt SLES{nbsp}15 Anda terdaftar di {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:7
msgid ""
"You have access to the SLES{nbsp}15 channels appropriate for your "
"architecture, including the live patching child channel (or channels)."
msgstr "Anda memiliki akses ke channel SLES{nbsp}15 yang sesuai dengan arsitektur Anda, termasuk satu atau beberapa channel turunan live patching."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Select the client you want to manage with Live Patching from "
"menu:Systems[Overview], and navigate to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Install] tab."
msgstr "Pilih klien yang ingin Anda kelola dengan Live Patching dari menu:Systems[Overview], lalu buka tab menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:13
msgid "Search for the `kernel-livepatch` package, and install it."
msgstr "Cari paket `kernel-livepatch`, lalu instal."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"
msgstr "enable_live_patching_kernel_live_install.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:17
msgid ""
"To check that live patching has been enabled correctly, select the client "
"from menu:Systems[System List], and ensure that `Live Patch` appears in the "
"`Kernel` field."
msgstr "Untuk memastikan live patching telah diaktifkan dengan benar, pilih klien dari menu:Systems[System List], lalu pastikan `Live Patch` muncul pada kolom `Kernel`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching-sles15.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Not all security issues can be fixed by applying a live patch.  Some "
"security issues can only be fixed by applying a full kernel update and "
"requires a reboot.  The assigned CVE numbers for these issues are not "
"included in live patches.  A CVE audit displays this requirement."
msgstr "Tidak semua masalah keamanan dapat diperbaiki dengan menerapkan live patch.  Beberapa masalah keamanan hanya dapat diperbaiki dengan menerapkan pembaruan kernel lengkap dan memerlukan reboot.  Nomor CVE yang ditetapkan untuk masalah ini tidak disertakan dalam live patch.  Audit CVE menampilkan persyaratan ini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Live Patching with {productname}"
msgstr "Live Patching dengan {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Performing a kernel update usually requires a system reboot.  Common "
"vulnerability and exposure (CVE) patches should be applied as soon as "
"possible, but if you cannot afford the downtime, you can use Live Patching "
"to inject these important updates and skip the need to reboot."
msgstr "Pembaruan kernel biasanya memerlukan reboot sistem.  Patch untuk Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVE) harus diterapkan sesegera mungkin, tetapi jika Anda tidak dapat menoleransi waktu henti, Anda dapat menggunakan Live Patching untuk menyisipkan pembaruan penting ini tanpa perlu melakukan reboot."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/live-patching.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The procedure for setting up Live Patching is slightly different for "
"SLES{nbsp}12 and SLES{nbsp}15.  Both procedures are documented in this "
"section."
msgstr "Prosedur penyiapan Live Patching sedikit berbeda antara SLES{nbsp}12 dan SLES{nbsp}15.  Kedua prosedur tersebut didokumentasikan dalam bagian ini."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Windows"
msgstr "Periode Pemeliharaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The maintenance windows feature in {productname} allows you to schedule "
"actions to occur during a scheduled maintenance window period.  When you "
"have created your maintenance window schedule, and applied it to a client, "
"you are prevented from executing some actions outside of the specified "
"period."
msgstr "Fitur periode pemeliharaan di {productname} memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan tindakan agar dijalankan selama periode pemeliharaan yang telah ditentukan.  Setelah Anda membuat jadwal periode pemeliharaan dan menerapkannya ke klien, Anda tidak dapat menjalankan tindakan tertentu di luar periode yang ditetapkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows operate in a different way to system locking.  System "
"locks are switched on or off as required, while maintenance windows define "
"periods of time when actions are allowed.  Additionally, the allowed and "
"restricted actions differ.  For more information about system locks, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."
msgstr "Periode pemeliharaan bekerja dengan cara yang berbeda dari penguncian sistem.  Penguncian sistem diaktifkan atau dinonaktifkan sesuai kebutuhan, sedangkan periode pemeliharaan menentukan rentang waktu ketika tindakan diizinkan.  Selain itu, tindakan yang diizinkan dan dibatasi juga berbeda.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penguncian sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-locking.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Maintenance windows require both a calendar, and a schedule.  The calendar "
"defines the date and time of your maintenance window events, including "
"recurring events, and must be in `ical` format.  The schedule uses the "
"events defined in the calendar to create the maintenance windows.  You must "
"create an `ical` file for upload, or link to an `ical` file to create the "
"calendar, before you can create the schedule."
msgstr "Periode pemeliharaan memerlukan kalender dan jadwal.  Kalender menentukan tanggal dan waktu kegiatan pemeliharaan Anda, termasuk kegiatan berulang, dan harus berformat `ical`.  Jadwal menggunakan kegiatan yang ditentukan dalam kalender untuk membuat periode pemeliharaan.  Anda harus membuat berkas `ical` untuk diunggah, atau menautkan berkas `ical` untuk membuat kalender, sebelum dapat membuat jadwal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:5
msgid ""
"When you have created the schedule, you can assign it to clients that are "
"registered to the {productname} Server.  Clients that have a maintenance "
"schedule assigned cannot run restricted actions outside of maintenance "
"windows."
msgstr "Setelah membuat jadwal, Anda dapat menetapkannya ke klien yang terdaftar di Server {productname}.  Klien yang telah diberi jadwal pemeliharaan tidak dapat menjalankan tindakan yang dibatasi di luar periode pemeliharaan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Some examples of restricted actions are:"
msgstr "Tindakan yang dibatasi mengubah klien secara signifikan dan berpotensi menyebabkan klien berhenti berjalan.  Beberapa contoh tindakan yang dibatasi adalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:7
msgid "Package installation"
msgstr "Instalasi paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:8
msgid "Client upgrade"
msgstr "Pemutakhiran klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:9
msgid "Product migration"
msgstr "Migrasi produk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:10
msgid "Highstate application"
msgstr "Penerapan highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  Some examples of unrestricted "
"actions are:"
msgstr "Tindakan yang tidak dibatasi merupakan tindakan kecil yang dianggap aman dan kecil kemungkinannya menyebabkan masalah pada klien.  Beberapa contoh tindakan yang tidak dibatasi adalah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:12
msgid "Package profile update"
msgstr "Pembaruan profil paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:13
msgid "Hardware refresh"
msgstr "Penyegaran informasi perangkat keras"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:14
msgid "Subscribing to software channels"
msgstr "Berlangganan channel perangkat lunak"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Before you begin, you must create an `ical` file for upload, or link to an "
"`ical` file to create the calendar.  You can create `ical` files in your "
"preferred calendaring tool, such as Microsoft Outlook, Google Calendar, or "
"KOrganizer."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, Anda harus membuat berkas `ical` untuk diunggah, atau menautkan berkas `ical` untuk membuat kalender.  Anda dapat membuat berkas `ical` menggunakan alat kalender pilihan Anda, seperti Microsoft Outlook, Google Calendar, atau KOrganizer."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading a New Maintenance Calendar"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengunggah Kalender Pemeliharaan Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:17
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Calendars], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Calendars], lalu klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:18
msgid "In the `Calendar Name` section, type a name for your calendar."
msgstr "Pada bagian `Calendar Name`, ketik nama kalender Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:19
msgid "Either provide a URL to your `ical` file, or upload the file directly."
msgstr "Berikan URL ke berkas `ical` Anda, atau unggah berkas tersebut secara langsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:20
msgid "Click btn:[Create Calendar] to save your calendar."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Calendar] untuk menyimpan kalender Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a New Schedule"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Jadwal Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:22
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:45
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows "
"> Schedules], and click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka menu:Schedule[Maintenance Windows > Schedules], lalu klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:23
msgid "In the `Schedule Name` section, type a name for your schedule."
msgstr "Di bagian `Schedule Name`, masukkan nama jadwal Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:24
msgid ""
"OPTIONAL: If your `ical` file contains events that apply to more than one "
"schedule, check `Multi`."
msgstr "OPSIONAL: Jika file `ical` Anda berisi acara yang berlaku untuk lebih dari satu jadwal, centang `Multi`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:25
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:49
msgid "Select the calendar to assign to this schedule."
msgstr "Pilih kalender yang akan ditetapkan untuk jadwal ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:26
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:50
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:55
msgid "Click btn:[Create Schedule] to save your schedule."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create Schedule] untuk menyimpan jadwal Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Assigning a Schedule to a Client"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menetapkan Jadwal ke Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:28
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List], select "
"the client to be assigned to a schedule, locate the `System Properties` "
"panel, and click btn:[Edit These Properties]."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka menu:Systems[Systems List], pilih klien yang akan diberi jadwal, cari panel `System Properties`, lalu klik btn:[Edit These Properties]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can assign clients through the system set manager by "
"navigating to menu:Systems[System Set Manager] and using the "
"menu:Misc[Maintenance Windows] tab."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menetapkan jadwal ke klien melalui pengelola kumpulan sistem dengan membuka menu:Systems[System Set Manager] dan menggunakan tab menu:Misc[Maintenance Windows]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:30
msgid ""
"In the `Edit System Details` page, locate the `Maintenance Schedule` field, "
"and select the name of the schedule to be assigned."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Edit System Details`, cari kolom `Maintenance Schedule`, lalu pilih nama jadwal yang akan ditetapkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:31
msgid "Click btn:[Update Properties] to assign the maintenance schedule."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Update Properties] untuk menetapkan jadwal pemeliharaan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:32
msgid ""
"When you assign a new maintenance schedule to a client, it is possible that "
"the client might already have some restricted actions scheduled, and that "
"these might now conflict with the new maintenance schedule.  If this occurs, "
"the {webui} displays an error and you cannot assign the schedule to the "
"client.  To resolve this, check the btn:[Cancel affected actions] option "
"when you assign the schedule.  This cancels any previously scheduled actions "
"that conflict with the new maintenance schedule."
msgstr "Saat Anda menetapkan jadwal pemeliharaan baru ke klien, klien tersebut mungkin sudah memiliki beberapa tindakan terbatas yang terjadwal, dan tindakan tersebut mungkin bertentangan dengan jadwal pemeliharaan baru.  Jika hal ini terjadi, {webui} menampilkan pesan kesalahan dan Anda tidak dapat menetapkan jadwal tersebut ke klien.  Untuk mengatasinya, centang opsi btn:[Cancel affected actions] saat menetapkan jadwal.  Opsi ini membatalkan semua tindakan yang sebelumnya telah dijadwalkan dan bertentangan dengan jadwal pemeliharaan baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:33
msgid ""
"When you have created your maintenance windows, you can schedule restricted "
"actions, such as package upgrades, to be performed during the maintenance "
"window."
msgstr "Setelah membuat periode pemeliharaan, Anda dapat menjadwalkan tindakan terbatas, seperti peningkatan paket, untuk dijalankan selama periode pemeliharaan tersebut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling a Package Upgrade"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjadwalkan Peningkatan Paket"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:35
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[System List], select "
"the client you want to upgrade, and go to the menu:Software[Packages > "
"Upgrade] tab."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka menu:Systems[System List], pilih klien yang ingin Anda tingkatkan, lalu buka tab menu:Software[Packages > Upgrade]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Select the package to upgrade from the list, and click btn:[Upgrade "
"Packages]."
msgstr "Pilih paket yang akan ditingkatkan dari daftar, lalu klik btn:[Upgrade Packages]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the `Maintenance Window` field, select which maintenance window the "
"client should use to perform the upgrade."
msgstr "Pada kolom `Maintenance Window`, pilih periode pemeliharaan yang harus digunakan klien untuk melakukan peningkatan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:38
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm] to schedule the package upgrade."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Confirm] untuk menjadwalkan peningkatan paket."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Maintenance Schedule Types"
msgstr "Jenis Jadwal Pemeliharaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:40
msgid ""
"When you create a calendar, it contains a number of events, which can be "
"either one-time events, or recurring events.  Each event contains a "
"`summary` field.  If you want to create multiple maintenance schedules for "
"one calendar, you can specify events for each using the `summary` field."
msgstr "Saat Anda membuat kalender, kalender tersebut berisi sejumlah acara, baik acara satu kali maupun acara berulang.  Setiap acara memiliki kolom `summary`.  Jika Anda ingin membuat beberapa jadwal pemeliharaan untuk satu kalender, Anda dapat menentukan acara untuk setiap jadwal menggunakan kolom `summary`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:41
msgid ""
"For example, you might like to create a schedule for production servers, and "
"a different schedule for testing servers.  In this case, you would specify "
"`SUMMARY: Production Servers` on events for the production servers, and "
"`SUMMARY: Testing Servers` on events for the testing servers."
msgstr "Misalnya, Anda ingin membuat satu jadwal untuk server produksi dan jadwal lain untuk server pengujian.  Dalam hal ini, Anda perlu menetapkan `SUMMARY: Production Servers` pada acara untuk server produksi dan `SUMMARY: Testing Servers` pada acara untuk server pengujian."

#. type: Target for macro image
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "maint_windows_multi.png"
msgstr "maint_windows_multi.png"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:43
msgid ""
"There are two types of schedule: single, or multi.  If your calendar "
"contains events that apply to more than one schedule, then you must select "
"`multi`, and ensure you name the schedule according to the `summary` field "
"you used in the calendar file."
msgstr "Ada dua jenis jadwal: tunggal atau multi.  Jika kalender Anda berisi acara yang berlaku untuk lebih dari satu jadwal, Anda harus memilih `multi` dan memastikan nama jadwal sesuai dengan kolom `summary` yang digunakan dalam file kalender."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a Multi Schedule"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Jadwal Multi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:46
msgid "In the `Schedule Name` section, type the name for your schedule."
msgstr "Di bagian `Schedule Name`, masukkan nama jadwal Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:47
msgid "Ensure it matches the `summary` field of the calendar."
msgstr "Pastikan nama tersebut sesuai dengan kolom `summary` pada kalender."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:48
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:54
msgid "Check the `Multi` option."
msgstr "Centang opsi `Multi`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:51
msgid "To create the next schedule, click btn:[Create]."
msgstr "Untuk membuat jadwal berikutnya, klik btn:[Create]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:52
msgid "In the `Schedule Name` section, type the name for your second schedule."
msgstr "Di bagian `Schedule Name`, masukkan nama jadwal kedua Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:53
msgid "Ensure it matches the `summary` field of the second calendar."
msgstr "Pastikan nama tersebut sesuai dengan kolom `summary` pada kalender kedua."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:56
msgid "Repeat for each schedule you need to create."
msgstr "Ulangi langkah-langkah ini untuk setiap jadwal yang perlu Anda buat."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restricted and Unrestricted Actions"
msgstr "Tindakan Terbatas dan Tidak Terbatas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:58
msgid ""
"This sections contains a complete list of restricted and unrestricted "
"actions."
msgstr "Bagian ini berisi daftar lengkap tindakan terbatas dan tidak terbatas."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:59
msgid ""
"Restricted actions significantly modify the client, and could potentially "
"cause the client to stop running.  Restricted actions can only be run during "
"a maintenance window.  The restricted actions are:"
msgstr "Tindakan terbatas mengubah klien secara signifikan dan berpotensi menyebabkan klien berhenti beroperasi.  Tindakan terbatas hanya dapat dijalankan selama periode pemeliharaan.  Tindakan terbatas meliputi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:60
msgid "Package operations (for example, installing, updating, or removing packages)"
msgstr "Operasi paket (misalnya, menginstal, memperbarui, atau menghapus paket)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:61
msgid "Patch updates"
msgstr "Pembaruan patch"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:62
msgid "Rebooting a client"
msgstr "Memulai ulang klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:63
msgid "Rolling back transactions"
msgstr "Mengembalikan transaksi ke kondisi sebelumnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:64
msgid "Configuration management changing tasks"
msgstr "Tugas yang mengubah manajemen konfigurasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:65
msgid "Applying a highstate"
msgstr "Menerapkan highstate"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:66
msgid "Autoinstallation and reinstallation"
msgstr "Instalasi otomatis dan instalasi ulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:67
msgid "Remote commands"
msgstr "Perintah jarak jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:68
msgid "Product migrations"
msgstr "Migrasi produk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:69
msgid "Cluster operations"
msgstr "Operasi klaster"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:70
msgid ""
"It is possible to run remote commands directly at any time by navigating to "
"menu:Salt[Remote Commands].  This applies whether or not the client is in a "
"maintenance window.  For more information about remote commands, see "
"xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda dapat menjalankan perintah jarak jauh secara langsung kapan saja dengan membuka menu:Salt[Remote Commands].  Hal ini berlaku baik klien sedang berada dalam periode pemeliharaan maupun tidak.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang perintah jarak jauh, lihat xref:administration:actions.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/maintenance-windows.adoc:71
msgid ""
"Unrestricted actions are minor actions that are considered safe and are "
"unlikely to cause problems on the client.  If an action is not restricted it "
"is, by definition, unrestricted, and can be run at any time."
msgstr "Tindakan tidak terbatas adalah tindakan kecil yang dianggap aman dan kecil kemungkinannya menimbulkan masalah pada klien.  Jika suatu tindakan tidak dibatasi, tindakan tersebut secara definisi termasuk tindakan tidak terbatas dan dapat dijalankan kapan saja."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up a Client to Master Validation Fingerprint"
msgstr "Menyiapkan Fingerprint Validasi dari Klien ke Master"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In highly secure network configurations you may wish to ensure your {salt} "
"clients are connecting a specific master.  To set up validation from client "
"to master start by entering the master's fingerprint within a {salt} minion "
"configuration file:"
msgstr "Dalam konfigurasi jaringan dengan tingkat keamanan tinggi, Anda mungkin ingin memastikan klien {salt} Anda terhubung ke master tertentu.  Untuk menyiapkan validasi dari klien ke master, mulailah dengan memasukkan fingerprint master ke dalam file konfigurasi minion {salt}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:3
msgid ""
"`/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf` in cases of using classic {salt} minion in "
"your client, or"
msgstr "`/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf` jika menggunakan minion {salt} klasik pada klien Anda, atau"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:4
msgid ""
"`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf` in case of using {salt} Bundle "
"in your client"
msgstr "`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf` jika menggunakan {salt} Bundle pada klien Anda"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:5
msgid "and follow the procedure:"
msgstr "lalu ikuti prosedur berikut:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/repo-metadata.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-iss.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the Server container run `mgrctl term` on the "
"container host."
msgstr "Untuk mengakses shell di dalam kontainer Server, jalankan `mgrctl term` pada host kontainer."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Adding Master's Fingerprint to Client"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menambahkan Fingerprint Master ke Klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the master, at the command prompt, as root, use this command to find the "
"`master.pub` fingerprint:"
msgstr "Pada master, di prompt perintah, sebagai root, gunakan perintah berikut untuk mengetahui fingerprint `master.pub`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt-key -F master\n"
msgstr "salt-key -F master\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On your client, open the `/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf` or "
"`/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf` configuration file.  Add this "
"line to enter the master's fingerprint replacing the example fingerprint:"
msgstr "Pada klien Anda, buka file konfigurasi `/etc/salt/minion.d/custom.conf` atau `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/custom.conf`.  Tambahkan baris berikut untuk memasukkan fingerprint master dengan mengganti fingerprint contoh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"
msgstr "master_finger: 'ba:30:65:2a:d6:9e:20:4f:d8:b2:f3:a7:d4:65:11:13'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:12
msgid "Restart the service.  For salt-minion, run:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan.  Untuk salt-minion, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:32
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-libvirt-events.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:14
msgid "Or, for venv-salt-minion, run:"
msgstr "Atau, untuk venv-salt-minion, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-hostname-rename.adoc:30
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-libvirt-events.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"
msgstr "systemctl restart venv-salt-minion\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about {salt} Bundle, see "
"xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang {salt} Bundle, lihat xref:client-configuration:contact-methods-saltbundle.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/master-fingerprint.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For information on configuring security from a client, see "
"https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi tentang konfigurasi keamanan dari sisi klien, lihat https://docs.saltproject.io/en/latest/ref/configuration/minion.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using `mgr-sync`"
msgstr "Menggunakan `mgr-sync`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The `mgr-sync` tool is used at the command prompt.  It provides functions "
"for using {productname} that are not always available in the {webui}.  The "
"primary use of `mgr-sync` is to connect to the {scclongform}, retrieve "
"product and package information, and prepare channels for synchronization "
"with the {productname} Server."
msgstr "Alat `mgr-sync` digunakan melalui prompt perintah.  Alat ini menyediakan fungsi untuk menggunakan {productname} yang tidak selalu tersedia di {webui}.  Kegunaan utama `mgr-sync` adalah menghubungkan ke {scclongform}, mengambil informasi produk dan paket, serta menyiapkan channel untuk sinkronisasi dengan Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This tool is designed for use with a {suse} support subscription.  It is not "
"required for open source distributions, including {opensuse}, {centos}, and "
"{ubuntu}."
msgstr "Alat ini dirancang untuk digunakan dengan langganan dukungan {suse}.  Alat ini tidak diperlukan untuk distribusi sumber terbuka, termasuk {opensuse}, {centos}, dan {ubuntu}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:4
msgid ""
"The available commands and arguments for `mgr-sync` are listed in this "
"table.  Use this syntax for `mgr-sync` commands:"
msgstr "Perintah dan argumen yang tersedia untuk `mgr-sync` tercantum dalam tabel berikut.  Gunakan sintaks berikut untuk perintah `mgr-sync`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync [-h] [--version] [-v] [-s] [-d {1,2,3}] {list,add,refresh,delete}\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Commands"
msgstr "Perintah mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Command | Description | Example Use\n"
"| list | List channels, organization credentials, or products | `mgr-sync "
"list channels`\n"
"| add | Add channels, organization credentials, or products | `mgr-sync add "
"channel <channel_name>`\n"
"| refresh | Refresh the local copy of products, channels, and subscriptions "
"| `mgr-sync refresh`\n"
"| delete | Delete existing {scc} organization credentials from the local "
"system | `mgr-sync delete credentials`\n"
"| sync | Synchronize specified channel or ask for it when left blank| "
"`mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Perintah | Deskripsi | Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"| list | Menampilkan daftar channel, kredensial organisasi, atau produk | `mgr-sync list channels`\n"
"| add | Menambahkan channel, kredensial organisasi, atau produk | `mgr-sync add channel <channel_name>`\n"
"| refresh | Memperbarui salinan lokal produk, channel, dan langganan | `mgr-sync refresh`\n"
"| delete | Menghapus kredensial organisasi {scc} yang ada dari sistem lokal | `mgr-sync delete credentials`\n"
"| sync | Menyinkronkan channel yang ditentukan atau meminta nama channel jika dibiarkan kosong| `mgr-sync sync channel <channel_name>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:8
msgid "To see the full list of options specific to a command, use this command:"
msgstr "Untuk melihat daftar lengkap opsi khusus suatu perintah, gunakan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"
msgstr "mgr-sync <command> --help\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgr-sync Optional Arguments"
msgstr "Argumen Opsional mgr-sync"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Option | Abbreviated option | Description | Example Use\n"
"| help | `h` | Display the command usage and options | `mgr-sync --help`\n"
"| version | N/A | Display the currently installed version of `mgr-sync` | "
"`mgr-sync --version`\n"
"| verbose | `v` | Provide verbose output | `mgr-sync --verbose refresh`\n"
"| store-credentials | `s` | Store credentials a local hidden file | "
"`mgr-sync --store-credentials`\n"
"| debug | `d` | Log additional debugging information. Requires a level of 1, "
"2, 3. 3 provides the highest amnount of debugging information | `mgr-sync -d "
"3 refresh`\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Use with the `add` command to add products or channels "
"without beginning a synchronization | `mgr-sync --no-sync add "
"<channel_name>`\n"
msgstr ""
"| Opsi | Opsi Singkat | Deskripsi | Contoh Penggunaan\n"
"| help | `h` | Menampilkan cara penggunaan dan opsi perintah | `mgr-sync --help`\n"
"| version | N/A | Menampilkan versi `mgr-sync` yang saat ini terinstal | `mgr-sync --version`\n"
"| verbose | `v` | Memberikan keluaran terperinci | `mgr-sync --verbose refresh`\n"
"| store-credentials | `s` | Menyimpan kredensial dalam file tersembunyi lokal | `mgr-sync --store-credentials`\n"
"| debug | `d` | Mencatat informasi debugging tambahan. Memerlukan tingkat 1, 2, atau 3. Tingkat 3 memberikan informasi debugging paling terperinci | `mgr-sync -d 3 refresh`\n"
"| no-sync | N/A | Digunakan bersama perintah `add` untuk menambahkan produk atau channel tanpa memulai sinkronisasi | `mgr-sync --no-sync add <channel_name>`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:12
msgid "Logs for `mgr-sync` are located in:"
msgstr "Log untuk `mgr-sync` berada di:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:13
msgid "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/mgr-sync.log`"
msgstr "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/mgr-sync.log`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mgr-sync.adoc:14
msgid "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/rhn_web_api.log`"
msgstr "`/var/lib/containers/storage/volumes/var-log/_data/rhn/rhn_web_api.log`"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mirror Source Packages"
msgstr "Membuat Mirror Paket Sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you build your own packages locally, or if you require the source code "
"for your packages for legal reasons, it is possible to mirror the source "
"packages on {productname} Server."
msgstr "Jika Anda membangun paket sendiri secara lokal, atau memerlukan kode sumber paket untuk memenuhi persyaratan hukum, Anda dapat membuat mirror paket sumber di Server {productname}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:3
msgid "Mirroring source packages can consume a significant amount of disk space."
msgstr "Pembuatan mirror paket sumber dapat menghabiskan ruang disk yang cukup besar."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Mirroring Source Packages"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Mirror Paket Sumber"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:6
msgid "Open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` configuration file, and add this line:"
msgstr "Buka file konfigurasi `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, lalu tambahkan baris berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"
msgstr "server.sync_source_packages = 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:8
msgid "Restart the Spacewalk service to pick up the changes:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang layanan Spacewalk untuk menerapkan perubahan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Currently, this feature can only be enabled globally for all repositories.  "
"It is not possible to select individual repositories for mirroring."
msgstr "Saat ini, fitur ini hanya dapat diaktifkan secara global untuk semua repositori.  Repositori individual tidak dapat dipilih untuk pembuatan mirror."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/mirror-sources.adoc:11
msgid ""
"When this feature has been activated, the source packages become available "
"in the {productname} {webui} after the next repository synchronization.  "
"They are shown as sources for the binary package, and can be downloaded "
"directly from the {webui}.  Source packages cannot be installed on clients "
"using the {webui}."
msgstr "Setelah fitur ini diaktifkan, paket sumber akan tersedia di {productname} {webui} setelah sinkronisasi repositori berikutnya.  Paket tersebut ditampilkan sebagai sumber untuk paket biner dan dapat diunduh langsung dari {webui}.  Paket sumber tidak dapat diinstal pada klien melalui {webui}."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring with Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "Pemantauan dengan Prometheus dan Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:2
msgid ""
"You can monitor your {productname} environment using Prometheus and "
"Grafana.  {productname} Server and Proxy are able to provide self-health "
"metrics.  You can also install and manage a number of Prometheus exporters "
"on Salt clients."
msgstr "Anda dapat memantau lingkungan {productname} menggunakan Prometheus dan Grafana.  Server dan Proxy {productname} dapat menyediakan metrik kondisi kesehatannya sendiri.  Anda juga dapat menginstal dan mengelola sejumlah exporter Prometheus pada klien Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Prometheus and Grafana packages are included in the {productname} Client "
"Tools for:"
msgstr "Paket Prometheus dan Grafana disertakan dalam Client Tools {productname} untuk:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:9
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}15"
msgstr "{sle}{nbsp}15"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:6
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:10
msgid "{sle}{nbsp}16"
msgstr "{sle}{nbsp}16"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:7
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:11
msgid "openSUSE Leap 15.x"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 15.x"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:12
msgid "openSUSE Leap 16.x"
msgstr "openSUSE Leap 16.x"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:13
msgid "Only the above listed clients are supported as a monitoring server."
msgstr "Hanya klien yang tercantum di atas yang didukung sebagai server pemantauan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:14
msgid ""
"You need to install Prometheus and Grafana on a machine separate from the "
"{productname} Server.  We recommend to use a managed Salt {suse} client as "
"your monitoring server."
msgstr "Anda perlu menginstal Prometheus dan Grafana pada mesin yang terpisah dari Server {productname}.  Kami menyarankan penggunaan klien {suse} yang dikelola Salt sebagai server pemantauan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  Clients must have "
"corresponding open ports and be reachable over the network.  Alternatively, "
"you can use reverse proxies to establish a connection."
msgstr "Prometheus mengambil metrik menggunakan mekanisme pull, sehingga server harus dapat membuat koneksi TCP ke klien yang dipantau.  Klien harus membuka port yang sesuai dan dapat dijangkau melalui jaringan.  Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menggunakan reverse proxy untuk membuat koneksi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:16
msgid ""
"You must have a monitoring add-on subscription for each client you want to "
"monitor.  Visit the {scclongform} to manage your {productname} "
"subscriptions."
msgstr "Anda harus memiliki langganan add-on pemantauan untuk setiap klien yang ingin dipantau.  Kunjungi {scclongform} untuk mengelola langganan {productname} Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus and Grafana"
msgstr "Prometheus dan Grafana"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus"
msgstr "Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Prometheus is an open-source monitoring tool that is used to record "
"real-time metrics in a time-series database.  Metrics are pulled via HTTP, "
"enabling high performance and scalability."
msgstr "Prometheus adalah alat pemantauan sumber terbuka yang digunakan untuk mencatat metrik secara real-time dalam basis data deret waktu.  Metrik diambil melalui HTTP, sehingga memungkinkan kinerja dan skalabilitas tinggi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics are time series data, or timestamped values belonging to "
"the same group or dimension.  A metric is uniquely identified by its name "
"and set of labels."
msgstr "Metrik Prometheus merupakan data deret waktu, yaitu nilai dengan penanda waktu yang termasuk dalam kelompok atau dimensi yang sama.  Setiap metrik diidentifikasi secara unik berdasarkan nama dan kumpulan labelnya."

#.  TODO:: This should be an actual image.
#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   metric name               labels                 timestamp     value\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  "
"42236\n"
msgstr ""
"   metric name               labels                 timestamp     value\n"
"┌────────┴───────┐  ┌───────────┴───────────┐    ┌──────┴──────┐  ┌─┴─┐\n"
"http_requests_total{status=\"200\", method=\"GET\"}  @1557331801.111  42236\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:22
msgid ""
"Each application or system being monitored must expose metrics in the format "
"above, either through code instrumentation or Prometheus exporters."
msgstr "Setiap aplikasi atau sistem yang dipantau harus menyediakan metrik dalam format di atas, baik melalui instrumentasi kode maupun exporter Prometheus."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prometheus exporters"
msgstr "Exporter Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Exporters are libraries that help with exporting metrics from third-party "
"systems as Prometheus metrics.  Exporters are useful whenever it is not "
"feasible to instrument a given application or system with Prometheus metrics "
"directly.  Multiple exporters can run on a monitored host to export local "
"metrics."
msgstr "Exporter adalah pustaka yang membantu mengekspor metrik dari sistem pihak ketiga sebagai metrik Prometheus.  Exporter berguna ketika instrumentasi langsung suatu aplikasi atau sistem dengan metrik Prometheus tidak memungkinkan.  Beberapa exporter dapat dijalankan pada satu host yang dipantau untuk mengekspor metrik lokal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:25
msgid ""
"The Prometheus community provides a list of official exporters, and more can "
"be found as community contributions.  For more information and an extensive "
"list of exporters, see https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."
msgstr "Komunitas Prometheus menyediakan daftar exporter resmi, dan exporter lainnya tersedia sebagai kontribusi komunitas.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya dan daftar exporter yang lebih lengkap, lihat https://prometheus.io/docs/instrumenting/exporters/."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Grafana"
msgstr "Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Grafana is a tool for data visualization, monitoring, and analysis.  It is "
"used to create dashboards with panels representing specific metrics over a "
"set period of time.  Grafana is commonly used together with Prometheus, but "
"also supports other data sources such as ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, "
"and Influx DB.  For more information about Grafana, see "
"https://grafana.com/docs/."
msgstr "Grafana adalah alat untuk visualisasi, pemantauan, dan analisis data.  Alat ini digunakan untuk membuat dasbor dengan panel yang menampilkan metrik tertentu selama rentang waktu yang ditetapkan.  Grafana umumnya digunakan bersama Prometheus, tetapi juga mendukung sumber data lain seperti ElasticSearch, MySQL, PostgreSQL, dan Influx DB.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Grafana, lihat https://grafana.com/docs/."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set up the monitoring server"
msgstr "Menyiapkan server pemantauan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:29
msgid ""
"To set up your monitoring server, you need to install Prometheus and "
"Grafana, and configure them."
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan server pemantauan, Anda perlu menginstal Prometheus dan Grafana, lalu mengonfigurasi keduanya."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Only {suse} clients are supported as a monitoring server.  For a complete "
"list, see xref:administration:monitoring.adoc#monitoring-requirements[]."
msgstr "Hanya klien {suse} yang didukung sebagai server pemantauan.  Untuk daftar lengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:monitoring.adoc#monitoring-requirements[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Prometheus"
msgstr "Menginstal Prometheus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:32
msgid ""
"If your monitoring server is a Salt client, you can install the Prometheus "
"package using the {productname} {webui}.  Otherwise you can download and "
"install the package on your monitoring server manually.  The Prometheus "
"software is also available for {productname} Proxy and {productname} {smr} "
"Branch Server."
msgstr "Jika server pemantauan Anda merupakan klien Salt, Anda dapat menginstal paket Prometheus melalui {productname} {webui}.  Jika tidak, Anda dapat mengunduh dan menginstal paket tersebut secara manual pada server pemantauan.  Perangkat lunak Prometheus juga tersedia untuk Proxy {productname} dan Branch Server {productname} {smr}."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:33
msgid ""
"To access a shell inside the {productname} Server container run `mgrctl "
"term` on the container host, or to execute one command run `mgrctl exec "
"<options> -- <command>`."
msgstr "Untuk mengakses shell di dalam kontainer Server {productname}, jalankan `mgrctl term` pada host kontainer, atau untuk menjalankan satu perintah, jalankan `mgrctl exec <options> -- <command>`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:34
msgid ""
"To copy files from inside the container to the container host use `mgrctl "
"cp`."
msgstr "Untuk menyalin file dari dalam kontainer ke host kontainer, gunakan `mgrctl cp`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Prometheus expects POSIX filesystem for storing data.  Non-POSIX compliant "
"filesystems are not supported.  NFS filesystems are not supported."
msgstr "Prometheus memerlukan sistem berkas POSIX untuk menyimpan data.  Sistem berkas yang tidak sesuai dengan POSIX tidak didukung.  Sistem berkas NFS tidak didukung."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus using the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Prometheus melalui {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:37
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system where "
"Prometheus is to be installed, and navigate to the `Formulas` tab."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka halaman detail sistem tempat Prometheus akan diinstal, lalu buka tab `Formulas`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Check the `Prometheus` checkbox to enable monitoring formulas, and click "
"btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Centang kotak `Prometheus` untuk mengaktifkan formula pemantauan, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
