#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitoring managed systems"
msgstr "Memantau sistem yang dikelola"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:137
msgid ""
"Prometheus metrics exporters can be installed and configured on {salt} "
"clients using formulas.  The packages are available from the {productname} "
"client tools channels, and can be enabled and configured directly in the "
"{productname} {webui}."
msgstr "Exporter metrik Prometheus dapat diinstal dan dikonfigurasi pada klien {salt} menggunakan formula.  Paketnya tersedia dari channel client tools {productname}, serta dapat diaktifkan dan dikonfigurasi langsung di {productname} {webui}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:138
msgid "These exporters can be installed on managed systems:"
msgstr "Exporter berikut dapat diinstal pada sistem yang dikelola:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:143
msgid "Apache exporter: `golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter`."
msgstr "Exporter Apache: `golang-github-lusitaniae-apache_exporter`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:144
msgid "See https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."
msgstr "Lihat https://github.com/Lusitaniae/apache_exporter."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:145
msgid ""
"On {sl-micro}, only the Node exporter and the Blackbox exporter are "
"available."
msgstr "Pada {sl-micro}, hanya exporter Node dan exporter Blackbox yang tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:146
msgid ""
"When you have the exporters installed and configured, you can start using "
"Prometheus to collect metrics from the monitored systems.  If you have "
"configured your monitoring server with the {webui}, metrics collection "
"happens automatically."
msgstr "Setelah exporter diinstal dan dikonfigurasi, Anda dapat mulai menggunakan Prometheus untuk mengumpulkan metrik dari sistem yang dipantau.  Jika Anda telah mengonfigurasi server pemantauan melalui {webui}, pengumpulan metrik dilakukan secara otomatis."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:147
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Prometheus exporters on a client"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi exporter Prometheus pada klien"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:148
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the client to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the menu:Formulas[] tab."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka halaman detail klien yang akan dipantau, lalu buka tab menu:Formulas[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:149
msgid "Check the `Enabled` checkbox on the `Prometheus Exporters` formula."
msgstr "Centang kotak `Enabled` pada formula `Prometheus Exporters`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:151
msgid "Navigate to the menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters] tab."
msgstr "Buka tab menu:Formulas[Prometheus Exporters]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:152
msgid ""
"Select the exporters you want to enable and customize arguments according to "
"your needs."
msgstr "Pilih exporter yang ingin Anda aktifkan dan sesuaikan argumennya dengan kebutuhan Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:153
msgid ""
"The `Address` field accepts either a port number preceded by a colon "
"(`:9100`), or a fully resolvable address (`example:9100`)."
msgstr "Kolom `Address` menerima nomor port yang diawali tanda titik dua (`:9100`), atau alamat yang dapat diresolusikan sepenuhnya (`example:9100`)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:155
msgid "Apply the highstate."
msgstr "Terapkan highstate."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:156
msgid "[IMPORTANT]"
msgstr "[IMPORTANT]"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:157
msgid "The following ports need to be enabled and not blocked by the firewall:"
msgstr "Port berikut harus diaktifkan dan tidak diblokir oleh firewall:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:158
msgid "on the monitor: 9090/tcp"
msgstr "pada server pemantauan: 9090/tcp"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:159
msgid "on the monitored system: 9100/tcp, 9117/tcp, and 9187/tcp"
msgstr "pada sistem yang dipantau: 9100/tcp, 9117/tcp, dan 9187/tcp"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:160
msgid ""
"Monitoring formulas can also be configured for System Groups, by applying "
"the same configuration used for individual systems inside the corresponding "
"group."
msgstr "Formula pemantauan juga dapat dikonfigurasi untuk Grup Sistem dengan menerapkan konfigurasi yang sama seperti yang digunakan untuk sistem individual di dalam grup terkait."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "Change Grafana password"
msgstr "Mengubah kata sandi Grafana"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:163
msgid ""
"To change the Grafana password follow the steps described in the Grafana "
"documentation:"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah kata sandi Grafana, ikuti langkah-langkah yang dijelaskan dalam dokumentasi Grafana:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:164
msgid "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"
msgstr "https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/user-management/user-preferences/#change-your-grafana-password"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:165
msgid ""
"In case you have lost the Grafana administrator password you can reset it as "
"`root` with the following command:"
msgstr "Jika Anda kehilangan kata sandi administrator Grafana, Anda dapat mengatur ulang kata sandi tersebut sebagai `root` dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:166
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana "
"--homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"
msgstr "grafana-cli --configOverrides cfg:default.paths.data=/var/lib/grafana --homepath /usr/share/grafana admin reset-admin-password <new_password>\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:167
#, no-wrap
msgid "Network boundaries"
msgstr "Batas jaringan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:168
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to monitored clients.  By default, "
"Prometheus uses these ports:"
msgstr "Prometheus mengambil metrik menggunakan mekanisme pull, sehingga server harus dapat membuat koneksi TCP ke klien yang dipantau.  Secara default, Prometheus menggunakan port berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:169
msgid "Node exporter: 9100"
msgstr "Exporter Node: 9100"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:170
msgid "PostgreSQL exporter: 9187"
msgstr "Exporter PostgreSQL: 9187"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:171
msgid "Apache exporter: 9117"
msgstr "Exporter Apache: 9117"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:172
msgid ""
"Additionally, if you are running the alert manager on a different host than "
"where you run Prometheus, you also need to open port 9093.  The alert "
"manager is part of Prometheus solution.  It handles alerts sent by client "
"applications such as the Prometheus server instance.  For more information "
"about the alert manager, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."
msgstr "Selain itu, jika Anda menjalankan pengelola peringatan pada host yang berbeda dari host tempat Prometheus berjalan, Anda juga perlu membuka port 9093.  Pengelola peringatan merupakan bagian dari solusi Prometheus.  Komponen ini menangani peringatan yang dikirim oleh aplikasi klien, seperti instans server Prometheus.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelola peringatan, lihat https://prometheus.io/docs/alerting/latest/alertmanager/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:173
msgid ""
"For clients installed on cloud instances, you can add the required ports to "
"a security group that has access to the monitoring server."
msgstr "Untuk klien yang diinstal pada instans cloud, Anda dapat menambahkan port yang diperlukan ke grup keamanan yang memiliki akses ke server pemantauan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:174
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can deploy a Prometheus instance in the exporters' local "
"network, and configure federation.  This allows the main monitoring server "
"to scrape the time series from the local Prometheus instance.  If you use "
"this method, you only need to open the Prometheus API port, which is 9090."
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, Anda dapat menerapkan instans Prometheus di jaringan lokal exporter dan mengonfigurasi federasi.  Dengan cara ini, server pemantauan utama dapat mengambil data deret waktu dari instans Prometheus lokal.  Jika menggunakan metode ini, Anda hanya perlu membuka port API Prometheus, yaitu 9090."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:175
msgid ""
"For more information on Prometheus federation, see "
"https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang federasi Prometheus, lihat https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/federation/."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:176
msgid ""
"You can also proxy requests through the network boundary.  Tools like "
"PushProx deploy a proxy and a client on both sides of the network barrier "
"and allow Prometheus to work across network topologies such as NAT."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat meneruskan permintaan melalui proxy untuk melintasi batas jaringan.  Alat seperti PushProx menerapkan proxy dan klien di kedua sisi pembatas jaringan sehingga Prometheus dapat bekerja melintasi topologi jaringan seperti NAT."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:177
msgid ""
"For more information on PushProx, see "
"https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang PushProx, lihat https://github.com/RobustPerception/PushProx."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:178
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reverse proxy setup"
msgstr "Menyiapkan reverse proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:179
msgid ""
"Prometheus fetches metrics using a pull mechanism, so the server must be "
"able to establish TCP connections to each exporter on the monitored "
"clients.  To simplify your firewall configuration, you can use reverse proxy "
"for your exporters to expose all metrics on a single port."
msgstr "Prometheus mengambil metrik menggunakan mekanisme pull, sehingga server harus dapat membuat koneksi TCP ke setiap exporter pada klien yang dipantau.  Untuk menyederhanakan konfigurasi firewall, Anda dapat menggunakan reverse proxy bagi exporter agar semua metrik tersedia melalui satu port."

#.  Probably a diagram here. --LKB 2020-08-11
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:180
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing Prometheus exporters with reverse proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal exporter Prometheus dengan reverse proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:181
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, open the details page of the system to be "
"monitored, and navigate to the `Formulas` tab."
msgstr "Di {productname} {webui}, buka halaman detail sistem yang akan dipantau, lalu buka tab `Formulas`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:182
msgid ""
"Check the `Prometheus Exporters` checkbox to enable the exporters formula, "
"and click btn:[Save]."
msgstr "Centang kotak `Prometheus Exporters` untuk mengaktifkan formula exporter, lalu klik btn:[Save]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:183
msgid "Navigate to the `Prometheus Exporters` tab in the top menu."
msgstr "Buka tab `Prometheus Exporters` di menu atas."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:184
msgid ""
"Check the `Enable reverse proxy` option, and enter a valid reverse proxy "
"port number.  For example, `9999`."
msgstr "Centang opsi `Enable reverse proxy`, lalu masukkan nomor port reverse proxy yang valid.  Misalnya, `9999`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:185
msgid "Ensure that port 9999/tcp is open on the firewall."
msgstr "Pastikan port 9999/tcp terbuka pada firewall."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:186
msgid "Customize the other exporters according to your needs."
msgstr "Sesuaikan exporter lainnya dengan kebutuhan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:191
msgid ""
"Prometheus server and Prometheus node exporter offer a built-in mechanism to "
"secure their endpoints with TLS encryption and authentication.  "
"{productname} {webui} simplifies the configuration of all involved "
"components. The TLS certificates have to be provided and deployed by the "
"user.  {productname} offers enabling the following security model:"
msgstr "Server Prometheus dan exporter Node Prometheus menyediakan mekanisme bawaan untuk mengamankan endpoint dengan enkripsi TLS dan autentikasi. {productname} {webui} menyederhanakan konfigurasi semua komponen yang terlibat. Sertifikat TLS harus disediakan dan diterapkan oleh pengguna.  {productname} menyediakan opsi untuk mengaktifkan model keamanan berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:192
msgid "Node exporter: TLS encryption and client certificate based authentication"
msgstr "Exporter Node: enkripsi TLS dan autentikasi berbasis sertifikat klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:193
msgid "Prometheus: TLS encryption and basic authentication"
msgstr "Prometheus: enkripsi TLS dan autentikasi dasar"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:194
msgid ""
"For more information about configuring all available options, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang konfigurasi semua opsi yang tersedia, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-formula-monitoring.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:195
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generating TLS certificates"
msgstr "Membuat sertifikat TLS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:196
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} does not provide any certificates for securing "
"monitoring configuration.  For providing security, you can generate or "
"import custom certificates, self-signed or signed by a third party "
"certificate authority (CA)."
msgstr "Secara default, {productname} tidak menyediakan sertifikat untuk mengamankan konfigurasi pemantauan.  Untuk memberikan keamanan, Anda dapat membuat atau mengimpor sertifikat khusus, baik yang ditandatangani sendiri maupun yang ditandatangani oleh otoritas sertifikat (CA) pihak ketiga."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:197
msgid ""
"This section demonstrates how to generate client/server certificates for "
"Prometheus and Node exporter minions self-signed with {productname} CA."
msgstr "Bagian ini menunjukkan cara membuat sertifikat klien/server untuk minion Prometheus dan exporter Node yang ditandatangani sendiri menggunakan CA {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:198
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating server/client TLS certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat sertifikat TLS server/klien"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:199
msgid ""
"At the command prompt of the {productname} container host, as root, run the "
"following commands:"
msgstr "Pada prompt perintah host kontainer {productname}, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:200
msgid "To generate certificate files, run the following command."
msgstr "Untuk membuat file sertifikat, jalankan perintah berikut."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:201
msgid ""
"Ensure that the `set-cname` parameter is the fully qualified domain name "
"(FQDN) of your {salt} client.  You can use the `set-cname` parameter "
"multiple times if you require multiple aliases:"
msgstr "Pastikan parameter `set-cname` berisi nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) dari klien {salt} Anda.  Anda dapat menggunakan parameter `set-cname` beberapa kali jika memerlukan beberapa alias:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:202
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" "
"--no-rpm\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- mgr-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"  --set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"  --set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"  --set-hostname=\"minion.example.com\" --set-cname=\"minion.example.com\" --no-rpm\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:203
msgid "Resulting in:"
msgstr "Menghasilkan keluaran berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:204
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Generating the web server's SSL private key: "
"/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key\n"
"Generating web server's SSL certificate request: "
"/root/ssl-build/minion/server.csr\n"
"Generating/signing web server's SSL certificate: server.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"Generating the web server's SSL private key: /root/ssl-build/minion/server.key\n"
"Generating web server's SSL certificate request: /root/ssl-build/minion/server.csr\n"
"Generating/signing web server's SSL certificate: server.crt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:205
msgid ""
"Copy `server.crt` and `server.key` files from the server container to the "
"host:"
msgstr "Salin file `server.crt` dan `server.key` dari kontainer server ke host:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:206
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key server.key\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.crt server.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.key server.key\n"
"mgrctl cp server:/root/ssl-build/minion/server.crt server.crt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:207
msgid ""
"Copy `server.crt` and `server.key` files from the host to the monitoring "
"client:"
msgstr "Salin file `server.crt` dan `server.key` dari host ke klien pemantauan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:208
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ssh minion.example.com 'mkdir /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
"scp /root/server.* minion.example.com:/etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs\n"
"ssh minion.example.com 'chmod go+r /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.*; ls "
"-la /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
msgstr ""
"ssh minion.example.com 'mkdir /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"
"scp /root/server.* minion.example.com:/etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs\n"
"ssh minion.example.com 'chmod go+r /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.*; ls -la /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:209
msgid ""
"To configure {salt} formulars, enter the directory names specified in the "
"previous steps."
msgstr "Untuk mengonfigurasi formula {salt}, masukkan nama direktori yang ditentukan pada langkah sebelumnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:210
msgid "formular server"
msgstr "formula server"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:211
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Server Certificate /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.crt\n"
"Server Key /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.key\n"
msgstr ""
"Server Certificate /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.crt\n"
"Server Key /etc/ssl/mlm-server-certs/server.key\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/monitoring.adoc:212
msgid "formular minion"
msgstr "formula minion"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enhanced SCAP Auditing (Beta)"
msgstr "Audit SCAP yang Ditingkatkan (Beta)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} introduces a modernized approach to SCAP (Security Content "
"Automation Protocol) auditing, available as a beta feature.  The enhanced "
"SCAP integration streamlines compliance scanning by centralizing content "
"management, introducing reusable policies, supporting automated remediation, "
"and eliminating the need to pre-stage SCAP files on managed systems."
msgstr "{productname} memperkenalkan pendekatan yang dimodernisasi untuk audit SCAP (Security Content Automation Protocol), yang tersedia sebagai fitur beta.  Integrasi SCAP yang ditingkatkan menyederhanakan pemindaian kepatuhan dengan memusatkan pengelolaan konten, memperkenalkan kebijakan yang dapat digunakan kembali, mendukung remediasi otomatis, dan menghilangkan kebutuhan untuk menyiapkan file SCAP terlebih dahulu pada sistem yang dikelola."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This feature is currently in **beta**.  You must enable the beta feature "
"flag in your user preferences before using it."
msgstr "Fitur ini saat ini berstatus **beta**.  Anda harus mengaktifkan opsi fitur beta di preferensi pengguna sebelum menggunakannya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enable the beta feature"
msgstr "Mengaktifkan fitur beta"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:6
msgid "To access the enhanced SCAP auditing features:"
msgstr "Untuk mengakses fitur audit SCAP yang ditingkatkan:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling the beta feature"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan fitur beta"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:8
msgid "Navigate to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:9
msgid "Check the btn:[Enable Beta Features] checkbox."
msgstr "Centang kotak btn:[Enable Beta Features]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:10
msgid "Click btn:[Save Preferences]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save Preferences]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Once enabled, additional menu entries appear under menu:Audit[OpenSCAP], and "
"the scan scheduling interface is replaced with the new beta UI."
msgstr "Setelah diaktifkan, entri menu tambahan akan muncul di bawah menu:Audit[OpenSCAP], dan antarmuka penjadwalan pemindaian akan digantikan dengan antarmuka beta yang baru."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The beta feature flag is a per-user setting.  Each user who wants to use the "
"enhanced SCAP features must enable it individually."
msgstr "Opsi fitur beta merupakan pengaturan per pengguna.  Setiap pengguna yang ingin menggunakan fitur SCAP yang ditingkatkan harus mengaktifkannya secara individual."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key differences from legacy SCAP integration"
msgstr "Perbedaan utama dari integrasi SCAP lama"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Legacy integration\n"
"| Enhanced integration (beta)\n"
"\n"
"| SCAP content files must exist on the managed system beforehand\n"
"| SCAP content is transferred automatically from the server to the managed "
"system at scan time\n"
"\n"
"| No centralized content management\n"
"| Upload and manage SCAP content centrally via the {webui}\n"
"\n"
"| No tailoring file management\n"
"| Dedicated UI for uploading and managing tailoring files\n"
"\n"
"| Scans are configured individually each time\n"
"| Reusable SCAP policies combine content, profiles, and tailoring files\n"
"\n"
"| No built-in remediation\n"
"| Apply remediation directly from scan results, or define custom remediation "
"scripts\n"
"\n"
"| No recurring scan support tied to policies\n"
"| Schedule recurring scans linked to policies for ongoing compliance "
"tracking\n"
msgstr ""
"| Integrasi lama\n"
"| Integrasi yang ditingkatkan (beta)\n"
"\n"
"| File konten SCAP harus sudah tersedia pada sistem yang dikelola\n"
"| Konten SCAP ditransfer secara otomatis dari server ke sistem yang dikelola saat pemindaian\n"
"\n"
"| Tidak ada pengelolaan konten terpusat\n"
"| Unggah dan kelola konten SCAP secara terpusat melalui {webui}\n"
"\n"
"| Tidak ada pengelolaan file tailoring\n"
"| Antarmuka khusus untuk mengunggah dan mengelola file tailoring\n"
"\n"
"| Pemindaian dikonfigurasi secara individual setiap kali dijalankan\n"
"| Kebijakan SCAP yang dapat digunakan kembali menggabungkan konten, profil, dan file tailoring\n"
"\n"
"| Tidak ada remediasi bawaan\n"
"| Terapkan remediasi langsung dari hasil pemindaian, atau tentukan skrip remediasi khusus\n"
"\n"
"| Tidak ada dukungan pemindaian berulang yang terkait dengan kebijakan\n"
"| Jadwalkan pemindaian berulang yang ditautkan ke kebijakan untuk pelacakan kepatuhan berkelanjutan\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP content management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan konten SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:16
msgid ""
"SCAP content files (DataStream and XCCDF) can be uploaded and managed "
"centrally on the {productname} server."
msgstr "File konten SCAP (DataStream dan XCCDF) dapat diunggah dan dikelola secara terpusat pada server {productname}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload SCAP content"
msgstr "Mengunggah konten SCAP"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading SCAP content"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengunggah konten SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:19
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:20
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:26
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:46
msgid "Click btn:[Upload]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Upload]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:21
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:44
msgid "Provide a **Name** and optional **Description**."
msgstr "Masukkan **Nama** dan **Deskripsi** opsional."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:22
msgid "Upload the files:"
msgstr "Unggah file berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "**DataStream file**: The filename must end with `-ds.xml`.\n"
msgstr "**File DataStream**: Nama file harus diakhiri dengan `-ds.xml`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "**XCCDF file**: The filename must end with `-xccdf.xml`.\n"
msgstr "**File XCCDF**: Nama file harus diakhiri dengan `-xccdf.xml`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Both files must share the same base name (for example, `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` "
"and `ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."
msgstr "Kedua file harus memiliki nama dasar yang sama (misalnya, `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` dan `ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Uploaded files are stored on the server at "
"`/srv/susemanager/scap/ssg/content/`."
msgstr "File yang diunggah disimpan pada server di `/srv/susemanager/scap/ssg/content/`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit and delete SCAP content"
msgstr "Mengedit dan menghapus konten SCAP"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and deleting SCAP content"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengedit dan menghapus konten SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:30
msgid "Go to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Click a content entry to edit its name, description, or replace the uploaded "
"files."
msgstr "Klik entri konten untuk mengedit nama, deskripsi, atau mengganti file yang diunggah."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:32
msgid "Click btn:[Delete] to remove SCAP content."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus konten SCAP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Deleting SCAP content that is referenced by a policy will break that "
"policy.  Ensure no active policies depend on the content before deleting it."
msgstr "Menghapus konten SCAP yang dirujuk oleh suatu kebijakan akan menyebabkan kebijakan tersebut tidak berfungsi.  Pastikan tidak ada kebijakan aktif yang bergantung pada konten tersebut sebelum menghapusnya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL files"
msgstr "File OVAL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Due to the large size of OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language) "
"files, they are not transferred automatically from the server to the managed "
"system.  If your SCAP evaluation requires OVAL files, you must ensure they "
"are already present on the managed system before scheduling the scan."
msgstr "Karena ukuran file OVAL (Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language) yang besar, file tersebut tidak ditransfer secara otomatis dari server ke sistem yang dikelola.  Jika evaluasi SCAP Anda memerlukan file OVAL, Anda harus memastikan file tersebut sudah tersedia pada sistem yang dikelola sebelum menjadwalkan pemindaian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:36
msgid "You can specify OVAL file paths when creating a SCAP policy."
msgstr "Anda dapat menentukan jalur file OVAL saat membuat kebijakan SCAP."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring file management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan file tailoring"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:38
msgid ""
"SCAP tailoring files allow you to customize the behavior of an SCAP profile "
"without modifying the original content.  The enhanced integration provides a "
"dedicated interface for managing tailoring files."
msgstr "File tailoring SCAP memungkinkan Anda menyesuaikan perilaku profil SCAP tanpa mengubah konten aslinya.  Integrasi yang ditingkatkan menyediakan antarmuka khusus untuk mengelola file tailoring."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Tailoring files are scoped per organization.  Each organization manages its "
"own set of tailoring files independently."
msgstr "File tailoring memiliki cakupan per organisasi.  Setiap organisasi mengelola kumpulan file tailoring miliknya secara mandiri."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload a tailoring file"
msgstr "Mengunggah file tailoring"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Uploading a tailoring file"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengunggah file tailoring"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:42
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:45
msgid "Upload the tailoring file (XML format)."
msgstr "Unggah file tailoring (format XML)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:47
msgid ""
"Tailoring files are stored on the server at "
"`/srv/susemanager/scap/tailoring-files/`."
msgstr "File tailoring disimpan pada server di `/srv/susemanager/scap/tailoring-files/`."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Editing and deleting tailoring files"
msgstr "Mengedit dan menghapus file tailoring"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Edit and delete tailoring files"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengedit dan menghapus file tailoring"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:50
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files] list."
msgstr "Buka daftar menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Click a tailoring file entry to edit its name, description, or replace the "
"file."
msgstr "Klik entri file tailoring untuk mengedit nama, deskripsi, atau mengganti file tersebut."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:52
msgid "Select one or more entries and click btn:[Delete] to remove them."
msgstr "Pilih satu atau beberapa entri, lalu klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapusnya."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:53
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP policies"
msgstr "Kebijakan SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:54
msgid ""
"SCAP policies define a reusable combination of SCAP content, a specific "
"profile, and an optional tailoring file.  Policies simplify the process of "
"scheduling consistent compliance scans across your infrastructure."
msgstr "Kebijakan SCAP menentukan kombinasi konten SCAP, profil tertentu, dan file tailoring opsional yang dapat digunakan kembali.  Kebijakan menyederhanakan proses penjadwalan pemindaian kepatuhan yang konsisten di seluruh infrastruktur Anda."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:55
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating a policy"
msgstr "Membuat kebijakan"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating a policy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat kebijakan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:57
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:59
msgid "Fill in the policy details:"
msgstr "Isi detail kebijakan:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy Name"
msgstr "Nama Kebijakan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:61
msgid "A unique name for the policy within your organization."
msgstr "Nama unik untuk kebijakan dalam organisasi Anda."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Deskripsi"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:63
msgid "An optional description of the policy's purpose."
msgstr "Deskripsi opsional tentang tujuan kebijakan."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP Content"
msgstr "Konten SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:65
msgid "Select from the uploaded SCAP content."
msgstr "Pilih dari konten SCAP yang telah diunggah."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "XCCDF Profile"
msgstr "Profil XCCDF"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:67
msgid ""
"Select a profile from the chosen SCAP content. The list of available "
"profiles is loaded dynamically from the content file."
msgstr "Pilih profil dari konten SCAP yang dipilih. Daftar profil yang tersedia dimuat secara dinamis dari file konten."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring File"
msgstr "File Tailoring"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:69
msgid "(Optional) Select a tailoring file to customize the selected profile."
msgstr "(Opsional) Pilih file tailoring untuk menyesuaikan profil yang dipilih."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tailoring Profile"
msgstr "Profil Tailoring"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:71
msgid ""
"(Optional) If a tailoring file is selected, choose a profile from the "
"tailoring file."
msgstr "(Opsional) Jika file tailoring dipilih, pilih profil dari file tailoring tersebut."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "OVAL Files"
msgstr "File OVAL"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:73
msgid ""
"(Optional) Comma-separated list of OVAL file paths that must exist on the "
"managed system."
msgstr "(Opsional) Daftar jalur file OVAL yang dipisahkan koma dan harus tersedia pada sistem yang dikelola."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Advanced Arguments"
msgstr "Argumen Lanjutan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:75
msgid ""
"(Optional) Additional `oscap` command-line arguments (for example, "
"`--fetch-remote-resources`)."
msgstr "(Opsional) Argumen baris perintah `oscap` tambahan (misalnya, `--fetch-remote-resources`)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch Remote Resources"
msgstr "Mengambil Sumber Daya Jarak Jauh"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:77
msgid ""
"(Optional) Enable to allow `oscap` to download remote XCCDF resources during "
"evaluation."
msgstr "(Opsional) Aktifkan untuk mengizinkan `oscap` mengunduh sumber daya XCCDF jarak jauh selama evaluasi."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:79
#, no-wrap
msgid "Policy details and scan history"
msgstr "Detail kebijakan dan riwayat pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:80
msgid "Click on a policy name in the list to view its details, including:"
msgstr "Klik nama kebijakan dalam daftar untuk melihat detailnya, termasuk:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:81
msgid "The associated SCAP content, profile, and tailoring file."
msgstr "Konten SCAP, profil, dan file tailoring yang terkait."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:82
msgid ""
"A scan history showing all scans that were executed using this policy, with "
"compliance results."
msgstr "Riwayat pemindaian yang menampilkan semua pemindaian yang dijalankan menggunakan kebijakan ini, beserta hasil kepatuhannya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Edit and delete policies"
msgstr "Mengedit dan menghapus kebijakan"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:84
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Editing and deleting policies"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengedit dan menghapus kebijakan"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:85
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies] list."
msgstr "Buka daftar menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:86
msgid "Click the edit icon to modify a policy."
msgstr "Klik ikon edit untuk mengubah kebijakan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:87
msgid "Click btn:[Delete] to remove a policy."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Delete] untuk menghapus kebijakan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:88
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule SCAP scans"
msgstr "Menjadwalkan pemindaian SCAP"

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scheduling a scan for a single system"
msgstr "Menjadwalkan pemindaian untuk satu sistem"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling a scan for a single system"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjadwalkan pemindaian untuk satu sistem"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:91
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System List > All]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System List > All]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:92
msgid "Select a system then go to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Schedule]."
msgstr "Pilih sistem, lalu buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Schedule]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:93
msgid "Select a **SCAP Policy** to use for the scan."
msgstr "Pilih **Kebijakan SCAP** yang akan digunakan untuk pemindaian."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:94
msgid "Choose the scan schedule:"
msgstr "Pilih jadwal pemindaian:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Run now**: Execute the scan immediately.\n"
msgstr "**Jalankan sekarang**: Jalankan pemindaian segera.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:96
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Schedule for later**: Pick a specific date and time.\n"
msgstr "**Jadwalkan untuk nanti**: Pilih tanggal dan waktu tertentu.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:98
msgid ""
"Package `openscap-utils` needs to be installed on the targeted minion.  For "
"more information see "
"xref:administration:openscap.adoc#prepare-clients-for-scap[Prepare clients "
"for an SCAP scan]."
msgstr "Paket `openscap-utils` harus diinstal pada minion target.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:openscap.adoc#prepare-clients-for-scap[Prepare clients for an SCAP scan]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:99
#, no-wrap
msgid "Schedule scans for multiple systems (SSM)"
msgstr "Menjadwalkan pemindaian untuk beberapa sistem (SSM)"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:100
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Scheduling scans for multiple systems (SSM)"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjadwalkan pemindaian untuk beberapa sistem (SSM)"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:101
msgid "Add the target systems to the System Set Manager (SSM)."
msgstr "Tambahkan sistem target ke System Set Manager (SSM)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:102
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > Schedule]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Audit > Schedule]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:103
msgid "Select a **SCAP Policy**."
msgstr "Pilih **Kebijakan SCAP**."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:104
msgid "Choose the scan schedule."
msgstr "Pilih jadwal pemindaian."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Recurring scans"
msgstr "Pemindaian berulang"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:107
msgid ""
"SCAP policies can be scheduled as recurring actions, enabling automated "
"compliance monitoring."
msgstr "Kebijakan SCAP dapat dijadwalkan sebagai tindakan berulang, sehingga memungkinkan pemantauan kepatuhan secara otomatis."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:108
msgid "To set up a recurring scan, run the procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk menyiapkan pemindaian berulang, ikuti prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:109
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Setting up a recurring scan"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyiapkan pemindaian berulang"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:110
msgid ""
"Navigate to the recurring actions configuration for a system or system "
"group."
msgstr "Buka konfigurasi tindakan berulang untuk sistem atau grup sistem."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:111
msgid "Select **SCAP Policy Scan** as the action type."
msgstr "Pilih **Pemindaian Kebijakan SCAP** sebagai jenis tindakan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:112
msgid "Choose the SCAP policy to apply."
msgstr "Pilih kebijakan SCAP yang akan diterapkan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:113
msgid "Configure the recurrence schedule (for example, daily, weekly)."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan jadwal pengulangan (misalnya, harian atau mingguan)."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:114
msgid ""
"Optionally enable **Test Mode** to simulate the scan without applying "
"changes."
msgstr "Jika diperlukan, aktifkan **Mode Uji** untuk menyimulasikan pemindaian tanpa menerapkan perubahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:115
msgid ""
"Recurring scans are linked to the selected SCAP policy.  If you update the "
"policy (for example, change the profile), future recurring scans will use "
"the updated configuration."
msgstr "Pemindaian berulang ditautkan ke kebijakan SCAP yang dipilih.  Jika Anda memperbarui kebijakan tersebut (misalnya, mengubah profil), pemindaian berulang berikutnya akan menggunakan konfigurasi yang diperbarui."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "How scans work"
msgstr "Cara kerja pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:117
msgid "When a scan is scheduled with the enhanced (beta) SCAP integration:"
msgstr "Saat pemindaian dijadwalkan dengan integrasi SCAP yang ditingkatkan (beta):"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:118
msgid ""
"The {productname} server transfers the required SCAP content files "
"(DataStream and XCCDF) from the server to the managed system using Salt's "
"file management."
msgstr "Server {productname} mentransfer file konten SCAP yang diperlukan (DataStream dan XCCDF) dari server ke sistem yang dikelola menggunakan pengelolaan file Salt."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:119
msgid "If a tailoring file is associated with the policy, it is also transferred."
msgstr "Jika file tailoring terkait dengan kebijakan, file tersebut juga ditransfer."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:120
msgid ""
"The `oscap` tool is executed on the managed system with the appropriate "
"parameters (profile, rules, tailoring, etc.)."
msgstr "Alat `oscap` dijalankan pada sistem yang dikelola dengan parameter yang sesuai (profil, aturan, tailoring, dan sebagainya)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:121
msgid ""
"Scan results (`results.xml` and `report.html`) are collected from the "
"managed system and stored on the server."
msgstr "Hasil pemindaian (`results.xml` dan `report.html`) dikumpulkan dari sistem yang dikelola dan disimpan pada server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:122
msgid ""
"Results are available for review in the WebUI under the system's audit "
"section."
msgstr "Hasil tersedia untuk ditinjau di WebUI pada bagian audit sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:123
msgid ""
"Files are transferred to `/var/cache/salt/minion/scap/` on the managed "
"system."
msgstr "File ditransfer ke `/var/cache/salt/minion/scap/` pada sistem yang dikelola."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:124
msgid ""
"OVAL files are **not** transferred automatically due to their large size.  "
"If your scan requires OVAL files, they must be present on the managed system "
"before the scan runs."
msgstr "File OVAL **tidak** ditransfer secara otomatis karena ukurannya yang besar.  Jika pemindaian Anda memerlukan file OVAL, file tersebut harus tersedia pada sistem yang dikelola sebelum pemindaian dijalankan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:125
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation"
msgstr "Remediasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:126
msgid ""
"The enhanced SCAP integration allows you to apply remediation actions "
"directly from scan results to fix non-compliant rules."
msgstr "Integrasi SCAP yang ditingkatkan memungkinkan Anda menerapkan tindakan remediasi langsung dari hasil pemindaian untuk memperbaiki ketidakpatuhan terhadap aturan."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:127
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remediation from scan results"
msgstr "Remediasi dari hasil pemindaian"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:128
msgid ""
"After reviewing scan results, you can apply remediation for individual rules "
"that have failed."
msgstr "Setelah meninjau hasil pemindaian, Anda dapat menerapkan remediasi untuk setiap aturan yang gagal dipenuhi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:129
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Applying remediation from scan results"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menerapkan remediasi dari hasil pemindaian"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:130
msgid "Navigate to a completed scan's results."
msgstr "Buka hasil pemindaian yang telah selesai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:131
msgid "Identify the non-compliant rule."
msgstr "Identifikasi aturan yang tidak dipatuhi."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:132
msgid "Click the remediation action to apply the fix."
msgstr "Klik tindakan remediasi untuk menerapkan perbaikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:133
msgid "Remediation can be applied in two ways:"
msgstr "Remediasi dapat diterapkan dengan dua cara:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:134
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bash remediation"
msgstr "Remediasi Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:135
msgid ""
"A shell script is executed on the managed system as root.  The script is "
"derived from the SCAP content's built-in fix elements."
msgstr "Skrip shell dijalankan pada sistem yang dikelola sebagai root.  Skrip ini berasal dari elemen perbaikan bawaan konten SCAP."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:136
#, no-wrap
msgid "Salt remediation"
msgstr "Remediasi Salt"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:137
msgid ""
"A {salt} state is applied to the managed system.  This uses the "
"`scap_beta.remediation` {salt} state with the remediation content passed as "
"pillar data."
msgstr "State {salt} diterapkan pada sistem yang dikelola.  Proses ini menggunakan state {salt} `scap_beta.remediation` dengan konten remediasi yang diteruskan sebagai data pillar."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:138
#, no-wrap
msgid "Custom remediation"
msgstr "Remediasi kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:139
msgid ""
"If the built-in remediation from the SCAP content is insufficient or you "
"need to tailor the fix for your environment, you can define custom "
"remediation scripts."
msgstr "Jika remediasi bawaan dari konten SCAP tidak memadai atau Anda perlu menyesuaikan perbaikan untuk lingkungan Anda, Anda dapat menentukan skrip remediasi kustom."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:140
msgid "Custom remediation is scoped per organization and per rule."
msgstr "Remediasi kustom memiliki cakupan per organisasi dan per aturan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:141
msgid "To save a custom remediation, follow these steps:"
msgstr "Untuk menyimpan remediasi kustom, ikuti langkah-langkah berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:142
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Saving a custom remediation"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menyimpan remediasi kustom"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:143
msgid "Navigate to the rule's remediation view."
msgstr "Buka tampilan remediasi aturan."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:144
msgid "Choose the script type:"
msgstr "Pilih jenis skrip:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:145
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Bash**: A custom shell script.\n"
msgstr "**Bash**: Skrip shell kustom.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:146
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Salt**: A custom Salt state definition.\n"
msgstr "**Salt**: Definisi state Salt kustom.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:147
msgid "Enter or modify the remediation script."
msgstr "Masukkan atau ubah skrip remediasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:149
msgid ""
"Custom remediation overrides the default remediation from the SCAP content "
"for the specific rule within your organization."
msgstr "Remediasi kustom menggantikan remediasi default dari konten SCAP untuk aturan tertentu dalam organisasi Anda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:150
msgid ""
"Custom remediation includes an audit trail.  The system tracks which user "
"created and last modified each custom remediation script."
msgstr "Remediasi kustom mencakup jejak audit.  Sistem melacak pengguna yang membuat dan terakhir mengubah setiap skrip remediasi kustom."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:151
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deleting custom remediation"
msgstr "Menghapus remediasi kustom"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:152
msgid ""
"You can delete a custom remediation to revert to the default remediation "
"provided by the SCAP content."
msgstr "Anda dapat menghapus remediasi kustom untuk kembali ke remediasi default yang disediakan oleh konten SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:153
msgid ""
"Navigate to the custom remediation view and click btn:[Delete] for the "
"specific script type."
msgstr "Buka tampilan remediasi kustom dan klik btn:[Delete] untuk jenis skrip tertentu."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:154
#, no-wrap
msgid "Navigation reference"
msgstr "Referensi navigasi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:155
msgid "When the beta feature is enabled, the following menu entries are available:"
msgstr "Saat fitur beta diaktifkan, entri menu berikut tersedia:"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:156
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Menu path\n"
"| Description\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]\n"
"| View all SCAP scan results (available with or without beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]\n"
"| Create and manage reusable SCAP policies. _(beta only)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]\n"
"| Upload and manage SCAP DataStream and XCCDF files. _(beta only)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]\n"
"| Upload and manage SCAP tailoring files. _(beta only)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > XCCDF Diff]\n"
"| Compare two SCAP scan results (available with or without beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Advanced Search]\n"
"| Search across all SCAP scan results (available with or without beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Systems[System Details > Audit > OpenSCAP > Schedule]\n"
"| Schedule a SCAP scan for a single system (uses the new policy-based UI "
"when beta is enabled).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Systems[SSM > Audit > Schedule]\n"
"| Schedule SCAP scans for multiple systems (uses the new policy-based UI "
"when beta is enabled).\n"
msgstr ""
"| Jalur menu\n"
"| Deskripsi\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]\n"
"| Lihat semua hasil pemindaian SCAP (tersedia dengan atau tanpa beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies]\n"
"| Buat dan kelola kebijakan SCAP yang dapat digunakan kembali. _(khusus beta)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content]\n"
"| Unggah dan kelola file SCAP DataStream dan XCCDF. _(khusus beta)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files]\n"
"| Unggah dan kelola file tailoring SCAP. _(khusus beta)_\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > XCCDF Diff]\n"
"| Bandingkan dua hasil pemindaian SCAP (tersedia dengan atau tanpa beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Advanced Search]\n"
"| Cari di seluruh hasil pemindaian SCAP (tersedia dengan atau tanpa beta).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Systems[System Details > Audit > OpenSCAP > Schedule]\n"
"| Jadwalkan pemindaian SCAP untuk satu sistem (menggunakan UI baru berbasis kebijakan saat beta diaktifkan).\n"
"\n"
"| menu:Systems[SSM > Audit > Schedule]\n"
"| Jadwalkan pemindaian SCAP untuk beberapa sistem (menggunakan UI baru berbasis kebijakan saat beta diaktifkan).\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:157
#, no-wrap
msgid "Workflow example"
msgstr "Contoh alur kerja"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:158
msgid ""
"The following example demonstrates a typical workflow using the enhanced "
"SCAP features:"
msgstr "Contoh berikut menunjukkan alur kerja umum yang menggunakan fitur SCAP yang disempurnakan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:159
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Enable beta features** in your user preferences.\n"
msgstr "**Aktifkan fitur beta** di preferensi pengguna Anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:160
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Upload SCAP content**:\n"
msgstr "**Unggah konten SCAP**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:161
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content] and upload a SCAP Security "
"Guide DataStream file (for example, `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` and "
"`ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Content] dan unggah file DataStream SCAP Security Guide (misalnya, `ssg-sle15-ds.xml` dan `ssg-sle15-xccdf.xml`)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:162
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Upload a tailoring file** (optional):\n"
msgstr "**Unggah file tailoring** (opsional):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:163
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files] and upload a tailoring "
"file if you need to customize a profile."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Tailoring Files] dan unggah file tailoring jika Anda perlu menyesuaikan profil."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:164
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Create a SCAP policy**:\n"
msgstr "**Buat kebijakan SCAP**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:165
msgid ""
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies] and create a policy that "
"references the uploaded content, selects a profile (for example, `CIS "
"Benchmark Level 1`), and optionally includes the tailoring file."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > SCAP Policies] dan buat kebijakan yang merujuk pada konten yang diunggah, memilih profil (misalnya, `CIS Benchmark Level 1`), dan secara opsional menyertakan file tailoring."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Schedule a scan**:\n"
msgstr "**Jadwalkan pemindaian**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:167
msgid ""
"Navigate to a system's menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Schedule] tab, select the "
"policy, and schedule the scan."
msgstr "Buka tab menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > Schedule] pada sistem, pilih kebijakan, lalu jadwalkan pemindaian."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:168
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Review results**:\n"
msgstr "**Tinjau hasil**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:169
msgid ""
"After the scan completes, review the results under the system's "
"menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > List Scans] tab."
msgstr "Setelah pemindaian selesai, tinjau hasilnya pada tab menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > List Scans] di sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:170
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Apply remediation**:\n"
msgstr "**Terapkan remediasi**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:171
msgid ""
"For any non-compliant rules, apply the built-in remediation or define custom "
"remediation scripts tailored to your environment."
msgstr "Untuk setiap aturan yang tidak dipatuhi, terapkan remediasi bawaan atau tentukan skrip remediasi kustom yang disesuaikan dengan lingkungan Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:172
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Set up recurring scans**:\n"
msgstr "**Siapkan pemindaian berulang**:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc:173
msgid ""
"Configure recurring scans using the SCAP policy to maintain ongoing "
"compliance monitoring."
msgstr "Konfigurasikan pemindaian berulang menggunakan kebijakan SCAP untuk mempertahankan pemantauan kepatuhan secara berkelanjutan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "System Security with OpenSCAP"
msgstr "Keamanan Sistem dengan OpenSCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to audit clients.  It allows you to schedule and "
"view compliance scans for any client."
msgstr "{productname} menggunakan OpenSCAP untuk mengaudit klien.  Fitur ini memungkinkan Anda menjadwalkan dan melihat pemindaian kepatuhan untuk setiap klien."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:3
msgid ""
"An enhanced SCAP auditing experience is available as a beta feature.  It "
"provides centralized content management, reusable scan policies, recurring "
"scans, and built-in remediation from the {webui}.  To get started, see "
"xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc[Enhanced SCAP Auditing "
"(Beta)]."
msgstr "Pengalaman audit SCAP yang disempurnakan tersedia sebagai fitur beta.  Fitur ini menyediakan pengelolaan konten terpusat, kebijakan pemindaian yang dapat digunakan kembali, pemindaian berulang, dan remediasi bawaan melalui {webui}.  Untuk memulai, lihat xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc[Enhanced SCAP Auditing (Beta)]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "About SCAP"
msgstr "Tentang SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) is a synthesis of "
"interoperable specifications derived from community ideas.  It is a line of "
"specifications maintained by the National Institute of Standards and "
"Technology (NIST) for maintaining system security for enterprise systems."
msgstr "Security Content Automation Protocol (SCAP) merupakan gabungan spesifikasi yang dapat saling beroperasi dan dikembangkan dari gagasan komunitas.  SCAP adalah serangkaian spesifikasi yang dikelola oleh National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST) untuk menjaga keamanan sistem perusahaan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:6
msgid ""
"SCAP was created to provide a standardized approach to maintaining system "
"security, and the standards that are used continually change to meet the "
"needs of the community and enterprise businesses.  New specifications are "
"governed by NIST's SCAP Release cycle to provide a consistent and repeatable "
"revision work flow.  For more information, see:"
msgstr "SCAP dibuat untuk menyediakan pendekatan terstandar dalam menjaga keamanan sistem, dan standar yang digunakan terus berubah untuk memenuhi kebutuhan komunitas dan perusahaan.  Spesifikasi baru diatur oleh siklus Rilis SCAP NIST untuk menyediakan alur kerja revisi yang konsisten dan dapat diulang.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:7
msgid "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"
msgstr "https://csrc.nist.gov/projects/security-content-automation-protocol"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:8
msgid "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"
msgstr "https://www.open-scap.org/features/standards/"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:9
msgid "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"
msgstr "https://ncp.nist.gov/repository?scap"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:10
msgid ""
"{productname} uses OpenSCAP to implement the SCAP specifications.  OpenSCAP "
"is an auditing tool that utilizes the Extensible Configuration Checklist "
"Description Format (XCCDF).  XCCDF is a standard way of expressing checklist "
"content and defines security checklists.  It also combines with other "
"specifications such as Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common "
"Configuration Enumeration (CCE), and Open Vulnerability and Assessment "
"Language (OVAL), to create a SCAP-expressed checklist that can be processed "
"by SCAP-validated products."
msgstr "{productname} menggunakan OpenSCAP untuk menerapkan spesifikasi SCAP.  OpenSCAP adalah alat audit yang menggunakan Extensible Configuration Checklist Description Format (XCCDF).  XCCDF merupakan cara standar untuk menyatakan konten daftar periksa dan mendefinisikan daftar periksa keamanan.  XCCDF juga dipadukan dengan spesifikasi lain seperti Common Platform Enumeration (CPE), Common Configuration Enumeration (CCE), dan Open Vulnerability and Assessment Language (OVAL), untuk membuat daftar periksa dalam format SCAP yang dapat diproses oleh produk yang telah divalidasi untuk SCAP."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:11
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP verifies the presence of patches by using content produced by the "
"{suse} Security Team.  OpenSCAP checks system security configuration "
"settings and examines systems for signs of compromise by using rules based "
"on standards and specifications.  For more information about the {suse} "
"Security Team, see https://www.suse.com/support/security."
msgstr "OpenSCAP memverifikasi keberadaan patch menggunakan konten yang dibuat oleh Tim Keamanan {suse}.  OpenSCAP memeriksa pengaturan konfigurasi keamanan sistem dan memeriksa sistem untuk menemukan tanda-tanda kompromi menggunakan aturan berdasarkan standar dan spesifikasi.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang Tim Keamanan {suse}, lihat https://www.suse.com/support/security."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare clients for an SCAP scan"
msgstr "Menyiapkan klien untuk pemindaian SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:13
msgid "Before you begin, you need to prepare your client systems for SCAP scanning."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, Anda perlu menyiapkan sistem klien untuk pemindaian SCAP."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:14
msgid ""
"OpenSCAP auditing is not available on Salt clients that use the SSH contact "
"method."
msgstr "Audit OpenSCAP tidak tersedia pada klien Salt yang menggunakan metode kontak SSH."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Scanning clients can consume a lot of memory and compute power on the client "
"being scanned.  Ensure you have at least 2{nbsp}GB of RAM available on each "
"client to be scanned (especially for {redhat}-based and other modern "
"clients)."
msgstr "Pemindaian klien dapat menghabiskan banyak memori dan daya komputasi pada klien yang dipindai.  Pastikan tersedia setidaknya 2{nbsp}GB RAM pada setiap klien yang akan dipindai (terutama untuk klien berbasis {redhat} dan klien modern lainnya)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:16
msgid ""
"Install the OpenSCAP scanner and the SCAP Security Guide (content) packages "
"on the client before you begin.  Depending on the operating system, these "
"packages are included either on the base operating system, or in the "
"{productname} Client Tools."
msgstr "Instal paket pemindai OpenSCAP dan SCAP Security Guide (konten) pada klien sebelum memulai.  Bergantung pada sistem operasinya, paket-paket ini disertakan dalam sistem operasi dasar atau dalam Client Tools {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:17
msgid "The table below lists the packages you need:"
msgstr "Tabel di bawah ini mencantumkan paket yang Anda perlukan:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "OpenSCAP packages"
msgstr "Paket OpenSCAP"

