#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:46
msgid "Take a note of the file paths and profiles for performing the scan."
msgstr "Catat jalur file dan profil yang akan digunakan untuk melakukan pemindaian."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Perform an audit scan"
msgstr "Melakukan pemindaian audit"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:48
msgid ""
"When you have installed or transferred your content files, you can perform "
"audit scans.  Audit scans can be triggered using the {productname} {webui}.  "
"You can also use the {productname} API to schedule regular scans."
msgstr "Setelah menginstal atau mentransfer file konten, Anda dapat melakukan pemindaian audit.  Pemindaian audit dapat dijalankan melalui {webui} {productname}.  Anda juga dapat menggunakan API {productname} untuk menjadwalkan pemindaian rutin."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the {webui}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjalankan pemindaian audit dari {webui}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:50
msgid ""
"In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Systems List] and "
"select the client you want to scan."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Systems List] dan pilih klien yang ingin Anda pindai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:51
msgid "Navigate to the `Audit` tab, and the `Schedule` subtab."
msgstr "Buka tab `Audit`, lalu subtab `Schedule`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:52
msgid ""
"In the `Path to XCCDF Document` field, enter the parameters for the SCAP "
"template and profile you want to use on the client.  For example:"
msgstr "Di kolom `Path to XCCDF Document`, masukkan parameter untuk templat dan profil SCAP yang ingin Anda gunakan pada klien.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:53
msgid "`Command`: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"
msgstr "`Command`: /usr/bin/oscap xccdf eval"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:54
msgid ""
"`Command-line arguments`: --profile "
"xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"
msgstr "`Command-line arguments`: --profile xccdf_org.ssgproject.content_profile_stig"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:55
msgid "`Path to XCCDF document`: /usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"
msgstr "`Path to XCCDF document`: /usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:56
msgid ""
"If you use `--fetch-remote-resources` parameter a lot of RAM is required.  "
"In addition, you may need to increase the value of `file_recv_max_size`."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan parameter `--fetch-remote-resources`, diperlukan RAM dalam jumlah besar.  Selain itu, Anda mungkin perlu meningkatkan nilai `file_recv_max_size`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:57
msgid "The scan runs at the client's next scheduled synchronization."
msgstr "Pemindaian dijalankan pada sinkronisasi terjadwal berikutnya di klien."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:58
msgid ""
"The XCCDF content file is validated before it is run on the remote system.  "
"If the content file includes invalid arguments, the test fails."
msgstr "File konten XCCDF divalidasi sebelum dijalankan pada sistem jarak jauh.  Jika file konten berisi argumen yang tidak valid, pengujian akan gagal."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Running an audit scan from the API"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menjalankan pemindaian audit dari API"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:60
msgid ""
"Before you begin, ensure that the client to be scanned has Python and "
"XML-RPC libraries installed."
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan Python dan pustaka XML-RPC telah diinstal pada klien yang akan dipindai."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:61
msgid ""
"Choose an existing script or create a script for scheduling a system scan "
"through `system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan`.  For example:"
msgstr "Pilih skrip yang sudah ada atau buat skrip untuk menjadwalkan pemindaian sistem melalui `system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan`.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
"    '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/python3\n"
"import xmlrpc.client\n"
"client = xmlrpc.client.ServerProxy('https://server.example.com/rpc/api')\n"
"key = client.auth.login('username', 'password')\n"
"client.system.scap.scheduleXccdfScan(key, <1000010001>,\n"
" '<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>',\n"
"    '--profile <profile_name>')\n"
"client.auth.logout(session_key)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:63
msgid "In this example:"
msgstr "Dalam contoh ini:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:64
msgid "`<1000010001>` is the system ID (sid)."
msgstr "`<1000010001>` adalah ID sistem (sid)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:65
msgid ""
"`<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>` is the path to the content file location on the "
"client.  For example, `/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml`."
msgstr "`<path_to_xccdf_file.xml>` adalah jalur ke lokasi file konten pada klien.  Misalnya, `/usr/share/xml/scap/ssg/content/ssg-sle15-ds.xml`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:66
msgid ""
"`<profile_name>` is an additional argument for the `oscap` command.  For "
"example, use `united_states_government_configuration_baseline` (USGCB)."
msgstr "`<profile_name>` adalah argumen tambahan untuk perintah `oscap`.  Misalnya, gunakan `united_states_government_configuration_baseline` (USGCB)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:67
msgid "Run the script on the client you want to scan, from the command prompt."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip pada klien yang ingin Anda pindai melalui prompt perintah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scan results"
msgstr "Hasil pemindaian"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:69
msgid ""
"Information about the scans you have run is in the {productname} {webui}.  "
"Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] for a table of results.  For "
"more information about the data in this table, see "
"xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."
msgstr "Informasi tentang pemindaian yang telah Anda jalankan tersedia di {webui} {productname}.  Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans] untuk melihat tabel hasil.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang data dalam tabel ini, lihat xref:reference:audit/openscap-all-scans.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:70
msgid ""
"To ensure that detailed information about scans is available, you need to "
"enable it on the client.  In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Organizations] and click on the organization the client is a part "
"of.  Navigate to the `Configuration` tab, and check the `Enable Upload of "
"Detailed SCAP Files` option.  When enabled, this generates an additional "
"HTML file on every scan, which contains extra information.  The results show "
"an extra line similar to this:"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan informasi terperinci tentang pemindaian tersedia, Anda perlu mengaktifkannya pada klien.  Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Admin[Organizations] dan klik organisasi tempat klien tersebut berada.  Buka tab `Configuration`, lalu centang opsi `Enable Upload of Detailed SCAP Files`.  Jika diaktifkan, opsi ini menghasilkan file HTML tambahan pada setiap pemindaian yang berisi informasi tambahan.  Hasilnya menampilkan baris tambahan seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml "
"scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"
msgstr "Detailed Results: xccdf-report.html xccdf-results.xml scap-yast2sec-oval.xml.result.xml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:72
msgid ""
"To retrieve scan information from the command line, use the "
"`spacewalk-report` command:"
msgstr "Untuk mengambil informasi pemindaian dari baris perintah, gunakan perintah `spacewalk-report`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"
msgstr ""
"spacewalk-report system-history-scap\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan\n"
"spacewalk-report scap-scan-results\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:74
msgid ""
"You can also use the {productname} API to view results, with the "
"`system.scap` handler."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menggunakan API {productname} untuk melihat hasil dengan handler `system.scap`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:75
#, no-wrap
msgid "Removing SCAP Scan Results"
msgstr "Menghapus Hasil Pemindaian SCAP"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:76
msgid ""
"Only SCAP scans that have passed the configured retention period can be "
"deleted.  You can configure the retention period in the `Organization "
"Configuration` section."
msgstr "Hanya pemindaian SCAP yang telah melewati masa retensi yang dikonfigurasi yang dapat dihapus.  Anda dapat mengonfigurasi masa retensi di bagian `Organization Configuration`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring the SCAP results retention period"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi masa retensi hasil SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:78
msgid "Navigate to menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Home[My Organization > Configuration]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:79
msgid "Under `SCAP`, check `Allow Deletion of SCAP Results`."
msgstr "Di bagian `SCAP`, centang `Allow Deletion of SCAP Results`."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:80
msgid "Enter a number of days in `Allow Deletion After` (default is 90)."
msgstr "Masukkan jumlah hari di `Allow Deletion After` (nilai default adalah 90)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:81
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deleting SCAP scan results"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghapus hasil pemindaian SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:82
msgid "Navigate to menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Audit[OpenSCAP > All Scans]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:83
msgid "Select the checkbox for the scan or scans you want to delete."
msgstr "Centang kotak untuk satu atau beberapa pemindaian yang ingin Anda hapus."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:84
msgid "Click btn:[Confirm]."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Confirm]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:86
msgid ""
"Remediation Bash scripts and Ansible playbooks are provided in the same SCAP "
"Security Guide packages to harden the client systems."
msgstr "Skrip remediasi Bash dan playbook Ansible disediakan dalam paket SCAP Security Guide yang sama untuk memperkuat keamanan sistem klien."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:87
msgid ""
"If you have the beta SCAP features enabled, you can apply remediation "
"directly from scan results in the {webui}, including custom per-rule "
"remediation scripts.  See "
"xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced "
"SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."
msgstr "Jika fitur SCAP beta diaktifkan, Anda dapat menerapkan remediasi langsung dari hasil pemindaian di {webui}, termasuk skrip remediasi kustom untuk setiap aturan.  Lihat xref:administration:openscap-enhanced-beta.adoc#remediation-enhanced[Enhanced SCAP Auditing - Remediation]."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:89
#, no-wrap
msgid "bash scripts"
msgstr "Skrip bash"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:90
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
