"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-cis.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-standard.sh\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:91
#, no-wrap
msgid "Ansible playbooks"
msgstr "Playbook Ansible"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"
msgstr ""
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-cis.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-standard.yml\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/ansible/sle15-playbook-stig.yml\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:93
msgid ""
"You can run them using remote commands or with Ansible, after enabling "
"Ansible in the client system."
msgstr "Anda dapat menjalankannya menggunakan perintah jarak jauh atau dengan Ansible setelah mengaktifkan Ansible pada sistem klien."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run remediation using a Bash script"
msgstr "Menjalankan remediasi menggunakan skrip Bash"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:95
msgid ""
"Install the `scap-security-guide` package on all your target systems.  For "
"more information, see xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."
msgstr "Instal paket `scap-security-guide` pada semua sistem target Anda.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:ansible-setup-control-node.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:96
msgid ""
"Packages, channels and scripts are different for each operating system and "
"distribution.  Examples are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "Paket, channel, dan skrip berbeda untuk setiap sistem operasi dan distribusi.  Contohnya tercantum di bagian <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:97
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Bash script on single systems as a remote command"
msgstr "Menjalankan skrip Bash pada satu sistem sebagai perintah jarak jauh"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:98
msgid "Run the Bash script as a remote command on single systems."
msgstr "Jalankan skrip Bash sebagai perintah jarak jauh pada satu sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:99
msgid ""
"From menu:System[Overview] tab, select your instance.  Then in "
"menu:Details[Remote Commands], write a Bash script such as:"
msgstr "Dari tab menu:System[Overview], pilih instans Anda.  Kemudian, di menu:Details[Remote Commands], tulis skrip Bash seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:100
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"chmod +x -R /usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/bin/bash\n"
"chmod +x -R /usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash\n"
"/usr/share/scap-security-guide/bash/sle15-script-stig.sh\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/openscap.adoc:102
msgid ""
"Folder and script names change between distribution and version.  Examples "
"are listed in the <<scripts-for-os-types>> section."
msgstr "Nama folder dan skrip berbeda menurut distribusi dan versi.  Contohnya tercantum di bagian <<scripts-for-os-types>>."

#. type: Title ====
