#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:32
msgid ""
"For more information about an individual report, run `spacewalk-report` with "
"the option `--info` or `--list-fields-info` and the report name.  This shows "
"the description and list of possible fields in the report."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang laporan tertentu, jalankan `spacewalk-report` dengan opsi `--info` atau `--list-fields-info` beserta nama laporan.  Perintah ini menampilkan deskripsi dan daftar kolom yang dapat tersedia dalam laporan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/reports.adoc:33
msgid ""
"For further information on program invocation and options, see the "
"`spacewalk-report(8)` man page as well as the `--help` parameter of the "
"`spacewalk-report` command."
msgstr "Untuk informasi lebih lanjut tentang cara menjalankan program dan opsinya, lihat halaman manual `spacewalk-report(8)` serta parameter `--help` pada perintah `spacewalk-report`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)"
msgstr "Kontrol Akses Berbasis Peran (RBAC)"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) is a security method that restricts "
"resources access to authorized users based on their assigned roles. In "
"{productname}, RBAC ensures that users can only perform actions and access "
"resources for which they have explicit authorization, enhancing security and "
"simplifying administration."
msgstr "Kontrol Akses Berbasis Peran (RBAC) adalah metode keamanan yang membatasi akses sumber daya hanya kepada pengguna yang berwenang berdasarkan peran yang ditetapkan kepada mereka. Dalam {productname}, RBAC memastikan bahwa pengguna hanya dapat melakukan tindakan dan mengakses sumber daya yang secara eksplisit diizinkan, sehingga meningkatkan keamanan dan menyederhanakan administrasi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:3
msgid "The core principles of RBAC include:"
msgstr "Prinsip utama RBAC meliputi:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Principle of Least Privilege:* Granting only the necessary access rights "
"for users to perform their tasks.\n"
msgstr "*Prinsip Hak Akses Minimum:* Memberikan hanya hak akses yang diperlukan pengguna untuk menjalankan tugasnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Granular Control:* Providing fine-grained control over specific "
"functionalities.\n"
msgstr "*Kontrol Terperinci:* Menyediakan kontrol terperinci atas fungsionalitas tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Separation of Duties:* Preventing a single user from having too much "
"control over critical processes.\n"
msgstr "*Pemisahan Tugas:* Mencegah satu pengguna memiliki kendali yang terlalu besar atas proses penting.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Auditability:* Allowing for clear tracking of user actions and "
"permissions.\n"
msgstr "*Kemampuan Audit:* Memungkinkan pelacakan tindakan dan izin pengguna secara jelas.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Architectural scope"
msgstr "Cakupan arsitektur"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In {productname}, RBAC controls only the {webui} and the {productname} API "
"(XML-RPC and JSON-RPC) layers.  The RBAC engine controls access to these "
"interfaces."
msgstr "Dalam {productname}, RBAC hanya mengontrol lapisan {webui} dan API {productname} (XML-RPC dan JSON-RPC).  Mesin RBAC mengontrol akses ke antarmuka tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:10
msgid ""
"RBAC does not control the native authentication of the Salt API (`salt-api` "
"or `eauth`) for external users.  The Salt API is an internal service.  The "
"system permits access to the Salt API port (port `9080`) only from the "
"internal loopback interface of the {productname} Server.  Only Tomcat and "
"Taskomatic services on the server can use the Salt API.  External users "
"cannot log in to the Salt API directly.  Instead, {productname} "
"authenticates the user, checks their RBAC permissions, and then runs Salt "
"commands on behalf of the user.  For more information about native Salt "
"authentication and command-line access controls, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-access-control.adoc[]."
msgstr "RBAC tidak mengontrol autentikasi bawaan API Salt (`salt-api` atau `eauth`) untuk pengguna eksternal.  API Salt merupakan layanan internal.  Sistem hanya mengizinkan akses ke port API Salt (port `9080`) dari antarmuka loopback internal Server {productname}.  Hanya layanan Tomcat dan Taskomatic pada server yang dapat menggunakan API Salt.  Pengguna eksternal tidak dapat masuk langsung ke API Salt.  Sebagai gantinya, {productname} mengautentikasi pengguna, memeriksa izin RBAC mereka, lalu menjalankan perintah Salt atas nama pengguna tersebut.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang autentikasi bawaan Salt dan kontrol akses baris perintah, lihat xref:specialized-guides:salt/salt-access-control.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key RBAC concepts"
msgstr "Konsep utama RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Understanding the following core concepts is crucial for effective RBAC "
"management:"
msgstr "Memahami konsep utama berikut sangat penting untuk pengelolaan RBAC yang efektif:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Role:* A collection of permissions defining a specific set of capabilities "
"within {productname}.\n"
msgstr "*Peran:* Kumpulan izin yang menentukan serangkaian kemampuan tertentu dalam {productname}.\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:14
msgid "Roles are assigned to users, granting the user aggregated permissions."
msgstr "Peran ditetapkan kepada pengguna, sehingga pengguna memperoleh gabungan izin dari peran-peran tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Permission:* An atomic authorization to perform a specific action, access a "
"specific web page or call a specific API endpoint within {productname}. In "
"{productname}, permissions are represented by namespaces and their access "
"modes.\n"
msgstr "*Izin:* Otorisasi atomik untuk melakukan tindakan tertentu, mengakses halaman web tertentu, atau memanggil endpoint API tertentu dalam {productname}. Dalam {productname}, izin direpresentasikan oleh namespace dan mode aksesnya.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*User:* An individual account that interacts with {productname}. Users are "
"assigned one or more roles.\n"
msgstr "*Pengguna:* Akun individual yang berinteraksi dengan {productname}. Pengguna diberi satu atau beberapa peran.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Namespace:* A granular unit of access control organized in a tree-like "
"structure. Most namespaces have distinct \"View\" or \"Modify\" modes.\n"
msgstr "*Namespace:* Unit kontrol akses terperinci yang disusun dalam struktur menyerupai pohon. Sebagian besar namespace memiliki mode \"View\" atau \"Modify\" yang berbeda.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "User roles in {productname}"
msgstr "Peran pengguna dalam {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:19
msgid ""
"{productname} provides predefined roles and allows for the definition of "
"additional custom roles, optionally inheriting from a combination of other "
"roles."
msgstr "{productname} menyediakan peran bawaan dan memungkinkan pendefinisian peran kustom tambahan, yang secara opsional dapat mewarisi izin dari kombinasi peran lain."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Predefined roles"
msgstr "Peran bawaan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:21
msgid ""
"Refer to xref:administration:users.adoc#administrator-roles[] for a complete "
"list of predefined roles and their descriptions."
msgstr "Lihat xref:administration:users.adoc#administrator-roles[] untuk daftar lengkap peran bawaan beserta deskripsinya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Defining additional roles"
msgstr "Menentukan peran tambahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:23
msgid "To define additional roles, you can:"
msgstr "Untuk menentukan peran tambahan, Anda dapat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:24
msgid "Select a number of existing roles to inherit permissions from."
msgstr "Memilih sejumlah peran yang sudah ada sebagai sumber pewarisan izin."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:25
msgid "Specify additional namespaces to grant access to."
msgstr "Menentukan namespace tambahan yang akan diberi akses."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Namespaces for fine-grained access"
msgstr "Namespace untuk akses terperinci"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Namespaces provide fine-grained access control, organized in a tree-like "
"structure. For most namespaces, access within a namespace is further "
"granularized by \"View\" and \"Modify\" modes."
msgstr "Namespace menyediakan kontrol akses terperinci yang disusun dalam struktur menyerupai pohon. Untuk sebagian besar namespace, akses di dalamnya diperinci lebih lanjut melalui mode \"View\" dan \"Modify\"."

