#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC"
msgstr "Mengelola RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Managing RBAC roles and permissions is possible either through the API or "
"through the {webui}."
msgstr "Peran dan izin RBAC dapat dikelola melalui API maupun {webui}."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC via {webui}"
msgstr "Mengelola RBAC melalui {webui}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:36
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, you can manage custom RBAC roles and assign permissions by "
"navigating to menu:Admin[Access Control]. From there, you can click "
"btn:[Create Access Group] to define a new role and configure its "
"permissions.  For step-by-step instructions on creating custom roles, see "
"xref:administration:users.adoc#creating-additional-roles[].  For more "
"information about configuring access groups and permission filters in the "
"{webui}, see xref:reference:admin/access-control.adoc[]."
msgstr "Di {webui}, Anda dapat mengelola peran RBAC kustom dan menetapkan izin dengan membuka menu:Admin[Access Control]. Dari sana, Anda dapat mengeklik btn:[Create Access Group] untuk menentukan peran baru dan mengonfigurasi izinnya.  Untuk petunjuk langkah demi langkah tentang pembuatan peran kustom, lihat xref:administration:users.adoc#creating-additional-roles[].  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang konfigurasi grup akses dan filter izin di {webui}, lihat xref:reference:admin/access-control.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Predefined roles cannot be seen or managed via the {webui}. Only custom "
"roles created within your organization are visible in the menu:Admin[Access "
"Control] section."
msgstr "Peran bawaan tidak dapat dilihat atau dikelola melalui {webui}. Hanya peran kustom yang dibuat dalam organisasi Anda yang ditampilkan di bagian menu:Admin[Access Control]."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managing RBAC via API"
msgstr "Mengelola RBAC melalui API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:39
msgid ""
"The {productname} API provides methods for programmaticaly managing roles, "
"permissions and user assignments."
msgstr "API {productname} menyediakan metode untuk mengelola peran, izin, dan penetapan pengguna secara terprogram."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `access` API"
msgstr "API `access`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:41
msgid "These API methods manage roles and their associated access:"
msgstr "Metode API berikut mengelola peran beserta akses terkait:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:42
msgid ""
"`listNamespaces`: Lists available namespaces, access modes and their "
"descriptions in {productname}."
msgstr "`listNamespaces`: Menampilkan daftar namespace, mode akses, dan deskripsinya yang tersedia dalam {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:43
msgid "`listPermissions`: Lists permitted namespaces of a role."
msgstr "`listPermissions`: Menampilkan daftar namespace yang diizinkan untuk suatu peran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:44
msgid "`listRoles`: Lists existing roles in {productname}."
msgstr "`listRoles`: Menampilkan daftar peran yang ada dalam {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:45
msgid ""
"`createRole`: Creates a new role, optionally copying permissions from "
"existing roles."
msgstr "`createRole`: Membuat peran baru, dengan opsi untuk menyalin izin dari peran yang sudah ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:46
msgid "`deleteRole`: Deletes a role."
msgstr "`deleteRole`: Menghapus peran."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:47
msgid "`grantAccess`: Grants access to namespaces."
msgstr "`grantAccess`: Memberikan akses ke namespace."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:48
msgid "`revokeAccess`: Revokes access to namespaces."
msgstr "`revokeAccess`: Mencabut akses ke namespace."

#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "The `user` API"
msgstr "API `user`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:50
msgid "These API methods manage user-role assignments:"
msgstr "Metode API berikut mengelola penetapan peran kepada pengguna:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:51
msgid "`listPermissions`: Lists effective permissions of a user."
msgstr "`listPermissions`: Menampilkan daftar izin efektif pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:52
msgid "`listRoles`: Lists a user's assigned roles."
msgstr "`listRoles`: Menampilkan daftar peran yang ditetapkan kepada pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:53
msgid "`addRole`: Assigns a role to a user."
msgstr "`addRole`: Menetapkan peran kepada pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:54
msgid "`removeRole`: Removes a role from a user."
msgstr "`removeRole`: Menghapus peran dari pengguna."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:55
msgid ""
"For detailed API documentation, including request and response formats, "
"refer to {productname} API reference."
msgstr "Untuk dokumentasi API terperinci, termasuk format permintaan dan respons, lihat referensi API {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "RBAC best practices"
msgstr "Praktik terbaik RBAC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:57
msgid ""
"Adhering to these best practices will help maintain a secure, efficient, and "
"manageable RBAC environment:"
msgstr "Mengikuti praktik terbaik berikut akan membantu mempertahankan lingkungan RBAC yang aman, efisien, dan mudah dikelola:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Principle of least privilege:* Always grant users the minimum permissions "
"necessary to perform their duties. Avoid overly broad permissions.\n"
msgstr "*Prinsip hak akses minimum:* Selalu berikan izin minimum yang diperlukan pengguna untuk menjalankan tugasnya. Hindari pemberian izin yang terlalu luas.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Regular review:* Periodically review assigned roles and permissions for "
"users to ensure they are still appropriate and comply with current security "
"policies.\n"
msgstr "*Peninjauan berkala:* Tinjau secara berkala peran dan izin yang ditetapkan kepada pengguna untuk memastikan keduanya masih sesuai dan mematuhi kebijakan keamanan saat ini.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Document roles:* Clearly document the purpose and permissions of each "
"custom role you create.\n"
msgstr "*Dokumentasikan peran:* Dokumentasikan dengan jelas tujuan dan izin setiap peran kustom yang Anda buat.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/role-based-access-control.adoc:61
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Separate duties:* Implement roles that enforce separation of duties to "
"prevent a single user from having too much control over critical "
"processes.\n"
msgstr "*Pisahkan tugas:* Terapkan peran yang memberlakukan pemisahan tugas untuk mencegah satu pengguna memiliki kendali yang terlalu besar atas proses penting.\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configure Automatic Channels Synchronization"
msgstr "Mengonfigurasi Sinkronisasi Channel Otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, channels are automatically synchronized with the upstream "
"repositories to ensure that clients have access to the latest content and "
"updates.  However, in some cases, you may want to disable this automatic "
"synchronization for specific channels."
msgstr "Secara default, channel disinkronkan secara otomatis dengan repositori upstream untuk memastikan klien memiliki akses ke konten dan pembaruan terbaru.  Namun, dalam beberapa kasus, Anda mungkin ingin menonaktifkan sinkronisasi otomatis ini untuk channel tertentu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This chapter explains how to disable automatic synchronization for a "
"channel."
msgstr "Bab ini menjelaskan cara menonaktifkan sinkronisasi otomatis untuk suatu channel."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify channel synchronization status using the API"
msgstr "Memverifikasi status sinkronisasi channel menggunakan API"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To check if a channel is set to be automatically synchronized you can call "
"an API."
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa apakah suatu channel diatur agar disinkronkan secara otomatis, Anda dapat memanggil API."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To check the synchronization status of a channel using the API, use the "
"following command.  Replace `<Channel_Label>` with the actual label of the "
"channel you want to check"
msgstr "Untuk memeriksa status sinkronisasi channel menggunakan API, gunakan perintah berikut.  Ganti `<Channel_Label>` dengan label sebenarnya dari channel yang ingin Anda periksa"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd api -- --args \"<Channel_Label>\" channel.software.isAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  true\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd api -- --args \"<Channel_Label>\" channel.software.isAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  true\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:8
msgid ""
"The command will return `true` if automatic synchronization is enabled, or "
"`false` if it is disabled."
msgstr "Perintah ini akan mengembalikan `true` jika sinkronisasi otomatis diaktifkan, atau `false` jika dinonaktifkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This information is also available in the {webui}.  To check the "
"synchronization status, navigate to the channel details page and look for "
"the field `Automatic Repository Synchronization`."
msgstr "Informasi ini juga tersedia di {webui}.  Untuk memeriksa status sinkronisasi, buka halaman detail channel dan cari kolom `Automatic Repository Synchronization`."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify automatic channels synchronization status"
msgstr "Memverifikasi status sinkronisasi channel otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:11
msgid ""
"You can also generate anoverview table for all configured software channels "
"at once."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat membuat tabel ringkasan untuk semua channel perangkat lunak yang dikonfigurasi sekaligus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This script logs in, queries the `channel.software.isAutoSync` status for "
"each channel retrieved by `softwarechannel_list`, and formats the output "
"into a table."
msgstr "Skrip ini melakukan login, memeriksa status `channel.software.isAutoSync` untuk setiap channel yang diperoleh melalui `softwarechannel_list`, dan memformat keluarannya menjadi tabel."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacecmd -q login\n"
msgstr "spacecmd -q login\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"printf \"%-70s | %s\\n\" \"CHANNEL\" \"AUTO-SYNC\"\n"
"printf \"%s\\n\" "
"\"----------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------\"\n"
msgstr ""
"printf \"%-70s | %s\\n\" \"CHANNEL\" \"AUTO-SYNC\"\n"
"printf \"%s\\n\" \"----------------------------------------------------------------------+-----------\"\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for I in $(spacecmd -q softwarechannel_list) ; do\n"
"    STATUS=$(spacecmd -q api -- --args \"$I\" channel.software.isAutoSync | "
"tr -d '[] \\n\\r')\n"
"    printf \"%-70s | %s\\n\" \"$I\" \"$STATUS\"\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for I in $(spacecmd -q softwarechannel_list) ; do\n"
"    STATUS=$(spacecmd -q api -- --args \"$I\" channel.software.isAutoSync | tr -d '[] \\n\\r')\n"
"    printf \"%-70s | %s\\n\" \"$I\" \"$STATUS\"\n"
"done\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:16
msgid ""
"This loop will also print the synchronization status for Content Lifecycle "
"Management (CLM) channels."
msgstr "Perulangan ini juga akan menampilkan status sinkronisasi untuk channel Content Lifecycle Management (CLM)."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "Set a channel to skip automatic synchronization"
msgstr "Mengatur channel agar melewati sinkronisasi otomatis"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:18
msgid ""
"To enable or disable automatic synchronization for a channel, you can use "
"the API call `channel.software.setAutoSync`."
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan sinkronisasi otomatis bagi suatu channel, Anda dapat menggunakan panggilan API `channel.software.setAutoSync`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Here is an example of how to set a channel to skip automatic synchronization "
"using the API (replace `<Channel_Label>` with the actual label of the "
"channel you want to update):"
msgstr "Berikut adalah contoh cara mengatur channel agar melewati sinkronisasi otomatis menggunakan API (ganti `<Channel_Label>` dengan label sebenarnya dari channel yang ingin Anda perbarui):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<Channel_Label>\", false]' "
"channel.software.setAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  false\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<Channel_Label>\", false]' channel.software.setAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  false\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:21
msgid "To re-enable automatic synchronization, set the second parameter to `true`:"
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan kembali sinkronisasi otomatis, atur parameter kedua menjadi `true`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<Channel_Label>\", true]' "
"channel.software.setAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  true\n"
"]\n"
msgstr ""
"spacecmd api -- --args '[\"<Channel_Label>\", true]' channel.software.setAutoSync\n"
"INFO: Connected to http://localhost/rpc/api as admin\n"
"[\n"
"  true\n"
"]\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually synchronize a channel"
msgstr "Menyinkronkan channel secara manual"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Even if you have disabled automatic synchronization for a channel, you can "
"still manually synchronize it whenever needed."
msgstr "Meskipun Anda telah menonaktifkan sinkronisasi otomatis untuk suatu channel, Anda tetap dapat menyinkronkannya secara manual kapan pun diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:26
msgid ""
"To manually synchronize a channel, you can use the command(replace "
"`<Channel_Label>` with the actual label of the channel you want to "
"synchronize):"
msgstr "Untuk menyinkronkan channel secara manual, Anda dapat menggunakan perintah berikut (ganti `<Channel_Label>` dengan label sebenarnya dari channel yang ingin Anda sinkronkan):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/skip-auto-sync-channels.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync -c <Channel_Label>\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync -c <Channel_Label>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disk Space Management"
msgstr "Pengelolaan Ruang Disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Running out of disk space can have a severe impact on the {productname} "
"database and file structure which, in some cases, is not recoverable."
msgstr "Kehabisan ruang disk dapat berdampak serius pada basis data dan struktur file {productname}, yang dalam beberapa kasus tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:3
msgid ""
"{productname} monitors some directories for free disk space.  You can modify "
"which directories are monitored, and the warnings that are created using "
"environment variables in systemd service override files."
msgstr "{productname} memantau ruang disk kosong pada beberapa direktori.  Anda dapat mengubah direktori yang dipantau dan peringatan yang dihasilkan menggunakan variabel lingkungan dalam file override layanan systemd."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When the available space in one of the monitored directories falls below a "
"warning threshold, a message is sent to the configured email address and a "
"notification is shown at the top of the sign-in page."
msgstr "Ketika ruang yang tersedia di salah satu direktori yang dipantau berada di bawah ambang peringatan, pesan dikirim ke alamat email yang dikonfigurasi dan notifikasi ditampilkan di bagian atas halaman login."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitored Directories"
msgstr "Direktori yang Dipantau"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:6
msgid "By default, the {productname} Server container monitors these directories:"
msgstr "Secara default, container Server {productname} memantau direktori berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:7
msgid "`/var/spacewalk`"
msgstr "`/var/spacewalk`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:8
msgid "`/var/cache`"
msgstr "`/var/cache`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:9
msgid "`/srv`"
msgstr "`/srv`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can change which directories are monitored by setting the "
"[systemitem]``PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS`` environment variable in the server "
"container systemd service override file, which passes "
"[systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` to the container.  You can specify multiple "
"directories by separating them with a space."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengubah direktori yang dipantau dengan mengatur variabel lingkungan [systemitem]``PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS`` dalam file override layanan systemd container server, yang meneruskan [systemitem]``DISKCHECKDIRS`` ke container.  Anda dapat menentukan beberapa direktori dengan memisahkannya menggunakan spasi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:11
msgid ""
"The `DISKCHECKDIRS` environment variable applies only to the server "
"container.  The database container always monitors `/var/lib/pgsql/data` and "
"this cannot be overridden."
msgstr "Variabel lingkungan `DISKCHECKDIRS` hanya berlaku untuk container server.  Container basis data selalu memantau `/var/lib/pgsql/data` dan pengaturan ini tidak dapat ditimpa."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Monitored Directories"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Direktori yang Dipantau"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:13
msgid "Create a systemd override directory for the server service:"
msgstr "Buat direktori override systemd untuk layanan server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
msgstr "mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:15
msgid "Create a configuration file with the custom directories:"
msgstr "Buat file konfigurasi yang memuat direktori kustom:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:16
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKDIRS=/var/spacewalk "
"/var/cache /srv\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKDIRS=/var/spacewalk /var/cache /srv\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:17
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:43
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-diskspace.adoc:31
msgid "Apply the configuration by restarting {productname}:"
msgstr "Terapkan konfigurasi dengan memulai ulang {productname}:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:19
msgid ""
"For more information about container volumes, see "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang volume container, lihat xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-management/persistent-container-volumes.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Ambang Batas"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:21
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} creates a warning when a monitored directory "
"reaches 90% disk usage.  A critical alert is created when a monitored "
"directory reaches 95% disk usage, and the container health check will fail."
msgstr "Secara default, {productname} menghasilkan peringatan ketika penggunaan disk pada direktori yang dipantau mencapai 90%.  Peringatan kritis dihasilkan ketika penggunaan disk pada direktori yang dipantau mencapai 95%, dan pemeriksaan kesehatan container akan gagal."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:22
msgid ""
"You can change these alert thresholds by setting the `DISKCHECKALERT` and "
"`DISKTHRESHOLD` environment variables."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengubah ambang peringatan ini dengan mengatur variabel lingkungan `DISKCHECKALERT` dan `DISKTHRESHOLD`."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Configuring Disk Check Thresholds"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengonfigurasi Ambang Pemeriksaan Disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:24
msgid "Create systemd override directories:"
msgstr "Buat direktori override systemd:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"
msgstr ""
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/\n"
"mkdir -p /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:26
msgid "Create configuration files for both server and database services:"
msgstr "Buat file konfigurasi untuk layanan server dan basis data:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=90 --env "
"DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=90 --env DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=90 --env "
"DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=90 --env DISKTHRESHOLD=95\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:31
msgid ""
"For large deployments with multi-terabyte storage volumes, you may want to "
"use higher thresholds to make more efficient use of disk space.  For "
"example, on a 10{nbsp}TB volume, keeping 5% free means 500{nbsp}GB unused.  "
"For tuning recommendations for large deployments, see "
"xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#diskcheck-thresholds[]."
msgstr "Untuk penerapan berskala besar dengan volume penyimpanan multiterabita, Anda mungkin ingin menggunakan ambang batas yang lebih tinggi agar penggunaan ruang disk lebih efisien.  Misalnya, pada volume 10{nbsp}TB, menyisakan ruang kosong sebesar 5% berarti 500{nbsp}GB tidak digunakan.  Untuk rekomendasi penyetelan bagi penerapan berskala besar, lihat xref:specialized-guides:large-deployments/tuning.adoc#diskcheck-thresholds[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Database Disk Check"
msgstr "Pemeriksaan Disk Basis Data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:33
msgid ""
"The database container has its own disk check that monitors only the "
"PostgreSQL data directory (`/var/lib/pgsql/data`).  This directory is always "
"monitored and cannot be changed or overridden with the `DISKCHECKDIRS` "
"environment variable."
msgstr "Container basis data memiliki pemeriksaan disk tersendiri yang hanya memantau direktori data PostgreSQL (`/var/lib/pgsql/data`).  Direktori ini selalu dipantau dan tidak dapat diubah atau ditimpa menggunakan variabel lingkungan `DISKCHECKDIRS`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:34
msgid ""
"The database disk check uses the `DISKCHECKALERT` and `DISKTHRESHOLD` "
"environment variables configured for the `uyuni-db` service."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan disk basis data menggunakan variabel lingkungan `DISKCHECKALERT` dan `DISKTHRESHOLD` yang dikonfigurasi untuk layanan `uyuni-db`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:35
msgid ""
"The database disk check runs as a PostgreSQL function and is invoked during "
"container health checks.  When the threshold is exceeded, the health check "
"will fail and the container will be automatically stopped to prevent data "
"corruption."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan disk basis data dijalankan sebagai fungsi PostgreSQL dan dipanggil selama pemeriksaan kesehatan container.  Ketika ambang batas terlampaui, pemeriksaan kesehatan akan gagal dan container akan dihentikan secara otomatis untuk mencegah kerusakan data."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The database container only monitors `/var/lib/pgsql/data`.  You cannot "
"configure additional directories to monitor in the database container using "
"`DISKCHECKDIRS`.  To monitor other directories, use the server container "
"configuration."
msgstr "Container basis data hanya memantau `/var/lib/pgsql/data`.  Anda tidak dapat mengonfigurasi direktori tambahan untuk dipantau dalam container basis data menggunakan `DISKCHECKDIRS`.  Untuk memantau direktori lain, gunakan konfigurasi container server."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Disable Space Checking"
msgstr "Menonaktifkan Pemeriksaan Ruang Disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The space checking tool is enabled by default and runs hourly via a "
"Taskomatic scheduled task.  Notification can be disabled by disabling "
"diskcheck-task-queue-default Taskomatic job.  To effectively disable disk "
"space monitoring, set the threshold values to 99 (percent)."
msgstr "Alat pemeriksaan ruang disk diaktifkan secara default dan dijalankan setiap jam melalui tugas terjadwal Taskomatic.  Notifikasi dapat dinonaktifkan dengan menonaktifkan tugas Taskomatic diskcheck-task-queue-default.  Untuk secara efektif menonaktifkan pemantauan ruang disk, atur nilai ambang batas menjadi 99 (persen)."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling Disk Space Monitoring"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menonaktifkan Pemantauan Ruang Disk"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:40
msgid "Edit the systemd override files to set very high thresholds:"
msgstr "Edit file override systemd untuk menetapkan ambang batas yang sangat tinggi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=99 --env "
"DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-server.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=99 --env DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=99 --env "
"DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"
msgstr ""
"cat > /etc/systemd/system/uyuni-db.service.d/diskcheck.conf << 'EOF'\n"
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=\"PODMAN_EXTRA_ARGS=--env DISKCHECKALERT=99 --env DISKTHRESHOLD=99\"\n"
"EOF\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/space-management.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Disabling disk space monitoring is not recommended in production "
"environments, as running out of disk space can cause severe and potentially "
"unrecoverable damage to the database."
msgstr "Menonaktifkan pemantauan ruang disk tidak disarankan di lingkungan produksi, karena kehabisan ruang disk dapat menyebabkan kerusakan parah pada basis data yang berpotensi tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migrate SSL Certificate Authorities"
msgstr "Memigrasikan Otoritas Sertifikat SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Use this procedure to replace the root certificate authority (CA) of a "
"{productname} server, for example to replace an older self-signed CA that "
"does not mark the `X509v3 Basic Constraints` extension as `critical`.  For "
"more information, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[]."
msgstr "Gunakan prosedur ini untuk mengganti otoritas sertifikat (CA) akar server {productname}, misalnya untuk mengganti CA lama yang ditandatangani sendiri dan tidak menandai ekstensi `X509v3 Basic Constraints` sebagai `critical`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Python 3.13 and later (and probably other SSL clients) validates "
"certificates strictly and rejects any CA certificate that does not mark the "
"`X509v3 Basic Constraints` extension as `critical`."
msgstr "Python 3.13 dan versi yang lebih baru (dan kemungkinan klien SSL lainnya) memvalidasi sertifikat secara ketat dan menolak sertifikat CA yang tidak menandai ekstensi `X509v3 Basic Constraints` sebagai `critical`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On Podman installations, the `mgradm ssl` commands help perform the "
"rotation.  They generate or import the new CA, update the server and "
"database secrets, and restart the services."
msgstr "Pada instalasi Podman, perintah `mgradm ssl` membantu melakukan rotasi.  Perintah ini membuat atau mengimpor CA baru, memperbarui secret server dan basis data, serta memulai ulang layanan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "The migration is done in two phases:"
msgstr "Migrasi dilakukan dalam dua tahap:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:6
msgid ""
"With `mgradm ssl addca`, you add the new CA to the trusted bundle so that "
"both the old and new CA are trusted, and distribute it to all clients and "
"proxies."
msgstr "Dengan `mgradm ssl addca`, Anda menambahkan CA baru ke bundel tepercaya agar CA lama dan baru sama-sama dipercaya, lalu mendistribusikannya ke semua klien dan proxy."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:7
msgid ""
"After all clients and proxies trust the new CA, `mgradm ssl rotate` switches "
"the server to a certificate signed by the new CA and drops the old one."
msgstr "Setelah semua klien dan proxy memercayai CA baru, `mgradm ssl rotate` mengalihkan server ke sertifikat yang ditandatangani oleh CA baru dan menghapus CA lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Also consider any machine that is not managed by the server but still "
"accesses it through the API or a browser, as it needs the new CA too.  These "
"machines are not detected by the trust check in "
"xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-verify-trust[], so "
"track and verify them yourself."
msgstr "Pertimbangkan juga setiap mesin yang tidak dikelola oleh server tetapi tetap mengaksesnya melalui API atau browser, karena mesin tersebut juga memerlukan CA baru.  Mesin-mesin ini tidak terdeteksi oleh pemeriksaan kepercayaan dalam xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-verify-trust[], sehingga Anda harus mendata dan memverifikasinya sendiri."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Do not switch the server certificate before all clients and proxies trust "
"the new CA.  A client that does not trust the new CA can no longer connect, "
"and you have to deploy the CA to it manually."
msgstr "Jangan mengganti sertifikat server sebelum semua klien dan proxy memercayai CA baru.  Klien yang tidak memercayai CA baru tidak lagi dapat terhubung, dan Anda harus mendistribusikan CA ke klien tersebut secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The certificates are stored in Podman secrets, which the container reads at "
"startup.  The server CA bundle, certificate, and key are in `uyuni-ca`, "
"`uyuni-cert`, and `uyuni-key`; the database equivalents are `uyuni-db-ca`, "
"`uyuni-db-cert`, and `uyuni-db-key`.  On {kube}, the root CAs are read from "
"the `uyuni-ca` and `db-ca` config maps, while the certificates are read from "
"the `uyuni-cert` and `db-cert` secrets.  The `mgradm ssl` commands manage "
"these secrets on Podman; on {kube}, you update the config maps and secrets "
"manually as described below."
msgstr "Sertifikat disimpan dalam secret Podman, yang dibaca oleh container saat dimulai.  Bundel CA, sertifikat, dan kunci server masing-masing disimpan dalam `uyuni-ca`, `uyuni-cert`, dan `uyuni-key`; padanannya untuk basis data adalah `uyuni-db-ca`, `uyuni-db-cert`, dan `uyuni-db-key`.  Pada {kube}, CA akar dibaca dari config map `uyuni-ca` dan `db-ca`, sedangkan sertifikat dibaca dari secret `uyuni-cert` dan `db-cert`.  Perintah `mgradm ssl` mengelola secret ini pada Podman; pada {kube}, Anda memperbarui config map dan secret secara manual seperti dijelaskan di bawah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "Add the New CA to the Trust Bundle"
msgstr "Menambahkan CA Baru ke Bundel Tepercaya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:12
msgid ""
"On Podman, add the new CA with `mgradm ssl addca`.  The command generates a "
"new self-signed root CA, or imports a third-party one, appends it to the "
"`uyuni-ca` and `uyuni-db-ca` secrets without changing the served "
"certificate, restarts the services, and prints the SHA-256 fingerprint of "
"the new CA."
msgstr "Pada Podman, tambahkan CA baru dengan `mgradm ssl addca`.  Perintah ini membuat CA akar baru yang ditandatangani sendiri atau mengimpor CA pihak ketiga, menambahkannya ke secret `uyuni-ca` dan `uyuni-db-ca` tanpa mengubah sertifikat yang disajikan, memulai ulang layanan, dan menampilkan sidik jari SHA-256 CA baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:13
msgid ""
"To generate a new self-signed CA, run the following command on the container "
"host.  Replace the subject values with the ones for your organization.  The "
"server's fully qualified domain name is detected automatically, or you can "
"pass it as an argument:"
msgstr "Untuk membuat CA baru yang ditandatangani sendiri, jalankan perintah berikut pada host container.  Ganti nilai subjek dengan nilai yang sesuai untuk organisasi Anda.  Nama domain lengkap (FQDN) server dideteksi secara otomatis, atau Anda dapat meneruskannya sebagai argumen:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm ssl addca --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD \\\n"
"  --ssl-country COUNTRY --ssl-state STATE --ssl-city CITY \\\n"
"  --ssl-org ORGANIZATION --ssl-ou \"ORGANIZATION UNIT\"\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm ssl addca --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD \\\n"
"  --ssl-country COUNTRY --ssl-state STATE --ssl-city CITY \\\n"
"  --ssl-org ORGANIZATION --ssl-ou \"ORGANIZATION UNIT\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If `--ssl-password` is omitted, the command prompts for it.  To use a "
"third-party root CA instead, pass its certificate and any intermediate "
"certificates in place of the generation options.  Repeat "
"`--ssl-ca-intermediate` for each intermediate CA:"
msgstr "Jika `--ssl-password` tidak disertakan, perintah akan meminta Anda memasukkannya.  Untuk menggunakan CA akar pihak ketiga, teruskan sertifikatnya beserta sertifikat perantara sebagai pengganti opsi pembuatan.  Ulangi `--ssl-ca-intermediate` untuk setiap CA perantara:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm ssl addca --ssl-ca-root /root/new-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate /root/intermediate-ca.pem\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm ssl addca --ssl-ca-root /root/new-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate /root/intermediate-ca.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:17
msgid ""
"On {kube}, append the new root CA certificate to the `uyuni-ca` and `db-ca` "
"config maps manually:"
msgstr "Pada {kube}, tambahkan sertifikat CA akar baru ke config map `uyuni-ca` dan `db-ca` secara manual:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"kubectl get configmap -n uyuni-server uyuni-ca -o "
"jsonpath='{.data.ca\\.crt}' > combined.crt && \\\n"
"echo \"\" >> combined.crt && \\\n"
"cat ca.crt >> combined.crt && \\\n"
"kubectl create configmap uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=combined.crt "
"--dry-run=client -o json | \\\n"
"kubectl patch -n uyuni-server configmap uyuni-ca --patch-file /dev/stdin  -o "
"yaml && \\\n"
"rm combined.crt\n"
msgstr ""
"kubectl get configmap -n uyuni-server uyuni-ca -o jsonpath='{.data.ca\\.crt}' > combined.crt && \\\n"
"echo \"\" >> combined.crt && \\\n"
"cat ca.crt >> combined.crt && \\\n"
"kubectl create configmap uyuni-ca --from-file=ca.crt=combined.crt --dry-run=client -o json | \\\n"
"kubectl patch -n uyuni-server configmap uyuni-ca --patch-file /dev/stdin  -o yaml && \\\n"
"rm combined.crt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:19
msgid "You also need to run a similar command for `db-ca`."
msgstr "Anda juga perlu menjalankan perintah serupa untuk `db-ca`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Once the server trusts the new CA, distribute it to every client and proxy.  "
"Deploy the new CA to all Salt clients by applying the highstate, as "
"described in "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-deploy-root-ca[]."
msgstr "Setelah server memercayai CA baru, distribusikan CA tersebut ke setiap klien dan proxy.  Distribusikan CA baru ke semua klien Salt dengan menerapkan highstate, seperti dijelaskan dalam xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-deploy-root-ca[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:21
msgid ""
"On each {productname} Proxy, make it trust the new CA without a full "
"redeployment.  The proxy reads its trusted CA from the `uyuni-ca` Podman "
"secret, so update that secret directly.  After `mgradm ssl addca`, the "
"server publishes the combined CA bundle, which contains both the old and new "
"root CAs, at `http://SERVER_FQDN/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`.  Download it "
"on the proxy host, replace the secret, and restart the proxy:"
msgstr "Pada setiap Proxy {productname}, konfigurasikan agar proxy memercayai CA baru tanpa penerapan ulang secara menyeluruh.  Proxy membaca CA tepercayanya dari secret Podman `uyuni-ca`, jadi perbarui secret tersebut secara langsung.  Setelah `mgradm ssl addca` dijalankan, server memublikasikan bundel CA gabungan, yang berisi CA akar lama dan baru, di `http://SERVER_FQDN/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT`.  Unduh bundel tersebut pada host proxy, ganti secret, lalu mulai ulang proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"curl -o /tmp/proxy-ca.pem http://SERVER_FQDN/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-ca /tmp/proxy-ca.pem\n"
"systemctl restart uyuni-proxy-pod\n"
msgstr ""
"curl -o /tmp/proxy-ca.pem http://SERVER_FQDN/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
"podman secret create --replace uyuni-ca /tmp/proxy-ca.pem\n"
"systemctl restart uyuni-proxy-pod\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Also make sure the new CA is deployed to any other machine that is not a "
"reachable Salt minion but still accesses the server, such as proxies running "
"on {kube} or unmanaged systems."
msgstr "Pastikan juga CA baru didistribusikan ke mesin lain yang bukan minion Salt yang dapat dijangkau tetapi tetap mengakses server, seperti proxy yang berjalan pada {kube} atau sistem yang tidak dikelola."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Confirm the Clients Trust the New CA"
msgstr "Memastikan Klien Memercayai CA Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Before switching, confirm that the clients trust the new CA.  On Podman, run "
"`mgradm ssl rotate --check-only` to query the Salt minions and report which "
"ones already trust the new CA and which do not, without performing the "
"rotation:"
msgstr "Sebelum beralih, pastikan klien memercayai CA baru.  Pada Podman, jalankan `mgradm ssl rotate --check-only` untuk memeriksa minion Salt dan melaporkan minion yang sudah memercayai CA baru dan yang belum, tanpa melakukan rotasi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm ssl rotate --check-only\n"
msgstr "mgradm ssl rotate --check-only\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:27
msgid ""
"This check is best-effort: it only covers Salt minions that respond at the "
"time of the check.  Offline minions and non-minion systems such as proxies "
"running on {kube} or unmanaged machines are not covered and must be verified "
"manually."
msgstr "Pemeriksaan ini dilakukan sebatas kemampuan yang tersedia: cakupannya hanya mencakup minion Salt yang merespons saat pemeriksaan berlangsung.  Minion yang offline dan sistem non-minion, seperti proxy yang berjalan pada {kube} atau mesin yang tidak dikelola, tidak tercakup dan harus diverifikasi secara manual."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:28
msgid ""
"To verify one of those manually, compare fingerprints.  The `mgradm ssl "
"addca` command already reported the SHA-256 fingerprint of the new CA.  You "
"can also recompute it from the new CA certificate.  For a self-signed CA, "
"read the staged certificate from the server:"
msgstr "Untuk memverifikasi salah satu sistem tersebut secara manual, bandingkan sidik jarinya.  Perintah `mgradm ssl addca` telah melaporkan sidik jari SHA-256 CA baru.  Anda juga dapat menghitungnya kembali dari sertifikat CA baru.  Untuk CA yang ditandatangani sendiri, baca sertifikat yang telah disiapkan pada server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- openssl x509 -in "
"/root/ssl-build-rotation/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT \\\n"
"  -noout -fingerprint -sha256\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- openssl x509 -in /root/ssl-build-rotation/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT \\\n"
"  -noout -fingerprint -sha256\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:30
msgid ""
"For a third-party CA, run the same command against the root CA file you "
"passed to `mgradm ssl addca`."
msgstr "Untuk CA pihak ketiga, jalankan perintah yang sama pada file CA akar yang Anda teruskan ke `mgradm ssl addca`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:31
msgid ""
"The client trust file `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` "
"contains several certificates.  List the fingerprints of all of them on a "
"client and confirm that the new CA fingerprint is present:"
msgstr "File kepercayaan klien `/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` berisi beberapa sertifikat.  Tampilkan daftar sidik jari semua sertifikat tersebut pada klien dan pastikan sidik jari CA baru tercantum:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"while openssl x509 -noout -fingerprint -sha256; do :; done < "
"/etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"
msgstr "while openssl x509 -noout -fingerprint -sha256; do :; done < /etc/pki/trust/anchors/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Switch to the New CA"
msgstr "Beralih ke CA Baru"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:34
msgid "Only continue after all clients and proxies trust the new CA."
msgstr "Lanjutkan hanya setelah semua klien dan proxy memercayai CA baru."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:35
msgid ""
"On Podman, switch to the new CA with `mgradm ssl rotate`.  The command "
"promotes the CA staged by `mgradm ssl addca`, issues a new server "
"certificate signed by it, replaces the server and database certificates, "
"keys, and CA secrets, and restarts the services.  Before switching, it "
"checks over Salt that the clients trust the new CA and refuses to continue "
"if some do not, unless you pass `--force`.  Like `mgradm ssl rotate "
"--check-only`, this check only covers Salt minions that respond, so an "
"offline minion that does not report does not block the rotation; verify such "
"minions manually beforehand."
msgstr "Pada Podman, beralihlah ke CA baru dengan `mgradm ssl rotate`.  Perintah ini mengaktifkan CA yang telah disiapkan oleh `mgradm ssl addca`, menerbitkan sertifikat server baru yang ditandatangani oleh CA tersebut, mengganti sertifikat, kunci, dan secret CA untuk server serta basis data, lalu memulai ulang layanan.  Sebelum beralih, perintah ini memeriksa melalui Salt apakah klien memercayai CA baru dan menolak melanjutkan jika ada yang belum memercayainya, kecuali Anda menyertakan `--force`.  Seperti `mgradm ssl rotate --check-only`, pemeriksaan ini hanya mencakup minion Salt yang merespons, sehingga minion offline yang tidak melaporkan statusnya tidak akan menghalangi rotasi; verifikasi minion tersebut secara manual terlebih dahulu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:36
msgid ""
"For a self-signed CA, run the following command.  Use the fully qualified "
"domain name of your {productname} server, or allow it to be detected "
"automatically, and repeat `--ssl-cname` for additional aliases:"
msgstr "Untuk CA yang ditandatangani sendiri, jalankan perintah berikut.  Gunakan nama domain lengkap server {productname} Anda atau biarkan nama tersebut dideteksi secara otomatis, dan ulangi `--ssl-cname` untuk alias tambahan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm ssl rotate --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD\n"
msgstr "mgradm ssl rotate --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:38
msgid ""
"To install a third-party server certificate signed by the new CA, provide "
"the certificate, key, and root CA instead.  The database reuses the server "
"values unless you pass the matching `--ssl-db-*` options:"
msgstr "Untuk menginstal sertifikat server pihak ketiga yang ditandatangani oleh CA baru, berikan sertifikat, kunci, dan CA akar sebagai gantinya. Basis data menggunakan kembali nilai server kecuali Anda menyertakan opsi `--ssl-db-*` yang sesuai:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:39
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm ssl rotate --ssl-ca-root /root/new-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate /root/intermediate-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert /root/server.crt \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-key /root/server.key\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm ssl rotate --ssl-ca-root /root/new-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-ca-intermediate /root/intermediate-ca.pem \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-cert /root/server.crt \\\n"
"  --ssl-server-key /root/server.key\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:40
msgid ""
"The `mgradm ssl addca` and `mgradm ssl rotate` commands are only available "
"on Podman.  On {kube}, replace the `uyuni-cert` and `db-cert` secrets with "
"the new server certificate and key, update the `uyuni-ca` and `db-ca` config "
"maps to contain only the new CA, then restart the server."
msgstr "Perintah `mgradm ssl addca` dan `mgradm ssl rotate` hanya tersedia pada Podman.  Pada {kube}, ganti secret `uyuni-cert` dan `db-cert` dengan sertifikat dan kunci server baru, perbarui config map `uyuni-ca` dan `db-ca` agar hanya berisi CA baru, lalu mulai ulang server."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:41
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rotate a Compromised CA Immediately"
msgstr "Segera Merotasi CA yang Telah Disusupi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:42
msgid ""
"If the current CA is compromised, you cannot wait for the overlap period in "
"which both the old and new CA are trusted.  Pass `--emergency` to `mgradm "
"ssl rotate` to generate a new CA together with a matching server certificate "
"and drop the old CA in a single step, without the two-phase overlap:"
msgstr "Jika CA saat ini telah disusupi, Anda tidak dapat menunggu masa transisi ketika CA lama dan baru sama-sama dipercaya.  Sertakan `--emergency` pada `mgradm ssl rotate` untuk membuat CA baru beserta sertifikat server yang sesuai dan menghapus CA lama dalam satu langkah, tanpa masa transisi dua tahap:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgradm ssl rotate --emergency --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD\n"
msgstr "mgradm ssl rotate --emergency --ssl-password CA_PASSWORD\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:44
msgid ""
"An emergency rotation drops the old CA immediately, so any client or proxy "
"that does not yet trust the new CA can no longer connect until you deploy "
"the new CA to it manually.  After an emergency rotation, distribute the new "
"CA to all clients and proxies as described in "
"xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-add[], and update "
"the proxies as described below."
msgstr "Rotasi darurat segera menghapus CA lama, sehingga klien atau proxy yang belum memercayai CA baru tidak lagi dapat terhubung sampai Anda mendistribusikan CA baru secara manual ke sistem tersebut.  Setelah rotasi darurat, distribusikan CA baru ke semua klien dan proxy seperti dijelaskan dalam xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-add[], dan perbarui proxy seperti dijelaskan di bawah."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Update Proxies"
msgstr "Memperbarui Proxy"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:46
msgid ""
"In xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-add[], you "
"already made each proxy trust the new CA by updating its `uyuni-ca` Podman "
"secret.  Now that the server uses a certificate signed by the new CA, every "
"proxy also needs its own certificate signed by it.  For each proxy, "
"regenerate the proxy configuration and redeploy the proxy:"
msgstr "Dalam xref:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc#ssl-certs-ca-migration-add[], Anda telah mengonfigurasi setiap proxy agar memercayai CA baru dengan memperbarui secret Podman `uyuni-ca` miliknya.  Kini, setelah server menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani oleh CA baru, setiap proxy juga memerlukan sertifikatnya sendiri yang ditandatangani oleh CA tersebut.  Untuk setiap proxy, buat ulang konfigurasi proxy dan terapkan ulang proxy:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:47
msgid ""
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc[Proxy "
"Deployment]."
msgstr "xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/mlm/proxy-deployment-mlm.adoc[Proxy Deployment]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc:48
msgid ""
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[Proxy "
"Deployment]."
msgstr "xref:installation-and-upgrade:container-deployment/uyuni/proxy-deployment-uyuni.adoc#proxy-setup-containers-generate-config[Proxy Deployment]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "HTTP Strict Transport Security"
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"HTTP Strict Transport Security "
"(https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security[HSTS]) "
"is a policy mechanism that helps to protect websites against "
"man-in-the-middle attacks such as protocol downgrade attacks and cookie "
"hijacking."
msgstr "HTTP Strict Transport Security (https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Headers/Strict-Transport-Security[HSTS]) adalah mekanisme kebijakan yang membantu melindungi situs web dari serangan man-in-the-middle, seperti serangan penurunan versi protokol dan pembajakan cookie."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On {productname}, HSTS is enabled by default.  If you need to disable it on "
"the server, follow this procedure:"
msgstr "Pada {productname}, HSTS diaktifkan secara default.  Jika Anda perlu menonaktifkannya pada server, ikuti prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling HSTS on the server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menonaktifkan HSTS pada server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:5
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the server container host, as root, execute the following command to "
"create a new configuration file with setting `max-age=0`:"
msgstr "Pada host container server, sebagai root, jalankan perintah berikut untuk membuat file konfigurasi baru dengan pengaturan `max-age=0`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -- \\\n"
"  echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; "
"includeSubDomains\"' \\\n"
"  > /etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -- \\\n"
"  echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; includeSubDomains\"' \\\n"
"  > /etc/apache2/conf.d/zz-spacewalk-www-hsts.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:7
msgid "Restart Apache with:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang Apache dengan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- systemctl restart apache2\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:9
msgid "If you need to disable it on the proxy, follow this procedure:"
msgstr "Jika Anda perlu menonaktifkannya pada proxy, ikuti prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Disabling HSTS on the proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menonaktifkan HSTS pada proxy"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; "
"includeSubDomains' \\\n"
"  > /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"echo 'Header always set Strict-Transport-Security \"max-age=0; includeSubDomains' \\\n"
"  > /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:13
msgid "Run the command:"
msgstr "Jalankan perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy install --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install --tuning-httpd /etc/uyuni/custom-httpd.conf config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:15
msgid ""
"When naming the new config file `<filename>.conf`, make sure it is loaded at "
"the right time.  For example, to override something defined in "
"`spacewalk-www.conf` the new file needs to be alphabetically after this "
"file.  For more information about how Apache loads files, see "
"https://httpd.apache.org/docs."
msgstr "Saat menamai file konfigurasi baru `<filename>.conf`, pastikan file tersebut dimuat pada urutan yang tepat.  Misalnya, untuk menimpa pengaturan yang ditentukan dalam `spacewalk-www.conf`, nama file baru harus berada setelah file tersebut menurut urutan abjad.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang cara Apache memuat file, lihat https://httpd.apache.org/docs."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-hsts.adoc:16
msgid ""
"When HSTS is enabled while using the default SSL certificate generated by "
"{productname} or a self-signed certificate, browsers will refuse to connect "
"with HTTPS unless the CA used to sign such certificates is trusted by the "
"browser.  If you are using the SSL certificate generated by {productname}, "
"you can trust it by importing the file located at "
"`http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` to the browsers of "
"all users."
msgstr "Ketika HSTS diaktifkan saat menggunakan sertifikat SSL default yang dibuat oleh {productname} atau sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri, browser akan menolak koneksi HTTPS kecuali CA yang digunakan untuk menandatangani sertifikat tersebut dipercaya oleh browser.  Jika Anda menggunakan sertifikat SSL yang dibuat oleh {productname}, Anda dapat membuatnya dipercaya dengan mengimpor file yang berada di `http://<SERVER-HOSTNAME>/pub/RHN-ORG-TRUSTED-SSL-CERT` ke browser semua pengguna."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Mengimpor Sertifikat SSL"

#. By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.
#. For additional security, you can import a custom certificate, signed by a third party certificate authority (CA).
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:2
msgid ""
"This section covers how to configure SSL certificate for new {productname} "
"installation, and how to replace existing certificates."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara mengonfigurasi sertifikat SSL untuk instalasi baru {productname} dan cara mengganti sertifikat yang sudah ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:3
msgid "Before you begin, ensure you have:"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai, pastikan Anda memiliki:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:4
msgid ""
"A certificate authority (CA) SSL public certificate.  If you are using a CA "
"chain, all intermediate CAs must also be available."
msgstr "Sertifikat publik SSL otoritas sertifikat (CA).  Jika Anda menggunakan rantai CA, semua CA perantara juga harus tersedia."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:5
msgid "An SSL server private key"
msgstr "Kunci privat SSL server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:6
msgid "An SSL server certificate"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL server"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:7
msgid "An SSL database private key"
msgstr "Kunci privat SSL basis data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:8
msgid "An SSL database certificate"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL basis data"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:9
msgid ""
"All files must be in PEM format.  All CA certificates in the chain must mark "
"`X509v3 Basic Constraints` as `critical` and include `CA:TRUE`.  For more "
"information, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[]."
msgstr "Semua file harus dalam format PEM.  Semua sertifikat CA dalam rantai harus menandai `X509v3 Basic Constraints` sebagai `critical` dan menyertakan `CA:TRUE`.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:10
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL server certificate must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on.  You can set the hostnames in "
"the `X509v3 Subject Alternative Name` section of the certificate.  You can "
"also list multiple hostnames if your environment requires it.  Supported Key "
"types are `RSA` and `EC` (Elliptic Curve)."
msgstr "Nama host pada sertifikat SSL server harus cocok dengan nama host lengkap mesin tempat Anda menerapkan sertifikat tersebut.  Anda dapat mengatur nama host di bagian `X509v3 Subject Alternative Name` pada sertifikat.  Anda juga dapat mencantumkan beberapa nama host jika lingkungan Anda memerlukannya.  Jenis kunci yang didukung adalah `RSA` dan `EC` (Elliptic Curve)."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In previous versions the database SSL certificates required `reportdb` and "
"`db` as `Subject Alternative Name`.  This is no longer needed."
msgstr "Pada versi sebelumnya, sertifikat SSL basis data memerlukan `reportdb` dan `db` sebagai `Subject Alternative Name`.  Hal ini tidak lagi diperlukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Third-party authorities commonly use intermediate CAs to sign requested "
"server certificates.  In this case, all CAs in the chain are required to be "
"available.  The `mgradm` commands are taking care of ordering the "
"certificates.  Ideally, the root CA should be in its own file.  The server "
"certificate file should contain the server certificate first, followed by "
"all intermediate CA certificates in order."
msgstr "Otoritas pihak ketiga umumnya menggunakan CA perantara untuk menandatangani sertifikat server yang diminta.  Dalam hal ini, semua CA dalam rantai harus tersedia.  Perintah `mgradm` menangani pengurutan sertifikat.  Idealnya, CA akar disimpan dalam file tersendiri.  File sertifikat server harus berisi sertifikat server terlebih dahulu, diikuti oleh semua sertifikat CA perantara secara berurutan."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Verify CA Basic Constraints"
msgstr "Memverifikasi Basic Constraints CA"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Strict certificate validators reject CA certificates when the `X509v3 Basic "
"Constraints` extension is not marked as `critical`.  This includes Python "
"3.13 and later, which is used by {sles} 16 and openSUSE Leap 16."
msgstr "Validator sertifikat yang ketat menolak sertifikat CA jika ekstensi `X509v3 Basic Constraints` tidak ditandai sebagai `critical`.  Ini mencakup Python 3.13 dan versi yang lebih baru, yang digunakan oleh {sles} 16 dan openSUSE Leap 16."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Before importing certificates or upgrading an existing installation, verify "
"every root and intermediate CA certificate used by {productname}.  For each "
"CA certificate, run:"
msgstr "Sebelum mengimpor sertifikat atau meningkatkan instalasi yang sudah ada, verifikasi setiap sertifikat CA akar dan perantara yang digunakan oleh {productname}.  Untuk setiap sertifikat CA, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "openssl x509 -in root-ca.pem -noout -text | grep -A1 \"Basic Constraints\"\n"
msgstr "openssl x509 -in root-ca.pem -noout -text | grep -A1 \"Basic Constraints\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:17
msgid "The output must include `critical` and `CA:TRUE`:"
msgstr "Keluaran harus menyertakan `critical` dan `CA:TRUE`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"X509v3 Basic Constraints: critical\n"
"  CA:TRUE\n"
msgstr ""
"X509v3 Basic Constraints: critical\n"
"  CA:TRUE\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:19
msgid ""
"If a CA certificate does not include both values, replace or regenerate the "
"affected CA certificate before using it with {productname}.  Replacing only "
"the server certificate does not fix a CA certificate that misses the "
"`critical` flag.  For self-signed certificates generated by {productname}, "
"see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc#ssl-certs-selfsigned-create-replace[].  "
"To replace a CA that is still trusted by the clients without interrupting "
"their connection, see xref:administration:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc[]."
msgstr "Jika sertifikat CA tidak menyertakan kedua nilai tersebut, ganti atau buat ulang sertifikat CA yang bersangkutan sebelum menggunakannya dengan {productname}.  Mengganti sertifikat server saja tidak memperbaiki sertifikat CA yang tidak memiliki penanda `critical`.  Untuk sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri yang dibuat oleh {productname}, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc#ssl-certs-selfsigned-create-replace[]. Untuk mengganti CA yang masih dipercaya oleh klien tanpa memutus koneksi mereka, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-ca-migration.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import Certificates for New Installations"
msgstr "Mengimpor Sertifikat untuk Instalasi Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:21
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  Certificates can "
"be imported with third-party certificates at the installation time."
msgstr "Secara default, {productname} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri.  Sertifikat pihak ketiga dapat diimpor saat instalasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing certificates on a new {productname} server"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor sertifikat pada server {productname} baru"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Deploy the {productname} Server according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-server.adoc[].  Make sure to pass the "
"correct files as parameters to `mgradm install`.  The parameters are:"
msgstr "Terapkan Server {productname} sesuai petunjuk dalam xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-server.adoc[].  Pastikan Anda meneruskan file yang benar sebagai parameter ke `mgradm install`.  Parameternya adalah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings    Intermediate CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string             Root CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string         Server certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string          Server key path\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-intermediate strings Intermediate CA certificate path for "
"the database if different from the server one\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-root string          Root CA certificate path for the "
"database if different from the server one\n"
"      --ssl-db-cert string             Database certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-db-key string              Database key path\n"
msgstr ""
"3rd Party SSL Certificate Flags:\n"
"      --ssl-ca-intermediate strings  Intermediate CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-ca-root string           Root CA certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-cert string         Server certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-server-key string          Server key path\n"
"      --ssl-db-ca-intermediate strings Intermediate CA certificate path for the database if different from the server one\n"
"   --ssl-db-ca-root string          Root CA certificate path for the database if different from the server one\n"
"      --ssl-db-cert string  Database certificate path\n"
"      --ssl-db-key string              Database key path\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Intermediate CAs can either be available in the file which is specified with "
"`--ssl-ca-root`, or specified as extra options with "
"`--ssl-ca-intermediate`.  The `--ssl-ca-intermediate` option can be "
"specified multiple times."
msgstr "CA perantara dapat disertakan dalam file yang ditentukan dengan `--ssl-ca-root` atau ditentukan sebagai opsi tambahan dengan `--ssl-ca-intermediate`.  Opsi `--ssl-ca-intermediate` dapat ditentukan beberapa kali."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Import certificates for new proxy installations"
msgstr "Mengimpor sertifikat untuk instalasi proxy baru"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:27
msgid ""
"The proxy certificates are embedded in the generated configuration.  In "
"order to use a third-party certificate, it needs to be provided during the "
"configuration."
msgstr "Sertifikat proxy disematkan dalam konfigurasi yang dihasilkan.  Untuk menggunakan sertifikat pihak ketiga, sertifikat tersebut harus disediakan selama konfigurasi."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Importing certificates on a new {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengimpor sertifikat pada Proxy {productname} baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:29
msgid ""
"Install the {productname} Proxy according to the instructions in "
"xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."
msgstr "Instal Proxy {productname} sesuai petunjuk dalam xref:installation-and-upgrade:install-proxy.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:30
msgid "Follow the prompts to complete setup."
msgstr "Ikuti petunjuk yang ditampilkan untuk menyelesaikan penyiapan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Use the same certificate authority (CA) to sign all certificates for servers "
"and proxies.  Certificates signed with different CAs do not match."
msgstr "Gunakan otoritas sertifikat (CA) yang sama untuk menandatangani semua sertifikat server dan proxy.  Sertifikat yang ditandatangani oleh CA yang berbeda tidak cocok."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace certificates"
msgstr "Mengganti sertifikat"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:33
msgid ""
"You can replace active certificates on your {productname} installation with "
"a new certificate.  There are two cases to consider: replacing only the "
"server or database certificate, and replacing the root CA."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengganti sertifikat aktif pada instalasi {productname} dengan sertifikat baru.  Ada dua kasus yang perlu dipertimbangkan: mengganti hanya sertifikat server atau basis data, dan mengganti CA akar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:34
msgid ""
"Replacing the root certificate requires more time and planning to avoid "
"disruption as all the registered proxies and systems will need to have the "
"new CA in their database before switching to it at the server level."
msgstr "Mengganti sertifikat akar memerlukan lebih banyak waktu dan perencanaan untuk menghindari gangguan, karena semua proxy dan sistem yang terdaftar harus memiliki CA baru dalam basis datanya sebelum server beralih ke CA tersebut."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:35
msgid ""
"When using third-party certificates signed by an intermediate CA, the "
"intermediate CA certificates need to be appended to the server or database "
"certificate file."
msgstr "Saat menggunakan sertifikat pihak ketiga yang ditandatangani oleh CA perantara, sertifikat CA perantara perlu ditambahkan ke file sertifikat server atau basis data."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:36
msgid ""
"The order is important: first comes the server certificate, then the CAs "
"from the one which signed the certificate to the one signed by the root CA.  "
"The root CA certificate should not be appended to the server certificate "
"file."
msgstr "Urutannya penting: sertifikat server ditempatkan terlebih dahulu, kemudian CA secara berurutan mulai dari CA yang menandatangani sertifikat tersebut hingga CA yang ditandatangani oleh CA akar.  Sertifikat CA akar tidak boleh ditambahkan ke file sertifikat server."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing all existing certificates"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengganti semua sertifikat yang ada"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:38
msgid ""
"The following considers that you have `root-ca.pem`, `intermediate-ca1.pem`, "
"`intermediate-ca2.pem`, `server.pem` and `server.key` files.  It may be "
"different depending on the number of intermediate CAs in the server "
"certificate signature chain."
msgstr "Petunjuk berikut mengasumsikan bahwa Anda memiliki file `root-ca.pem`, `intermediate-ca1.pem`, `intermediate-ca2.pem`, `server.pem`, dan `server.key`.  File yang diperlukan dapat berbeda bergantung pada jumlah CA perantara dalam rantai penandatanganan sertifikat server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Combine the intermediate CAs and server certificates.  The order matters, "
"the server must be first and the intermediate CAs in order.  Do not add the "
"root CA last into the chain as it will be passed separately to `uyuni-ca` "
"and `uyuni-db-ca` secrets.  If there is no intermediate CA, then you can use "
"the `server.pem` instead of the combined file in the next steps."
msgstr "Gabungkan sertifikat CA perantara dan sertifikat server.  Urutannya penting: sertifikat server harus ditempatkan terlebih dahulu, diikuti oleh CA perantara secara berurutan.  Jangan tambahkan CA akar di akhir rantai karena CA tersebut akan diteruskan secara terpisah ke secret `uyuni-ca` dan `uyuni-db-ca`.  Jika tidak ada CA perantara, Anda dapat menggunakan `server.pem` sebagai pengganti file gabungan pada langkah berikutnya."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat server.pem intermediate-ca1.pem intermediate-ca2.pem "
">combined-server.pem\n"
msgstr "cat server.pem intermediate-ca1.pem intermediate-ca2.pem >combined-server.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:41
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, rotate the "
"certificates using `mgradm ssl rotate`:"
msgstr "Pada host container {productname}, melalui prompt perintah, lakukan rotasi sertifikat menggunakan `mgradm ssl rotate`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgradm ssl rotate \\\n"
"   --ssl-ca-root $path_to_ca_certificate \\\n"
"   --ssl-server-cert $path_to_combined_server_certificate \\\n"
"   --ssl-server-key $path_to_server_key\n"
msgstr ""
"mgradm ssl rotate \\\n"
"   --ssl-ca-root $path_to_ca_certificate \\\n"
"   --ssl-server-cert $path_to_combined_server_certificate \\\n"
"   --ssl-server-key $path_to_server_key\n"

#.  bsc#1271329
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replace certificates on a Proxy"
msgstr "Mengganti sertifikat pada Proxy"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:44
msgid ""
"If you are using a {productname} Proxy, you must regenerate and redeploy the "
"Proxy's configuration after replacing the certificates on the {productname} "
"Server.  This ensures the Proxy trusts the Server's new CA and uses its own "
"updated server certificate."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan Proxy {productname}, Anda harus membuat ulang dan menerapkan ulang konfigurasi Proxy setelah mengganti sertifikat pada Server {productname}.  Hal ini memastikan Proxy memercayai CA baru Server dan menggunakan sertifikat server miliknya sendiri yang telah diperbarui."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:45
msgid ""
"Generating the Proxy configuration using the Web UI is not supported for "
"replacing certificates. You must use `spacecmd` from the command line."
msgstr "Pembuatan konfigurasi Proxy melalui Web UI tidak didukung untuk penggantian sertifikat. Anda harus menggunakan `spacecmd` melalui baris perintah."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Replacing certificates on a {productname} Proxy"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengganti sertifikat pada Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:47
msgid ""
"On your {productname} Server container host, copy the Root CA certificate "
"(`ca.crt`), the Proxy certificate (`proxy.crt`), and the Proxy private key "
"(`proxy.key`) into the server container:"
msgstr "Pada host container Server {productname}, salin sertifikat CA Akar (`ca.crt`), sertifikat Proxy (`proxy.crt`), dan kunci privat Proxy (`proxy.key`) ke dalam container server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:48
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"
msgstr ""
"for f in ca.crt proxy.crt proxy.key; do\n"
"  mgrctl cp $f server:/tmp/$f\n"
"done\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:49
msgid ""
"If your environment uses one or more intermediate CAs, also copy them into "
"the container:"
msgstr "Jika lingkungan Anda menggunakan satu atau beberapa CA perantara, salin juga sertifikat tersebut ke dalam container:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"
msgstr "mgrctl cp intermediateCA.pem server:/tmp/intermediateCA.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:51
msgid ""
"Execute `spacecmd proxy_container_config` inside the server container to "
"generate the new configuration archive, replacing the FQDNs and admin email:"
msgstr "Jalankan `spacecmd proxy_container_config` di dalam container server untuk membuat arsip konfigurasi baru, dengan mengganti FQDN dan email administrator:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com "
"srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt "
"/tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:53
msgid ""
"If you copied an intermediate CA in the previous step, append the `-i` "
"parameter:"
msgstr "Jika Anda menyalin CA perantara pada langkah sebelumnya, tambahkan parameter `-i`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i "
"/tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 "
"email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o "
"/tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -ti 'spacecmd proxy_container_config -- -p 8022 -i /tmp/intermediateCA.pem pxy.example.com srv.example.com 2048 email@example.com /tmp/ca.crt /tmp/proxy.crt /tmp/proxy.key -o /tmp/config.tar.gz'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:55
msgid ""
"Copy the generated configuration archive from the server container to the "
"Server host:"
msgstr "Salin arsip konfigurasi yang dihasilkan dari kontainer server ke host Server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl cp server:/tmp/config.tar.gz .\n"
msgstr "mgrctl cp server:/tmp/config.tar.gz .\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:57
msgid "Transfer the `config.tar.gz` archive to the Proxy host:"
msgstr "Transfer arsip `config.tar.gz` ke host Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "scp config.tar.gz root@pxy.example.com:/root/\n"
msgstr "scp config.tar.gz root@pxy.example.com:/root/\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:59
msgid "On the Proxy host, stop the Proxy:"
msgstr "Pada host Proxy, hentikan Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy stop\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy stop\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:61
msgid "Install the new configuration on the Proxy host:"
msgstr "Instal konfigurasi baru pada host Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy install config.tar.gz\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy install config.tar.gz\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:63
msgid "Start the Proxy:"
msgstr "Jalankan Proxy:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrpxy start\n"
msgstr "mgrpxy start\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:65
msgid ""
"If the Root CA was changed, it needs to get deployed to all the clients "
"connected to {productname}.  This is ideally done in advance to minimize the "
"disruption."
msgstr "Jika CA akar diubah, CA tersebut perlu didistribusikan ke semua klien yang terhubung ke {productname}.  Idealnya, hal ini dilakukan terlebih dahulu untuk meminimalkan gangguan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Deploying the root CA on clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mendistribusikan CA akar ke klien"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:67
msgid "In the {productname} {webui}, navigate to menu:Systems[Overview]."
msgstr "Di {webui} {productname}, buka menu:Systems[Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:68
msgid "Check all your clients to add them to the system set manager."
msgstr "Centang semua klien Anda untuk menambahkannya ke pengelola kumpulan sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:69
msgid "Navigate to menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."
msgstr "Buka menu:Systems[System Set Manager > Overview]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:70
msgid "In the `States` field, click btn:[Apply] to apply the system states."
msgstr "Pada bidang `States`, klik btn:[Apply] untuk menerapkan status sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-imported.adoc:71
msgid ""
"In the `Highstate` page, click btn:[Apply Highstate] to propagate the "
"changes to the clients."
msgstr "Pada halaman `Highstate`, klik btn:[Apply Highstate] untuk meneruskan perubahan ke klien."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Self-Signed SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL yang Ditandatangani Sendiri"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:2
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate.  In this case, the "
"certificate is created and signed by {productname}.  This method does not "
"use an independent certificate authority to guarantee that the details of "
"the certificate are correct.  Third-party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct."
msgstr "Secara default, {productname} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri.  Dalam hal ini, sertifikat dibuat dan ditandatangani oleh {productname}.  Metode ini tidak menggunakan otoritas sertifikat independen untuk menjamin kebenaran detail sertifikat.  CA pihak ketiga melakukan pemeriksaan untuk memastikan bahwa informasi yang tercantum dalam sertifikat benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:3
msgid ""
"For more information on third-party CAs, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang CA pihak ketiga, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:4
msgid ""
"For more information on replacing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggantian sertifikat, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This section covers how to create or re-create your self-signed certificates "
"on new or existing installation."
msgstr "Bagian ini membahas cara membuat atau membuat ulang sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri pada instalasi baru atau yang sudah ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The hostname of the SSL keys and certificates must match the fully qualified "
"hostname of the machine you deploy them on."
msgstr "Nama host pada kunci dan sertifikat SSL harus cocok dengan nama host yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat dari mesin tempat kunci dan sertifikat tersebut diterapkan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:7
msgid ""
"CA certificates generated by older {productname} versions can miss the "
"`critical` flag on the `X509v3 Basic Constraints` extension.  Strict "
"certificate validators, including Python 3.13 and later, reject such CA "
"certificates and can report `Basic Constraints of CA cert not marked "
"critical`.  If your self-signed CA is affected, create a new CA and new "
"server certificates, then deploy the new root CA to all clients.  For more "
"information about checking the CA certificate, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[].  "
"For more information about replacing certificates and deploying the root CA "
"to clients, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-deploy-root-ca[]."
msgstr "Sertifikat CA yang dihasilkan oleh versi {productname} yang lebih lama mungkin tidak memiliki penanda `critical` pada ekstensi `X509v3 Basic Constraints`.  Validator sertifikat yang ketat, termasuk Python 3.13 dan versi yang lebih baru, menolak sertifikat CA tersebut dan dapat melaporkan `Basic Constraints of CA cert not marked critical`.  Jika CA yang Anda tandatangani sendiri terpengaruh, buat CA baru dan sertifikat server baru, lalu distribusikan CA akar baru ke semua klien.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pemeriksaan sertifikat CA, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-verify-ca-basic-constraints[]. Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang penggantian sertifikat dan distribusi CA akar ke klien, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-deploy-root-ca[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "Re-Create Existing Server Certificates"
msgstr "Membuat Ulang Sertifikat Server yang Sudah Ada"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If your existing certificates have expired or stopped working for any "
"reason, you can generate a new server certificate from the existing CA."
msgstr "Jika sertifikat yang sudah ada telah kedaluwarsa atau tidak lagi berfungsi karena alasan apa pun, Anda dapat membuat sertifikat server baru dari CA yang sudah ada."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Re-Creating an Existing Server Certificate"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Ulang Sertifikat Server yang Sudah Ada"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:11
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, regenerate the "
"server certificate:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer {productname}, di prompt perintah, buat ulang sertifikat server:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.com\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:13
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:25
msgid ""
"Ensure that the `set-cname` parameter is the fully qualified domain name of "
"your {productname} Server.  You can use the `set-cname` parameter multiple "
"times if you require multiple aliases."
msgstr "Pastikan parameter `set-cname` berisi nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat dari Server {productname} Anda.  Anda dapat menggunakan parameter `set-cname` beberapa kali jika memerlukan beberapa alias."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:14
msgid ""
"The private key and the server certificate can be found inside the server "
"container in the directory `/root/ssl-build/susemanager/` as `server.key` "
"and `server.crt`.  The name of the last directory depends on the hostname "
"used with `--set-hostname` option."
msgstr "Kunci privat dan sertifikat server dapat ditemukan di dalam kontainer server pada direktori `/root/ssl-build/susemanager/` dengan nama `server.key` dan `server.crt`.  Nama direktori terakhir bergantung pada nama host yang digunakan dengan opsi `--set-hostname`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Deploy or import the new certificate and key by updating container's host "
"podman secrets.  For more information about importing the just generated "
"certificate, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."
msgstr "Terapkan atau impor sertifikat dan kunci baru dengan memperbarui secret Podman pada host kontainer.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang mengimpor sertifikat yang baru saja dihasilkan, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc#ssl-certs-import-replace[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create a new CA and Server Certificates"
msgstr "Membuat CA Baru dan Sertifikat Server"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Be careful when you need to replace the Root CA.  It is possible to break "
"the trust chain between the server and clients.  If that happens, you need "
"an administrative user to log in to every client and deploy the CA directly."
msgstr "Berhati-hatilah saat Anda perlu mengganti CA akar.  Penggantian ini dapat memutus rantai kepercayaan antara server dan klien.  Jika hal itu terjadi, pengguna dengan hak administratif perlu masuk ke setiap klien dan menerapkan CA secara langsung."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating New Certificates"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat Sertifikat Baru"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:19
msgid ""
"On the {productname} container host, at the command prompt, move the old "
"certificate directory to a new location:"
msgstr "Pada host kontainer {productname}, di prompt perintah, pindahkan direktori sertifikat lama ke lokasi baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"
msgstr "mgrctl exec -- mv /root/ssl-build /root/old-ssl-build\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:21
msgid "Generate a new CA certificate:"
msgstr "Buat sertifikat CA baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA "
"Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-ca --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-common-name=\"SUSE Manager CA Certificate\" \\\n"
"--set-email=\"name@example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:23
msgid "Generate a new server certificate:"
msgstr "Buat sertifikat server baru:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" "
"--set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl exec -ti -- 'rhn-ssl-tool --gen-server --dir=\"/root/ssl-build\" --set-country=\"COUNTRY\" \\\n"
"--set-state=\"STATE\" --set-city=\"CITY\" --set-org=\"ORGANIZATION\" \\\n"
"--set-org-unit=\"ORGANIZATION UNIT\" --set-email=\"name@example.com\" \\\n"
"--set-hostname=\"susemanager.example.top\" --set-cname=\"example.com\"'\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc:26
msgid ""
"You need to generate a server certificate also for each proxy, using their "
"hostnames and cnames."
msgstr "Anda juga perlu membuat sertifikat server untuk setiap proxy menggunakan nama host dan cname masing-masing."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "SSL Certificates"
msgstr "Sertifikat SSL"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} uses SSL certificates to ensure that clients are registered to "
"the correct server."
msgstr "{productname} menggunakan sertifikat SSL untuk memastikan bahwa klien terdaftar pada server yang benar."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Every client that uses SSL to register to the {productname} Server checks "
"that it is connecting to the right server by validating against a server "
"certificate.  This process is called an SSL handshake."
msgstr "Setiap klien yang menggunakan SSL untuk mendaftar ke Server {productname} memeriksa apakah klien tersebut terhubung ke server yang benar dengan melakukan validasi terhadap sertifikat server.  Proses ini disebut SSL handshake."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"During the SSL handshake, the client checks that the hostname in the server "
"certificate matches what it expects.  The client also needs to check if the "
"server certificate is trusted."
msgstr "Selama SSL handshake, klien memeriksa apakah nama host dalam sertifikat server sesuai dengan yang diharapkan.  Klien juga perlu memeriksa apakah sertifikat server tepercaya."

#. Every {productname} Server that uses SSL requires an SSL server certificate.
#. Provide the path to the server certificate using the `SERVER_CERT` environment variable during setup, or with the `--from-server-cert` option of the `rhn-ssl-tool` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Certificate authorities (CAs) are certificates that are used to sign other "
"certificates.  All certificates must be signed by a certificate authority "
"(CA) in order for them to be considered valid, and for clients to be able to "
"successfully match against them."
msgstr "Otoritas sertifikat (CA) adalah sertifikat yang digunakan untuk menandatangani sertifikat lain.  Semua sertifikat harus ditandatangani oleh otoritas sertifikat (CA) agar dianggap valid dan agar klien dapat berhasil melakukan pencocokan terhadap sertifikat tersebut."

#. When an organization signs its own certificate, the certificate is considered self-signed.
#. A self-signed certificate is straight-forward to set up, and does not cost any money, but they are considered less secure.
#. If you are using a self-signed certificate, you have a root CA that is signed with itself.
#. When you look at the details of a root CA, you can see that the subject has the same value as the issuer.
#. Provide the path to your root CA certificate using the `CA_CERT` environment variable during setup, or with the `--ca-cert` option of the `rhn-ssl-tool` command.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"In order for SSL authentication to work correctly, the client must trust the "
"root CA.  This means that the root CA must be installed on every client."
msgstr "Agar autentikasi SSL berfungsi dengan benar, klien harus memercayai CA akar.  Artinya, CA akar harus diinstal pada setiap klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"The default method of SSL authentication is for {productname} to use "
"self-signed certificates.  In this case, {productname} has generated all the "
"certificates, and the root CA has signed the server certificate directly."
msgstr "Metode autentikasi SSL default pada {productname} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri.  Dalam hal ini, {productname} telah menghasilkan semua sertifikat, dan CA akar telah menandatangani sertifikat server secara langsung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"An alternative method is to use an intermediate CA.  In this case, the root "
"CA signs the intermediate CA.  The intermediate CA can then sign any number "
"of other intermediate CAs, and the final one signs the server certificate.  "
"This is referred to as a chained certificate."
msgstr "Metode alternatifnya adalah menggunakan CA perantara.  Dalam hal ini, CA akar menandatangani CA perantara.  CA perantara kemudian dapat menandatangani sejumlah CA perantara lainnya, dan CA perantara terakhir menandatangani sertifikat server.  Ini disebut sertifikat berantai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If you are using intermediate CAs in a chained certificate, the root CA is "
"installed on the client, and the server certificate is installed on the "
"server.  During the SSL handshake, clients must be able to verify the entire "
"chain of intermediate certificates between the root CA and the server "
"certificate, so they must be able to access all the intermediate "
"certificates."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan CA perantara dalam sertifikat berantai, CA akar diinstal pada klien, sedangkan sertifikat server diinstal pada server. Selama SSL handshake, klien harus dapat memverifikasi seluruh rantai sertifikat perantara antara CA akar dan sertifikat server, sehingga klien harus dapat mengakses semua sertifikat perantara."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"There are two main ways of achieving this.  In older versions of "
"{productname}, by default, all the intermediate CAs are installed on the "
"client.  However, you could also configure your services on the server to "
"provide them to the client.  In this case, during the SSL handshake, the "
"server presents the server certificate as well as all the intermediate CAs.  "
"This mechanism is used now as the default configuration."
msgstr "Ada dua cara utama untuk melakukannya.  Pada versi {productname} yang lebih lama, semua CA perantara diinstal pada klien secara default.  Namun, Anda juga dapat mengonfigurasi layanan pada server untuk menyediakannya kepada klien.  Dalam hal ini, selama SSL handshake, server menyajikan sertifikat server beserta semua CA perantara.  Mekanisme ini kini digunakan sebagai konfigurasi default."

#. Whichever method you choose, you must ensure that the `CA_CERT` environment variable points to the root CA, and all intermediate CAs.
#. It should not contain the server certificate.
#. The server certificate must be defined at the `SERVER_CERT` environment variable.
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:11
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} uses a self-signed certificate without "
"intermediate CAs.  For additional security, you can arrange a third party CA "
"to sign your certificates.  Third party CAs perform checks to ensure that "
"the information contained in the certificate is correct.  They usually "
"charge an annual fee for this service.  Using a third party CA makes "
"certificates harder to spoof, and provides additional protection for your "
"installation.  If you have certificates signed by a third party CA, you can "
"import them to your {productname} installation."
msgstr "Secara default, {productname} menggunakan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri tanpa CA perantara.  Untuk keamanan tambahan, Anda dapat meminta CA pihak ketiga untuk menandatangani sertifikat Anda.  CA pihak ketiga melakukan pemeriksaan untuk memastikan bahwa informasi yang tercantum dalam sertifikat benar.  Mereka biasanya mengenakan biaya tahunan untuk layanan ini.  Penggunaan CA pihak ketiga membuat sertifikat lebih sulit dipalsukan dan memberikan perlindungan tambahan bagi instalasi Anda.  Jika Anda memiliki sertifikat yang ditandatangani oleh CA pihak ketiga, Anda dapat mengimpornya ke instalasi {productname} Anda."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:12
msgid "This manual describe the use of SSL certificates in two steps:"
msgstr "Panduan ini menjelaskan penggunaan sertifikat SSL dalam dua langkah:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:13
msgid "How to create a self-signed certificate with {productname} tools"
msgstr "Cara membuat sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri dengan alat {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:14
msgid "How to deploy a certificate on {productname} Server or Proxy"
msgstr "Cara menerapkan sertifikat pada Server atau Proxy {productname}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:15
msgid ""
"In case the certificates are provided by a third party instance like an own "
"or external PKI, step 1 can be skipped."
msgstr "Jika sertifikat disediakan oleh pihak ketiga, seperti PKI milik sendiri atau eksternal, langkah 1 dapat dilewati."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:16
msgid ""
"For more information about creating self-signed certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pembuatan sertifikat yang ditandatangani sendiri, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-selfsigned.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:17
msgid ""
"For more information about importing certificates, see "
"xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengimporan sertifikat, lihat xref:administration:ssl-certs-imported.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/ssl-certs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Providing SSL certificates to the {productname} containers"
msgstr "Menyediakan sertifikat SSL untuk kontainer {productname}"

