msgid ""
"For secure mail communication, you can enable authentication, define "
"username and password, and enable `SSL` or `STARTLS` in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Untuk komunikasi email yang aman, Anda dapat mengaktifkan autentikasi, menentukan nama pengguna dan kata sandi, serta mengaktifkan `SSL` atau `STARTLS` di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_server = string (default: localhost)\n"
"java.smtp_port = integer (default: 25)\n"
"java.smtp_auth = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_ssl = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_starttls = true/false (default: false)\n"
"java.smtp_user = string (default: null)\n"
"java.smtp_pass = string (default: null)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To increase the connection timeout for SMTP server communication, the "
"following parameters can be set in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Untuk memperpanjang batas waktu koneksi dalam komunikasi dengan server SMTP, parameter berikut dapat ditetapkan di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mail.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
msgstr ""
"java.smtp_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_connection_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"
"java.smtp_write_timeout = integer (default: 5000)\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Mass Machine_id Duplication"
msgstr "Duplikasi Machine_id secara Massal"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:2
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If you are using {productname} to manage virtual machines, you might find it "
"useful to create clones of your VMs.  A clone is a VM that uses a primary "
"disk that is an exact copy of an existing disk."
msgstr "Jika Anda menggunakan {productname} untuk mengelola mesin virtual, Anda mungkin merasa terbantu dengan membuat klon VM Anda.  Klon adalah VM yang menggunakan disk utama berupa salinan persis dari disk yang sudah ada."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:3
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While cloning VMs can save you a lot of time, the duplicated identifying "
"information on the disk can sometimes cause problems."
msgstr "Meskipun kloning VM dapat menghemat banyak waktu, informasi identitas yang terduplikasi pada disk terkadang dapat menimbulkan masalah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you try to register two machine where one is the clone of the other, you "
"probably want {productname} to register them as two separate clients.  "
"However, if the machine ID in both the original client and the clone is the "
"same, {productname} registers both clients as one system, and the data is "
"overwritten one the second machine is registered."
msgstr "Jika Anda mencoba mendaftarkan dua mesin dan salah satunya merupakan klon dari mesin lainnya, Anda mungkin ingin {productname} mendaftarkannya sebagai dua klien terpisah.  Namun, jika ID mesin pada klien asli dan klonnya sama, {productname} mendaftarkan kedua klien sebagai satu sistem, dan data ditimpa saat mesin kedua didaftarkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients.  For more "
"information and instructions on how to change machine ID, see "
"xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."
msgstr "Hal ini dapat diatasi dengan mengubah ID mesin klon agar {productname} mengenalinya sebagai dua klien yang berbeda.  Untuk informasi dan petunjuk selengkapnya tentang cara mengubah ID mesin, lihat xref:administration:troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:6
msgid ""
"However, in some situations, it is neither feasible nor practical to change "
"the machine ID on all systems, as this could disrupt other applications that "
"depend on the existing machine IDs. In those cases, a option is available "
"where a fake machine ID is generated to be used in the context of "
"{productname}."
msgstr "Namun, dalam beberapa situasi, mengubah ID mesin pada semua sistem tidak memungkinkan atau tidak praktis karena dapat mengganggu aplikasi lain yang bergantung pada ID mesin yang ada. Dalam kasus tersebut, tersedia opsi untuk menghasilkan ID mesin semu yang digunakan dalam konteks {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Generating machine ID for {productname} at registration time"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menghasilkan ID mesin untuk {productname} saat pendaftaran"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Create a Bootstrap script (skip this step if you already have it)  For more "
"information, see xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."
msgstr "Buat skrip bootstrap (lewati langkah ini jika Anda sudah memilikinya). Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat xref:client-configuration:registration-bootstrap.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:9
msgid "Open the file and change the parameter:"
msgstr "Buka berkas dan ubah parameter berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"
msgstr "GENERATE_OWN_MACHINEID=1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mass-duplication-machine_id.adoc:11
msgid "Start using your bootstrap strict, and machine ID will not collide anymore."
msgstr "Mulailah menggunakan skrip bootstrap Anda, dan ID mesin tidak akan lagi berkonflik."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /tmp with noexec"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Pemasangan /tmp dengan noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt runs remote commands from `/tmp` on the client's file system.  "
"Therefore you must not mount `/tmp` with the `noexec` option.  The other way "
"to solve this issue is to override temporary directory path with the "
"`TMPDIR` environment variable specified for the Salt service to make it "
"pointing to the directory with no `noexec` option set.  It is recommended to "
"use systemd drop-in configuration file "
"`/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` if Salt "
"Bundle is used, or "
"`/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` if `salt-minion` "
"is used on the client.  The example of the drop-in configuration file "
"content:"
msgstr "Salt menjalankan perintah jarak jauh dari `/tmp` pada sistem berkas klien.  Oleh karena itu, Anda tidak boleh memasang `/tmp` dengan opsi `noexec`.  Cara lain untuk mengatasi masalah ini adalah dengan mengganti jalur direktori sementara melalui variabel lingkungan `TMPDIR` yang ditetapkan untuk layanan Salt agar mengarah ke direktori yang tidak menggunakan opsi `noexec`.  Sebaiknya gunakan berkas konfigurasi drop-in systemd `/etc/systemd/system/venv-salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` jika menggunakan Salt Bundle, atau `/etc/systemd/system/salt-minion.service.d/10-TMPDIR.conf` jika menggunakan `salt-minion` pada klien.  Contoh isi berkas konfigurasi drop-in:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-tmp-with-noexec.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"
msgstr ""
"[Service]\n"
"Environment=TMPDIR=/var/tmp\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Mounting /var/tmp with noexec"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Pemasangan /var/tmp dengan noexec"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-mounting-vartmp-with-noexec.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Salt SSH is using `/var/tmp` to deploy Salt Bundle to and execute Salt "
"commands on the client with the bundled Python.  Therefore you must not "
"mount `/var/tmp` with the `noexec` option.  It is not possible to bootstrap "
"the clients, which have `/var/tmp` mounted with `noexec` option, with the "
"{webui} because the bootstrap process is using Salt SSH to reach a client."
msgstr "Salt SSH menggunakan `/var/tmp` untuk menempatkan Salt Bundle dan menjalankan perintah Salt pada klien dengan Python yang disertakan dalam bundel.  Oleh karena itu, Anda tidak boleh memasang `/var/tmp` dengan opsi `noexec`.  Klien yang memasang `/var/tmp` dengan opsi `noexec` tidak dapat di-bootstrap melalui {webui} karena proses bootstrap menggunakan Salt SSH untuk mengakses klien."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Not Enough Disk Space"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Kekurangan Ruang Disk"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Check the available disk space before you begin migration.  We recommend "
"locating `/var/spacewalk` and `/var/lib/pgsql` on separate XFS file systems."
msgstr "Periksa ruang disk yang tersedia sebelum memulai migrasi.  Kami menyarankan agar `/var/spacewalk` dan `/var/lib/pgsql` ditempatkan pada sistem berkas XFS yang terpisah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When you are setting up a separate file system, edit `/etc/fstab` and remove "
"the `/var/lib/pqsql` subvolume.  Reboot the server to pick up the changes."
msgstr "Saat menyiapkan sistem berkas terpisah, edit `/etc/fstab` dan hapus subvolume `/var/lib/pqsql`.  Mulai ulang server untuk menerapkan perubahan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-not-enough-disk-space.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To get more information about an upgrade problem, check the migration log "
"file.  The log file is located at `/var/log/rhn/migration.log` on the system "
"you are upgrading."
msgstr "Untuk memperoleh informasi selengkapnya tentang masalah peningkatan versi, periksa berkas log migrasi.  Berkas log terletak di `/var/log/rhn/migration.log` pada sistem yang sedang Anda tingkatkan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Notifications"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Notifikasi"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The default lifetime of notification messages is 30 days, after which "
"messages are deleted from the database, regardless of read status.  To "
"change this value, add or edit this line in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Masa berlaku default pesan notifikasi adalah 30 hari. Setelah itu, pesan dihapus dari basis data, terlepas dari status sudah dibaca atau belum.  Untuk mengubah nilai ini, tambahkan atau edit baris berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"
msgstr "java.notifications_lifetime = 30\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To enable or disable a notification type, add or edit a line as follows in "
"`/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkan jenis notifikasi, tambahkan atau edit baris berikut di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"
msgstr ""
"java.notifications_type_disabled = OnboardingFailed,ChannelSyncFailed,\\\n"
"  ChannelSyncFinished,CreateBootstrapRepoFailed,StateApplyFailed,\\\n"
"  PaygAuthenticationUpdateFailed,EndOfLifePeriod,SubscriptionWarning\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-notifications.adoc:6
msgid ""
"For default settings and configuration options, see the "
"`usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf` template file."
msgstr "Untuk pengaturan default dan opsi konfigurasi, lihat berkas templat `usr/share/rhn/config-defaults/rhn_java.conf`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting OES repositories enablement"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Pengaktifan Repositori OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:2
msgid ""
"To enable Open Enterprise Server (OES) on {productname} Server, follow the "
"procedure described."
msgstr "Untuk mengaktifkan Open Enterprise Server (OES) pada Server {productname}, ikuti prosedur yang dijelaskan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enabling OES repositories"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan Repositori OES"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:4
msgid "Ensure you have mirror credentials from Microfocus with access to OES."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki kredensial mirror dari Microfocus dengan akses ke OES."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:5
msgid "Log in to {productname} Server."
msgstr "Masuk ke Server {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:6
msgid "Go to `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`."
msgstr "Buka `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:7
msgid "Make sure you already have SUSE credentials for {productname}."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda sudah memiliki kredensial SUSE untuk {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:8
msgid "Select option for adding new and type in Microfocus credentials."
msgstr "Pilih opsi untuk menambahkan kredensial baru, lalu masukkan kredensial Microfocus."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Go to `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials` and wait for the "
"refresh operation to complete."
msgstr "Buka `Admin > Setup Wizard > Organization Credentials` dan tunggu hingga proses penyegaran selesai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:10
msgid ""
"OES should be visible on the refreshed product list.  You can now enable it "
"like any other products."
msgstr "OES seharusnya terlihat dalam daftar produk yang telah disegarkan.  Anda kini dapat mengaktifkannya seperti produk lainnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-oes-repos-enablement.adoc:11
msgid ""
"For more information about OES, see "
"https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang OES, lihat https://www.microfocus.com/documentation/open-enterprise-server/."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Package Inconsistencies"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Ketidakkonsistenan Paket"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:2
msgid ""
"When packages on a client are locked, {productname} Server may not be able "
"to correctly determine the set of applicable patches.  When this occurs, "
"package updates are available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the "
"client, and attempts to update the client fail.  Check package locks and "
"exclude lists to determine if packages are locked or excluded on the client."
msgstr "Jika paket pada klien dikunci, Server {productname} mungkin tidak dapat menentukan kumpulan patch yang berlaku dengan benar.  Saat hal ini terjadi, pembaruan paket tersedia di {webui}, tetapi tidak muncul pada klien, dan upaya memperbarui klien gagal.  Periksa penguncian paket dan daftar pengecualian untuk menentukan apakah paket dikunci atau dikecualikan pada klien."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:3
msgid ""
"On the client, check package locks and exclude lists to determine if "
"packages are locked or excluded:"
msgstr "Pada klien, periksa penguncian paket dan daftar pengecualian untuk menentukan apakah paket dikunci atau dikecualikan:"

#.  SUSE Liberty Linux not available at Uyuni for now
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On an Expanded Support Platform, check `/etc/yum.conf` and search for "
"`exclude=`."
msgstr "Pada Expanded Support Platform, periksa `/etc/yum.conf` dan cari `exclude=`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-packages.adoc:5
msgid "On {sle} and {opensuse}, use the `zypper locks` command."
msgstr "Pada {sle} dan {opensuse}, gunakan perintah `zypper locks`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Passing Grains to a Start Event"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Penerusan Grain ke Peristiwa Mulai"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Every time a Salt client starts, it passes the `machine_id` grain to "
"{productname}. {productname} uses this grain to determine if the client is "
"registered.  This process requires a synchronous Salt call. Synchronous Salt "
"calls block other processes, so if you have a lot of clients start at the "
"same time, the process could create significant delays."
msgstr "Setiap kali klien Salt dimulai, klien meneruskan grain `machine_id` ke {productname}. {productname} menggunakan grain ini untuk menentukan apakah klien terdaftar.  Proses ini memerlukan panggilan Salt sinkron. Panggilan Salt sinkron memblokir proses lain, sehingga jika banyak klien dimulai secara bersamaan, proses ini dapat menimbulkan penundaan yang signifikan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To overcome this problem, a new feature has been introduced in Salt to avoid "
"making a separate synchronous Salt call."
msgstr "Untuk mengatasi masalah ini, fitur baru telah diperkenalkan dalam Salt agar tidak perlu melakukan panggilan Salt sinkron secara terpisah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To use this feature, you can add a configuration parameter to the client "
"configuration, on clients that support it."
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan fitur ini, Anda dapat menambahkan parameter konfigurasi ke konfigurasi klien pada klien yang mendukungnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To make this process easier, you can use the `mgr_start_event_grains.sls` "
"helper Salt state."
msgstr "Untuk mempermudah proses ini, Anda dapat menggunakan state Salt pembantu `mgr_start_event_grains.sls`."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:6
msgid ""
"This only applies to already registered clients.  If you registered your "
"Salt client recently, this config parameter is added by default."
msgstr "Hal ini hanya berlaku untuk klien yang sudah terdaftar.  Jika Anda baru saja mendaftarkan klien Salt, parameter konfigurasi ini ditambahkan secara default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:7
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, at the command prompt, use this command to "
"enable the `start_event_grains` configuration helper:"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, di prompt perintah, gunakan perintah ini untuk mengaktifkan pembantu konfigurasi `start_event_grains`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt '*' state.sls util.mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:9
msgid ""
"This command adds the required configuration into the client's configuration "
"file, and applies it when the client is restarted.  If you have a large "
"number of clients, you can execute the command in batch mode instead:"
msgstr "Perintah ini menambahkan konfigurasi yang diperlukan ke berkas konfigurasi klien dan menerapkannya saat klien dimulai ulang.  Jika Anda memiliki banyak klien, Anda dapat menjalankan perintah dalam mode batch:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-passing-grains-to-start-event.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"
msgstr "salt --batch-size 50 '*' state.sls mgr_start_event_grains\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Proxy Connections and FQDN"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Koneksi Proxy dan FQDN"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes clients connected through a proxy appear in the {webui}, but do "
"not show that they are connected through a proxy.  This can occur if you are "
"not using the fully qualified domain name (FQDN) to connect, and the proxy "
"is not known to {productname}."
msgstr "Terkadang, klien yang terhubung melalui proxy muncul di {webui}, tetapi tidak menunjukkan bahwa koneksinya melalui proxy.  Hal ini dapat terjadi jika Anda tidak menggunakan nama domain yang sepenuhnya memenuhi syarat (FQDN) untuk terhubung, dan proxy tidak dikenali oleh {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:3
msgid ""
"To correct this behavior, specify additional FQDNs based on the "
"configuration file location used:"
msgstr "Untuk memperbaiki perilaku ini, tentukan FQDN tambahan berdasarkan lokasi berkas konfigurasi yang digunakan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"When placing a configuration file in the `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/` "
"directory, specify the top-level `grains` block:"
msgstr "Saat menempatkan berkas konfigurasi di direktori `/etc/venv-salt-minion/minion.d/`, tentukan blok `grains` tingkat teratas:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"
msgstr ""
"grains:\n"
"  susemanager:\n"
"    custom_fqdns:\n"
"      - name.one\n"
"      - name.two\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Alternatively, when using `/etc/venv-salt-minion/grains` directly, omit the "
"`grains:` line because the filename itself acts as the parent grain name:"
msgstr "Sebagai alternatif, saat menggunakan `/etc/venv-salt-minion/grains` secara langsung, hilangkan baris `grains:` karena nama berkas itu sendiri berfungsi sebagai nama grain induk:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-proxy-connections-and-fqdns.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"susemanager:\n"
"  custom_fqdns:\n"
"    - proxy.example.com\n"
"    - proxy-alias.example.com\n"
msgstr ""
"susemanager:\n"
"  custom_fqdns:\n"
"    - proxy.example.com\n"
"    - proxy-alias.example.com\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registration from {webui} fails and does not show any errors"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Pendaftaran dari {webui} yang Gagal Tanpa Menampilkan Kesalahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For the initial registration from the {webui}, all Salt clients are using "
"Salt SSH."
msgstr "Untuk pendaftaran awal dari {webui}, semua klien Salt menggunakan Salt SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:3
msgid ""
"Because of its nature, Salt SSH clients do not report errors back to the "
"server."
msgstr "Karena karakteristiknya, klien Salt SSH tidak melaporkan kesalahan kembali ke server."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-reg-from-webui-fails-no-errors.adoc:4
msgid ""
"However, the Salt SSH clients store a log locally at `/var/log/salt-ssh.log` "
"that can be inspected for errors."
msgstr "Namun, klien Salt SSH menyimpan log secara lokal di `/var/log/salt-ssh.log` yang dapat diperiksa untuk menemukan kesalahan."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Registering Cloned Clients"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Pendaftaran Klien Hasil Kloning"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If you have a client that is already registered, you create a clone of that "
"client, and then try and register the clone, you probably want {productname} "
"to register them as two separate clients.  However, if the machine ID in "
"both the original client and the clone is the same, {productname} registers "
"both clients as one system, and the existing client data is overwritten with "
"that of the clone."
msgstr "Jika Anda memiliki klien yang sudah terdaftar, membuat klon dari klien tersebut, lalu mencoba mendaftarkan klonnya, Anda mungkin ingin {productname} mendaftarkannya sebagai dua klien terpisah.  Namun, jika ID mesin pada klien asli dan klonnya sama, {productname} mendaftarkan kedua klien sebagai satu sistem, dan data klien yang sudah ada ditimpa dengan data klon."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:5
msgid ""
"This can be resolved by changing the machine ID of the clone, so that "
"{productname} recognizes them as two different clients."
msgstr "Hal ini dapat diatasi dengan mengubah ID mesin klon agar {productname} mengenalinya sebagai dua klien yang berbeda."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:6
msgid ""
"Each step of this procedure is performed on the cloned client.  This "
"procedure does not manipulate the original client, which remains registered "
"to {productname}."
msgstr "Setiap langkah dalam prosedur ini dilakukan pada klien hasil kloning.  Prosedur ini tidak mengubah klien asli, yang tetap terdaftar di {productname}."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs in Cloned Salt Clients"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengatasi ID Mesin Duplikat pada Klien Salt Hasil Kloning"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Initial System Configuration*\n"
msgstr "*Konfigurasi Sistem Awal*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:9
msgid "On the cloned machine, change the hostname and IP addresses."
msgstr "Pada mesin hasil kloning, ubah nama host dan alamat IP."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Make sure `/etc/hosts` contains the changes you made and the correct host "
"entries."
msgstr "Pastikan `/etc/hosts` memuat perubahan yang Anda lakukan dan entri host yang benar."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Resolving Duplicate Machine IDs*\n"
msgstr "*Mengatasi ID Mesin Duplikat*\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:12
msgid "_For distributions that support systemd:_"
msgstr "_Untuk distribusi yang mendukung systemd:_"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:13
msgid ""
"If your machines have the same machine ID, as root, delete the files on each "
"duplicated client and re-create it:"
msgstr "Jika mesin Anda memiliki ID mesin yang sama, sebagai root, hapus berkas pada setiap klien duplikat dan buat ulang ID mesin:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
"systemd-machine-id-setup\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:15
msgid ""
"If the cloned machine also has a folder in `/var/log/journal/` it needs to "
"be renamed accordingly to the new machine ID. If names do not match, "
"`journalctl` could not retrieve any log and `podman logs` would not show "
"anything."
msgstr "Jika mesin hasil kloning juga memiliki folder di `/var/log/journal/`, folder tersebut perlu diganti namanya agar sesuai dengan ID mesin baru. Jika namanya tidak cocok, `journalctl` tidak dapat mengambil log apa pun dan `podman logs` tidak akan menampilkan apa pun."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"
msgstr "mv /var/log/journal/* /var/log/journal/$(cat /etc/machine-id)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:17
msgid "_For distributions that do not support systemd:_"
msgstr "_Untuk distribusi yang tidak mendukung systemd:_"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:18
msgid "As root, generate a machine ID from dbus:"
msgstr "Sebagai root, hasilkan ID mesin dari dbus:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /var/lib/dbus/machine-id\n"
"rm /var/lib/zypp/AnonymousUniqueId\n"
"dbus-uuidgen --ensure\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:20
msgid ""
"If you are cloning a {rhel} 8.10 server that will later be liberated to "
"{sll}, you must perform extra steps to fix the kernel configuration files."
msgstr "Jika Anda mengkloning server {rhel} 8.10 yang nantinya akan dimigrasikan ke {sll}, Anda harus melakukan langkah tambahan untuk memperbaiki berkas konfigurasi kernel."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:21
msgid ""
"{rhel} uses the machine ID to generate kernel entries in "
"`/boot/loader/entries`.  Not performing these steps will result in a mix of "
"old and new kernel entries after the liberation, as {sll} kernels will "
"create new entries instead of replacing the old ones."
msgstr "{rhel} menggunakan ID mesin untuk membuat entri kernel di `/boot/loader/entries`.  Jika langkah-langkah ini tidak dilakukan, setelah migrasi akan terdapat campuran entri kernel lama dan baru, karena kernel {sll} akan membuat entri baru alih-alih mengganti entri lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:22
msgid "After changing the machine ID and before liberating, run:"
msgstr "Setelah mengubah ID mesin dan sebelum melakukan migrasi, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do "
"echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver "
"/lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo rm -rf /boot/loader/entries/\n"
"sudo for ver in $(rpm -q kernel --qf '%{VERSION}-%{RELEASE}.%{ARCH}\\n'); do echo \"Reinstalling kernel $ver...\"; sudo kernel-install add $ver /lib/modules/$ver; done\n"
"sudo grub2-mkconfig -o /boot/efi/EFI/redhat/grub.cfg\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:24
msgid ""
"For more information and example on liberating {rhel} 8.10 server, see "
"xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi dan contoh selengkapnya tentang migrasi server {rhel} 8.10, lihat xref:common-workflows:workflow-liberate-rhel-with-secureboot.adoc[]."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Reconfiguring {salt} Clients*\n"
msgstr "*Mengonfigurasi Ulang Klien {salt}*\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:26
msgid ""
"If your clients still have the same Salt client ID, delete the `minion_id` "
"file on each client (FQDN is used when it is regenerated on client restart)."
msgstr "Jika klien Anda masih memiliki ID klien Salt yang sama, hapus berkas `minion_id` pada setiap klien (FQDN digunakan saat berkas dibuat ulang ketika klien dimulai ulang)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:27
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:32
msgid "For Salt Minion clients:"
msgstr "Untuk klien Salt Minion:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/salt/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/salt/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:29
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:34
msgid "For Salt Bundle clients:"
msgstr "Untuk klien Salt Bundle:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"
msgstr ""
"rm /etc/venv-salt-minion/minion_id\n"
"rm -rf /etc/venv-salt-minion/pki\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Delete accepted keys from the onboarding page and the system profile from "
"{productname}, and restart the client with."
msgstr "Hapus kunci yang telah diterima dari halaman pendaftaran dan profil sistem dari {productname}, lalu mulai ulang klien dengan perintah berikut."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "service salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"
msgstr "service venv-salt-minion restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-registerclones.adoc:36
msgid ""
"Re-register the clients.  Each client now has a different `/etc/machine-id` "
"and should be correctly displayed on the `System Overview` page."
msgstr "Daftarkan ulang klien.  Setiap klien kini memiliki `/etc/machine-id` yang berbeda dan seharusnya ditampilkan dengan benar pada halaman `System Overview`."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remote root login on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Login root jarak jauh pada {sl-micro}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:2
msgid ""
"For enhanced security, new installations of {sl-micro} 6.2 and later do not "
"allow password-based remote root login anymore, which affects server and "
"proxy container hosts running on {sl-micro} and managed {sl-micro} clients.  "
"Also, {sle-micro} 5.5 clients with password-based remote root login which "
"will when be migrated to 6.1/6.2 will suddenly lose this access and must be "
"newly configured.  For more information, see SL Micro Release Notes 6.2 "
"(https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."
msgstr "Untuk meningkatkan keamanan, instalasi baru {sl-micro} 6.2 dan versi yang lebih baru tidak lagi mengizinkan login root jarak jauh berbasis kata sandi. Hal ini memengaruhi host kontainer server dan proxy yang berjalan pada {sl-micro}, serta klien {sl-micro} yang dikelola.  Selain itu, klien {sle-micro} 5.5 dengan login root jarak jauh berbasis kata sandi akan kehilangan akses ini saat dimigrasikan ke 6.1/6.2 dan harus dikonfigurasi ulang.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya, lihat Catatan Rilis SL Micro 6.2 (https://documentation.suse.com/releasenotes/sle-micro/html/releasenotes_sle-micro_6.2/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:3
msgid ""
"While deploying components of {productname} such as a {productname} Proxy, "
"by default, password-based remote root login is required.  You can enable "
"password-based remote root login with the following steps."
msgstr "Saat menerapkan komponen {productname}, seperti Proxy {productname}, login root jarak jauh berbasis kata sandi diperlukan secara default.  Anda dapat mengaktifkan login root jarak jauh berbasis kata sandi dengan langkah-langkah berikut."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Enable SSH root login with a password on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengaktifkan Login Root SSH dengan Kata Sandi pada {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:5
msgid ""
"You can enable SSH root login in two different ways.  Either of them will "
"work; choose the one that best fits your setup."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengaktifkan login root SSH dengan dua cara.  Keduanya dapat digunakan; pilih cara yang paling sesuai dengan konfigurasi Anda."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option A: Use the preconfigured package"
msgstr "Opsi A: Menggunakan paket yang telah dikonfigurasi sebelumnya"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Install the package `openssh-server-config-rootlogin` from the UI/API on the "
"client."
msgstr "Instal paket `openssh-server-config-rootlogin` pada klien melalui UI/API."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Reboot the container host to activate the new configuration either from UI "
"or from terminal"
msgstr "Mulai ulang host kontainer untuk mengaktifkan konfigurasi baru, baik melalui UI maupun terminal"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option B: Edit the SSH configuration manually"
msgstr "Opsi B: Mengedit konfigurasi SSH secara manual"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Add a drop-in config `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf` file, with "
"the following content:"
msgstr "Tambahkan berkas konfigurasi drop-in `/etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/permit_root.conf` dengan isi berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "PermitRootLogin yes\n"
msgstr "PermitRootLogin yes\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:12
msgid "Reload the SSH server configuration"
msgstr "Muat ulang konfigurasi server SSH"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl reload sshd\n"
msgstr "systemctl reload sshd\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If connected using SSH, before disconnecting from the server, validate the "
"SSH server is working correctly by opening a new SSH connection."
msgstr "Jika terhubung menggunakan SSH, sebelum memutuskan koneksi dari server, pastikan server SSH berfungsi dengan benar dengan membuka koneksi SSH baru."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-remote-root-on-micro.adoc:15
msgid ""
"For more information about `transactional-update`, see "
"https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang `transactional-update`, lihat https://documentation.suse.com/sle-micro/6.2/html/Micro-transactional-updates/index.html."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing BTRFS"
msgstr "Mengubah Ukuran BTRFS"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS LVM partition on {sles}"
msgstr "Mengubah ukuran partisi LVM BTRFS pada {sles}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When managing a {sles} installation, the BTRFS root file system can become "
"full due to files, caches, or snapshots.  Because removing snapshots "
"manually is not recommended, the best approach is to resize the partition."
msgstr "Saat mengelola instalasi {sles}, sistem berkas root BTRFS dapat menjadi penuh akibat berkas, cache, atau snapshot.  Karena penghapusan snapshot secara manual tidak disarankan, pendekatan terbaik adalah mengubah ukuran partisi."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resize a BTRFS partition, the partition must remain mounted during this "
"procedure."
msgstr "Untuk mengubah ukuran partisi BTRFS, partisi harus tetap terpasang selama prosedur ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:5
msgid ""
"The following steps illustrate how to resize a BTRFS LVM partition by adding "
"a new disk (for example, `/dev/sdb`) to the volume group."
msgstr "Langkah-langkah berikut menunjukkan cara mengubah ukuran partisi LVM BTRFS dengan menambahkan disk baru (misalnya, `/dev/sdb`) ke grup volume."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing a BTRFS LVM Partition*"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengubah Ukuran Partisi LVM BTRFS*"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:7
msgid ""
"Check the disk information to identify the root file system device and the "
"new disk using the `lsblk` command:"
msgstr "Periksa informasi disk untuk mengidentifikasi perangkat sistem berkas root dan disk baru menggunakan perintah `lsblk`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "lsblk\n"
msgstr "lsblk\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:9
msgid "Create a physical volume on the newly added disk:"
msgstr "Buat volume fisik pada disk yang baru ditambahkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "pvcreate /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:11
msgid "Scan for the current volume group that the root file system is using:"
msgstr "Pindai grup volume yang saat ini digunakan oleh sistem berkas root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgscan\n"
msgstr "vgscan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:13
msgid "Extend the volume group with the newly created physical volume:"
msgstr "Perluas grup volume dengan volume fisik yang baru dibuat:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"
msgstr "vgextend system /dev/sdb\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:15
msgid "Extend the logical volume using the extended volume group:"
msgstr "Perluas volume logis menggunakan grup volume yang telah diperluas:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"
msgstr "lvextend -l +100%FREE /dev/system/root\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:17
msgid "Resize the BTRFS root file system:"
msgstr "Ubah ukuran sistem berkas root BTRFS:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"
msgstr "btrfs filesystem resize max /\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Check the result to verify that the system's root file system has been "
"successfully resized to the new capacity:"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya untuk memastikan bahwa ukuran sistem berkas root telah berhasil diubah ke kapasitas baru:"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Resizing a BTRFS root volume on {sl-micro}"
msgstr "Mengubah ukuran volume root BTRFS pada {sl-micro}"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:22
msgid ""
"When managing a {sle-micro} 5.5 or {sl-micro} 6 installation, the BTRFS root "
"volume may run out of disk space and require resizing."
msgstr "Saat mengelola instalasi {sle-micro} 5.5 atau {sl-micro} 6, volume root BTRFS dapat kehabisan ruang disk dan memerlukan perubahan ukuran."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Attempting to resize the root volume using the standard command `btrfs fi "
"resize max /` will result in the following error:"
msgstr "Upaya mengubah ukuran volume root menggunakan perintah standar `btrfs fi resize max /` akan menghasilkan kesalahan berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"
msgstr "ERROR: unable to resize '/': Read-only file system\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This occurs because the root volume is mounted read-only on {sle-micro} "
"systems.  To successfully complete the operation online, you must target the "
"`/.snapshots` mount point instead, which is mounted read-write."
msgstr "Hal ini terjadi karena volume root dipasang dalam mode hanya baca pada sistem {sle-micro}.  Agar operasi berhasil diselesaikan saat sistem tetap berjalan, Anda harus menargetkan titik pemasangan `/.snapshots`, yang dipasang dalam mode baca-tulis."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:26
msgid "Changes to the partition table can cause damage to the system."
msgstr "Perubahan pada tabel partisi dapat merusak sistem."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Always make sure to have a complete backup before making changes to the "
"partition table."
msgstr "Selalu pastikan Anda memiliki cadangan lengkap sebelum melakukan perubahan pada tabel partisi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:28
msgid ""
"The following procedure illustrates how to resize a single disk where the "
"root partition is the last partition on the device (for example, "
"`/dev/sda3`).  If your layout contains further partitions, the operation may "
"become more complex and you may need to reach out to {scclongform} for "
"support."
msgstr "Prosedur berikut menunjukkan cara mengubah ukuran satu disk yang partisi root-nya merupakan partisi terakhir pada perangkat (misalnya, `/dev/sda3`).  Jika tata letak Anda memiliki partisi lain setelahnya, operasi ini dapat menjadi lebih rumit dan Anda mungkin perlu menghubungi {scclongform} untuk mendapatkan dukungan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resizing the BTRFS root volume"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengubah Ukuran Volume Root BTRFS"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:30
msgid ""
"Resize the existing disk to the new size using the appropriate hypervisor or "
"storage tools for your environment."
msgstr "Ubah ukuran disk yang ada ke ukuran baru menggunakan alat hypervisor atau penyimpanan yang sesuai untuk lingkungan Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Rescan the device to be resized.  For example, to rescan `/dev/sda`, run the "
"following command as root:"
msgstr "Pindai ulang perangkat yang akan diubah ukurannya.  Misalnya, untuk memindai ulang `/dev/sda`, jalankan perintah berikut sebagai root:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"
msgstr "echo 1 > /sys/block/sda/device/rescan\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Resize the root partition using the comamnd `growpart`.  In this example, we "
"resize partition 3 on `/dev/sda`:"
msgstr "Ubah ukuran partisi root menggunakan perintah `growpart`.  Dalam contoh ini, kita mengubah ukuran partisi 3 pada `/dev/sda`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"
msgstr "growpart /dev/sda 3\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:35
msgid ""
"Resize the BTRFS filesystem.  Be sure to use `/.snapshots` instead of `/` to "
"avoid the read-only error:"
msgstr "Ubah ukuran sistem berkas BTRFS.  Pastikan Anda menggunakan `/.snapshots`, bukan `/`, untuk menghindari kesalahan hanya baca:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi resize max /.snapshots\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:37
msgid ""
"Check the filesystem to verify that the new size has been applied "
"successfully:"
msgstr "Periksa sistem berkas untuk memastikan bahwa ukuran baru telah berhasil diterapkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-resizingBtrfs.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "btrfs fi show /\n"
msgstr "btrfs fi show /\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Red Hat CDN Channel and Multiple Certificates"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Channel CDN Red Hat dan Beberapa Sertifikat"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"The {redhat} content delivery network (CDN) channels sometimes provide "
"multiple certificates, but the {productname} {webui} can only import a "
"single certificate.  If CDN presents a certificate that is different to the "
"one the {productname} {webui} knows about, validation fails and permission "
"to access the repository is denied, even though the certificate is "
"accurate.  The error message received is:"
msgstr "Channel jaringan distribusi konten (CDN) {redhat} terkadang menyediakan beberapa sertifikat, tetapi {webui} {productname} hanya dapat mengimpor satu sertifikat.  Jika CDN menyajikan sertifikat yang berbeda dari sertifikat yang dikenali oleh {webui} {productname}, validasi gagal dan akses ke repositori ditolak, meskipun sertifikat tersebut benar.  Pesan kesalahan yang diterima adalah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid "
"repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys "
"are not imported\n"
msgstr ""
"[error]\n"
"Repository '<repo_name>' is invalid.\n"
"<repo.pem> Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
"History:\n"
" - [|] Error trying to read from '<repo.pem>'\n"
" - Permission to access '<repo.pem>' denied.\n"
"Please check if the URIs defined for this repository are pointing to a valid repository.\n"
"Skipping repository '<repo_nam' because of the above error.\n"
"Could not refresh the repositories because of errors.\n"
"HH:MM:SS RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To resolve this issue, merge all valid certificates into a single `.pem` "
"file, and rebuild the certificates for use by {productname}:"
msgstr "Untuk mengatasi masalah ini, gabungkan semua sertifikat yang valid ke dalam satu berkas `.pem`, lalu buat ulang sertifikat untuk digunakan oleh {productname}:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Multiple {redhat} CDN Certificates"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengatasi Beberapa Sertifikat CDN {redhat}"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {redhat} client, at the command prompt, as root, gather all current "
"certificates from `/etc/pki/entitlement/` in a single `rh-cert.pem` file:"
msgstr "Pada klien {redhat}, di prompt perintah, sebagai root, gabungkan semua sertifikat yang ada dari `/etc/pki/entitlement/` ke dalam satu berkas `rh-cert.pem`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem "
"redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087.pem 3539668047766796506.pem redhat-entitlement-authority.pem > rh-cert.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"Gather all current keys from `/etc/pki/entitlement/` in a single "
"`rh-key.pem` file:"
msgstr "Gabungkan semua kunci yang ada dari `/etc/pki/entitlement/` ke dalam satu berkas `rh-key.pem`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"
msgstr "cat 866705146090697087-key.pem 3539668047766796506-key.pem > rh-key.pem\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rh-cdn-channel-and-multiple-certs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can now import the new certificates to the {productname} Server, using "
"the instructions in xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."
msgstr "Anda kini dapat mengimpor sertifikat baru ke Server {productname} menggunakan petunjuk di xref:client-configuration:clients-rh-cdn.adoc[]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting RPC Connection Timeouts"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Batas Waktu Koneksi RPC"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:2
msgid ""
"RPC connections can sometimes time out due to slow networks or a network "
"link going down.  This results in package downloads or batch jobs hanging or "
"taking longer than expected.  You can adjust the maximum time that an RPC "
"connection can take by editing the configuration file.  While this does not "
"resolve networking problems, it does cause a process to fail rather than "
"hang."
msgstr "Koneksi RPC terkadang dapat mengalami batas waktu habis akibat jaringan yang lambat atau terputusnya sambungan jaringan.  Hal ini menyebabkan pengunduhan paket atau tugas batch macet atau memerlukan waktu lebih lama dari yang diharapkan.  Anda dapat menyesuaikan durasi maksimum koneksi RPC dengan mengedit berkas konfigurasi.  Meskipun tidak mengatasi masalah jaringan, pengaturan ini membuat proses gagal alih-alih macet."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving RPC connection timeouts"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengatasi Batas Waktu Koneksi RPC"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:4
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file and set a "
"maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, buka berkas `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` dan tetapkan nilai batas waktu maksimum (dalam detik):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "server.timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "server.timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:6
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Proxy, open the `/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml` file and "
"set a maximum timeout value (in seconds).  The proxy containers need to be "
"restarted for the change to be effective:"
msgstr "Pada Proxy {productname}, buka berkas `/etc/uyuni/proxy/config.yaml` dan tetapkan nilai batas waktu maksimum (dalam detik).  Kontainer proxy perlu dimulai ulang agar perubahan berlaku:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout: `number`\n"
msgstr "timeout: `number`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On a {sles} client that uses zypper, open the `/etc/zypp/zypp.conf` file and "
"set a maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "Pada klien {sles} yang menggunakan zypper, buka berkas `/etc/zypp/zypp.conf` dan tetapkan nilai batas waktu maksimum (dalam detik):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"## Valid values:  [0,3600]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"
msgstr ""
"## Valid values:  [3600][0]\n"
"## Default value: 180\n"
"download.transfer_timeout = 180\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:10
msgid ""
"On a {rhel} client that uses yum, open the `/etc/yum.conf` file and set a "
"maximum timeout value (in seconds):"
msgstr "Pada klien {rhel} yang menggunakan yum, buka berkas `/etc/yum.conf` dan tetapkan nilai batas waktu maksimum (dalam detik):"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "timeout =`number`\n"
msgstr "timeout =`number`\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-rpctimeout.adoc:12
msgid ""
"If you limit RPC timeouts to less than `180` seconds, you risk aborting "
"perfectly normal operations."
msgstr "Jika Anda membatasi waktu koneksi RPC hingga kurang dari `180` detik, Anda berisiko menghentikan operasi yang sebenarnya berjalan normal."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt clients shown as down and DNS settings"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Klien Salt yang Ditampilkan Tidak Aktif dan Pengaturan DNS"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Even if the Salt client is running, actions such as package refresh or apply "
"states can be marked as failed with the message:"
msgstr "Meskipun klien Salt sedang berjalan, tindakan seperti penyegaran paket atau penerapan state dapat ditandai sebagai gagal dengan pesan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid "Minion is down or could not be contacted.\n"
msgstr "Minion tidak aktif atau tidak dapat dihubungi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:4
msgid ""
"In this case try rescheduling the action.  If rescheduling succeeds, the "
"cause of the problem can be a wrong DNS configuration."
msgstr "Dalam kasus ini, coba jadwalkan ulang tindakan.  Jika penjadwalan ulang berhasil, penyebab masalahnya mungkin adalah konfigurasi DNS yang salah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:6
msgid ""
"When the Salt client is restarted, or in case the grains are refreshed, the "
"client calculates its FQDN grains, and it is unresponsive until the grains "
"are proceeded.  When a scheduled action on {productname} Server is going to "
"be executed, {productname} Server performs a `test.ping` to the client "
"before the actual action to ensure the client is actually running and the "
"action can be triggered."
msgstr "Saat klien Salt dimulai ulang atau grain disegarkan, klien menghitung grain FQDN-nya dan tidak responsif hingga grain selesai diproses.  Saat tindakan terjadwal pada Server {productname} akan dijalankan, Server {productname} melakukan `test.ping` ke klien sebelum tindakan sebenarnya untuk memastikan klien benar-benar berjalan dan tindakan dapat dipicu."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:7
msgid ""
"By default, {productname} Server waits for 5 seconds to get the response "
"from `test.ping` command.  If the response is not received within 5 seconds, "
"then the action is set to fail with the message that the client is down or "
"could not be contacted."
msgstr "Secara default, Server {productname} menunggu selama 5 detik untuk menerima respons dari perintah `test.ping`.  Jika respons tidak diterima dalam 5 detik, tindakan ditandai sebagai gagal dengan pesan bahwa klien tidak aktif atau tidak dapat dihubungi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To correct this, fix the DNS resolution on the client, so the client does "
"not get stuck for 5 seconds while solving its FQDN."
msgstr "Untuk mengatasinya, perbaiki resolusi DNS pada klien agar klien tidak tertahan selama 5 detik saat meresolusikan FQDN-nya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:9
msgid ""
"If this is not possible, try to increase the value for "
"`java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` in the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file on the "
"{productname} Server to a value higher than 4."
msgstr "Jika hal ini tidak memungkinkan, coba tingkatkan nilai `java.salt_presence_ping_timeout` dalam berkas `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` pada Server {productname} menjadi lebih dari 4."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"
msgstr ""
"mgrctl term\n"
"vim /etc/rhn/rhn.conf\n"
"java.salt_presence_ping_timeout = 6\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:12
msgid "After that, run:"
msgstr "Setelah itu, jalankan:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-clients-down-and-dns.adoc:14
msgid ""
"Increasing this value will cause {productname} Server to take longer to "
"check if a minion is unreachable or unresponsive, causing the {productname} "
"Server to be slower or less responsive overall."
msgstr "Meningkatkan nilai ini akan membuat Server {productname} memerlukan waktu lebih lama untuk memeriksa apakah minion tidak dapat dijangkau atau tidak responsif, sehingga Server {productname} secara keseluruhan menjadi lebih lambat atau kurang responsif."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Salt SSH known hosts"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Host yang Dikenal oleh Salt SSH"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If a machine or VM is reinstalled with a new SSH key, but the same IP "
"address is used to onboard it, there is a chance that Salt will complain "
"about a \"man-in-the-middle attack\".  This happens because Salt's "
"`.ssh/known_hosts` file still contains the old SSH fingerprint."
msgstr "Jika mesin atau VM diinstal ulang dengan kunci SSH baru, tetapi alamat IP yang sama digunakan untuk mendaftarkannya, Salt mungkin melaporkan \"serangan man-in-the-middle\".  Hal ini terjadi karena berkas `.ssh/known_hosts` Salt masih berisi sidik jari SSH lama."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:3
msgid "To remove a host from this list, run the following command:"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus host dari daftar ini, jalankan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl ssh knownhost remove <hostname>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl ssh knownhost remove <hostname>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:5
msgid ""
"If the host to remove is not using the default SSH port `22`, you can "
"specify the port manually:"
msgstr "Jika host yang akan dihapus tidak menggunakan port SSH default `22`, Anda dapat menentukan port secara manual:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-salt-ssh-known-hosts.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "mgrctl ssh knownhost remove <hostname> <port>\n"
msgstr "mgrctl ssh knownhost remove <hostname> <port>\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Schema Upgrade Fails"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Kegagalan Peningkatan Versi Skema"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:2
msgid ""
"If the schema upgrade fails, the database version check and all the other "
"spacewalk services do not start.  Run `mgradm start` on the container host "
"for more information and hints how to proceed."
msgstr "Jika peningkatan versi skema gagal, pemeriksaan versi basis data dan semua layanan spacewalk lainnya tidak akan dimulai.  Jalankan `mgradm start` pada host kontainer untuk memperoleh informasi selengkapnya dan petunjuk tentang langkah selanjutnya."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:4
msgid "You can also run the version check directly in the container:"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat menjalankan pemeriksaan versi secara langsung di dalam kontainer:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl status uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"
msgstr "journalctl -u uyuni-check-database.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-schema-upgrade-fails.adoc:8
msgid ""
"These commands print debug information if you do not want to run the more "
"general `mgradm` command."
msgstr "Perintah-perintah ini menampilkan informasi debug jika Anda tidak ingin menjalankan perintah `mgradm` yang lebih umum."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Synchronization"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Sinkronisasi"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Synchronization can fail for a number of reasons.  To get more information "
"about a connection problem, run this command:"
msgstr "Sinkronisasi dapat gagal karena sejumlah alasan.  Untuk memperoleh informasi selengkapnya tentang masalah koneksi, jalankan perintah ini:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:3
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > "
"/var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"
msgstr ""
"export URLGRABBER_DEBUG=DEBUG\n"
"spacewalk-repo-sync -c <channelname> <options> > /var/log/spacewalk-repo-sync-$(date +%F-%R).log 2>&1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:4
msgid "You can also check logs created by Zypper at `/var/log/zypper.log`"
msgstr "Anda juga dapat memeriksa log yang dibuat oleh Zypper di `/var/log/zypper.log`"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Mismatch"
msgstr "Ketidakcocokan Kunci GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} does not automatically trust third party GPG keys.  If package "
"synchronization fails, it could be because of an untrusted GPG key.  You can "
"find out if this is the case by opening `/var/log/rhn/reposync` and looking "
"for an error like this:"
msgstr "{productname} tidak secara otomatis memercayai kunci GPG pihak ketiga. Jika sinkronisasi paket gagal, penyebabnya mungkin adalah kunci GPG yang tidak tepercaya.  Anda dapat memastikan apakah ini penyebabnya dengan membuka `/var/log/rhn/reposync` dan mencari kesalahan seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not "
"imported\n"
msgstr ""
"['/usr/bin/spacewalk-repo-sync', '--channel', 'sle-12-sp1-ga-desktop-\n"
"nvidia-driver-x86_64', '--type', 'yum', '--non-interactive']\n"
"RepoMDError: Cannot access repository. Maybe repository GPG keys are not imported\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To resolve the problem, you need to import the GPG key to {productname}.  "
"For more on importing GPG keys, see "
"xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk mengatasi masalah ini, Anda perlu mengimpor kunci GPG ke {productname}.  Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengimporan kunci GPG, lihat xref:administration:repo-metadata.adoc[]."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "GPG Key Removal from `spacewalk-repo-sync`"
msgstr "Penghapusan Kunci GPG dari `spacewalk-repo-sync`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:10
msgid ""
"When a GPG key for repository has been manually imported using "
"`spacewalk-repo-sync`, and this key is no longer needed (for example if the "
"key was compromised, or was used for testing purposes only), it can be "
"removed from the zypper RPM database used by `spacewalk-repo-sync` with the "
"following command:"
msgstr "Jika kunci GPG untuk repositori telah diimpor secara manual menggunakan `spacewalk-repo-sync` dan kunci tersebut tidak lagi diperlukan (misalnya, jika keamanan kunci telah disusupi atau kunci hanya digunakan untuk pengujian), kunci dapat dihapus dari basis data RPM zypper yang digunakan oleh `spacewalk-repo-sync` dengan perintah berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"
msgstr "rpm --dbpath=/var/lib/spacewalk/reposync/root/var/lib/rpm/ -e gpg-pubkey-*\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:12
msgid "where `gpg-pubkey-*` is the name of the GPG key to be removed."
msgstr "dengan `gpg-pubkey-*` sebagai nama kunci GPG yang akan dihapus."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Renewing GPG Key"
msgstr "Memperbarui Kunci GPG"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:14
msgid ""
"If you want to renew a GPG key, first remove the old key, and then generate "
"and import a new one."
msgstr "Jika Anda ingin memperbarui kunci GPG, hapus kunci lama terlebih dahulu, lalu buat dan impor kunci baru."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Checksum Mismatch"
msgstr "Ketidakcocokan Checksum"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:16
msgid ""
"If a checksum has failed, you might see an error like this in the "
"`/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log` log file:"
msgstr "Jika pemeriksaan checksum gagal, Anda mungkin melihat kesalahan seperti berikut dalam berkas log `/var/log/rhn/reposync/*.log`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"
msgstr ""
"Repo Sync Errors: (50, u'checksums did not match\n"
"326a904c2fbd7a0e20033c87fc84ebba6b24d937 vs\n"
"afd8c60d7908b2b0e2d95ad0b333920aea9892eb', 'Invalid information uploaded\n"
"to the server')\n"
"The package microcode_ctl-1.17-102.57.62.1.x86_64 which is referenced by\n"
"patch microcode_ctl-8413 was not found in the database. This patch has\n"
"been skipped.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:18
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by running the synchronization from the command "
"prompt with the `-Y` option:"
msgstr "Anda dapat mengatasi kesalahan ini dengan menjalankan sinkronisasi dari prompt perintah menggunakan opsi `-Y`:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-repo-sync --channel <channelname> -Y\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:20
msgid ""
"This option verifies the repository data before the synchronization, rather "
"than relying on locally cached checksums."
msgstr "Opsi ini memverifikasi data repositori sebelum sinkronisasi, alih-alih mengandalkan checksum yang tersimpan dalam cache lokal."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid "Connection Timeout"
msgstr "Batas Waktu Koneksi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:22
msgid "If the download times out with the following error:"
msgstr "Jika pengunduhan mengalami batas waktu habis dengan kesalahan berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "28, 'Operation too slow. Less than 1000 bytes/sec transferred the last 300 seconds\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:24
msgid ""
"You can resolve this error by specifying `reposync_timeout` and "
"`reposync_minrate` configuration values in `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  By default, "
"when less than 1000 bytes per second are transferred in 300 secs, the "
"download is aborted.  You can adjust the number of bytes per second with "
"`reposync_minrate`, and the number of seconds to wait with "
"`reposync_timeout`."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengatasi kesalahan ini dengan menetapkan nilai konfigurasi `reposync_timeout` dan `reposync_minrate` di `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  Secara default, pengunduhan dihentikan jika laju transfer kurang dari 1000 byte per detik selama 300 detik.  Anda dapat menyesuaikan jumlah byte per detik dengan `reposync_minrate` dan jumlah detik waktu tunggu dengan `reposync_timeout`."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manually Trusting the Key During reposync"
msgstr "Memercayai Kunci secara Manual Selama reposync"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:26
msgid ""
"It is possible that in some cases when `reposync` is run, you may need to "
"accept the GPG key manually.  For example:"
msgstr "Dalam beberapa kasus, saat `reposync` dijalankan, Anda mungkin perlu menerima kunci GPG secara manual.  Misalnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-sync.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires:      (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
"    Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications "
"occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead "
"to a corrupted system\n"
"    and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely "
"on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the "
"repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the "
"fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] "
"(r):\n"
msgstr ""
"# spacewalk-repo-sync -c nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 | Channel: nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"17:07:40 ======================================\n"
"17:07:40 Sync of channel started.\n"
"New repository or package signing key received:\n"
"  Repository:       nvidia-compute-sle-15-x86_64-we-sp3\n"
"  Key Fingerprint:  610C 7B14 E068 A878 070D A4E9 9CD0 A493 D42D 0685\n"
"  Key Name:         cudatools <cudatools@nvidia.com>\n"
"  Key Algorithm:    RSA 4096\n"
"  Key Created:      Thu Apr 14 16:04:01 2022\n"
"  Key Expires: (does not expire)\n"
"  Rpm Name:         gpg-pubkey-d42d0685-62589a51\n"
"  Note: Signing data enables the recipient to verify that no modifications occurred after the data\n"
"    were signed. Accepting data with no, wrong or unknown signature can lead to a corrupted system\n"
"   and in extreme cases even to a system compromise.\n"
"    Note: A GPG pubkey is clearly identified by its fingerprint. Do not rely on the key's name. If\n"
"    you are not sure whether the presented key is authentic, ask the repository provider or check\n"
"    their web site. Many providers maintain a web page showing the fingerprints of the GPG keys they\n"
"    are using.\n"
"Do you want to reject the key, trust temporarily, or trust always? [r/t/a/?] (r):\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting Taskomatic"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah Taskomatic"

#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Repository metadata regeneration is a relatively intensive process, so "
"Taskomatic can take several minutes to complete.  Additionally, if "
"Taskomatic crashes, repository metadata regeneration can be interrupted."
msgstr "Pembuatan ulang metadata repositori merupakan proses yang relatif intensif, sehingga Taskomatic dapat memerlukan beberapa menit untuk menyelesaikannya.  Selain itu, jika Taskomatic mengalami crash, pembuatan ulang metadata repositori dapat terhenti."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If Taskomatic is still running, or if the process has crashed, package "
"updates can seem available in the {webui}, but do not appear on the client, "
"and attempts to update the client fail.  In this case, the `zypper ref` "
"command shows an error like this:"
msgstr "Jika Taskomatic masih berjalan atau prosesnya mengalami crash, pembaruan paket dapat terlihat tersedia di {webui}, tetapi tidak muncul pada klien, dan upaya memperbarui klien gagal.  Dalam kasus ini, perintah `zypper ref` menampilkan kesalahan seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"
msgstr "Valid metadata not found at specified URL\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:6
msgid ""
"To correct this, determine if Taskomatic is still in the process of "
"generating repository metadata, or if a crash could have occurred.  Wait for "
"metadata regeneration to complete or restart Taskomatic after a crash in "
"order for client updates to be carried out correctly."
msgstr "Untuk mengatasinya, tentukan apakah Taskomatic masih dalam proses membuat metadata repositori atau mungkin telah mengalami crash.  Tunggu hingga pembuatan ulang metadata selesai atau mulai ulang Taskomatic setelah mengalami crash agar pembaruan klien dapat dilakukan dengan benar."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Resolving Taskomatic Problems"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengatasi Masalah Taskomatic"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:8
msgid ""
"On the {productname} Server, check the "
"`/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log` file to determine if any metadata "
"regeneration processes are still running, or if a crash occurred."
msgstr "Pada Server {productname}, periksa berkas `/var/log/rhn/rhn_taskomatic_daemon.log` untuk menentukan apakah proses pembuatan ulang metadata masih berjalan atau telah terjadi crash."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:9
msgid "Restart taskomatic:"
msgstr "Mulai ulang taskomatic:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "service taskomatic restart\n"
msgstr "service taskomatic restart\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:11
msgid ""
"In the Taskomatic log files, you can identify the section related to "
"metadata regeneration by looking for opening and closing lines that look "
"like this:"
msgstr "Dalam berkas log Taskomatic, Anda dapat mengidentifikasi bagian yang terkait dengan pembuatan ulang metadata dengan mencari baris pembuka dan penutup seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new "
"repository metadata for channel "
"'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 "
"errata\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,174 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Generating new repository metadata for channel 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64'(sha256) 550 packages, 140 errata\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "...\n"
msgstr "...\n"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-taskomatic.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  "
"com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata "
"generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 "
"seconds\n"
msgstr "<YYYY-DD-MM> <HH:MM:SS>,704 [Thread-584] INFO  com.redhat.rhn.taskomatic.task.repomd.RepositoryWriter - Repository metadata generation for 'cloned-2018-q1-sles12-sp3-updates-x86_64' finished in 4 seconds\n"

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Troubleshooting {webui} Fails to Load"
msgstr "Pemecahan Masalah {webui} yang Gagal Dimuat"

#
#
#
#
#
#. PUT THIS COMMENT AT THE TOP OF TROUBLESHOOTING SECTIONS
#. Troubleshooting format:
#. One sentence each:
#. Cause: What created the problem?
#. Consequence: What does the user see when this happens?
#. Fix: What can the user do to fix this problem?
#. Result: What happens after the user has completed the fix?
#. If more detailed instructions are required, put them in a "Resolving" procedure:
#. .Procedure: Resolving Widget Wobbles
#. . First step
#. . Another step
#. . Last step
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Sometimes, the {webui} will not load after migration.  This is usually "
"caused by browser caching, if the new system has the same hostname and IP "
"address as the old system.  This duplication can confuse some browsers."
msgstr "Terkadang, {webui} tidak dapat dimuat setelah migrasi.  Hal ini biasanya disebabkan oleh cache peramban jika sistem baru memiliki nama host dan alamat IP yang sama dengan sistem lama.  Duplikasi ini dapat membingungkan beberapa peramban."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-webui-fails-load.adoc:3
msgid ""
"This issue is resolved by clearing the cache and reloading the page.  In "
"most browsers, you can do this quickly by pressing kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."
msgstr "Masalah ini dapat diatasi dengan membersihkan cache dan memuat ulang halaman.  Pada sebagian besar peramban, Anda dapat melakukannya dengan cepat dengan menekan kbd:[Ctrl+F5]."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Replacing wicked with NetworkManager after Host OS Upgrade"
msgstr "Mengganti wicked dengan NetworkManager setelah Peningkatan Versi OS Host"

#
#. Applies to: SUSE Multi-Linux Manager 5.0 / 5.1 on SL Micro 6.1
#. Platform: Microsoft Azure (cloud image deployments)
#. Cause: After upgrading the host OS from SLE Micro 5.5 to SL Micro 6.1, wicked remains active.
#. Consequence: Wicked packages become orphaned with no repository or security updates.
#. Fix: Install NetworkManager inside a transactional shell, remove wicked, enable NetworkManager, and reboot.
#. Result: NetworkManager manages the network and the system is in a supported configuration.
#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Problem description"
msgstr "Deskripsi masalah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:3
msgid ""
"In some cases, after upgrading the {productname} host OS from SLE Micro 5.5 "
"to SL Micro 6.1, the system may continue running wicked as the active "
"network manager."
msgstr "Dalam beberapa kasus, setelah meningkatkan OS host {productname} dari SLE Micro 5.5 ke SL Micro 6.1, sistem mungkin tetap menjalankan wicked sebagai pengelola jaringan aktif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:4
msgid "This is an unsupported configuration."
msgstr "Konfigurasi ini tidak didukung."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:5
msgid ""
"Wicked packages carried over from the previous installation become orphaned "
"as they are no longer available in any SL Micro 6.1 repository and receive "
"no security updates."
msgstr "Paket wicked yang terbawa dari instalasi sebelumnya menjadi paket tanpa repositori karena tidak lagi tersedia di repositori SL Micro 6.1 mana pun dan tidak menerima pembaruan keamanan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:6
msgid ""
"{productname} runs as a container on the SL Micro host.  Network management "
"is handled entirely by the host OS.  The {productname} container does not "
"require any changes during this procedure."
msgstr "{productname} berjalan sebagai kontainer pada host SL Micro.  Pengelolaan jaringan ditangani sepenuhnya oleh OS host.  Kontainer {productname} tidak memerlukan perubahan apa pun selama prosedur ini."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:7
msgid "The following symptoms confirm the system is affected:"
msgstr "Gejala berikut memastikan bahwa sistem terdampak:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:8
msgid "`systemctl status wicked` shows `active (exited)`"
msgstr "`systemctl status wicked` menampilkan `active (exited)`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:9
msgid ""
"`systemctl status NetworkManager` shows `Unit NetworkManager.service could "
"not be found`"
msgstr "`systemctl status NetworkManager` menampilkan `Unit NetworkManager.service could not be found`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:10
msgid "`systemctl show -p Id network.service` returns `Id=wicked.service`"
msgstr "`systemctl show -p Id network.service` mengembalikan `Id=wicked.service`"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:11
msgid ""
"`sudo zypper se -s wicked` shows wicked listed under `(System Packages)` "
"with no repository"
msgstr "`sudo zypper se -s wicked` menampilkan wicked dalam daftar `(System Packages)` tanpa repositori"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:12
msgid ""
"This procedure applies to systems using DHCP, which is the standard "
"configuration for {productname} cloud images.  If your deployment uses "
"static IP addresses, VLANs, custom bonding, or other non-standard network "
"configurations, do not proceed.  Contact SUSE Support for guidance specific "
"to your configuration."
msgstr "Prosedur ini berlaku untuk sistem yang menggunakan DHCP, yang merupakan konfigurasi standar untuk image cloud {productname}.  Jika penerapan Anda menggunakan alamat IP statis, VLAN, bonding kustom, atau konfigurasi jaringan nonstandar lainnya, jangan lanjutkan.  Hubungi SUSE Support untuk mendapatkan panduan yang sesuai dengan konfigurasi Anda."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope and impact"
msgstr "Cakupan dan dampak"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Detail\n"
" \n"
"| Applies to\n"
"| {productname} 5.0 and 5.1 on SL Micro 6.1\n"
" \n"
"| Network interruption\n"
"| The system is briefly unreachable during the reboot at the end of this "
"procedure\n"
" \n"
"| {productname} container\n"
"| Remains running throughout.\n"
"No changes to the container are required.\n"
" \n"
"| IP address\n"
"| Unchanged after migration when using DHCP with a cloud provider.\n"
"DHCP leases are typically bound to the MAC address.\n"
" \n"
"| Minions\n"
"| No reconfiguration required.\n"
"Minions connect to the same IP address after the migration.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Detail\n"
" \n"
"| Berlaku untuk\n"
"| {productname} 5.0 dan 5.1 pada SL Micro 6.1\n"
" \n"
"| Gangguan jaringan\n"
"| Sistem tidak dapat dijangkau untuk sementara selama proses mulai ulang di akhir prosedur ini\n"
" \n"
"| Kontainer {productname}\n"
"| Tetap berjalan selama proses berlangsung.\n"
"Tidak diperlukan perubahan pada kontainer.\n"
" \n"
"| Alamat IP\n"
"| Tidak berubah setelah migrasi saat menggunakan DHCP dengan penyedia cloud.\n"
"Sewa DHCP biasanya terikat pada alamat MAC.\n"
" \n"
"| Minion\n"
"| Tidak memerlukan konfigurasi ulang.\n"
"Minion terhubung ke alamat IP yang sama setelah migrasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:16
msgid "Before starting:"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Ensure you have out-of-band console access to the system (for example, the "
"serial console provided by your cloud platform or hypervisor).  This is your "
"recovery path if the network does not come back correctly after the reboot."
msgstr "Pastikan Anda memiliki akses konsol out-of-band ke sistem (misalnya, konsol serial yang disediakan oleh platform cloud atau hypervisor Anda).  Akses ini merupakan jalur pemulihan jika jaringan tidak kembali berfungsi dengan benar setelah sistem dimulai ulang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:18
msgid "Confirm the {productname} container is running and healthy:"
msgstr "Pastikan kontainer {productname} berjalan dan dalam kondisi baik:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:19
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo podman ps\n"
msgstr "sudo podman ps\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:20
msgid ""
"Record the current IP address and routing table on the host.  You will "
"verify these are unchanged after the migration:"
msgstr "Catat alamat IP dan tabel perutean saat ini pada host.  Anda akan memastikan keduanya tidak berubah setelah migrasi:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"ip addr show eth0\n"
"ip route show\n"
msgstr ""
"ip addr show eth0\n"
"ip route show\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Migration procedure"
msgstr "Prosedur migrasi"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Migrating wicked to NetworkManager"
msgstr "Prosedur: Bermigrasi dari wicked ke NetworkManager"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:24
msgid ""
"Take a snapshot before making any changes.  This is your rollback point if "
"something goes wrong."
msgstr "Buat snapshot sebelum melakukan perubahan apa pun.  Snapshot ini menjadi titik pemulihan jika terjadi masalah."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:25
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo snapper create -d \"Pre-NetworkManager-Migration\"\n"
msgstr "sudo snapper create -d \"Pre-NetworkManager-Migration\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:26
msgid ""
"Note the snapshot number from the output.  You will use it if you need to "
"roll back."
msgstr "Catat nomor snapshot dari keluaran.  Anda akan menggunakannya jika perlu mengembalikan sistem ke kondisi sebelumnya."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo snapper list\n"
msgstr "sudo snapper list\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:28
msgid "Open a transactional update shell to apply changes."
msgstr "Buka shell pembaruan transaksional untuk menerapkan perubahan."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:29
msgid ""
"All changes made here are staged atomically and only take effect after the "
"reboot in the next step."
msgstr "Semua perubahan yang dilakukan di sini disiapkan secara atomik dan baru berlaku setelah sistem dimulai ulang pada langkah berikutnya."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo transactional-update shell\n"
msgstr "sudo transactional-update shell\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:31
msgid "Inside the shell, install NetworkManager:"
msgstr "Di dalam shell, instal NetworkManager:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper in NetworkManager\n"
msgstr "zypper in NetworkManager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:33
msgid ""
"Confirm with `y` when prompted.  NetworkManager and its dependencies are "
"installed from the SL Micro-6.1 repositories."
msgstr "Konfirmasikan dengan `y` saat diminta.  NetworkManager dan dependensinya diinstal dari repositori SL Micro-6.1."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:34
msgid "Remove the orphaned wicked packages:"
msgstr "Hapus paket wicked yang tidak lagi memiliki repositori:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "zypper rm wicked wicked-service cockpit-wicked\n"
msgstr "zypper rm wicked wicked-service cockpit-wicked\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:36
msgid "Confirm with `y` when prompted."
msgstr "Konfirmasikan dengan `y` saat diminta."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:37
msgid "During the wicked removal you will see warnings similar to the following:"
msgstr "Selama penghapusan wicked, Anda akan melihat peringatan seperti berikut:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:38
#, no-wrap
msgid " warning: file wicked: remove failed: No such file or directory\n"
msgstr " warning: file wicked: remove failed: No such file or directory\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:39
msgid ""
"These warnings are expected.  Some wicked files were already absent after "
"the OS upgrade.  The removal completes successfully.  Look for the following "
"lines to confirm the critical symlinks were removed:"
msgstr "Peringatan ini wajar terjadi.  Beberapa berkas wicked sudah tidak ada setelah peningkatan versi OS.  Penghapusan tetap berhasil diselesaikan.  Cari baris berikut untuk memastikan tautan simbolis penting telah dihapus:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Removed \"/etc/systemd/system/network.service\".\n"
" Removed \"/etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/wicked.service\".\n"
msgstr ""
" Removed \"/etc/systemd/system/network.service\".\n"
" Removed \"/etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/wicked.service\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:41
msgid "Enable NetworkManager so it starts on the next boot:"
msgstr "Aktifkan NetworkManager agar dimulai saat boot berikutnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl enable NetworkManager\n"
msgstr "systemctl enable NetworkManager\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:43
msgid "You should see the following symlinks created:"
msgstr "Anda seharusnya melihat tautan simbolis berikut dibuat:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" Created symlink /etc/systemd/system/network.service → "
"/usr/lib/systemd/system/NetworkManager.service.\n"
" Created symlink "
"/etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/NetworkManager.service → ...\n"
msgstr ""
" Created symlink /etc/systemd/system/network.service → /usr/lib/systemd/system/NetworkManager.service.\n"
" Created symlink /etc/systemd/system/multi-user.target.wants/NetworkManager.service → ...\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:45
msgid "Exit the transactional shell:"
msgstr "Keluar dari shell transaksional:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:47
msgid "Reboot."
msgstr "Mulai ulang sistem."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:48
msgid ""
"The system will lose network connectivity during the reboot.  SSH sessions "
"will be terminated.  Use your out-of-band console to monitor the reboot if "
"needed."
msgstr "Sistem akan kehilangan konektivitas jaringan selama proses mulai ulang.  Sesi SSH akan terputus.  Gunakan konsol out-of-band untuk memantau proses mulai ulang jika diperlukan."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:49
#, no-wrap
msgid "sudo reboot\n"
msgstr "sudo reboot\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:50
msgid ""
"Verify the migration after the system comes back up.  Run the following "
"checks on the host."
msgstr "Verifikasi migrasi setelah sistem kembali berjalan.  Jalankan pemeriksaan berikut pada host."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:51
msgid "Confirm `network.service` now points to NetworkManager:"
msgstr "Pastikan `network.service` kini mengarah ke NetworkManager:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "systemctl show -p Id network.service\n"
msgstr "systemctl show -p Id network.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:53
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:57
msgid "Expected output:"
msgstr "Keluaran yang diharapkan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:54
#, no-wrap
msgid " Id=NetworkManager.service\n"
msgstr " Id=NetworkManager.service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:55
msgid "Confirm wicked packages are fully removed:"
msgstr "Pastikan paket wicked telah dihapus sepenuhnya:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "rpm -q wicked wicked-service\n"
msgstr "rpm -q wicked wicked-service\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:58
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
" package wicked is not installed\n"
" package wicked-service is not installed\n"
msgstr ""
" package wicked is not installed\n"
" package wicked-service is not installed\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:59
msgid "Confirm the IP address is unchanged:"
msgstr "Pastikan alamat IP tidak berubah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip addr show eth0\n"
msgstr "ip addr show eth0\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:61
msgid ""
"The IP address must match what was recorded before the migration.  If it has "
"changed, minions will lose connectivity to {productname}."
msgstr "Alamat IP harus sama dengan yang dicatat sebelum migrasi.  Jika berubah, minion akan kehilangan konektivitas ke {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:62
msgid "Confirm the routing table is intact:"
msgstr "Pastikan tabel perutean tetap utuh:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "ip route show\n"
msgstr "ip route show\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:64
msgid ""
"Compare the output against the routing table recorded before the migration "
"and verify all routes are present."
msgstr "Bandingkan keluaran dengan tabel perutean yang dicatat sebelum migrasi dan pastikan semua rute tersedia."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:65
msgid ""
"If any routes are missing immediately after boot, wait 90 seconds and check "
"again.  The `cloud-netconfig` service runs on a 60-second timer and restores "
"any missing cloud-provider-specific routes automatically."
msgstr "Jika ada rute yang hilang segera setelah boot, tunggu 90 detik lalu periksa kembali.  Layanan `cloud-netconfig` berjalan dengan interval 60 detik dan secara otomatis memulihkan rute khusus penyedia cloud yang hilang."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:66
msgid "Confirm the {productname} container is running:"
msgstr "Pastikan kontainer {productname} berjalan:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:68
msgid "The container should show status `healthy` within a few minutes of boot."
msgstr "Kontainer seharusnya menampilkan status `healthy` dalam beberapa menit setelah boot."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:69
#, no-wrap
msgid "The changes after the migration"
msgstr "Perubahan setelah migrasi"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:70
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Item | Notes\n"
" \n"
"| IP address\n"
"| Unchanged when using DHCP.\n"
"NetworkManager obtains the same address via DHCP.\n"
" \n"
"| Slave or bonded interfaces\n"
"| Slave interfaces remain present and attached to their master.\n"
"They no longer appear in `ip addr show` because NetworkManager does not "
"display slave interfaces there.\n"
"Use `ip link show <interface>` to confirm they are present.\n"
"This is expected behaviour and has no impact on network performance.\n"
" \n"
"| Cloud-provider-specific routes\n"
"| Managed by `cloud-netconfig`, which operates independently of the network "
"manager and continues to do so after the switch.\n"
"Routes are restored within 60 seconds if missing after boot.\n"
" \n"
"| IPv6 link-local address\n"
"| The link-local address on the primary interface changes because "
"NetworkManager generates it differently from wicked.\n"
"This has no impact on standard {productname} deployments which use IPv4.\n"
" \n"
"| Default route metric\n"
"| NetworkManager adds an explicit `metric 100` to the default route.\n"
"This is correct behaviour and has no negative impact.\n"
" \n"
"| NetworkManager connection files\n"
"| NetworkManager auto-generates connection definitions in "
"`/var/run/NetworkManager/system-connections/` which is a tmpfs location.\n"
"These are regenerated on every boot from DHCP.\n"
"The original wicked configuration in `/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-*` is "
"left in place but is not read by NetworkManager.\n"
" \n"
"| {productname} container\n"
"| Not affected.\n"
"Continues running without modification or restart.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Item | Catatan\n"
" \n"
"| Alamat IP\n"
"| Tidak berubah saat menggunakan DHCP.\n"
"NetworkManager memperoleh alamat yang sama melalui DHCP.\n"
" \n"
"| Antarmuka slave atau bonding\n"
"| Antarmuka slave tetap tersedia dan terhubung ke antarmuka induknya.\n"
"Antarmuka tersebut tidak lagi muncul dalam `ip addr show` karena NetworkManager tidak menampilkan antarmuka slave di sana.\n"
"Gunakan `ip link show <interface>` untuk memastikan antarmuka tersebut tersedia.\n"
"Perilaku ini normal dan tidak berdampak pada kinerja jaringan.\n"
" \n"
"| Rute khusus penyedia cloud\n"
"| Dikelola oleh `cloud-netconfig`, yang beroperasi secara independen dari pengelola jaringan dan tetap melakukannya setelah peralihan.\n"
"Rute dipulihkan dalam 60 detik jika hilang setelah boot.\n"
" \n"
"| Alamat link-local IPv6\n"
"| Alamat link-local pada antarmuka utama berubah karena NetworkManager menghasilkannya dengan cara yang berbeda dari wicked.\n"
"Hal ini tidak berdampak pada penerapan standar {productname} yang menggunakan IPv4.\n"
" \n"
"| Metrik rute default\n"
"| NetworkManager menambahkan `metric 100` secara eksplisit ke rute default.\n"
"Perilaku ini benar dan tidak menimbulkan dampak negatif.\n"
" \n"
"| Berkas koneksi NetworkManager\n"
"| NetworkManager secara otomatis membuat definisi koneksi di `/var/run/NetworkManager/system-connections/`, yang merupakan lokasi tmpfs.\n"
"Definisi ini dibuat ulang pada setiap boot berdasarkan DHCP.\n"
"Konfigurasi wicked asli di `/etc/sysconfig/network/ifcfg-*` tetap dibiarkan, tetapi tidak dibaca oleh NetworkManager.\n"
" \n"
"| Kontainer {productname}\n"
"| Tidak terpengaruh.\n"
"Tetap berjalan tanpa modifikasi atau mulai ulang.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:71
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rollback"
msgstr "Pengembalian ke Kondisi Sebelumnya"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:72
msgid ""
"If the system does not come back correctly after the reboot, use the "
"snapshot taken in Step 1 to roll back."
msgstr "Jika sistem tidak kembali berfungsi dengan benar setelah dimulai ulang, gunakan snapshot yang dibuat pada Langkah 1 untuk mengembalikan sistem ke kondisi sebelumnya."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roll back via boot menu"
msgstr "Mengembalikan sistem melalui menu boot"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:74
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Rolling back via boot menu"
msgstr "Prosedur: Mengembalikan Sistem melalui Menu Boot"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:75
msgid "Connect to the system using your out-of-band console."
msgstr "Hubungkan ke sistem menggunakan konsol out-of-band Anda."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:76
msgid "When the GRUB menu appears during boot, select the snapshot taken in Step 1."
msgstr "Saat menu GRUB muncul selama boot, pilih snapshot yang dibuat pada Langkah 1."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:77
msgid "The system boots into the pre-migration state with wicked active."
msgstr "Sistem melakukan boot ke kondisi sebelum migrasi dengan wicked aktif."

#. type: Title ===
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:78
#, no-wrap
msgid "Roll back via command line"
msgstr "Mengembalikan sistem melalui baris perintah"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:79
msgid "If the system boots but the network is not working correctly:"
msgstr "Jika sistem berhasil melakukan boot tetapi jaringan tidak berfungsi dengan benar:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:80
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"sudo transactional-update rollback <snapshot-number>\n"
"sudo reboot\n"
msgstr ""
"sudo transactional-update rollback <snapshot-number>\n"
"sudo reboot\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/troubleshooting/tshoot-wicked-to-networkmanager.adoc:81
msgid ""
"After a rollback, the system returns to the orphaned wicked state.  The "
"system will function, but wicked remains unsupported.  Contact SUSE Support "
"if the migration continues to fail."
msgstr "Setelah dikembalikan ke kondisi sebelumnya, sistem kembali menggunakan wicked yang tidak lagi memiliki repositori.  Sistem akan berfungsi, tetapi wicked tetap tidak didukung.  Hubungi SUSE Support jika migrasi terus gagal."

#. type: Title =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Tuning Changelogs"
msgstr "Menyesuaikan Log Perubahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Some packages have a long list of changelog entries.  This data is "
"downloaded by default, but it is not always useful information to keep.  In "
"order to limit the amount of changelog metadata which is downloaded and to "
"save disk space, you can put a limit on how many entries to keep on disk."
msgstr "Beberapa paket memiliki daftar entri log perubahan yang panjang.  Data ini diunduh secara default, tetapi informasinya tidak selalu berguna untuk disimpan.  Untuk membatasi jumlah metadata log perubahan yang diunduh dan menghemat ruang disk, Anda dapat membatasi jumlah entri yang disimpan pada disk."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:4
msgid ""
"This configuration option is in the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` configuration file.  "
"The parameter defaults to `20`.  Changing this value to `0` will provide an "
"unlimited number of entries."
msgstr "Opsi konfigurasi ini terdapat dalam berkas konfigurasi `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`.  Nilai default parameternya adalah `20`.  Mengubah nilai ini menjadi `0` akan membuat jumlah entri tidak terbatas."

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"
msgstr "java.max_changelog_entries = 20\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:6
msgid ""
"If you set this parameter, it comes into effect only for new packages when "
"they are synchronized."
msgstr "Jika Anda menetapkan parameter ini, pengaturan hanya berlaku untuk paket baru saat disinkronkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:7
msgid "After changing this parameter, restart services with `mgradm restart`."
msgstr "Setelah mengubah parameter ini, mulai ulang layanan dengan `mgradm restart`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:8
msgid ""
"You might like to delete and regenerate the cached data to remove older "
"data."
msgstr "Anda dapat menghapus dan membuat ulang data cache untuk menghilangkan data lama."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:9
msgid ""
"Deleting and regenerating cached data can take a long time.  Depending on "
"the number of channels you have and the amount of data to be deleted, it can "
"potentially take several hours.  The task is run in the background by "
"Taskomatic, so you can continue to use {productname} while the operation "
"completes, however you should expect some performance loss."
msgstr "Menghapus dan membuat ulang data cache dapat memerlukan waktu lama.  Bergantung pada jumlah channel yang Anda miliki dan jumlah data yang akan dihapus, proses ini dapat memerlukan waktu beberapa jam.  Tugas dijalankan di latar belakang oleh Taskomatic, sehingga Anda dapat terus menggunakan {productname} selama operasi berlangsung, tetapi kinerja mungkin menurun."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:10
msgid ""
"You can delete and request a regeneration of cached data from the command "
"line:"
msgstr "Anda dapat menghapus dan meminta pembuatan ulang data cache melalui baris perintah:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid "spacewalk-sql -i\n"
msgstr "spacewalk-sql -i\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:12
msgid "Then on the SQL database prompt, enter:"
msgstr "Kemudian, pada prompt basis data SQL, masukkan:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/tuning-changelogs.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"        'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"
msgstr ""
"DELETE FROM rhnPackageRepodata;\n"
"INSERT INTO rhnRepoRegenQueue (id, CHANNEL_LABEL, REASON, FORCE)\n"
"(SELECT sequence_nextval('rhn_repo_regen_queue_id_seq'),\n"
"        C.label,\n"
"   'cached data regeneration',\n"
"        'Y'\n"
"        FROM rhnChannel C);\n"
"\\q\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:2
msgid ""
"{productname} Administrators can add new users, grant permissions, and "
"deactivate or delete users.  If you are managing a large number of users, "
"you can assign users to system groups to manage permissions at a group "
"level.  You can also change the system defaults for the {webui}, including "
"language and theme defaults."
msgstr "Administrator {productname} dapat menambahkan pengguna baru, memberikan izin, serta menonaktifkan atau menghapus pengguna.  Jika Anda mengelola banyak pengguna, Anda dapat menetapkan pengguna ke grup sistem untuk mengelola izin pada tingkat grup.  Anda juga dapat mengubah pengaturan default sistem untuk {webui}, termasuk bahasa dan tema default."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:3
msgid ""
"The `Users` menu is only available if you are logged in with the "
"{productname} administrator account."
msgstr "Menu `Users` hanya tersedia jika Anda masuk dengan akun administrator {productname}."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:4
msgid ""
"To manage {productname} users, navigate to menu:Users[User List > All] to "
"see all users in your {productname} Server.  Each user in the list shows the "
"username, real name, assigned roles, the date the user last signed in, and "
"the current status of the user.  Click btn:[Create User] to create a new "
"user account.  Click the username to go to the `User Details` page."
msgstr "Untuk mengelola pengguna {productname}, buka menu:Users[User List > All] untuk melihat semua pengguna pada Server {productname} Anda.  Setiap pengguna dalam daftar menampilkan nama pengguna, nama asli, peran yang ditetapkan, tanggal terakhir pengguna masuk, dan status pengguna saat ini.  Klik btn:[Create User] untuk membuat akun pengguna baru.  Klik nama pengguna untuk membuka halaman `User Details`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:5
msgid ""
"To add new users to your organization, click btn:[Create User], complete the "
"details for the new user, and click btn:[Create Login]."
msgstr "Untuk menambahkan pengguna baru ke organisasi Anda, klik btn:[Create User], lengkapi detail pengguna baru, lalu klik btn:[Create Login]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "Password requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan kata sandi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:7
msgid "{productname} is shipped with a selection of default values."
msgstr "{productname} dilengkapi dengan sejumlah nilai default."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:8
msgid ""
"To ensure that all new user passwords adhere to the organization's security "
"standards, {productname} administrator has the option to enforce the "
"password creation rules."
msgstr "Untuk memastikan semua kata sandi pengguna baru memenuhi standar keamanan organisasi, administrator {productname} dapat memberlakukan aturan pembuatan kata sandi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:9
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password "
"Policy] to define the password requirements.  Use a combination of the "
"following fields:"
msgstr "Di {webui}, buka menu:Admin[Manager Configuration > Password Policy] untuk menentukan persyaratan kata sandi.  Gunakan kombinasi bidang berikut:"

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Min Password Length"
msgstr "Panjang Minimum Kata Sandi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:11
msgid "Use this field to define the minimal length of password."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan panjang minimum kata sandi."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Password Length"
msgstr "Panjang Maksimum Kata Sandi"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:13
msgid "Use this field to define the maximum length of password."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan panjang maksimum kata sandi."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Digits"
msgstr "Wajibkan Angka"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:15
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the digits "
"(0-9)."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan apakah kata sandi harus menyertakan angka (0-9)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Lowercase Characters"
msgstr "Wajibkan Huruf Kecil"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:17
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the lowercase "
"characters (a-z)."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan apakah kata sandi harus menyertakan huruf kecil (a-z)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters"
msgstr "Wajibkan Huruf Kapital"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:19
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include the uppercase "
"characters (A-Z)."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan apakah kata sandi harus menyertakan huruf kapital (A-Z)."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Consecutive Characters"
msgstr "Batasi Karakter Berurutan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:21
msgid "Use this field to specify whether the restricted consecutive characters."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan apakah karakter berurutan dibatasi."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Require Special Characters"
msgstr "Wajibkan Karakter Khusus"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:23
msgid ""
"Use this field to specify whether the password must include special "
"characters."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan apakah kata sandi harus menyertakan karakter khusus."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Allowed Special Characters"
msgstr "Karakter Khusus yang Diizinkan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:25
msgid ""
"This field is enable only of the `Require Special Characters` is selected.  "
"Use it to specify which special characters are allowed, for example "
"`!@#$%&*`, and others."
msgstr "Bidang ini hanya diaktifkan jika `Require Special Characters` dipilih. Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan karakter khusus yang diizinkan, misalnya `!@#$%&*`, dan lainnya."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Restrict Character Occurences"
msgstr "Batasi Kemunculan Karakter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:27
msgid "Use this field to specify restricted character occurences."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan batas kemunculan karakter."

#. type: Labeled list
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Max Character Occurences"
msgstr "Jumlah Maksimum Kemunculan Karakter"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:29
msgid "Use this field to specify maximum character occurences."
msgstr "Gunakan bidang ini untuk menentukan jumlah maksimum kemunculan karakter."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:30
msgid "Click btn:[Save] to save any of the changed password settings."
msgstr "Klik btn:[Save] untuk menyimpan pengaturan kata sandi yang telah diubah."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:31
msgid "Use btn:[Reset] to change any settings to the default ones."
msgstr "Gunakan btn:[Reset] untuk mengembalikan pengaturan ke nilai default."

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:32
msgid "{productname} is shipped with the following default values:"
msgstr "{productname} dilengkapi dengan nilai default berikut:"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:33
msgid "Min Password Length: 4"
msgstr "Panjang Minimum Kata Sandi: 4"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:34
msgid "Max Password Length: 32"
msgstr "Panjang Maksimum Kata Sandi: 32"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:35
msgid "Require Uppercase Characters: checked"
msgstr "Wajibkan Huruf Kapital: dicentang"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deactivate and delete accounts"
msgstr "Menonaktifkan dan menghapus akun"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:37
msgid ""
"You can deactivate or delete user accounts if they are no longer required.  "
"Deactivated user accounts can be reactivated at any time.  Deleted user "
"accounts are not visible, and cannot be retrieved."
msgstr "Anda dapat menonaktifkan atau menghapus akun pengguna jika tidak lagi diperlukan.  Akun pengguna yang dinonaktifkan dapat diaktifkan kembali kapan saja.  Akun pengguna yang dihapus tidak terlihat dan tidak dapat dipulihkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:38
msgid ""
"Users can deactivate their own accounts.  However, if users have an "
"administrator role, the role must be removed before the account can be "
"deactivated."
msgstr "Pengguna dapat menonaktifkan akun mereka sendiri.  Namun, jika pengguna memiliki peran administrator, peran tersebut harus dihapus sebelum akun dapat dinonaktifkan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:39
msgid ""
"Deactivated users cannot log in to the {productname} {webui} or schedule any "
"actions.  Actions scheduled by a user prior to their deactivation remain in "
"the action queue.  Deactivated users can be reactivated by {productname} "
"administrators."
msgstr "Pengguna yang dinonaktifkan tidak dapat masuk ke {webui} {productname} atau menjadwalkan tindakan apa pun.  Tindakan yang dijadwalkan oleh pengguna sebelum dinonaktifkan tetap berada dalam antrean tindakan.  Pengguna yang dinonaktifkan dapat diaktifkan kembali oleh administrator {productname}."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "User roles"
msgstr "Peran pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:41
msgid ""
"Users can be assigned multiple roles, and there can be more than one user "
"holding any role at any time.  There must always be at least one active "
"{productname} Administrator."
msgstr "Pengguna dapat diberi beberapa peran, dan setiap peran dapat dimiliki oleh lebih dari satu pengguna pada saat yang sama.  Harus selalu ada setidaknya satu Administrator {productname} yang aktif."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:42
msgid ""
"To change a user's roles, except for the {productname} Administrator role, "
"navigate to menu:Users[User List > All], select the user to change, and "
"check or uncheck the administrator roles as required."
msgstr "Untuk mengubah peran pengguna, selain peran Administrator {productname}, buka menu:Users[User List > All], pilih pengguna yang akan diubah, lalu centang atau hapus centang pada peran administrator sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:43
msgid ""
"To change a user's {productname} Administrator role, navigate to "
"menu:Admin[Users] and check or uncheck `{productname} Admin?` as required."
msgstr "Untuk mengubah peran Administrator {productname} pengguna, buka menu:Admin[Users], lalu centang atau hapus centang pada `{productname} Admin?` sesuai kebutuhan."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "User Role Permissions"
msgstr "Izin Peran Pengguna"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Role Name | Description\n"
"| {productname} Administrator | Can perform all functions, including "
"changing privileges of other users.\n"
"| Organization Administrator | Manages activation keys, configurations, "
"channels, and system groups.\n"
"| Activation Key Administrator | Manages activation keys.\n"
"| Image Administrator | Manages image profiles, builds, and stores.\n"
"| Configuration Administrator | Manages system configuration.\n"
"| Channel Administrator | Manages software channels, including making "
"channels globally subscribable, and creating new channels.\n"
"| System Group Administrator | Manages systems groups, including creating "
"and deleting system groups, adding clients to existing groups, and managing "
"user access to groups.\n"
"| Regular User | Provides standard level of access. Newly created users are "
"automatically assigned to this role.\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama Peran | Deskripsi\n"
"| Administrator {productname} | Dapat menjalankan semua fungsi, termasuk mengubah hak akses pengguna lain.\n"
"| Administrator Organisasi | Mengelola kunci aktivasi, konfigurasi, channel, dan grup sistem.\n"
"| Administrator Kunci Aktivasi | Mengelola kunci aktivasi.\n"
"| Administrator Image | Mengelola profil, build, dan penyimpanan image.\n"
"| Administrator Konfigurasi | Mengelola konfigurasi sistem.\n"
"| Administrator Channel | Mengelola channel perangkat lunak, termasuk mengatur agar channel dapat dilanggani secara global dan membuat channel baru.\n"
"| Administrator Grup Sistem | Mengelola grup sistem, termasuk membuat dan menghapus grup sistem, menambahkan klien ke grup yang sudah ada, serta mengelola akses pengguna ke grup.\n"
"| Pengguna Biasa | Memiliki tingkat akses standar. Pengguna yang baru dibuat secara otomatis diberi peran ini.\n"

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating additional roles"
msgstr "Membuat peran tambahan"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:47
msgid ""
"With Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) in {productname}, you can create "
"custom roles (referred to as access groups in the {webui}) to fine-tune user "
"permissions beyond the predefined administrator roles."
msgstr "Dengan Kontrol Akses Berbasis Peran (RBAC) di {productname}, Anda dapat membuat peran kustom (disebut grup akses di {webui}) untuk mengatur izin pengguna secara lebih terperinci di luar peran administrator yang telah ditentukan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:48
msgid "To create an access group, use the following procedure:"
msgstr "Untuk membuat grup akses, gunakan prosedur berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:49
msgid ""
"To edit an existing access group, navigate to menu:Admin[Access Control], "
"click the Edit icon in the `Actions` column for the group, modify settings "
"across the tabs, and click btn:[Update Access Group].  To delete an access "
"group, navigate to menu:Admin[Access Control], click the Delete icon in the "
"`Actions` column, and confirm the deletion."
msgstr "Untuk mengedit grup akses yang sudah ada, buka menu:Admin[Access Control], klik ikon Edit pada kolom `Actions` untuk grup tersebut, ubah pengaturan pada tab yang tersedia, lalu klik btn:[Update Access Group].  Untuk menghapus grup akses, buka menu:Admin[Access Control], klik ikon Delete pada kolom `Actions`, lalu konfirmasikan penghapusan."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:50
msgid ""
"For more information about access groups and permission namespaces, see "
"xref:reference:admin/access-control.adoc[] and "
"xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup akses dan namespace izin, lihat xref:reference:admin/access-control.adoc[] dan xref:administration:role-based-access-control.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:51
#, no-wrap
msgid "User permissions and systems"
msgstr "Izin pengguna dan sistem"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:52
msgid ""
"If you have created system groups to manage your clients, you can assign "
"groups to users for them to manage."
msgstr "Jika Anda telah membuat grup sistem untuk mengelola klien, Anda dapat menetapkan grup kepada pengguna untuk mereka kelola."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:53
msgid ""
"To assign a user to a system group, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the `System Groups` tab.  Check the groups "
"to assign, and click btn:[Update Defaults]."
msgstr "Untuk menetapkan pengguna ke grup sistem, buka menu:Users[User List], klik nama pengguna yang akan diedit, lalu buka tab `System Groups`.  Centang grup yang akan ditetapkan, lalu klik btn:[Update Defaults]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:54
msgid ""
"You can also select one or more default system groups for a user.  When the "
"user registers a new client, it is assigned to the chosen system group by "
"default.  This allows the user to immediately access the newly registered "
"client."
msgstr "Anda juga dapat memilih satu atau beberapa grup sistem default untuk pengguna.  Saat pengguna mendaftarkan klien baru, klien tersebut secara default ditetapkan ke grup sistem yang dipilih.  Dengan demikian, pengguna dapat langsung mengakses klien yang baru didaftarkan."

#.  I really don't understand what this is. Need a sentence or two to explain it.  --LKB 2020-04-29
#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:55
msgid ""
"To manage external groups, navigate to menu:Users[System Group "
"Configuration], and go to the `External Authentication` tab.  Click "
"btn:[Create External Group] to create a new external group.  Give the group "
"a name, and assign it to the appropriate system group."
msgstr "Untuk mengelola grup eksternal, buka menu:Users[System Group Configuration], lalu buka tab `External Authentication`.  Klik btn:[Create External Group] untuk membuat grup eksternal baru.  Beri nama grup tersebut, lalu tetapkan ke grup sistem yang sesuai."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:56
msgid ""
"For more information about system groups, see "
"xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang grup sistem, lihat xref:reference:systems/system-groups.adoc[]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:57
msgid ""
"To see the individual clients a user can administer, navigate to "
"menu:Users[User List], click the username to edit, and go to the `Systems` "
"tab.  To carry out bulk tasks, you can select clients from the list to add "
"them to the system set manager."
msgstr "Untuk melihat setiap klien yang dapat dikelola oleh pengguna, buka menu:Users[User List], klik nama pengguna yang akan diedit, lalu buka tab `Systems`.  Untuk menjalankan tugas secara massal, Anda dapat memilih klien dari daftar untuk menambahkannya ke pengelola kumpulan sistem."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:58
msgid ""
"For more information about the system set manager, see "
"xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."
msgstr "Untuk informasi selengkapnya tentang pengelola kumpulan sistem, lihat xref:client-configuration:system-set-manager.adoc[]."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:59
#, no-wrap
msgid "Users and channel permissions"
msgstr "Pengguna dan izin channel"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:60
msgid ""
"You can assign users to software channels within your organization either as "
"a subscriber that consumes content from channels, or as an administrator, "
"who can manage the channels themselves."
msgstr "Anda dapat menetapkan pengguna ke channel perangkat lunak dalam organisasi Anda sebagai pelanggan yang menggunakan konten dari channel, atau sebagai administrator yang dapat mengelola channel tersebut."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:61
msgid ""
"To subscribe a user to a channel, navigate to menu:Users[User List], click "
"the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription] "
"tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "Untuk melanggankan pengguna ke channel, buka menu:Users[User List], klik nama pengguna yang akan diedit, lalu buka tab menu:Channel Permissions[Subscription].  Centang channel yang akan ditetapkan, lalu klik btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:62
msgid ""
"To grant a user channel management permissions, navigate to menu:Users[User "
"List], click the username to edit, and go to the menu:Channel "
"Permissions[Management] tab.  Check the channels to assign, and click "
"btn:[Update Permissions]."
msgstr "Untuk memberikan izin pengelolaan channel kepada pengguna, buka menu:Users[User List], klik nama pengguna yang akan diedit, lalu buka tab menu:Channel Permissions[Management].  Centang channel yang akan ditetapkan, lalu klik btn:[Update Permissions]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:63
msgid ""
"Some channels in the list might not be subscribable.  This is usually "
"because of the users administrator status, or the channels global settings."
msgstr "Beberapa channel dalam daftar mungkin tidak dapat dilanggani.  Hal ini biasanya disebabkan oleh status administrator pengguna atau pengaturan global channel."

#. type: Title ==
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:64
#, no-wrap
msgid "User default language"
msgstr "Bahasa default pengguna"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:65
msgid ""
"When you create a new user, you can choose which language to use for the "
"{webui}.  After a user has been created, you can change the language by "
"navigating to menu:Home[My Preferences]."
msgstr "Saat membuat pengguna baru, Anda dapat memilih bahasa yang akan digunakan untuk {webui}.  Setelah pengguna dibuat, Anda dapat mengubah bahasa dengan membuka menu:Home[My Preferences]."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:66
msgid ""
"The default language is set in the `rhn.conf` configuration file.  To change "
"the default language, open the `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf` file and add or edit this "
"line:"
msgstr "Bahasa default ditetapkan dalam berkas konfigurasi `rhn.conf`.  Untuk mengubah bahasa default, buka berkas `/etc/rhn/rhn.conf`, lalu tambahkan atau edit baris berikut:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:67
#, no-wrap
msgid "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"
msgstr "web.locale = <LANGCODE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/pages/users.adoc:68
msgid "If the parameter is not set, the default language is `en_US`."
msgstr "Jika parameter tidak ditetapkan, bahasa default adalah `en_US`."

