#. type: Title ====
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Image Inspection"
msgstr "Inspeksi Image"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:2
msgid ""
"Base container images (BCIs) come with all the software to run them, but "
"because they are lightweight, they may not include all the tools and "
"libraries required for inspection."
msgstr "Image kontainer dasar (BCI) dilengkapi dengan semua perangkat lunak untuk menjalankannya, tetapi karena ukurannya ringan, image tersebut mungkin tidak menyertakan semua alat dan pustaka yang diperlukan untuk inspeksi."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:3
msgid ""
"When performing container image inspection, {productname} copies and "
"extracts the {salt} bundle (`venv-salt-minion`) from the build host (where "
"the inspection is scheduled) into the target container, and then executes it "
"inside the container.  Therefore, the target container image must satisfy "
"any dynamic dependencies of the build host's {salt} bundle."
msgstr "Saat melakukan inspeksi image kontainer, {productname} menyalin dan mengekstrak bundel {salt} (`venv-salt-minion`) dari host build (tempat inspeksi dijadwalkan) ke dalam kontainer target, lalu menjalankannya di dalam kontainer.  Oleh karena itu, image kontainer target harus memenuhi semua dependensi dinamis bundel {salt} milik host build."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:4
msgid ""
"If the target image is missing required dynamic libraries, the inspection "
"fails.  For example, you might see error messages like:"
msgstr "Jika image target tidak memiliki pustaka dinamis yang diperlukan, inspeksi akan gagal.  Misalnya, Anda mungkin melihat pesan kesalahan seperti:"

#. type: delimited block -
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"
msgstr "libssl.so.1.1: cannot open shared object file: No such file or directory\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:6
msgid ""
"The most common dependency issue is with OpenSSL libraries, because the "
"{salt} bundle's Python modules are dynamically linked against the build "
"host's OpenSSL version.  Because OpenSSL versions differ between major "
"operating system versions (such as SLE 15 and SLE 16), compatibility depends "
"on both the build host and the target image:"
msgstr "Masalah dependensi yang paling umum berkaitan dengan pustaka OpenSSL, karena modul Python dalam bundel {salt} ditautkan secara dinamis ke versi OpenSSL milik host build.  Karena versi OpenSSL berbeda antarversi utama sistem operasi (seperti SLE 15 dan SLE 16), kompatibilitas bergantung pada host build dan image target:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**On a SLE 15 build host**:\n"
"The {salt} bundle is compiled against OpenSSL 1.1 (providing "
"`libssl.so.1.1`).\n"
"Therefore, any image inspected on a SLE 15 build host must have OpenSSL 1.1 "
"installed (typically via the `libopenssl1_1` package).\n"
"Since OpenSSL 1.1 is not available on SLE 16 and openSUSE Leap 16, a SLE 16 "
"/ Leap 16 image *cannot* be inspected on a SLE 15 build host.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pada host build SLE 15**:\n"
"Bundel {salt} dikompilasi dengan OpenSSL 1.1 (yang menyediakan `libssl.so.1.1`).\n"
"Oleh karena itu, setiap image yang diinspeksi pada host build SLE 15 harus memiliki OpenSSL 1.1 yang terinstal (biasanya melalui paket `libopenssl1_1`).\n"
"Karena OpenSSL 1.1 tidak tersedia pada SLE 16 dan openSUSE Leap 16, image SLE 16 / Leap 16 *tidak dapat* diinspeksi pada host build SLE 15.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:8
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**On a SLE 16 build host**:\n"
"The {salt} bundle is compiled against OpenSSL 3 (providing `libssl.so.3`).\n"
"Therefore, any image inspected on a SLE 16 build host must have OpenSSL 3 "
"installed (typically via the `libopenssl3` package).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pada host build SLE 16**:\n"
"Bundel {salt} dikompilasi dengan OpenSSL 3 (yang menyediakan `libssl.so.3`).\n"
"Oleh karena itu, setiap image yang diinspeksi pada host build SLE 16 harus memiliki OpenSSL 3 yang terinstal (biasanya melalui paket `libopenssl3`).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:9
msgid "To ensure successful image inspection, follow these best practices:"
msgstr "Untuk memastikan inspeksi image berhasil, ikuti praktik terbaik berikut:"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:10
msgid ""
"Match the major operating system version of the build host and the target "
"image. For example, use a SLE 16 / Leap 16 build host to inspect SLE 16 / "
"Leap 16 images, and a SLE 15 build host to inspect SLE 15 images."
msgstr "Samakan versi utama sistem operasi host build dan image target. Misalnya, gunakan host build SLE 16 / Leap 16 untuk menginspeksi image SLE 16 / Leap 16, dan host build SLE 15 untuk menginspeksi image SLE 15."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:11
msgid ""
"Install the correct version of OpenSSL inside your image (for example, by "
"adding `libopenssl3` for SLE 16 or `libopenssl1_1` for SLE 15 to the "
"`Dockerfile`) and rebuilding the image."
msgstr "Instal versi OpenSSL yang tepat di dalam image Anda (misalnya, dengan menambahkan `libopenssl3` untuk SLE 16 atau `libopenssl1_1` untuk SLE 15 ke `Dockerfile`), lalu bangun ulang image."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/image-mgmt-container-inspection.adoc:12
msgid ""
"The same dependency requirements apply to other dynamic libraries, such as "
"`libexpat`."
msgstr "Persyaratan dependensi yang sama berlaku untuk pustaka dinamis lainnya, seperti `libexpat`."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:1
msgid ""
"For executing remediations you need to install the SCAP security guide "
"package on the Ansible control node."
msgstr "Untuk menjalankan remediasi, Anda perlu menginstal paket panduan keamanan SCAP pada node kontrol Ansible."

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:2
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Installing the SCAP security guide package"
msgstr "Prosedur: Menginstal Paket Panduan Keamanan SCAP"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:3
msgid ""
"From menu:Systems[Overview], select the client.  Then click "
"menu:Software[Packages > Install]."
msgstr "Dari menu:Systems[Overview], pilih klien.  Kemudian klik menu:Software[Packages > Install]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:4
msgid ""
"Search for `scap-security-guide` and install the package suitable for your "
"system.  See the following table for package distribution requirements:"
msgstr "Cari `scap-security-guide` dan instal paket yang sesuai untuk sistem Anda.  Lihat tabel berikut untuk persyaratan distribusi paket:"

#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "SCAP security guide package requirements"
msgstr "Persyaratan paket panduan keamanan SCAP"

#. type: Table
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package name\n"
"| Supported Systems\n"
"\n"
