"Virtualization 4, Scientific Linux\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-debian\n"
"| Debian 12\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Ubuntu 22.04\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"| Nama paket\n"
"| Sistem yang Didukung\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide\n"
"| {opensuse}, SLES12, SLES15\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-redhat\n"
"| CentOS 7, CentOS 8, Fedora, Oracle Linux 7, Oracle Linux 8, RHEL7, RHEL8, RHEL9, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 10, Red Hat OpenStack Platform 13, Red Hat Virtualization 4, Scientific Linux\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-debian\n"
"| Debian 12\n"
"\n"
"| scap-security-guide-ubuntu\n"
"| Ubuntu 22.04\n"
"\n"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/modules/administration/partials/install_scap_security_guide_package.adoc:7
msgid ""
"For Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04, and Ubuntu 26.04, {suse} does not provide "
"custom security guide packages.  You must use upstream packages "
"(`ssg-debian` and `ssg-debderived` respectively) from their respective "
"community repositories.  Please note that these upstream guides are not "
"officially supported by {suse}."
msgstr "Untuk Debian 13, Ubuntu 24.04, dan Ubuntu 26.04, {suse} tidak menyediakan paket panduan keamanan khusus. Anda harus menggunakan paket upstream (`ssg-debian` untuk Debian serta `ssg-debderived` untuk Ubuntu) dari repositori komunitas masing-masing. Perlu diperhatikan bahwa panduan upstream ini tidak didukung secara resmi oleh {suse}."

#.  This snippet is reusable across multiple guides.
#. type: Block title
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Procedure: Creating an access group"
msgstr "Prosedur: Membuat grup akses"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:2
msgid ""
"In the {webui}, navigate to menu:Admin[Access Control] and click btn:[Create "
"Access Group]."
msgstr "Di {webui}, buka menu:Admin[Access Control], lalu klik btn:[Create Access Group]."

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:3
msgid "On the `Details` page, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "Pada halaman `Details`, isi kolom berikut:"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Name*: Enter a unique name for the access group.\n"
msgstr "*Name*: Masukkan nama unik untuk grup akses.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:5
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Description*: Enter a description explaining the purpose of the group.\n"
msgstr "*Description*: Masukkan deskripsi yang menjelaskan tujuan grup.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:6
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Organization*: Select the organization to which the access group belongs.\n"
msgstr "*Organization*: Pilih organisasi tempat grup akses berada.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:7
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Copy Permissions From*: Optionally select one or more existing access "
"groups to inherit permissions from.\n"
"Once created, the new group functions independently, and future changes to "
"either group do not affect the other.\n"
msgstr ""
"*Copy Permissions From*: Jika diperlukan, pilih satu atau beberapa grup akses yang sudah ada untuk mewarisi izinnya.\n"
"Setelah dibuat, grup baru berfungsi secara independen, dan perubahan selanjutnya pada salah satu grup tidak memengaruhi grup lainnya.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:8
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:15
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Continue].\n"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Continue].\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:9
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the `Namespaces & Permissions` page, select the permissions to grant to "
"the access group:\n"
msgstr "Pada halaman `Namespaces & Permissions`, pilih izin yang akan diberikan kepada grup akses:\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:10
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select *View* to grant read-only access to a namespace.\n"
msgstr "Pilih *View* untuk memberikan akses hanya baca ke namespace.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:11
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select *Modify* to grant full access, including creating, updating, or "
"deleting resources.\n"
msgstr "Pilih *Modify* untuk memberikan akses penuh, termasuk membuat, memperbarui, atau menghapus sumber daya.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:12
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the search bar (`Filter by name`) to locate specific namespaces.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan bilah pencarian (`Filter by name`) untuk menemukan namespace tertentu.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter permissions using the `API`, `Web`, and `Only selected` checkboxes.\n"
msgstr "Filter izin menggunakan kotak centang `API`, `Web`, dan `Only selected`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:14
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click btn:[Expand All] or btn:[Collapse All] to expand or collapse all "
"namespaces in the hierarchy.\n"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Expand All] atau btn:[Collapse All] untuk memperluas atau menciutkan semua namespace dalam hierarki.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the `Users` page, assign users to this access group:\n"
msgstr "Pada halaman `Users`, tetapkan pengguna ke grup akses ini:\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Select a user from the `Search & Add Users` dropdown to add them to the "
"group.\n"
msgstr "Pilih pengguna dari daftar tarik-turun `Search & Add Users` untuk menambahkannya ke grup.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:18
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Review the list of assigned users in the table (showing `Username`, `Email`, "
"and `Real Name`).\n"
msgstr "Tinjau daftar pengguna yang telah ditetapkan dalam tabel (yang menampilkan `Username`, `Email`, dan `Real Name`).\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:19
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove an assigned user, click the Delete icon in the `Actions` column.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus pengguna yang telah ditetapkan, klik ikon Hapus di kolom `Actions`.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"On the `Review` page, verify the access group details, assigned users, and "
"granted permissions.\n"
msgstr "Pada halaman `Review`, verifikasi detail grup akses, pengguna yang telah ditetapkan, dan izin yang diberikan.\n"

#. type: delimited block _
#: en/modules/administration/partials/snippet-creating-access-group.adoc:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "Click btn:[Create] to finish creating the access group.\n"
msgstr "Klik btn:[Create] untuk menyelesaikan pembuatan grup akses.\n"
